:[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Ella Glatt (11:34 A.M.) Hi.Iknow this is a busy day, but I wanted to know whether anyone from the finance team could come to the marketing meeting. Stef Goldberg(11:35A.M.) Hi, Ella. I wish I could, but it starts at 2:00.I need to be ata different meeting at2:30. Ella Glatt (11:36A.M.) Oh, right. I forgot you were going to the executive board meeting. Daniel Seidal (11:36A.M.) I''m also supposed to go to the2:30meeting. Is it essential that one of us attend the marketing meeting? Ella Glatt (11:37A.M.) Well, it would be helpful to have someone from the finance department there, atleastfor15minutesorso. Bill lverman (11:38 A.M.) The quarterly reports just came in, and Daniel, Stef, and I need to review them by the end of the day. Ella Glatt (11:39A.M.) You all have plenty to do. Daniel Seidal(11:41A.M.) That''s true! But I could come from2:00 t02:15.That''s all Ican commit to. Ella Glatt (11:43 A.M.) Sounds great. We just need one of you to clarify a few quick points about the budget for the next advertising campaign."}],"question":"Why does Ms.Glatt want a colleague to attend a meeting?","bilingual":"Tại sao cô Glatt lại muốn đồng nghiệp tham dự cuộc họp?","options":["To summarize a previous meeting","To explain a promotional campaign","To provide information about a budget","To review recently approved documents"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"To provide information about a budget\".","vocabList":[{"word":"promotional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pərˈmoʊʃənəl/","meaning":"công khai; sự thăng tiến; khuyến khích; của"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"advertising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈædvərˌtaɪzɪŋ/","meaning":"Quảng cáo"},{"word":"department","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"