m the finance department there, atleastfor15minutesorso. Bill lverman (11:38 A.M.) The quarterly reports just came in, and Daniel, Stef, and I need to review them by the end of the day. Ella Glatt (11:39A.M.) You all have plenty to do. Daniel Seidal(11:41A.M.) That''s true! But I could come from2:00 t02:15.That''s all Ican commit to. Ella Glatt (11:43 A.M.) Sounds great. We just need one of you to clarify a few quick points about the budget for the next advertising campaign."}],"question":"At 11:43A.M., what does Ms.Glatt most likely mean when she writes,\"Sounds great\"?","bilingual":"Vào lúc 11:43 sáng, rất có thể cô Glatt có ý gì khi viết, \"Nghe hay đấy\"?","options":["She accepts Mr.Seidal''s offer.","She agrees that Mr. Iverman should attend themeetingat3:00p.M.","She is pleased with the proposed budget.","She is happy that a project has been completed."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She accepts Mr.Seidal''s offer.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈædvərˌtaɪzɪŋ/","meaning":"Quảng cáo"},{"word":"department","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈpɑːrt.mənt/","meaning":"khoa, bộ"},{"word":"completed","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/kəmˈplitɪd/","meaning":"đã hoàn thành"},{"word":"marketing","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''mɑ:kitiɳ/","meaning":"tiếp thị"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô ấy chấp nhận lời đề nghị của ông Seidal.","Cô ấy đồng ý rằng ông Iverman sẽ tham dự cuộc họp lúc 3:00 chiều","Cô ấy hài lòng với ngân sách đề xuất.","Cô ấy rất vui vì một dự án đã hoàn thành."]},{"questionNum":"162","passageTitle":"To: | amal.abboud@bunzifoundation.org From: | maria_mcfarland@myemail.com D","passageText":"To: | amal.abboud@bunzifoundation.org From: | maria_mcfarland@myemail.com Date: | Thursday, August 22\n\nSubject: | Project Coordinator Position\n\nAttachment: resume_m.mcfarland.pdf\n\nDear Mr, Abboud, My friend Josiah Wilkins told me that you are seeking a project coordinator for your company. Ihave a degree in business administration and am attaching my résume asI think I am an excellent fit for your needs. As you will see, I have experience using several me to coordinate multiple activities simultaneously, and I can convey expectations clearly to team members involved in each phase of a project. My current role as project coordinator for an international engineering firm, where I have worked for the past five years, has also afforded me ample experience managing teams, schedules, and budgets. While I enjoy the kind of work I do, it has become clear to me that I need motivation from a strong mission. The goal of your company to create sustainable housing projects is something that I strongly support and would be delighted to work on. Through my work and volunteer activities, I have spent many months abroad in various countries throughout Asia and the Middle East. This seems particularly relevant to mention, as I am comfortable leading geographically and culturally diverse teams. Thank you for your attention, and I look forward to speaking with you soon. Kind regards, Maria McFarland","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | amal.abboud@bunzifoundation.org From: | maria_mcfarland@myemail.com Date: | Thursday, August 22\n\nSubject: | Project Coordinator Position\n\nAttachment: resume_m.mcfarland.pdf\n\nDear Mr, Abboud, My friend Josiah Wilkins told me that you are seeking a project coordinator for your company. Ihave a degree in business administration and am attaching my résume asI think I am an excellent fit for your needs. As you will see, I have experience using several me to coordinate multiple activities simultaneously, and I can convey expectations clearly to team members involved in each phase of a project. My current role as project coordinator for an international engineering firm, where I have worked for the past five years, has also afforded me ample experience managing teams, schedules, and budgets. While I enjoy the kind of work I do, it has become clear to me that I need motivation from a strong mission. The goal of your company to create sustainable housing projects is something that I strongly support and would be delighted to work on. Through my work and volunteer activities, I have spent many months abroad in various countries throughout Asia and the Middle East. This seems particularly relevant to mention, as I am comfortable leading geographically and culturally diverse teams. Thank you for your attention, and I look forward to speaking with you soon. Kind regards, Maria McFarland"}],"question":"What does Ms.McFarlandmentionabout Mr.Wilkins?","bilingual":"","options":["He informed her of a job opening.","He will require a professional reference.","He would make a good business partner.","He is considering resigning from his position."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"He informed her of a job opening.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"professional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/prə''feʃənl/","meaning":"(thuộc) nghề, (thuộc) nghề nghiệp; có tay nghề"},{"word":"considering","pos":"Giới từ (Preposition)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈsɪdərɪŋ/","meaning":"có tính đến; trong ánh sáng của"},{"word":"engineering","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌen.dʒɪˈnɪr.ɪŋ/","meaning":"công việc kỹ sư"}]},{"questionNum":"163","passageTitle":"To: | amal.abboud@bunzifoundation.org From: | maria_mcfarland@myemail.com D","passageText":"To: | amal.abboud@bunzifoundation.org From: | maria_mcfarland@myemail.com Date: | Thursday, August 22\n\nSubject: | Project Coord