siness offers products as well as design-consulting services. For start-up labs, we have a team of consulting specialists available to evaluate your facility''s specific needs and assist you in arranging your space and choosing the most suitable furniture. Recently, for example, we were chosen by a major producer of biofuels to provide expert help in changing the layout of a research laboratory to maximize available space. As a result of this project, this client has realized substantial savings by reducing energy usage in the lab.\n\nPlease visit the“Lab Planning\" section of this Web site if you are interested in learning more about building or renovating a laboratory facility. There, you can fill out an interest form to contact one of our consultants about your next project."}],"question":"What did Trexdale Supply do ina recent project?","bilingual":"Trexdale Supply đã làm gì trong một dự án gần đây?","options":["It reorganized a client''s laboratory.","It convert edits vehicles to use biofuels.","It expanded staffing at its production facility.","It helped a client organize a trade show."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It reorganized a client''s laboratory.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"application","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌæp.ləˈkeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"ứng dụng, sự áp dụng"},{"word":"production","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pərˈdəkʃən/","meaning":"sản xuất; cuộc họp; đầu ra; năng suất"},{"word":"specialize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈspeʃ.ə.laɪz/","meaning":"chuyên môn hóa"},{"word":"consultant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/kənˈsʌl.tənt/","meaning":"tư vấn viên, cố vấn"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó đã tổ chức lại phòng thí nghiệm của khách hàng.","Nó đã chuyển đổi phương tiện của mình sang sử dụng nhiên liệu sinh học.","Nó đã mở rộng nhân sự tại cơ sở sản xuất của mình.","Nó đã giúp khách hàng tổ chức một triển lãm thương mại."]},{"questionNum":"168","passageTitle":"https://trexdale.com/aboutus About Our Company","passageText":"https://trexdale.com/aboutus About Our Company\n\nTrexdale Supply specializes in designing, producing, and installing furniture for all types of scientific laboratories. We provide a range of fully assembled cabinets, workstations, benches, and more, all made exclusively at our production facility in Dallas, Texas. Our lab furniture is available in a wide variety of sizes and configurations to match the needs of any research application.\n\nOur business offers products as well as design-consulting services. For start-up labs, we have a team of consulting specialists available to evaluate your facility''s specific needs and assist you in arranging your space and choosing the most suitable furniture. Recently, for example, we were chosen by a major producer of biofuels to provide expert help in changing the layout of a research laboratory to maximize available space. As a result of this project, this client has realized substantial savings by reducing energy usage in the lab.\n\nPlease visit the“Lab Planning\" section of this Web site if you are interested in learning more about building or renovating a laboratory facility. There, you can fill out an interest form to contact one of our consultants about your next project.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"https://trexdale.com/aboutus About Our Company\n\nTrexdale Supply specializes in designing, producing, and installing furniture for all types of scientific laboratories. We provide a range of fully assembled cabinets, workstations, benches, and more, all made exclusively at our production facility in Dallas, Texas. Our lab furniture is available in a wide variety of sizes and configurations to match the needs of any research application.\n\nOur business offers products as well as design-consulting services. For start-up labs, we have a team of consulting specialists available to evaluate your facility''s specific needs and assist you in arranging your space and choosing the most suitable furniture. Recently, for example, we were chosen by a major producer of biofuels to provide expert help in changing the layout of a research laboratory to maximize available space. As a result of this project, this client has realized substantial savings by reducing energy usage in the lab.\n\nPlease visit the“Lab Planning\" section of this Web site if you are interested in learning more about building or renovating a laboratory facility. There, you can fill out an interest form to contact one of our consultants about your next project."}],"question":"What method of communicatingwith Trexdale Supply is mentioned?","bilingual":"Phương thức liên lạc nào với Trexdale Supply được đề cập?","options":["By e-mail","By phone","By instant message","By an online form"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"By an online form\".","vocabList":[{"word":"application","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌæp.ləˈkeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"ứng dụng, sự áp dụng"},{"word":"specialize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈspeʃ.ə.laɪz/","meaning":"chuyên môn hóa"},{"word":"production","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pərˈdəkʃən/","meaning":"sản xuất; cuộc họp; đầu ra; năng suất"},{"word":"consultant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/kənˈsʌl.tənt/","meaning":"tư vấn viên, cố vấn"}],"optionMeanings":["Bởi e - mail","Qua điện thoại","Bằng tin nhắn tức thời","Bằng một hình thức trực tuyến"]},{"questionNum":"169","passageTitle":"PRODUCTDEMONSTRATORSNEEDED!","passageText":"PRODUCTDEMONSTRATORSNEEDED!\n\nAre you outgoing and enthusiastic? -[1] -. Do you enjoy talking to all types of people? Put your personality and communication skills to work! -[2] -.BBD Staffing is seeking to hire in-store product demonstrators to promote our clients'' m erchandise to shoppers.-[3] -.As a member of our team, you will demonstrate a wide range of small kitchen appliances and tools in grocery stores and other retail venues. For some products, you will be required to prepare simple recipes. You will also need to answer shoppers'' questions. Thus, it is essential that you can become familiar with clients products and provide key information to consumers. Because many of the demonstrations require working with food, candidates must have a Professional Food Handler certificate.[4]\n\nTo apply, upload a video of no more than one minute in length telling us why you would bea successful productdemonstratorat www.bbdstaffing.com/applications.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"PRODUCTDEMONSTRATORSNEEDED!\n\nAre you outgoing and enthusiastic? -[1] -. Do you enjoy talking to all types of people? Put your personality and communication skills to work! -[2] -.BBD Staffing is seeking to hire in-store product demonstrators to promote our clients'' m erchandise to shoppers.-[3] -.As a member of our team, you will demonstrate a wide range of small kitchen appliances and tools in grocery stores and other retail venues. For some products, you will be required to prepare simple recipes. You will also need to answer shoppers'' questions. Thus, it is essential that you can become familiar with clients products and provide key information to consumers. Because many of the demonstrations require working with food, candidates must have a Professional Food Handler certificate.[4]\n\nTo apply, upload a video of no more than one minute in length telling us why you would bea successful productdemonstratorat www.bbdstaffing.com/applications."}],"question":"What work experience would best qualify a candidate for the position?","bilingual":"Kinh nghiệm làm việc nào sẽ giúp ứng viên đủ điều kiện nhất cho vị trí này?","options":["Cook","Cashier","Interior designer","Event planner"],"c