oy talking to all types of people? Put your personality and communication skills to work! -[2] -.BBD Staffing is seeking to hire in-store product demonstrators to promote our clients'' m erchandise to shoppers.-[3] -.As a member of our team, you will demonstrate a wide range of small kitchen appliances and tools in grocery stores and other retail venues. For some products, you will be required to prepare simple recipes. You will also need to answer shoppers'' questions. Thus, it is essential that you can become familiar with clients products and provide key information to consumers. Because many of the demonstrations require working with food, candidates must have a Professional Food Handler certificate.[4]\n\nTo apply, upload a video of no more than one minute in length telling us why you would bea successful productdemonstratorat www.bbdstaffing.com/applications."}],"question":"According to the advertisement, what should people interested in applying do next?","bilingual":"Theo quảng cáo, những người quan tâm đến việc đăng ký nên làm gì tiếp theo?","options":["Respond to a survey","Arrange for an interview","Submit a recording","Provide references"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Submit a recording\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertisement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/æd.vɝːˈtaɪz.mənt/","meaning":"bản tin quảng cáo"},{"word":"communication","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəmˌjunəˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"trao đổi thông tin hoặc ý tưởng; chuyển khoản; đi qua"},{"word":"enthusiastic","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˌθuː.ziˈæs.tɪk/","meaning":"nhiệt tình, hứng khởi"},{"word":"professional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/prə''feʃənl/","meaning":"(thuộc) nghề, (thuộc) nghề nghiệp; có tay nghề"}],"optionMeanings":["Trả lời khảo sát","Sắp xếp một cuộc phỏng vấn","Gửi bản ghi","Cung cấp tài liệu tham khảo"]},{"questionNum":"171","passageTitle":"PRODUCTDEMONSTRATORSNEEDED!","passageText":"PRODUCTDEMONSTRATORSNEEDED!\n\nAre you outgoing and enthusiastic? -[1] -. Do you enjoy talking to all types of people? Put your personality and communication skills to work! -[2] -.BBD Staffing is seeking to hire in-store product demonstrators to promote our clients'' m erchandise to shoppers.-[3] -.As a member of our team, you will demonstrate a wide range of small kitchen appliances and tools in grocery stores and other retail venues. For some products, you will be required to prepare simple recipes. You will also need to answer shoppers'' questions. Thus, it is essential that you can become familiar with clients products and provide key information to consumers. Because many of the demonstrations require working with food, candidates must have a Professional Food Handler certificate.[4]\n\nTo apply, upload a video of no more than one minute in length telling us why you would bea successful productdemonstratorat www.bbdstaffing.com/applications.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"PRODUCTDEMONSTRATORSNEEDED!\n\nAre you outgoing and enthusiastic? -[1] -. Do you enjoy talking to all types of people? Put your personality and communication skills to work! -[2] -.BBD Staffing is seeking to hire in-store product demonstrators to promote our clients'' m erchandise to shoppers.-[3] -.As a member of our team, you will demonstrate a wide range of small kitchen appliances and tools in grocery stores and other retail venues. For some products, you will be required to prepare simple recipes. You will also need to answer shoppers'' questions. Thus, it is essential that you can become familiar with clients products and provide key information to consumers. Because many of the demonstrations require working with food, candidates must have a Professional Food Handler certificate.[4]\n\nTo apply, upload a video of no more than one minute in length telling us why you would bea successful productdemonstratorat www.bbdstaffing.com/applications."}],"question":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3], and[4] does the following sentence best belong? \"Many of the world''s best-known brands rely on our product demonstrators to generate positive impressions of their products.\"","bilingual":"Câu sau đây thuộc về vị trí nào trong số các vị trí được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]?“Many of the world''s best - các thương hiệu nổi tiếng dựa vào những người giới thiệu sản phẩm của chúng tôi để tạo ra những ấn tượng tích cực về sản phẩm của họ.”","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"[3]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"communication","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəmˌjunəˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"trao đổi thông tin hoặc ý tưởng; chuyển khoản; đi qua"},{"word":"enthusiastic","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˌθuː.ziˈæs.tɪk/","meaning":"nhiệt tình, hứng khởi"},{"word":"professional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/prə''feʃənl/","meaning":"(thuộc) nghề, (thuộc) nghề nghiệp; có tay nghề"},{"word":"demonstrate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈdem.ən.streɪt/","meaning":"làm mẫu, giải thích"}],"optionMeanings":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"]},{"questionNum":"172","passageTitle":"Gorman Unveils Newest | \"The Pro Phone 4is a game changer in","passageText":"Gorman Unveils Newest | \"The Pro Phone 4is a game changer in\n\nSmartphone Model | terms of its picture quality and sleek design,\"\n\nLONDON(20 April)Gorman Mobile said Hill.“Improvements were based on direct customer feedback, which cited the unveiled its newest smartphone to an eager poor camera functionality as the biggest reception at the annual Technobrit draw back of prior models. Our clients spoke, Conference. TheProPhone4,which and we listened and adapted accordingly.\" includes 512 GB of storage, a 7-inch screen [3] —\n\ndisplay, and an optional stylus pen, will hit | One similaritythat theProPhone4has\n\ntheshelvesoni June. Unlike its with previous models is the charger. Going predecessor-the Pro Phone 3it features a against the trend of competing wire less larger screen, an ultrawide camera lens, and companies, Gorman is instead focusing on\n\n8K-resolutionfilming capability. | convenience,\n\n[1].The 999 starting price is | \"We want to afford our customers the\n\nf100 more than that of the previous model. ability to reuse elements of the other Add-ons, such as the stylus pen, protective Gorman devices they''ve already purchased,\" case, and wire less head phones, cost an said Hill.\"Why add to the overload of cables additionalf39,59,and79,respectively. already in circulation?\"—[4]—, Gorman Product Manager Ian Hill doesn''t believe the price increase will dissuade customers. [2]","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Gorman Unveils Newest | \"The Pro Phone 4is a game changer in\n\nSmartphone Model | terms of its picture quality and sleek design,\"\n\nLONDON(20 April)Gorman Mobile said Hill.“Improvements were based on direct customer feedback, which cited the unveiled its newest smartphone to an eager poor camera functionality as the biggest reception at the annual Technobrit draw back of prior models. Our clients spoke, Conference. TheProPhone4,which and we listened and adapted accordingly.\" includes 512 GB of storage, a 7-inch screen [3] —\n\ndisplay, and an optional stylus pen, will hit | One similaritythat theProPhone4has\n\ntheshelvesoni June. Unlike its with previous models is the charger. Going predecessor-the Pro Phone 3it features a against the trend of competing wire less larger screen, an ultrawide camera lens, and companies, Gorman is instead focusing on\n\n8K-resolutionfilming capability. | convenience,\n\n[1].The 999 starting price is | \"We want to afford our customers the\n\nf100 more than that of the previous model. ability to reuse elements of the other Add-ons, such as the stylus pen, protective Gorman devices they''ve already purchased,\" case, and wire less head phones, cost an said Hill.\"Why add to the overload of cables additionalf39,59,and79,respectively. already in circulation?\"—[4]—, Gorman Product Manager Ian Hill doesn''t believe the price increase will dissuade customers. [2]"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the article?","bilingual":"","options":["To promote a technologys how","To introduce a product","To interview smartphone users","To announce are call of a device"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To introduce a product\".","vocabList":[{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"technology","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/tɛkˈnɑləʤi/","meaning":"khoa học nghệ thuật công nghiệp; khoa học ứng dụng"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"},{"word":"introduce","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪntrəˈdus/","meaning":"trình bày lần đầu tiên; bắt đầu; thành lập; ĐẾN"}]},{"questionNum":"173","passageTitle":"Gorman Unveils Newest | \"The Pro Phone 4is a game changer in","passageText":"Gorman Unveils Newest | \"The Pro Phone 4is a game changer in\n\nSmartphone Model | terms of its picture quality and sleek design,\"\n\nLONDON(20 April)Gorman Mobile said Hill.“Improvements were based on direct customer feedback, which cited the unveiled its newest smartphone to an eager poor camera functionality as the biggest reception at the annual Technobrit draw back of prior models. Our clients spoke, Conference. TheProPhone4,which and we listened and adapted accordingly.\" includes 512 GB of storage, a 7-inch screen [3] —\n\ndisplay, and an option