our customers the\n\nf100 more than that of the previous model. ability to reuse elements of the other Add-ons, such as the stylus pen, protective Gorman devices they''ve already purchased,\" case, and wire less head phones, cost an said Hill.\"Why add to the overload of cables additionalf39,59,and79,respectively. already in circulation?\"—[4]—, Gorman Product Manager Ian Hill doesn''t believe the price increase will dissuade customers. [2]","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Gorman Unveils Newest | \"The Pro Phone 4is a game changer in\n\nSmartphone Model | terms of its picture quality and sleek design,\"\n\nLONDON(20 April)Gorman Mobile said Hill.“Improvements were based on direct customer feedback, which cited the unveiled its newest smartphone to an eager poor camera functionality as the biggest reception at the annual Technobrit draw back of prior models. Our clients spoke, Conference. TheProPhone4,which and we listened and adapted accordingly.\" includes 512 GB of storage, a 7-inch screen [3] —\n\ndisplay, and an optional stylus pen, will hit | One similaritythat theProPhone4has\n\ntheshelvesoni June. Unlike its with previous models is the charger. Going predecessor-the Pro Phone 3it features a against the trend of competing wire less larger screen, an ultrawide camera lens, and companies, Gorman is instead focusing on\n\n8K-resolutionfilming capability. | convenience,\n\n[1].The 999 starting price is | \"We want to afford our customers the\n\nf100 more than that of the previous model. ability to reuse elements of the other Add-ons, such as the stylus pen, protective Gorman devices they''ve already purchased,\" case, and wire less head phones, cost an said Hill.\"Why add to the overload of cables additionalf39,59,and79,respectively. already in circulation?\"—[4]—, Gorman Product Manager Ian Hill doesn''t believe the price increase will dissuade customers. [2]"}],"question":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2],[3], and [4] does the following sentence best belong? \"These upgrades do come at a cost.\"","bilingual":"Câu sau đây thuộc về vị trí nào trong số các vị trí được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]? “Những nâng cấp này phải trả giá”.","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"[1]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"},{"word":"reception","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ri''sep∫n/","meaning":"sự nhận, sự thu nhận, sự lĩnh"},{"word":"position","pos":"Verb (Động từ)","level":"B1","ipa":"/pəˈzɪʃn/","meaning":"đặt vào vị trí"}],"optionMeanings":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"]},{"questionNum":"176","passageTitle":"WORKORDER:7549","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nWORKORDER:7549\n\nRequester: | Xi, Gina\n\nDate Entered: | Wednesday,9 April\n\nDate Due: | Thursday,10 April\n\nType: | Technology end-user request\n\nSummary: | Voic e-mail security settings\n\nTechnician Assigned: | Arnold, Sam\n\nComputer Workstation ID: | HYS31\n\nDescription: Is it possible to remove the new layers of security on my voice mail in the new phone system? I really don''t want to use a password, and I certainly don''t want to change it every month. I don''t need a high degree of security because my work is not confidential. If someone else gained access to my messages, it wouldn''t do much harm.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Gina Xi\n\nFrom: | Sam Arnold\n\nDate: | Thursday,10 April\n\nSubject: | Tech supportrequest7549\n\nHello, Ms. Xi, This is in reference to your work order 7549 related to the new phone system.I am happy to help you with that. I understand that you do not feel that a high degree of security is needed for your voic e-mail settings, but the new system does require you to have a password to retrieve your voice mail. However, company policy allows me to change the settings for employees who do not work with confidential material.I can update the security settings so that you do not have to reset the password on a regular basis. I want to make sure that you understand the risk involved with a lower level of security. Anyone who gains access to your voic e-mail account can do more than simply listen to your messages. They would be able to delete messages, change your grccting, or change your password so that you would lose access to your own voice mail (at least until someone here at IT could over ride the password change). If you still feel comfortable with that level of risk, let me know, and I will change the settings so that your password never expires. Sam Arnold Tech Support Associate","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"WORKORDER:7549\n\nRequester: | Xi, Gina\n\nDate Entered: | Wednesday,9 April\n\nDate Due: | Thursday,10 April\n\nType: | Technology end-user request\n\nSummary: | Voic e-mail security settings\n\nTechnician Assigned: | Arnold, Sam\n\nComputer Workstation ID: | HYS31\n\nDescription: Is it possible to remove the new layers of security on my voice mail in the new phone system? I really don''t want to use a password, and I certainly don''t want to change it every month. I don''t need a high degree of security because my work is not confidential. If someone else gained access to my messages, it wouldn''t do much harm."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Gina Xi\n\nFrom: | Sam Arnold\n\nDate: | Thursday,10 April\n\nSubject: | Tech supportrequest7549\n\nHello, Ms. Xi, This is in reference to your work order 7549 related to the new phone system.I am happy to help you with that. I understand that you do not feel that a high degree of security is needed for your voic e-mail settings, but the new system does require you to have a password to retrieve your voice mail. However, company policy allows me to change the settings for employees who do not work with confidential material.I can update the security settings so that you do not have to reset the password on a regular basis. I want to make sure that you understand the risk involved with a lower level of security. Anyone who gains access to your voic e-mail account can do more than simply listen to your messages. They would be able to delete messages, change your grccting, or change your password so that you would lose access to your own voice mail (at least until someone here at IT could over ride the password change). If you still feel comfortable with that level of risk, let me know, and I will change the settings so that your password never expires. Sam Arnold Tech Support Associate"}],"question":"What does Ms.Xi''s request indicate about the company?","bilingual":"Yêu cầu của bà Xi cho biết gì về công ty?","options":["It provides mobile phones to some employees.","Its employees value confidentiality.","It has recently changed its phone system.","It offers technology training to employees."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It has recently changed its phone system.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"technology","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/tɛkˈnɑləʤi/","meaning":"khoa học nghệ thuật công nghiệp; khoa học ứng dụng"},{"word":"technician","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/tekˈnɪʃ.ən/","meaning":"kỹ thuật viên"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó cung cấp điện thoại di động cho một số người nhân viên.","Nhân viên của nó coi trọng sự bảo mật.","Gần đây nó đã thay đổi hệ thống điện thoại.","Nó cung cấp đào tạo về công nghệ cho nhân viên. (D) Bằng cách đề xuất chỉ thực hiện một phần yêu cầu của bà Xi."]},{"questionNum":"177","passageTitle":"WORKORDER:7549","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nWORKORDER:7549\n\nRequester: | Xi, Gina\n\nDate Entered: | Wednesday,9 April\n\nDate Due: | Thursday,10 April\n\nType: | Technology end-user request\n\nSummary: | Voic e-mail security settings\n\nTechnician Assigned: | Arnold, Sam\n\nComputer Workstation ID: | HYS31\n\nDescription: Is it possible to remove the new layers of security on my voice mail in the new phone system? I really don''t want to use a password, and I certainly don''t want to change it every month. I don''t need a high degree of security because my work is not confidential. If someone else gained access to my messages, it wouldn''t do much harm.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Gina Xi\n\nFrom: | Sam Arnold\n\nDate: | Thursday,10 April\n\nSubject: | Tech supportrequest7549\n\nHello, Ms. Xi, This is in reference to your work order 7549 related to the new phone system.I am happy to help you with that. I understand that you do not feel that a high degree of security is needed for your voic e-mail settings, but the new system does require you to have a password to retrieve your voice mail. However, company policy allows me to change the settings for employees who do not work with confidential material.I can update the security settings so that you do not have to reset the password on a regular basis. I want to make sure that you understand the risk involved with a lower level of security. Anyone who gains access to your voic e-mail account can do more than simply listen to your messages. They would be able to delete messages, change your grccting, or change your password so that you would lose access to your own voice mail (at least until someone here at IT could over ride the password change). If you still feel comfortable with that level of risk, let me know, and I will change the settings so that your password never expires. Sam Arnold Tech Support Associate","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"WORKORDER:7549\n\nRequester: | Xi, Gina\n\nDate Entered: | Wednesday,9 April\n\nDate Due: | Thursday,10 April\n\nType: | Technology end-user request\n\nSummary: | Voic e-mail security settings\n\nTechnician Assigned: | Arnold, Sam\n\nComputer Workstation ID: | HYS31\n\nDescription: Is it possible to remove the new layers of security on my voice mail in the new phone system? I really don''t want to use a password, and I certainly don''t want to change it every month. I don''t need a high degree of security because my work is not confidential. If someone else gained access to my messages, it wouldn''t do much harm."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Gina Xi\n\nFrom: | Sam Arnold\n\nDate: | Thursday,10 April\n\nSubject: | Tech supportrequest7549\n\nHello, Ms. Xi, This is in reference to your work order 7549 related to the new phone system.I am happy to help you with that. I understand that you do not feel that a high degree of security is needed for your voic e-mail settings, but the new system does require you to have a password to retrieve your voice mail. However, company policy allows me to change the settings for employees who do not work with confidential material.I can update the security settings so that you do not have to reset the password on a regular basis. I want to make sure that you understand the risk involved with a lower level of security. Anyone who gains access to your voic e-mail account can do more than simply listen to your messages. They would be able to delete messages, change your grccting, or change your password so that you would lose access to your own voice mail (at least until someone here at IT could over ride the password change). If you still feel comfortable with that level of risk, let me know, and I will change the settings so that your password never expires. Sam Arnold Tech Support Associate"}],"question":"In the e-mail, the word \"regular\" in paragraph 1, line 6, is closest in meaning to","bilingual":"Trong e -mail, từ “regular” ở đoạn 1, dòng 6, có ý nghĩa gần nhất với","options":["periodic","orderly","customary","legitimate"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"periodic\".","vocabList":[{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"technology","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/tɛkˈnɑləʤi/","meaning":"khoa học nghệ thuật công nghiệp; khoa học ứng dụng"},{"word":"technician","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/tekˈnɪʃ.ən/","meaning":"kỹ thuật viên"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"}],"optionMeanings":["định kỳ","có trật tự","thông lệ","hợp pháp"]},{"questionNum":"178","passageTitle":"WORKORDER:7549","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nWORKORDER:7549\n\nRequester: | Xi, Gina\n\nDate Entered: | Wednesday,9 April\n\nDate Due: | Thursday,10 April\n\nType: | Technology end-user request\n\nSummary: | Voic e-mail security settings\n\nTechnician Assigned: | Arnold, Sam\n\nComputer Workstation ID: | HYS31\n\nDescription: Is it possible to remove the new layers of security on my voice mail in the new phone system? I really don''t want to use a password, and I certainly don''t want to change it every month. I don''t need a high degree of security because my work is not confidential. If someone else gained access to my messages, it wouldn''t do much harm.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Gina Xi\n\nFrom: | Sam Arnold\n\nDate: | Thursday,10 April\n\nSubject: | Tech supportrequest7549\n\nHello, Ms. Xi, This is in reference to your work order 7549 related to the new phone system.I am happy to help you with that. I understand that you do not feel that a high degree of security is needed for your voic e-mail settings, but the new system does require you to have a password to retrieve your voice mail. However, company policy allows me to change the settings for employees who do not work with confidential material.I can update the security settings so that you do not have to reset the password on a regular basis. I want to make sure that you understand the risk involved with a lower level of security. Anyone who gains access to your voic e-mail account can do more than simply listen to your messages. They would be able to delete messages, change your grccting, or change your password so that you would lose access to your own voice mail (at least until someone here at IT could over ride the password change). If you still feel comfortable with that level of risk, let me know, and I will change the settings so that your password never expires. Sam Arnold Tech Support Associate","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"WORKORDER:7549\n\nRequester: | Xi, Gina\n\nDate Entered: | Wednesday,9 April\n\nDate Due: | Thursday,10 April\n\nType: | Technology end-user request\n\nSummary: | Voic e-mail security settings\n\nTechnician Assigned: | Arnold, Sam\n\nComputer Workstation ID: | HYS31\n\nDescription: Is it possible to remove the new layers of security on my voice mail in the new phone system? I really don''t want to use a password, and I certainly don''t want to change it every month. I don''t need a high degree of security because my work is not confidential. If someone else gained access to my messages, it wouldn''t do much harm."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Gina Xi\n\nFrom: | Sam Arnold\n\nDate: | Thursday,10 April\n\nSubject: | Tech supportrequest7549\n\nHello, Ms. Xi, This is in reference to your work order 7549 related to the new phone system.I am happy to help you with that. I understand that you do not feel that a high degree of security is needed for your voic e-mail settings, but the new system does require you to have a password to retrieve your voice mail. However, company policy allows me to change the settings for employees who do not work with confidential material.I can update the security settings so that you do not have to reset the password on a regular basis. I want to make sure that you understand the risk involved with a lower level of security. Anyone who gains access to your voic e-mail account can do more than simply listen to your messages. They would be able to delete messages, change your grccting, or change your password so that you would lose access to your own voice mail (at least until someone here at IT could over ride the password change). If you still feel comfortable with that level of risk, let me know, and I will change the settings so that your password never expires. Sam Arnold Tech Support Associate"}],"question":"Where did Mr.Arnold learn about the details of Ms. Xi''s request?","bilingual":"Ông Arnold biết chi tiết yêu cầu của bà Tập ở đâu?","options":["In a weekly managers'' m eeting","In a work order","In a phone call","In a personal voice mail"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"In a work order\".","vocabList":[{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"technology","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/tɛkˈnɑləʤi/","meaning":"khoa học nghệ thuật công nghiệp; khoa học ứng dụng"},{"word":"technician","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/tekˈnɪʃ.ən/","meaning":"kỹ thuật viên"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"}],"optionMeanings":["Trong cuộc họp của các nhà quản lý hàng tuần","Theo yêu cầu công việc","Trong một cuộc gọi điện thoại","Trong thư thoại cá nhân"]},{"questionNum":"179","passageTitle":"WORKORDER:7549","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nWORKORDER:7549\n\nRequester: | Xi, Gina\n\nDate Entered: | Wednesday,9 April\n\nDate Due: | 