    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Dear Neighbot, Now that the long, cold winter is just behind us, we would l","passageText":"Dear Neighbot, Now that the long, cold winter is just behind us, we would love to invite you to help us improve the newly established Moon Township Community Garden. The township committee acquired the land where the community pool used to be located, and we hope to create on this land an area for families to come and enjoy the green space in our beautiful town, We will have volunteers on hand during the weekends for the remainder of the month to assist families with arranging and planting the flowers, shrubs, and trees of their choice. We hope you participate in decorating our beautiful community garden! Sincerely, Moon Township Committee for Green Spaces","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Dear Neighbot, Now that the long, cold winter is just behind us, we would love to invite you to help us improve the newly established Moon Township Community Garden. The township committee acquired the land where the community pool used to be located, and we hope to create on this land an area for families to come and enjoy the green space in our beautiful town, We will have volunteers on hand during the weekends for the remainder of the month to assist families with arranging and planting the flowers, shrubs, and trees of their choice. We hope you participate in decorating our beautiful community garden! Sincerely, Moon Township Committee for Green Spaces"}],"question":"During which season of the year was the notice most likely written?","bilingual":"Thông báo có nhiều khả năng được viết vào mùa nào trong năm?","options":["Winter","Spring","Summer","Autumn"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Spring\".","vocabList":[{"word":"participate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pɑrˈtɪsəˌpeɪt/","meaning":"được tham gia; tham gia vào"},{"word":"volunteers","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌvɑlənˈtɪrz/","meaning":"Tình nguyện viên"},{"word":"committee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/kəˈmɪt̬.i/","meaning":"ủy ban"},{"word":"beautiful","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈbjuː.t̬ə.fəl/","meaning":"xinh đẹp, tốt đẹp"}],"optionMeanings":["Mùa đông","Mùa xuân","Mùa hè","Mùa thu"]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"Dear Neighbot, Now that the long, cold winter is just behind us, we would l","passageText":"Dear Neighbot, Now that the long, cold winter is just behind us, we would love to invite you to help us improve the newly established Moon Township Community Garden. The township committee acquired the land where the community pool used to be located, and we hope to create on this land an area for families to come and enjoy the green space in our beautiful town, We will have volunteers on hand during the weekends for the remainder of the month to assist families with arranging and planting the flowers, shrubs, and trees of their choice. We hope you participate in decorating our beautiful community garden! Sincerely, Moon Township Committee for Green Spaces","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Dear Neighbot, Now that the long, cold winter is just behind us, we would love to invite you to help us improve the newly established Moon Township Community Garden. The township committee acquired the land where the community pool used to be located, and we hope to create on this land an area for families to come and enjoy the green space in our beautiful town, We will have volunteers on hand during the weekends for the remainder of the month to assist families with arranging and planting the flowers, shrubs, and trees of their choice. We hope you participate in decorating our beautiful community garden! Sincerely, Moon Township Committee for Green Spaces"}],"question":"What are families encouraged to do?","bilingual":"Các gia đình được khuyến khích làm gì?","options":["Use a community pool","Purchase flowers","Vote for township committee members","Help to plant a garden"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Help to plant a garden\".","vocabList":[{"word":"participate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pɑrˈtɪsəˌpeɪt/","meaning":"được tham gia; tham gia vào"},{"word":"volunteers","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌvɑlənˈtɪrz/","meaning":"Tình nguyện viên"},{"word":"encourage","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˈkɝː.ɪdʒ/","meaning":"động viên, cổ vũ"},{"word":"committee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/kəˈmɪt̬.i/","meaning":"ủy ban"}],"optionMeanings":["Sử dụng nhóm cộng đồng.","Mua hoa.","Bầu chọn các thành viên ủy ban thị trấn.","Giúp trồng một khu vườn. (A) Sử dụng bebơi cộng đồng. (B) Mua hoa.(C) Bỏ phiếu cho các thành viênủybanthịtrấn. (D) Giúp trồng vườn. VOCAB: - on hand: có sẵn - hỗ trợ (v) = help: help đỡ, hỗ trợB ẢN DỊCH: Sparkling Creek Coffeehouse & GrillPhiếu quà tặng Quà tặng Tới: Natasha TuckerSố tiền: $75 Từ: Hua XieTin nhắn: Cảm ơn sựgiúp đỡ của bạn với bài báo của tôi. Bạn đã thực hiện một công việc chỉnh sửa tuyệt vời! Được cấp quyền bởi: Jenny Lenox"]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Sparkling Creek Coffeehouse&Grill Gift Certificate Presented to: Natasha Tu","passageText":"Sparkling Creek Coffeehouse&Grill Gift Certificate Presented to: Natasha Tucker Amount: $75\n\nFrom: Hua Xie\n\nMessage: Thank you for your help with my article. You did a great job editing! Authorized by: Jenny Lenox","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Sparkling Creek Coffeehouse&Grill Gift Certificate Presented to: Natasha Tucker Amount: $75\n\nFrom: Hua Xie\n\nMessage: Thank you for your help with my article. You did a great job editing! Authorized by: Jenny Lenox"}],"question":"Why was Ms.Tucker given a gift certificate?","bilingual":"Tại sao cô Tucker lại được tặng phiếu quà tặng?","options":["To acknowledge good work at a restaurant","To express gratitude for help that was provided","To authorize a reward","To repay a loan"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To express gratitude for help that was provided\".","vocabList":[{"word":"restaurant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnt/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"express","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspres/","meaning":"công văn hỏa tốc; trình bày, diễn đạt"},{"word":"provide","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/prəˈvaɪd/","meaning":"cung cấp; cấp ; để thiết lập; cung cấp"},{"word":"present","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈprɛzənt/","meaning":"hiển thị; để chứng minh; ban cho ; cấp"}],"optionMeanings":["Để ghi nhận công việc tốt ở nhà hàng.","Để bày tỏ lòng biết ơn vì sự giúp đỡ đã được cung cấp.","Để cho phép nhận phần thưởng.","Để trả nợ. (B) để bày bày tỏ rõ ràng đối với sự thậthelp đỡđã được cung cấp. (C) Để cấp quyền một phần thưởng. (D) Để trả lại một khoản vay."]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Sparkling Creek Coffeehouse&Grill Gift Certificate Presented to: Natasha Tu","passageText":"Sparkling Creek Coffeehouse&Grill Gift Certificate Presented to: Natasha Tucker Amount: $75\n\nFrom: Hua Xie\n\nMessage: Thank you for your help with my article. You did a great job editing! Authorized by: Jenny Lenox","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Sparkling Creek Coffeehouse&Grill Gift Certificate Presented to: Natasha Tucker Amount: $75\n\nFrom: Hua Xie\n\nMessage: Thank you for your help with my article. You did a great job editing! Authorized by: Jenny Lenox"}],"question":"Who most likely is Ms.Lenox?","bilingual":"Cô Lenox có nhiều khả năng là ai nhất?","options":["An employee at a restaurant","Afriend of Ms.Tucker''s","An editor","Ms. Xie''s assistant"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"An employee at a restaurant\".","vocabList":[{"word":"restaurant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnt/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"assistant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈsɪstənt/","meaning":"người giúp đỡ cấp trên; phụ tá; người trợ giúp"},{"word":"employee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ɪmˈplɔɪi/","meaning":"công nhân; người làm việc cho một công ty hoặc một"},{"word":"present","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈprɛzənt/","meaning":"hiển thị; để chứng minh; ban cho ; cấp"}],"optionMeanings":["Một nhân viên tại một nhà hàng.","Một người bạn của cô Tucker.","Một biên tập viên.","Trợ lý của cô Xie."]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"Welcome E-mail Warmly welcome new staff to our team Include dates for train","passageText":"Welcome E-mail Warmly welcome new staff to our team Include dates for training sessions Include daily training schedule (as attachment) Provide phone numbers of mentors Create list of documents to bring\n\nOnboarding Announce start dates Include information about social gathering to welcome new hires and allow them to meet company leaders Contact the Technology Team to create e-mail accounts Prepare new D badges and keys Prepare benefits packages (health insurance and retirement) Personally meet new hires upon their arrival","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Welcome E-mail Warmly welcome new staff to our team Include dates for training sessions Include daily training schedule (as attachment) Provide phone numbers of mentors Create list of documents to bring\n\nOnboarding Announce start dates Include information about social gathering to welcome new hires and allow them to meet company leaders Contact the Technology Team to create e-mail accounts Prepare new D badges and keys Prepare benefits packages (health insurance and retirement) Personally meet new hires upon their arrival"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the checklist?","bilingual":"Mục đích của việc này là gì danh sách kiểm tra?","options":["To announce a new e-mail system","To prepare for new employees","To assist people who are leaving a company","To notify trainers of a schedule"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To prepare for new employees\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"attachment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtætʃ.mənt/","meaning":"sự gắn thêm; phần kèm thêm"},{"word":"technology","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/tɛkˈnɑləʤi/","meaning":"khoa học nghệ thuật công nghiệp; khoa học ứng dụng"},{"word":"retirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtaɪərmənt/","meaning":"sự ẩn dật, sự về hưu"}],"optionMeanings":["Để thông báo một e mới - hệ thống thư.","Để chuẩn bị cho nhân viên mới.","Để hỗ trợ những người sắp rời công ty.","Để thông báo cho giảng viên về lịch trình."]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"Welcome E-mail Warmly welcome new staff to our team Include dates for train","passageText":"Welcome E-mail Warmly welcome new staff to our team Include dates for training sessions Include daily training schedule (as attachment) Provide phone numbers of mentors Create list of documents to bring\n\nOnboarding Announce start dates Include information about social gathering to welcome new hires and allow them to meet company leaders Contact the Technology Team to create e-mail accounts Prepare new D badges and keys Prepare benefits packages (health insurance and retirement) Personally meet new hires upon their arrival","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Welcome E-mail Warmly welcome new staff to our team Include dates for training sessions Include daily training schedule (as attachment) Provide phone numbers of mentors Create list of documents to bring\n\nOnboarding Announce start dates Include information about social gathering to welcome new hires and allow them to meet company leaders Contact the Technology Team to create e-mail accounts Prepare new D badges and keys Prepare benefits packages (health insurance and retirement) Personally meet new hires upon their arrival"}],"question":"What is one goal of the social gathering?","bilingual":"Một mục tiêu của buổi tụ tập giao lưu là gì?","options":["To meet managers","To learn about benefits","To receive identification documents","To begin training exercises"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"To meet managers\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"attachment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtætʃ.mənt/","meaning":"sự gắn thêm; phần kèm thêm"},{"word":"technology","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/tɛkˈnɑləʤi/","meaning":"khoa học nghệ thuật công nghiệp; khoa học ứng dụng"},{"word":"retirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtaɪərmənt/","meaning":"sự ẩn dật, sự về hưu"}],"optionMeanings":["Để gặp gỡ các nhà quản lý.","Để tìm hiểu về các lợi ích.","Để nhận tài liệu nhận dạng.","Để bắt đầu bài tập huấn luyện."]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Lucy 0''Malley (1:36P.M.) I am at the office, but I can''t find the Miller fi","passageText":"Lucy 0''Malley (1:36P.M.) I am at the office, but I can''t find the Miller file anywhere.\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:37 P.M.) Did you check in the future projects file cabinet?\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:39 P.M.) No luck. Any other ideas?\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:40 P.M.) I bet it is in Charles Wada''s office. Check on his desk and let me know.\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:47 P.M.) Got it! How would you like me to get this to you?\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:48 P.M.) Would it be too much to ask you to deliver it? We need the original documents with signatures. Please get here as soon as you can.\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:50 P.M.) Not a problem. I''ll take a taxi.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Lucy 0''Malley (1:36P.M.) I am at the office, but I can''t find the Miller file anywhere.\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:37 P.M.) Did you check in the future projects file cabinet?\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:39 P.M.) No luck. Any other ideas?\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:40 P.M.) I bet it is in Charles Wada''s office. Check on his desk and let me know.\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:47 P.M.) Got it! How would you like me to get this to you?\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:48 P.M.) Would it be too much to ask you to deliver it? We need the original documents with signatures. Please get here as soon as you can.\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:50 P.M.) Not a problem. I''ll take a taxi."}],"question":"At1:39p.M.,what does Ms.O''Malleymost likely mean when she writes,\"No luck\"?","bilingual":"Vào lúc 1:39 chiều, rất có thể cô O''Malley có ý gì khi viết \"Không may mắn\"?","options":["She does not support a future project.","She is unsure where a coworker''s office is.","She was unable to find something.","She needs more instruction from vir.vvaaa."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"She was unable to find something.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"coworker","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkoʊˈwɝː.kɚ/","meaning":"đồng nghiệp"},{"word":"anywhere","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɛniˌwɛr/","meaning":"bất cứ nơi nào"},{"word":"document","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"B1","ipa":"/ˈdɒk.jə.mənt/","meaning":"tài liệu, văn kiện"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô ấy không hỗ trợ một dự án trong tương lai.","Cô ấy không chắc văn phòng của đồng nghiệp ở đâu.","Cô ấy không thể tìm thấy thứ gì đó.","Cô ấy cần thêm sự hướng dẫn từ Mr. Wada."]},{"questionNum":"154","passageTitle":"Lucy 0''Malley (1:36P.M.) I am at the office, but I can''t find the Miller fi","passageText":"Lucy 0''Malley (1:36P.M.) I am at the office, but I can''t find the Miller file anywhere.\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:37 P.M.) Did you check in the future projects file cabinet?\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:39 P.M.) No luck. Any other ideas?\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:40 P.M.) I bet it is in Charles Wada''s office. Check on his desk and let me know.\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:47 P.M.) Got it! How would you like me to get this to you?\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:48 P.M.) Would it be too much to ask you to deliver it? We need the original documents with signatures. Please get here as soon as you can.\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:50 P.M.) Not a problem. I''ll take a taxi.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Lucy 0''Malley (1:36P.M.) I am at the office, but I can''t find the Miller file anywhere.\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:37 P.M.) Did you check in the future projects file cabinet?\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:39 P.M.) No luck. Any other ideas?\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:40 P.M.) I bet it is in Charles Wada''s office. Check on his desk and let me know.\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:47 P.M.) Got it! How would you like me to get this to you?\n\nStanley Hamstead (1:48 P.M.) Would it be too much to ask you to deliver it? We need the original documents with signatures. Please get here as soon as you can.\n\nLucy O''Malley (1:50 P.M.) Not a problem. I''ll take a taxi."}],"question":"What will Ms.O''Malley probably do next?","bilingual":"Cô O''Malley có thể sẽ làm gì tiếp theo?","options":["E-mail some documents","Call a courier service","Deliver some documents herself","Contact Mr.Wada"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Deliver some documents herself\".","vocabList":[{"word":"probably","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´prɔbəbli/","meaning":"có khả năng, có lẽ, có thể"},{"word":"document","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"B1","ipa":"/ˈdɒk.jə.mənt/","meaning":"tài liệu, văn kiện"},{"word":"anywhere","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɛniˌwɛr/","meaning":"bất cứ nơi nào"},{"word":"service","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sə:vis/","meaning":"sự phục vụ, sự hầu hạ"}],"optionMeanings":["E -gửi một số tài liệu","Gọi cho dịch vụ chuyển phát nhanh.","Tự mình giao một số tài liệu.","Liên hệ Mr. Wada."]},{"questionNum":"155","passageTitle":"Fetler Airlines Tarmac Delay Contingency Plan On board departure delays are","passageText":"Fetler Airlines Tarmac Delay Contingency Plan On board departure delays are situations we do our best to avoid. On rare occasions, weather, visibility, airport conditions, or other circumstances cause unavoidable ground delays. In these cases, if the delay lasts more than 60 minutes, we will provide complimentary snacks and beverages. If the delay continues for more than two hours (for domestic flights) or three hours (for international flights), the aircraft will return to the gate, and passengers can get off the plane. Passengers will receive notifications at the gate every 30 minutes regarding the status of the delay. These notifications will include the reasons for the delay and whether further amenities will be available such as meal or hotel vouchers.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Fetler Airlines Tarmac Delay Contingency Plan On board departure delays are situations we do our best to avoid. On rare occasions, weather, visibility, airport conditions, or other circumstances cause unavoidable ground delays. In these cases, if the delay lasts more than 60 minutes, we will provide complimentary snacks and beverages. If the delay continues for more than two hours (for domestic flights) or three hours (for international flights), the aircraft will return to the gate, and passengers can get off the plane. Passengers will receive notifications at the gate every 30 minutes regarding the status of the delay. These notifications will include the reasons for the delay and whether further amenities will be available such as meal or hotel vouchers."}],"question":"What is the purpose of the notice?","bilingual":"Mục đích của thông báo là gì?","options":["To apologize for a flight delay","To list in-flight beverage options","To describe flight safety procedures","To explain an airline policy"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To explain an airline policy\".","vocabList":[{"word":"circumstances","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈsɝː.kəm.stæns/","meaning":"hoàn cảnh, tình huống"},{"word":"complimentary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkɑːm.pləˈmen.t̬ɚ.i/","meaning":"ngợi khen, đánh giá cao"},{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"conditions","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈdɪʃənz/","meaning":"điều kiện"}],"optionMeanings":["Để xin lỗi vì chuyến bay bị chậm trễ.","Để liệt kê trong -tùy chọn đồ uống trên chuyến bay.","Để mô tả các thủ tục an toàn chuyến bay.","Để giải thích chính sách của hãng hàng không."]},{"questionNum":"156","passageTitle":"Fetler Airlines Tarmac Delay Contingency Plan On board departure delays are","passageText":"Fetler Airlines Tarmac Delay Contingency Plan On board departure delays are situations we do our best to avoid. On rare occasions, weather, visibility, airport conditions, or other circumst