e ground delays. In these cases, if the delay lasts more than 60 minutes, we will provide complimentary snacks and beverages. If the delay continues for more than two hours (for domestic flights) or three hours (for international flights), the aircraft will return to the gate, and passengers can get off the plane. Passengers will receive notifications at the gate every 30 minutes regarding the status of the delay. These notifications will include the reasons for the delay and whether further amenities will be available such as meal or hotel vouchers."}],"question":"The word\"status\"in paragraph 1, line 7,is closest in meaning to","bilingual":"Từ “status” trong đoạn 1, dòng 7, gần nghĩa nhất với","options":["rank","lateness","condition","supervisor"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"condition\".","vocabList":[{"word":"circumstances","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈsɝː.kəm.stæns/","meaning":"hoàn cảnh, tình huống"},{"word":"complimentary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkɑːm.pləˈmen.t̬ɚ.i/","meaning":"ngợi khen, đánh giá cao"},{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"supervisor","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈsupərˌvaɪzər/","meaning":"người giám sát; giám đốc; giám đốc"}],"optionMeanings":["cấp bậc","độ trễ","điều kiện","người giám sát"]},{"questionNum":"158","passageTitle":"MARIGOLD CITY (11 May)The Marigold City Council has received a draft of the","passageText":"MARIGOLD CITY (11 May)The Marigold City Council has received a draft of the plans to build a new sports aren a in outer Marigold. The aren a, which will host both sporting events and concerts, will be built on the site of the former Marigold Furniture Factory. The building has remained empty since Marigold Furniture moved production to another location over five years ago. The aren a''s designers now need to send the construction plans to the city''s planning commission for acceptance. Building can begin once the plans, and any revisions, are accepted. Construction is expected to start early next year and take approximately two years.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"MARIGOLD CITY (11 May)The Marigold City Council has received a draft of the plans to build a new sports aren a in outer Marigold. The aren a, which will host both sporting events and concerts, will be built on the site of the former Marigold Furniture Factory. The building has remained empty since Marigold Furniture moved production to another location over five years ago. The aren a''s designers now need to send the construction plans to the city''s planning commission for acceptance. Building can begin once the plans, and any revisions, are accepted. Construction is expected to start early next year and take approximately two years."}],"question":"The word \"draft\" in paragraph 1, line 2, is Teword closest in meaning to","bilingual":"Từ “bản nháp” trong đoạn 1, dòng 2, gần nghĩa nhất với","options":["wind","cost","version","change"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"version\".","vocabList":[{"word":"approximately","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈprɑksəmətli/","meaning":"gần như; Về; xung quanh; khoảng"},{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"xây dựng; kết cấu; ngành xây dựng tòa nhà"},{"word":"production","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pərˈdəkʃən/","meaning":"sản xuất; cuộc họp; đầu ra; năng suất"},{"word":"furniture","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈfɝː.nɪ.tʃɚ/","meaning":"đồ đạc"}],"optionMeanings":["gió","chi phí","phiên bản","thay đổi"]},{"questionNum":"159","passageTitle":"MARIGOLD CITY (11 