iful walls and ceilings inside your home, ask for Jasmine Leaf Paint at a quality paint store near you.[4].","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"United Kingdom''s Top-Selling Paint Just Got Better\n\nMore Choices for Jasmine Leaf Paint Jasmine Leaf Paint has been the number one selling house paint for the last five years in a row. -[1], But being the best.seller is not enough for us. [2] -, That''s why we are bringing you additional ways to make your home more beautiful! Our specially blended Blendex Formula interior paint and primer are prized for their stain resistance, excellent coverage, low-odourformula, ease of cleanup, and lifetime guarantee. In addition, we are now offering our paints in cans of five different sizes. And you can now get our paints in five beautiful finishes:flat, eggshell, sat in, semigloss, and high gloss. —[3] —,\n\nIf you want rich, long-lasting, beautiful walls and ceilings inside your home, ask for Jasmine Leaf Paint at a quality paint store near you.[4]."}],"question":"What is new about Jasmine Leaf Paint?","bilingual":"Sơn Lá Lài có gì mới?","options":["It isnowstainresistant.","It now features a lifetime guarantee.","It is now thicker.","It is now available in more sizes."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It is now available in more sizes.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"guarantee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɡer.ənˈtiː/","meaning":"sự đảm bảo; cam kết"},{"word":"available","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈveɪ.lə.bəl/","meaning":"có sẵn để dùng"},{"word":"beautiful","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈbjuː.t̬ə.fəl/","meaning":"xinh đẹp, tốt đẹp"}],"optionMeanings":["Hiện tại nó có khả năng chống vết bẩn.","Hiện tại nó có tính năn