marked [1], [2], [3], and [4] does the following sentence best belong? \"This all means more convenient options for you.\"","bilingual":"Câu sau đây phù hợp nhất với vị trí nào trong số các vị trí được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]?“Điều này đồng nghĩa với việc bạn sẽ có nhiều lựa chọn thuận tiện hơn”.","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"[3]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"convenient","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈvinjənt/","meaning":"thoải mái; hữu ích; có thể sử dụng được"},{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"beautiful","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈbjuː.t̬ə.fəl/","meaning":"xinh đẹp, tốt đẹp"},{"word":"excellent","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈek.səl.ənt/","meaning":"xuất sắc, ưu tú"}],"optionMeanings":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"]},{"questionNum":"164","passageTitle":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Lily Kwan, lkwan@itamitheater.com SEATTLE (Apri","passageText":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Lily Kwan, lkwan@itamitheater.com SEATTLE (April 10)-Following the recent announcement that Artistic Director Lucas Freel and has stepped down, the Itami Theater Board of Directors has appointed Xu Li as the interim artistic director. -[1]. Ms. Li has been at Itami for -[1].Ms.Li has been at Itami for ten years, serving as director of new play development. Ms. Li has been pivotal in Itami''s artistic direction. [2]. She will continue to guide the play selection for next season. \"I am honored that the board trusts me to carry forward the work that the entire team at Itami Theater has established,\" said Ms. Li. I am excited to work with our dedicated staff, everyone from stage hands to costume designers, to build a thrilling season next year.\" In addition to overseeing the development of new plays for the theater, Ms. Li is a director. -[3], Later this season, she will direct Forest Creatures, written by the award-winning play wright May Nunes. “Ms. Li is a wise choice to serve as Itami''s interim artistic director,\" says Executive Director John Stojanowski. “Her deep theatrical knowledge will help Itami Theater continue its artistic endeavors after the departure of Mr. Freel and and during the search for a permanent artistic director.\" -[4] -. The board of directors is committed to taking its time in its search for a permanent artistic director. The board is pursuing candidates from across the country and expects the hiring process to take six to nine months.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Lily Kwan, lkwan@itamitheater.com SEATTLE (April 10)-Following the recent announcement that Artistic Director Lucas Freel and has stepped down, the Itami Theater Board of Directors has appointed Xu Li as the interim artistic director. -[1]. Ms. Li has been at Itami for -[1].Ms.Li has been at Itami for ten years, serving as director of new play development. Ms. Li has been pivotal in Itami''s artistic direction. [2]. She will continue to guide the play selection for next season. \"I am honored that the board trusts me to carry forward the work that the entire team at Itami Theater has established,\" said Ms. Li. I am excited to work with our dedicated staff, everyone from stage hands to costume designers, to build a thrilling season next year.\" In addition to overseeing the development of new plays for the theater, Ms. Li is a director. -[3], Later this season, she will direct Forest Creatures, written by the award-winning play wright May Nunes. “Ms. Li is a wise choice to serve as Itami''s interim artistic director,\" says Executive Director John Stojanowski. “Her deep theatrical knowledge will help Itami Theater continue its artistic endeavors after the departure of Mr. Freel and and during the search for a permanent artistic director.\" -[4] -. The board of directors is committed to taking its time in its search for a permanent artistic director. The board is pursuing candidates from across the country and expects the hiring process to take six to nine months."}],"question":"What is suggested about the Itami Theater?","bilingual":"Điều gì được đề xuất về Nhà hát Itami?","options":["It focuses on new playwrights.","It is searching for a new costume designer.","It is building a second stage.","It has operated for over ten years."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It has operated for over ten years.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"announcement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈnaʊnsmɛnt/","meaning":"tuyên ngôn; để ý; hành động thông báo cho công chúng"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"direction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/dɪˈrɛkʃɪn/","meaning":"hướng dẫn; giám sát; tiến hành; sự quản lý"},{"word":"selection","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/si''lekʃn/","meaning":"sự lựa chọn, sự chọn lọc, sự tuyển lựa"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó tập trung vào các nhà viết kịch mới.","Đó là tìm kiếm một nhà thiết kế trang phục mới.","Nó đang xây dựng giai đoạn thứ hai.","Đã hoạt động được hơn mười năm."]},{"questionNum":"165","passageTitle":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Lily Kwan, lkwan@itamitheater.com SEATTLE (Apri","passageText":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Lily Kwan, lkwan@itamitheater.com SEATTLE (April 10)-Following the recent announcement that Artistic Director Lucas Freel and has stepped down, the Itami Theater Board of Directors has appointed Xu Li as the interim artistic director. -[1]. Ms. Li has been at Itami for -[1].Ms.Li has been at Itami for ten years, serving as director of new play development. Ms. Li has been pivotal in 