restaurants starting September 25. The initial launch includes three flavors: peppermint, lemon ginger, and hibiscus flower. More varieties are expected to be added next year. Next, Miguel Luna shared his pro to types of the tea boxes and discussed the sustain ability of the materials used to produce them. The colorful designs received positive feedback from meeting attendees. After that, Jennifer Lin provided a brief overview of the marketing budget for the product launch. Funds are currently limited to one advertising campaign. For more detailed information about the marketing budget, contact Ms. Lin directly. Finally, Vladimir Ikram led a discussion about advertising options. Radio advertisements have been successful in the past and are cheaper than television. Digital advertisements were also considered. The final decision was to start with print advertisements in The Southtown Times. The next meeting will be on August 17.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Meeting Minutes-August 10 In attendance: Miguel Luna, Jennifer Lin, Amal Taylor, Vladimir Ikram, Nevena Ivanova\n\nAmal Taylor, the product manager, opened the meeting, She reported that our new line of herbal teas will be on local store shelves and in restaurants starting September 25. The initial launch includes three flavors: peppermint, lemon ginger, and hibiscus flower. More varieties are expected to be added next year. Next, Miguel Luna shared his pro to types of the tea boxes and discussed the sustain ability of the materials used to produce them. The colorful designs received positive feedback from meeting attendees. After that, Jennifer Lin provided a brief overview of the marketing budget for the product launch. Funds are currently limited to one advertising campaign. For more detailed information about the marketing budget, contact Ms. Lin directly. Finally, Vladimir Ikram led a discussion about advertising options. Radio advertisements have been successful in the past and are cheaper than television. Digital advertisements were also considered. The final decision was to start with print advertisements in The Southtown Times. The next meeting will be on August 17."}],"question":"Where will the products initially be advertised?","bilingual":"Sản phẩm ban đầu sẽ được quảng cáo ở đâu?","options":["In a newspaper","In an online magazine","On the radio","On social media"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"In a newspaper\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertisement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/æd.vɝːˈtaɪz.mənt/","meaning":"bản tin quảng cáo"},{"word":"restaurants","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnts/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"advertising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈædvərˌtaɪzɪŋ/","meaning":"Quảng cáo"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"}],"optionMeanings":["Trên một tờ báo","Trên một tạp chí trực tuyến","Trên đài phát thanh","Trên mạng xã hội"]},{"questionNum":"172","passageTitle":"Joanne Matos(11:45A.M.) Tuyetand Jim, do you know where Ican find that big ","passageText":"Joanne Matos(11:45A.M.) Tuyetand Jim, do you know where Ican find that big signboard-the one that we usually post at the entrance to advertise when we''re having a sale inside?\n\nTuyet Nguyen (11:58 A.M.) Ihaven''t seen it lately. Why? Joanne Matos (11:59 A.M.) I''m setting up for this afternoon''s party under the tent out in the cafe court yard, and I want to have seating information posted for people as they arrive. Tuyet Nguyen (12:01 P.M.) Jim likely has it. He usually sets things up for ioidn those sales. But I think he''s gone for the day. Jim Thomas (12:02P.M.) No, I''m not! I''m out making a delivery right now, but I''ll be back soon. You can find the signboard in the alcove just inside our building''s delivery entrance. Just put it back when you''re done so that I can find it the next time I need it.\n\nJoanne Matos(12:04P.M.) No problem. Thanks!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Joanne Matos(11:45A.M.) Tuyetand Jim, do you know where Ican find that big signboard-the one that we usually post at the entrance to advertise when we''re having a sale inside?\n\nTuyet Nguyen (11:58 A.M.) Ihaven''t seen it lately. Why? Joanne Matos (11:59 A.M.) I''m setting up for this afternoon''s party under the tent out in the cafe court yard, and I want to have seating information posted for people as they arrive. Tuyet Nguyen (12:01 P.M.) Jim likely has it. He usually sets things up for ioidn those sales. But I think he''s gone for the day. Jim Thomas (12:02P.M.) No, I''m not! I''m out making a delivery right now, but I''ll be back soon. You can find the signboard in the alcove just inside our building''s delivery entrance. Just put it back when you''re done so that I can find it the next time I need it.\n\nJoanne Matos(12:04P.M.) No problem. Thanks!"}],"question":"Why did Ms.Matos begin the text-message chain?","bilingual":"Tại sao cô Matos lại bắt đầu văn bản - chuỗi tin nhắn?","options":["She needs help locating something.","She is wondering what time Mr.Thomas will arrive.","She wants to know why the tent is up today.","She wants help putting up decorations."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She needs help locating something.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"advertise","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈæd.vɚ.taɪz/","meaning":"quảng cáo, thông báo"},{"word":"entrance","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɛntrəns/","meaning":"thôi miên; làm say mê"},{"word":"delivery","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"