de our building''s delivery entrance. Just put it back when you''re done so that I can find it the next time I need it.\n\nJoanne Matos(12:04P.M.) No problem. Thanks!"}],"question":"What will happen this afternoon?","bilingual":"Chuyện gì sẽ xảy ra chiều nay?","options":["There will be an outdoor event.","There will be a sale.","Ms. Nguyen will order a signboard.","Mr. Thomas will deliver an additional tent."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"There will be an outdoor event.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"advertise","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈæd.vɚ.taɪz/","meaning":"quảng cáo, thông báo"},{"word":"entrance","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɛntrəns/","meaning":"thôi miên; làm say mê"}],"optionMeanings":["Sẽ có một sự kiện ngoài trời.","Sẽ có giảm giá.","Chị Nguyên sẽ đặt biển hiệu.","Ông Thomas sẽ giao thêm một chiếc lều."]},{"questionNum":"174","passageTitle":"Joanne Matos(11:45A.M.) Tuyetand Jim, do you know where Ican find that big ","passageText":"Joanne Matos(11:45A.M.) Tuyetand Jim, do you know where Ican find that big signboard-the one that we usually post at the entrance to advertise when we''re having a sale inside?\n\nTuyet Nguyen (11:58 A.M.) Ihaven''t seen it lately. Why? Joanne Matos (11:59 A.M.) I''m setting up for this afternoon''s party under the tent out in the cafe court yard, and I want to have seating information posted for people as they arrive. Tuyet Nguyen (12:01 P.M.) Jim likely has it. He usually sets things up for ioidn those sales. But I think he''s gone for the day. Jim Thomas (12:02P.M.) No, I''m not! I''m out making a delivery right now, but I''ll be back soon. You can find the signboard in the alcove just inside our building''s delivery entrance. Just put it back when you''re done so that I can find it the next time I need it.\n\nJoanne Matos(12:04P.M.) No problem. Thanks!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Joanne Matos(11:45A.M.) Tuyetand Jim, do you know where Ican find that big signboard-the one that we usually post at the entrance to advertise when we''re having a sale inside?\n\nTuyet Nguyen (11:58 A.M.) Ihaven''t seen it lately. Why? Joanne Matos (11:59 A.M.) I''m setting up for this afternoon''s party under the tent out in the cafe court yard, and I want to have seating information posted for people as they arrive. Tuyet Nguyen (12:01 P.M.) Jim likely has it. He usually sets things up for ioidn those sales. But I think he''s gone for the day. Jim Thomas (12:02P.M.) No, I''m not! I''m out making a delivery right now, but I''ll be back soon. You can find the signboard in the alcove just inside our building''s delivery entrance. Just put it back when you''re done so that I can find it the next time I need it.\n\nJoanne Matos(12:04P.M.) No problem. Thanks!"}],"question":"Where is Mr.Thomas most likely texting from?","bilingual":"Có khả năng ông Thomas sẽ nhắn tin từ đâu nhất?","options":["The tent","The building entrance","His home","A delivery site"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"A delivery site\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"advertise","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈæd.vɚ.taɪz/","meaning":"quảng cáo, thông báo"},{"word":"building","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɪldɪŋ/","meaning":"căn nhà; nhà ở; kết cấu; cơ sở"},{"word":"entrance","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɛntrəns/","meaning":"th