model within three weeks, including new countertops, cabinets, flooring, and appliances (refrigerator, dishwasher, stove, oven). Client preferences: Countertops:black granite Cabinets:Client kept samples and wil let me know by the April 3deadline for ordering. Flooring: Client will let me know by April 3. Notes: Ten percent off coupon to be applied to materials purchase. Not valid on premium materials. Project contract and deposit were received on April 1.\n\n102"}],"question":"What is indicated about the marble and granite?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về đá cẩm thạch và đá granite?","options":["They are not eligible for a discount offer.","They are no longer being manufactured.","They are produced in limited colors.","They are very popular with customers."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"They are not eligible for a discount offer.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"refrigerator","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈfrɪdʒ.ər.eɪ.tər/","meaning":"tủ lạnh"},{"word":"manufacture","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,mænju''fæktʃə/","meaning":"sự chế tạo, sự sản xuất"},{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"}],"optionMeanings":["Họ không đủ điều kiện để nhận ưu đãi giảm giá.","Chúng không còn được sản xuất nữa.","Chúng được sản xuất với số lượng hạn chế.","Chúng rất được khách hàng ưa chuộng."]},{"questionNum":"186","passageTitle":"Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase June 5-Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase is","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nAlexandria''s Restaurant Showcase June 5-Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase is back!From July 8 to July 25, participating restaurants in the Alexandria area will offer set menus at discounted prices. As in past years, restaurants can offer a two-course lunch menu for $15, a two-course dinner menu for $20, or a three-course dinner menu for $30.Both customers and restaurant owners love the showcase. Food enthusiasts try new options at a lower cost, and restaurants report it''s the time of year when dining areas are at their fullest. Alexandria had its first restaurant showcase 15 years ago. It was mode led on a similar showcase in the beach town of Will mar. Originally, only eight restaurants participated. Since then, the showcase has grown, adding more restaurants and extending the number of days each year. This year, there will be 40 participating restaurants--about 70percent of all the restaurants in Alexandria. Those looking to book a table should act fast. Some restaurants require reservations, and the most popular places book up quickly. To see the list of participating restaurants and make a reservation, visit www.alexandriarestaurants.com/showcase.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.alexandriarestaurants.com/showcase/reservations Showing search results for:Center City Neighborhood Claire''s Frenchfood Serving lunchand3-course dinner Open Tuesday-Sunday Call (703)555-0102tomakeareservation.\n\nFresh Fish Grill Seafood Serving lunchand3-course dinner Open Monday-Sunday Call (703)555-0195 to make a reservation.\n\nJin-Yi''s House Koreanfood Serving2-course dinner Open Wednesday-Saturday Call (703)555-0198tomakeareservation.\n\nRoberto''s Pizzeria\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nItalian food Serving lunch only Open Tuesday-Sunday No reservations necessary\n\n104 https://www.foodreviews.com/alexandria/freshfishgrill Nori Sato I highly recommend Fresh Fish Grill. It was my first time eating there, and not only was the food excellent, but the staff was welcoming and efficient. I had some clients in town and was lucky enough to get a reservation on the last day of the restaurant showcase. We all really enjoyed the experience.I would gladly take clients there again.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase June 5-Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase is back!From July 8 to July 25, participating restaurants in the Alexandria area will offer set menus at discounted prices. As in past years, restaurants can offer a two-course lunch menu for $15, a two-course dinner menu for $20, or a three-course dinner menu for $30.Both customers and restaurant owners love the showcase. Food enthusiasts try new options at a lower cost, and restaurants report it''s the time of year when dining areas are at their fullest. Alexandria had its first restaurant showcase 15 years ago. It was mode led on a similar showcase in the beach town of Will mar. Originally, only eight restaurants participated. Since then, the showcase has grown, adding more restaurants and extending the number of days each year. This year, there will be 40 participating restaurants--about 70percent of all the restaurants in Alexandria. Those looking to book a table should act fast. Some restaurants require reservations, and the most popular places book up quickly. To see the list of participating restaurants and make a reservation, visit www.alexandriarestaurants.com/showcase."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"https://www.alexandriarestaurants.com/showcase/reservations Showing search results for:Center City Neighborhood Claire''s Frenchfood Serving lunchand3-course dinner Open Tuesday-Sunday Call (703)555-0102tomakeareservation.\n\nFresh Fish Grill Seafood Serving lunchand3-course dinner Open Monday-Sunday Call (703)555-0195 to make a reservation.\n\nJin-Yi''s House Koreanfood Serving2-course dinner Open Wednesday-Saturday Call (703)555-0198tomakeareservation.\n\nRoberto''s Pizzeria"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"Italian food Serving lunch only Open Tuesday-Sunday No reservations necessary\n\n104 https://www.foodreviews.com/alexandria/freshfishgrill Nori Sato I highly recommend Fresh Fish Grill. It was my first time eating there, and not only was the food excellent, but the staff was welcoming and efficient. I had some clients in town and was lucky enough to get a reservation on the last day of the restaurant showcase. We all really enjoyed the experience.I would gladly take clients there again."}],"question":"What does the article mention about Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase?","bilingual":"Bài báo đề cập đến điều gì về Showcase Nhà hàng của Alexandria?","options":["Every restaurant in Alexandria participates.","Restaurants are open seven days a week.","It is the busiest time of year for restaurants.","Restaurants are open only for dinner."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It is the busiest time of year for restaurants.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"neighborhood","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈneɪbərˌhʊd/","meaning":"hàng xóm"},{"word":"participate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pɑrˈtɪsəˌpeɪt/","meaning":"được tham gia; tham gia vào"},{"word":"restaurants","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnts/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"reservation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌrez.ɚˈveɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"dự phòng"}],"optionMeanings":["Mọi nhà hàng ở Alexandria đều tham gia.","Các nhà hàng mở cửa bảy ngày một tuần.","Đó là thời gian bận rộn nhất trong (C) Đây là thời điểm bận rộn nhất trong năm của các nhà trồng rừng.","Các nhà hàng chỉ mở cửa phục vụ bữa tối. đối số với các nhà hàng. (D) Các nhà hàng chỉ mở cửa phục vụbữa tối."]},{"questionNum":"187","passageTitle":"Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase June 5-Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase is","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nAlexandria''s Restaurant Showcase June 5-Alexandria''s Restaurant Showcase is back!From July 8 to July 25, participating restaurants in the Alexandria area will offer set menus at discounted prices. As in past years, restaurants can offer a two-course lunch men