te","A bonus for referring new subscribers","A free issue of Modern Style Magazine"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"A bonus for referring new subscribers\".","vocabList":[{"word":"complimentary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkɑːm.pləˈmen.t̬ɚ.i/","meaning":"ngợi khen, đánh giá cao"},{"word":"subscription","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səbˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đăng ký"},{"word":"including","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈkludɪŋ/","meaning":"bao gồm; chứa đựng; ôm ấp"},{"word":"discount","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈdɪs.kaʊnt/","meaning":"sự giảm giá, chiết khấu; giảm giá, bớt giá"}]},{"questionNum":"162","passageTitle":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965","passageText":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965\n\nLISBON (18 June)—This year''s International Candy Conference will be held in Lisbon, Portugal, at the Vil de Maitros Convention Center near the Bibb Bubblegum factory. Thousands of candy industry specialists from around the world are expected to attend the event on 8-10 September.[1]—,\n\nAmanda Bibb, CEO of Bibb Bubblegum, takesthechewinggum industry very seriously. [2].As the company''s fourth-generation CEO, she proudly shares, My family is excited to sponsor this event and thrilled to be the first chewing gum company ever to host the International Candy Conference!\"Ms.Bibbis also especially pleased that the candy conference will be in Portugal this year.-[3]-.“Bibb Bubblegum started with a tiny shop near Lisbon. While our main factory is local, we now sell our gum in seven countries. We hope this event will bring attention and revenue to our community as well as to the international bubble gum market.\"\n\nFor more information about the International Candy Conference and for tours of the Bibb Bubble gum factory, contact Roberto Barboza at3519225559650rvisit www.BibbBubblegum.com.[4]-","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965\n\nLISBON (18 June)—This year''s International Candy Conference will be held in Lisbon, Portugal, at the Vil de Maitros Convention Center near the Bibb Bubblegum factory. Thousands of candy industry specialists from around the world are expected to attend the event on 8-10 September.[1]—,\n\nAmanda Bibb, CEO of Bibb Bubblegum, takesthechewinggum industry very seriously. [2].As the company''s fourth-generation CEO, she proudly shares, My family is excited to sponsor this event and thrilled to be the first chewing gum company ever to host the International Candy Conference!\"Ms.Bibbis also especially pleased that the candy conference will be in Portugal this year.-[3]-.“Bibb Bubblegum started with a tiny shop near Lisbon. While our main factory is local, we now sell our gum in seven countries. We hope this event will bring attention and revenue to our community as well as to the international bubble gum market.\"\n\nFor more information about the International Candy Conference and for tours of the Bibb Bubble gum factory, contact Roberto Barboza at3519225559650rvisit www.BibbBubblegum.com.[4]-"}],"question":"What is the main purpose of the press release?","bilingual":"Mục đích chính của thông cáo báo chí là gì?","options":["To explain the history of the candy industry","To announce the expansion of a gum company","To introduce the CEO of a new business","To promote a conference and its sponsor"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To promote a conference and its sponsor\".","vocabList":[{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"},{"word":"convention","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈvɛnʃən/","meaning":"hội nghị; lịch trình; phong tục; hiệp ước"}],"optionMeanings":["Để giải thích về lịch sử của ngành công nghiệp kẹo.","Để thông báo về việc mở rộng của một công ty kẹo cao su.","Để giới thiệu CEO của một doanh nghiệp mới.","Để quảng bá một hội nghị và nhà tài trợ của nó."]},{"questionNum":"163","passageTitle":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965","passageText":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965\n\nLISBON (18 June)—This year''s International Candy Conference will be held in Lisbon, Portugal, at the Vil de Maitros Convention Center near the Bibb Bubblegum factory. Thousands of candy industry specialists from around the world are expected to attend the event on 8-10 September.[1]—,\n\nAmanda Bibb, CEO of Bibb Bubblegum, takesthechewinggum industry very seriously. [2].As the company''s fourth-generation CEO, she proudly shares, My family is excited to sponsor this event and thrilled to be the first chewing gum company ever to host the International Candy Conference!\"Ms.Bibbis also especially pleased that the candy conference will be in Portugal this year.-[3]-.“Bibb Bubblegum started with a tiny shop near Lisbon. While our main factory is local, we now sell our gum in seven countries. We hope this event will bring attention and revenue to our community as well as to the international bubble gum market.\"\n\nFor more information about the International Candy Conference and for tours of the Bibb Bubble gum factory, contact Roberto Barboza at3519225559650rvisit www.BibbBubblegum.com.[4]-","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965\n\nLISBON (18 June)—This year''s International Candy Conference will be held in Lisbon, Portugal, at the Vil de Maitros Convention Center near the Bibb Bubblegum factory. Thousands of candy industry specialists from around the world are expected to attend the event on 8-10 September.[1]—,\n\nAmanda Bibb, CEO of Bibb Bubblegum, takesthechewinggum industry very seriously. [2].As the company''s fourth-generation CEO, she proudly shares, My family is excited to sponsor this event and thrilled to be the first chewing gum company ever to host the International Candy Conference!\"Ms.Bibbis also especially pleased that the candy conference will be in Portugal this year.-[3]-.“Bibb Bubblegum started with a tiny shop near Lisbon. While our main factory is local, we now sell our gum in seven countries. We hope this event will bring attention and revenue to our community as well as to the international bubble gum market.\"\n\nFor more information about the International Candy Conference and for tours of the Bibb Bubble gum factory, contact Roberto Barboza at3519225559650rvisit www.BibbBubblegum.com.[4]-"}],"question":"What is indicated about the Bibb Bubble gum company?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về công ty Bibb Bubblegum?","options":["It allows visitors to tour its facility.","Its headquarters are in Lisbon.","It is a new candy business in Portugal.","It offers more flavors than other gum companies do."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It allows visitors to tour its facility.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"headquarters","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈhedˌkwɔːr.t̬ɚz/","meaning":"sở chỉ huy, bộ chỉ huy"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó cho phép khách tham quan cơ sở của nó.","Trụ sở chính của nó ở Lisbon.","Đây là một hoạt động kinh doanh kẹo mới ở Bồ Đào Nha.","Nó mang lại nhiều hương vị hơn các công ty kẹo cao su khác."]},{"questionNum":"164","passageTitle":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965","passageText":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965\n\nLISBON (18 June)—This year''s International Candy Conference will be held in Lisbon, Portugal, at the Vil de Maitros Convention Center near the Bibb Bubblegum factory. Thousands of candy industry specialists from around the world are expected to attend the event on 8-10 September.[1]—,\n\nAmanda Bibb, CEO of Bibb Bubblegum, takesthechewinggum industry very seriously. [2].As the company''s fourth-generation CEO, she proudly shares, My family is excited to sponsor this event and thrilled to be the first chewing gum company ever to host the International Candy Conference!\"Ms.Bibbis also especially pleased that the candy conference will be in Portugal this year.-[3]-.“Bibb Bubblegum started with a tiny shop near Lisbon. While our main factory is local, we now sell our gum in seven countries. We hope this event will bring attention and revenue to our community as well as to the international bubble gum market.\"\n\nFor more information about the International Candy Conference and for tours of the Bibb Bubble gum factory, contact Roberto Barboza at3519225559650rvisit www.BibbBubblegum.com.[4]-","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965\n\nLISBON (18 June)—This year''s International Candy Conference will be held in Lisbon, Portugal, at the Vil de Maitros Convention Center near the Bibb Bubblegum factory. Thousands of candy industry specialists from around the world are expected to attend the event on 8-10 September.[1]—,\n\nAmanda Bibb, CEO of Bibb Bubblegum, takesthechewinggum industry very seriously. [2].As the company''s fourth-generation CEO, she proudly shares, My family is excited to sponsor this event and thrilled to be the first chewing gum company ever to host the International Candy Conference!\"Ms.Bibbis also especially pleased that the candy conference will be in Portugal this year.-[3]-.“Bibb Bubblegum started with a tiny shop near Lisbon. While our main factory is local, we now sell our gum in seven countries. We hope this event will bring attention and revenue to our community as well as to the international bubble gum market.\"\n\nFor more information about the International Candy Conference and for tours of the Bibb Bubble gum factory, contact Roberto Barboza at3519225559650rvisit www.BibbBubblegum.com.[4]-"}],"question":"Who most likely is Mr.Barboza?","bilingual":"Ông Barboza rất có thể là ai?","options":["A shop owner","A company representative","A newspaper writer","A travel agent"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"A company representative\".","vocabList":[{"word":"representative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,repri''zentətiv/","meaning":"miêu tả, biểu hiện"},{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"}],"optionMeanings":["Chủ cửa hàng","Đại diện công ty","Một người viết báo","Một đại lý du lịch165. Câu sau đây thuộc về vị trí nào được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]? “Con số đó bây giờ có thể sẽ bao gồm nhiều nhà sản xuất kẹo cao su, vì Bibb Bubblegum sẽ tổ chức sự kiện năm nay.”(A) [1](B) [2](C) [3](D) [4] BÃN DỊCH: Cần phát hành ngay Liên hệ: Roberto Barboza 351 922 555 965LISBON (18 tháng 6) Hội nghịkẹo quốc tế năm nay sẽ được tổ chức tại Lisbon, Bồ Đào Nha, tại Trung tâm Hội nghịVil de Maitros gần nhà máy Bibb Bubblegum. Hàng ngàn chuyên gia trong ngành công nghiệp kẹo từkhắp nơi trên thếgiới dự ánkiến trúc sẽ dự kiến sự việc này từ ngày 8 đến ngày 10 tháng 9. - [1] -. Amanda Bibb, Giám đốc điều hành của Bibb Bubblegum, rất quan trọng ngành công nghiệp kẹo cao su. - [2] - Là CEO thế hệ thứ tư của công ty, cô tự hào chia sẻ: \"Gia đình tôi rất hào hứng tài trợ cho sự kiện này và vui mừng trở thành công tykẹo cao su đầu tiên từng tổchúc Hội nghịkẹo quốc tế!\" Cô Bibb cũng đặc biệt hàilòng khi hội nghị sẽ được tổ chức tại Bồ Đào Nha trong năm nay. – [3] - \"BibbBubblegum bắt đầu với một cửa hàng nhỏ gần Lisbon. Mặc dù nhà máy chính của chúng tôi ở địa phương, nhưng bánh cao su của chúng tôi hiện đã có mặt trênbảy quốc gia. Chúng tôi hy vọng sự kiện này sẽ mang lại sự kiện và doanh thu cộng đồng của chúng tôi cũng như cho xem khung cao su quốc tế.\" để biết thêm thông tin về Hội nghịkẹo quốc tếvà các chuyến tham quan nhà máy Bibb Bubblegum, liên hệ với Roberto Barboza theo số351 922 555 965 hoặc truy cập www.BibbBubblegum.com. - [4] -162. Mục chính của bài báo báo chí là gì? (A) Để giải thích lịch sử của khối kẹo. (B) Thông báo về việc mởcông ty kẹo cao su rộng rãi. (C) để giới thiệu hiệu quả giám sát điều hành của một doanh nghiệp mới. (D) Để quản lý một quốc hội và nhà tài trợ của nó."]},{"questionNum":"165","passageTitle":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965","passageText":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965\n\nLISBON (18 June)—This year''s International Candy Conference will be held in Lisbon, Portugal, at the Vil de Maitros Convention Center near the Bibb Bubblegum factory. Thousands of candy industry specialists from around the world are expected to attend the event on 8-10 September.[1]—,\n\nAmanda Bibb, CEO of Bibb Bubblegum, takesthechewinggum industry very seriously. [2].As the company''s fourth-generation CEO, she proudly shares, My family is excited to sponsor this event and thrilled to be the first chewing gum company ever to host the International Candy Conference!\"Ms.Bibbis also especially pleased that the candy conference will be in Portugal this year.-[3]-.“Bibb Bubblegum started with a tiny shop near Lisbon. While our main factory is local, we now sell our gum in seven countries. We hope this event will bring attention and revenue to our community as well as to the international bubble gum market.\"\n\nFor more information about the International Candy Conference and for tours of the Bibb Bubble gum factory, contact Roberto Barboza at3519225559650rvisit www.BibbBubblegum.com.[4]-","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"FORIMMEDIATERELEASE Contact:Roberto Barboza 351922555965\n\nLISBON (18 June)—This year''s International Candy Conference will be held in Lisbon, Portugal, at the Vil de Maitros Convention Center near the Bibb Bubblegum factory. Thousands of candy industry specialists from around the world are expected to attend the event on 8-10 September.[1]—,\n\nAmanda Bibb, CEO of Bibb Bubblegum, takesthechewinggum industry very seriously. [2].As the company''s fourth-generation CEO, she proudly shares, My family is excited to sponsor this event and thrilled to be the first chewing gum company ever to host the International Candy Conference!\"Ms.Bibbis also especially pleased that the candy conference will be in Portugal this year.-[3]-.“Bibb Bubblegum started with a tiny shop near Lisbon. While our main factory is local, we now sell our gum in seven countries. We hope this event will bring attention and revenue to our community as well as to the international bubble gum market.\"\n\nFor more information about the International Candy Conference and for tours of the Bibb Bubble gum factory, contact Roberto Barboza at3519225559650rvisit www.BibbBubblegum.com.[4]-"}],"question":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3], and[4] does the following sentence best belong? \"That number now will likely include many gum manufacturers, as Bibb Bubblegum will host this year''s event.\"","bilingual":"","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"[1]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"},{"word":"convention","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈvɛnʃən/","meaning":"hội nghị; lịch trình; phong tục; hiệp ước"}]},{"questionNum":"166","passageTitle":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!","passageText":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!\n\nAt Impala Credit Union, your safety and convenience are paramount. That is why we are introducing contact less technology for all our member credit and debit cards. With this new development, you will no longer have to swipe or insert your card in a chip reader at checkout. In fact, you will not even need to remove your card from a physical wallet; simply hold it near a point of sale for it to be read! There are a few important things to keep in mind. First, your current card will be deactivated on October 31. You may continue to use it until that time.\n\nSecond, the upgraded card may arrive before your current one expires. Once you activate the new card, the old one will automatically be deactivated and no longer be valid for use. You will need to manually activate your new card by following the instructions on the attached sticker. Third, your contact less technology card will have a new card number, expiration date, and security number. When activating, you will be prompted to choose a PIN (personal identification number).The PIN from your current card will not automatically transfer over. Be sure to update your card on file for all preferred online retailers and app subscriptions to ensure continued access. We hope that you enjoy your new card. For any questions regarding your contact less technology Impala card feel free to contact customer service at 1-610-555-0168.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!\n\nAt Impala Credit Union, your safety and convenience are paramount. That is why we are introducing contact less technology for all our member credit and debit cards. With this new development, you will no longer have to swipe or insert your card in a chip reader at checkout. In fact, you will not even need to remove your card from a physical wallet; simply hold it near a point of sale for it to be read! There are a few important things to keep in mind. First, your current card will be deactivated on October 31. You may continue to use it until that time.\n\nSecond, the upgraded card may arrive before your current one expires. Once you activate the new card, the old one will automatically be deactivated and no longer be valid for use. You will need to manually activate your new card by following the instructions on the attached sticker. Third, your contact less technology card will have a new card number, expiration date, and security number. When activating, you will be prompted to choose a PIN (personal identification number).The PIN from your current card will not automatically transfer over. Be sure to update your card on file for all preferred online retailers and app subscriptions to ensure continued access. We hope that you enjoy your new card. For any questions regarding your contact less technology Impala card feel free to contact customer service at 1-610-555-0168."}],"question":"What is the purpose of the notice?","bilingual":"Mục đích của thông báo là gì?","options":["To request customer feedback","To alert customers of credit card fraud","To inform customer sofa new payment method","To announce a change in billing policies"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"To inform customer sofa new payment method\".","vocabList":[{"word":"subscription","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səbˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đăng ký"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"technology","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/tɛkˈnɑləʤi/","meaning":"khoa học nghệ thuật công nghiệp; khoa học ứng dụng"}],"optionMeanings":["Để yêu cầu phản hồi của khách hàng","Để cảnh báo khách hàng về việc gian lận thẻ tín dụng","Để thông báo cho khách hàng về phương thức thanh toán mới","Để thông báo thay đổi về chính sách thanh toán167. Điều gì được chỉ ra về thẻ Impala mới? (A) Thẻ sẽ có hiệu lực sử dụng kể từ ngày 31 tháng 10. (B) Không cần phải lấy thẻ ra khỏi ví để sử dụng. (C) Không thể sử dụng thẻ này để đăng ký ứng dụng. (D) Nó sẽ chứa thông tin nhận dạng giống như thẻ cũ.168. Khách hàng cần làm gì khi kích hoạt thẻ mới?(A) Chọn mã PIN(B) Hủy thẻ hiện tại(C) Nhập số bảo mật(D) Chuyển số dư nợB ẢN DỊCH: ThẻImpala của bạn đã được nâng cấp trong thư hòm! Tại Impala Credit Union, sự an toàn và thuận tiện của bạn là điều đặc biệt quan trọng. Đó là vì chúng tôi đang tiến hành làng công nghệ không đạt điểm cuối cùngthẻ ghi nợ và thẻ tínd user của chúng tôi. Với sự phát triển mới này, bạn sẽ không còn phải que hay thẻ của bạn vào chip đọc đầu tại tinh thanhtoán. Trên thực tế, bạn thậm chí sẽ không cần phải rút thẻ của mình khỏi ví; chỉcần để nó gần một điểm bán hàng để có thể đọc được! Có một số điều quan trọng cần ghi nhớ. Đầu tiên, thẻ hiện tại của bạn sẽ ngừng kích hoạt vào ngày 31 tháng 10. Bạn có thể tiếp tục sử dụng nó để đến điểm đó. Thứhai, thẻnâng cấp có thể đến trước khi thẻ hiện tại của bạn hết hạn. Một khi bạn kích hoạt thẻ mới, thẻ sẽtự động ngừng kích hoạt và không còn giá trị sử dụng. Bạn sẽ cần phải kích hoạt thẻ công nghệ của mình bằng cách làm theo hướng dẫn trên nhãn dán được đính kèm. Thứba, thẻ công nghệ không đạt điểm của bạn sẽ có số lượng mới, ngày hết hạn và số bảo mật mới. Khi kích hoạt. bạn sẽ được nhắc chọn mã PIN mã hóa (cá nhân mã số). Mã PIN hiện tại của bạn sẽ không tự động chuyển đổi. Đảm bảo cập nhật thẻ của bạn trong hồ sơ cho tất cả các nhà bán lẻtrực tuyến đượcgợi ý và đăng ký ứng dụng để đảm bảo quyền truy cập liên tục. Chúng tôi hy vọng rằng bạn thích bài viết mới của bạn. Đối với bất kỳ câu hỏi nào liên quan đến thẻ Impala tích hợp công nghệ điểm yếu của bạn, vui lòng liên hệ với dịch vụ chăm sóc khách hàng tại số 1 - 610 - 555 - 0168."]},{"questionNum":"167","passageTitle":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!","passageText":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!\n\nAt Impala Credit Union, your safety and convenience are paramount. That is why we are introducing contact less technology for all our member credit and debit cards. With this new development, you will no longer have to swipe or insert your card in a chip reader at checkout. In fact, you will not even need to remove your card from a physical wallet; simply hold it near a point of sale for it to be read! There are a few important things to keep in mind. First, your current card will be deactivated on October 31. You may continue to use it until that time.\n\nSecond, the upgraded card may arrive before your current one expires. Once you activate the new card, the old one will automatically be deactivated and no longer be valid for use. You will need to manually activate your new card by following the instructions on the attached sticker. Third, your contact less technology card will have a new card number, expiration date, and security number. When activating, you will be prompted to choose a PIN (personal identification number).The PIN from your current card will not automatically transfer over. Be sure to update your card on file for all preferred online retailers and app subscriptions to ensure continued access. We hope that you enjoy your new card. For any questions regarding your contact less technology Impala card feel free to contact customer service at 1-610-555-0168.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!\n\nAt Impala Credit Union, your safety and convenience are paramount. That is why we are introducing contact less technology for all our member credit and debit cards. With this new development, you will no longer have to swipe or insert your card in a chip reader at checkout. In fact, you will not even need to remove your card from a physical wallet; simply hold it near a point of sale for it to be read! There are a few important things to keep in mind. First, your current card will be deactivated on October 31. You may continue to use it until that time.\n\nSecond, the upgraded card may arrive before your current one expires. Once you activate the new card, the old one will automatically be deactivated and no longer be valid for use. You will need to manually activate your new card by following the instructions on the attached sticker. Third, your contact less technology card will have a new card number, expiration date, and security number. When activating, you will be prompted to choose a PIN (personal identification number).The PIN from your current card will not automatically transfer over. Be sure to update your card on file for all preferred online retailers and app subscriptions to ensure continued access. We hope that you enjoy your new card. For any questions regarding your contact less technology Impala card feel free to contact customer service at 1-610-555-0168."}],"question":"What is indicated about the new Impala card?","bilingual":"","options":["ItwillbevalidforuseasofOctober31.","It does not need to be removed from a wallet for use.","It cannot be used for app subscriptions.","It will contain the same identification information as the old card."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It does not need to be removed from a wallet for use.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"subscription","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səbˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đăng ký"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}]},{"questionNum":"168","passageTitle":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!","passageText":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!\n\nAt Impala Credit Union, your safety and convenience are paramount. That is why we are introducing contact less technology for all our member credit and debit cards. With this new development, you will no longer have to swipe or insert your card in a chip reader at checkout. In fact, you will not even need to remove your card from a physical wallet; simply hold it near a point of sale for it to be read! There are a few important things to keep in mind. First, your current card will be deactivated on October 31. You may continue to use it until that time.\n\nSecond, the upgraded card may arrive before your current one expires. Once you activate the new card, the old one will automatically be deactivated and no longer be valid for use. You will need to manually activate your new card by following the instructions on the attached sticker. Third, your contact less technology card will have a new card number, expiration date, and security number. When activating, you will be prompted to choose a PIN (personal identification number).The PIN from your current card will not automatically transfer over. Be sure to update your card on file for all preferred online retailers and app subscriptions to ensure continued access. We hope that you enjoy your new card. For any questions regarding your contact less technology Impala card feel free to contact customer service at 1-610-555-0168.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Your upgraded Impala card is in the mail!\n\nAt Impala Credit Union, your safety and convenience are paramount. That is why we are introducing contact less technology for all our member credit and debit cards. With this new development, you will no longer have to swipe or insert your card in a chip reader at checkout. In fact, you will not even need to remove your card from a physical wallet; simply hold it near a point of sale for it to be read! There are a few important things to keep in mind. First, your current card will be deactivated on October 31. You may continue to use it until that time.\n\nSecond, the upgraded card may arrive before your current one expires. Once you activate the new card, the old one will automatically be deactivated and no longer be valid for use. You will need to manually activate your new card by following the instructions on the attached sticker. Third, your contact less technology card will have a new card number, expiration date, and security number. When activating, you will be prompted to choose a PIN (personal identification number).The PIN from your current card will not automatically transfer over. Be sure to update your card on file for all preferred online retailers and app subscriptions to ensure continued access. We hope that you enjoy your new card. For any questions regarding your contact less technology Impala card feel free to contact customer service at 1-610-555-0168."}],"question":"What do customers need to do when activating their new card?","bilingual":"","options":["Select a PIN","Cancel their current card","Enter the security number","Transfer outstanding balances"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Select a PIN\".","vocabList":[{"word":"subscription","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səbˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đăng ký"},{"word":"outstanding","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/¸aut´stændiη/","meaning":"nổi bật, đáng chú ý; nổi tiếng, vượt trội"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}]},{"questionNum":"169","passageTitle":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday u","passageText":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday until next Monday. I need to present a funding request at the regional legislatureoffice. Would you both feel comfortable giving the presentation about the new River walk to the urban development committee on Friday? Cassie Alswith(9:18A.M.)Ithink we could handle that. Right, Austin? Austin Everett (9:20A.M.)Definitely.I''m not sure how available you will be, Ms.Jung, but we could send you an overview of the presentation on Thursday if you''d like. Frieda Jung (9:22A.M.)I don''t think that''s necessary. Please be sure to highlight the revenue that we think will be brought into the region by the new businesses, as well as the positive environmental impacts our research group noted. Austin Everett (9:23 A.M.) Got it. We will make sure to do that. Cassie Alswith (9:25A.M.)Would it be okay if I submit the weekly progress report on Monday instead of Friday? That way I''ll have a little more time to prepare for the presentation. Frieda Jung (9:26 A.M.) Yes, that''s a good idea. Cassie Alswith (9:26A.M.)Great. Thank you! Frieda Jung(9:27A.M.)I might not respond to e-mail as frequently while I''m gone, but feel free to call me or text me if there''s anything urgent that comes up.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday until next Monday. I need to present a funding request at the regional legislatureoffice. Would you both feel comfortable giving the presentation about the new River walk to the urban development committee on Friday? Cassie Alswith(9:18A.M.)Ithink we could handle that. Right, Austin? Austin Everett (9:20A.M.)Definitely.I''m not sure how available you will be, Ms.Jung, but we could send you an overview of the presentation on Thursday if you''d like. Frieda Jung (9:22A.M.)I don''t think that''s necessary. Please be sure to highlight the revenue that we think will be brought into the region by the new businesses, as well as the positive environmental impacts our research group noted. Austin Everett (9:23 A.M.) Got it. We will make sure to do that. Cassie Alswith (9:25A.M.)Would it be okay if I submit the weekly progress report on Monday instead of Friday? That way I''ll have a little more time to prepare for the presentation. Frieda Jung (9:26 A.M.) Yes, that''s a good idea. Cassie Alswith (9:26A.M.)Great. Thank you! Frieda Jung(9:27A.M.)I might not respond to e-mail as frequently while I''m gone, but feel free to call me or text me if there''s anything urgent that comes up."}],"question":"Why will Ms.Jung be out of the office?","bilingual":"Tại sao cô Jung lại vắng mặt ở văn phòng?","options":["She is interviewing for a different job.","She has another work obligation.","She is taking time off for personal reasons.","She has a doctor''s appointment."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"She has another work obligation.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"environmental","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˌvaɪ.rənˈmen.t̬əl/","meaning":"(thuộc) môi trường"},{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"appointment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɔɪnt.mənt/","meaning":"sự bổ nhiệm, cuộc hẹn gặp"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô ấy đang phỏng vấn cho một công việc khác.","Cô ấy có nghĩa vụ công việc khác.","Cô ấy đang xin nghỉ vì lý do cá nhân.","Cô ấy có hẹn với bác sĩ.170. Vào lúc 9:22 sáng, rất có thể cô Jung có ý gì khi viết \"Tôi không nghĩ điều đó là cần thiết\"?(A) Cô ấy thất vọng với ông Everett.(B) Cô ấy tự tin vào khả năng của ông Everett và cô Alswith. (C) Cô ấy không thích đọc sách điện tử - thư. (D) Cô ấy nghĩ cuộc họp nên bị hủy bỏ.171. Điều gì được chỉ ra về Riverwalk? (A) Nó có thể sẽ mang lại nhiều hoạt động kinh doanh hơn cho khu vực. (B) Nó nằm ở trung tâm thành phố. (C) Cô Alswith hoài nghi về lợi ích của nó. (D) Việc xây dựng nó đã tiến triển nhanh chóng.172. Có gợi ý gì về báo cáo của bà Alswith? (A) Nó chưa bao giờ được nộp muộn. (B) Nó sẽ được nộp cho văn phòng lập pháp. (C) Nó được nộp vào thứ Sáu hàng tuần. (D) Nó phải được ông Everett xem xét vào thứ Hai. BÃN DỊCH: Frieda Jung (9:16 sáng) Tôi sẽ không có mặt mở phòng bắt đầu từ thứTư cho đến thứ 2 tuần sau. Tôi cần trình bày tài liệu yêu cầu hỗ trợtại văn bản phòng trong phòng họp. Cảhai bạn có cảm thấy tựtin khi thuyết trình về Đường đi bộven sông mới choủy ban phát triển đô thị vào thứSáu không? Cassie Alswith (9:18 sáng) Tôi nghĩ chúng tôi có thể thất bại. Phải không Austin? Austin Everett (9:20 sáng) An toàn rồitôi. Tôi không chắc cô miễn phí khi nào, cô Jung, Nhưng chúng tôi có thể gửi cho cô bản miêu tả giải thích về trình bày lý thuyết thứ năm nếu cô muốn. Frieda Jung (9:22 sáng) Tôi không nghĩ điều đó là cần thiết. Hãy chắc chắn làm nổi các tài khoản doanh nghiệp mà chúng tôi nghĩ rằng sẽ mang tới khu vực cho các doanh nghiệp mớii, cũng như tác động tích lên môi trường cực đoan mà nhóm nghiên cứu của chúng tôi đã chỉra. Austin Everett (9:23 sáng) Hiểu rồi. Chúng tôi bảo đảm sẽ thực hiện điều đó. Cassie Alswith (9:25 sáng) Có tổ chức nếu tôi gửi báo cáo tiến độ hàng tuần vào thứ haithay vì thứ hai không? Bằng cách đó, tôi sẽ có thêm một chút thời gian để chuẩn bị bài thuyết trình. Frieda Jung (9:26 sáng) Được, đó là một ý kiến ​​hay. Cassie Alswith (9:26 sáng) Tuyệt vời. Cảm ơn! Frieda Jung (9:27 sáng) Tôi không thể trả lờilời e - mail thường xuyên khi tôi đivắng, nhưng cứthoải mái gọi cho tôi hoặc nhắn tin nếu có bất cứ điều gì khẩn cấp xảy ra."]},{"questionNum":"170","passageTitle":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday u","passageText":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday until next Monday. I need to present a funding request at the regional legislatureoffice. Would you both feel comfortable giving the presentation about the new River walk to the urban development committee on Friday? Cassie Alswith(9:18A.M.)Ithink we could handle that. Right, Austin? Austin Everett (9:20A.M.)Definitely.I''m not sure how available you will be, Ms.Jung, but we could send you an overview of the presentation on Thursday if you''d like. Frieda Jung (9:22A.M.)I don''t think that''s necessary. Please be sure to highlight the revenue that we think will be brought into the region by the new businesses, as well as the positive environmental impacts our research group noted. Austin Everett (9:23 A.M.) Got it. We will make sure to do that. Cassie Alswith (9:25A.M.)Would it be okay if I submit the weekly progress report on Monday instead of Friday? That way I''ll have a little more time to prepare for the presentation. Frieda Jung (9:26 A.M.) Yes, that''s a good idea. Cassie Alswith (9:26A.M.)Great. Thank you! Frieda Jung(9:27A.M.)I might not respond to e-mail as frequently while I''m gone, but feel free to call me or text me if there''s anything urgent that comes up.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday until next Monday. I need to present a funding request at the regional legislatureoffice. Would you both feel comfortable giving the presentation about the new River walk to the urban development committee on Friday? Cassie Alswith(9:18A.M.)Ithink we could handle that. Right, Austin? Austin Everett (9:20A.M.)Definitely.I''m not sure how available you will be, Ms.Jung, but we could send you an overview of the presentation on Thursday if you''d like. Frieda Jung (9:22A.M.)I don''t think that''s necessary. Please be sure to highlight the revenue that we think will be brought into the region by the new businesses, as well as the positive environmental impacts our research group noted. Austin Everett (9:23 A.M.) Got it. We will make sure to do that. Cassie Alswith (9:25A.M.)Would it be okay if I submit the weekly progress report on Monday instead of Friday? That way I''ll have a little more time to prepare for the presentation. Frieda Jung (9:26 A.M.) Yes, that''s a good idea. Cassie Alswith (9:26A.M.)Great. Thank you! Frieda Jung(9:27A.M.)I might not respond to e-mail as frequently while I''m gone, but feel free to call me or text me if there''s anything urgent that comes up."}],"question":"At 9:22A.M., what does Ms.Jungmost likely mean when she writes,\"I don''t think that''s necessary\"?","bilingual":"","options":["She is frustrated with Mr.Everett.","She is confident in the abilities of Mr.Everettand Ms.Alswith.","She does not enjoy reading e-mails.","She thinks the meeting should be canceled."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"She is confident in the abilities of Mr.Everettand Ms.Alswith.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"environmental","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˌvaɪ.rənˈmen.t̬əl/","meaning":"(thuộc) môi trường"},{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"frequently","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈfrikwɛntli/","meaning":"thường xuyên; thường"}]},{"questionNum":"171","passageTitle":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday u","passageText":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday until next Monday. I need to present a funding request at the regional legislatureoffice. Would you both feel comfortable giving the presentation about the new River walk to the urban development committee on Friday? Cassie Alswith(9:18A.M.)Ithink we could handle that. Right, Austin? Austin Everett (9:20A.M.)Definitely.I''m not sure how available you will be, Ms.Jung, but we could send you an overview of the presentation on Thursday if you''d like. Frieda Jung (9:22A.M.)I don''t think that''s necessary. Please be sure to highlight the revenue that we think will be brought into the region by the new businesses, as well as the positive environmental impacts our research group noted. Austin Everett (9:23 A.M.) Got it. We will make sure to do that. Cassie Alswith (9:25A.M.)Would it be okay if I submit the weekly progress report on Monday instead of Friday? That way I''ll have a little more time to prepare for the presentation. Frieda Jung (9:26 A.M.) Yes, that''s a good idea. Cassie Alswith (9:26A.M.)Great. Thank you! Frieda Jung(9:27A.M.)I might not respond to e-mail as frequently while I''m gone, but feel free to call me or text me if there''s anything urgent that comes up.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday until next Monday. I need to present a funding request at the regional legislatureoffice. Would you both feel comfortable giving the presentation about the new River walk to the urban development committee on Friday? Cassie Alswith(9:18A.M.)Ithink we could handle that. Right, Austin? Austin Everett (9:20A.M.)Definitely.I''m not sure how available you will be, Ms.Jung, but we could send you an overview of the presentation on Thursday if you''d like. Frieda Jung (9:22A.M.)I don''t think that''s necessary. Please be sure to highlight the revenue that we think will be brought into the region by the new businesses, as well as the positive environmental impacts our research group noted. Austin Everett (9:23 A.M.) Got it. We will make sure to do that. Cassie Alswith (9:25A.M.)Would it be okay if I submit the weekly progress report on Monday instead of Friday? That way I''ll have a little more time to prepare for the presentation. Frieda Jung (9:26 A.M.) Yes, that''s a good idea. Cassie Alswith (9:26A.M.)Great. Thank you! Frieda Jung(9:27A.M.)I might not respond to e-mail as frequently while I''m gone, but feel free to call me or text me if there''s anything urgent that comes up."}],"question":"What is indicated about the Riverwalk?","bilingual":"","options":["It willikely bring extra business to the area.","It is located in the center of the city.","Ms.Alswith is skepticalabout its benefits.","The construction on it has progressed quickly."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It willikely bring extra business to the area.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"environmental","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˌvaɪ.rənˈmen.t̬əl/","meaning":"(thuộc) môi trường"},{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"xây dựng; kết cấu; ngành xây dựng tòa nhà"},{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"}]},{"questionNum":"172","passageTitle":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday u","passageText":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday until next Monday. I need to present a funding request at the regional legislatureoffice. Would you both feel comfortable giving the presentation about the new River walk to the urban development committee on Friday? Cassie Alswith(9:18A.M.)Ithink we could handle that. Right, Austin? Austin Everett (9:20A.M.)Definitely.I''m not sure how available you will be, Ms.Jung, but we could send you an overview of the presentation on Thursday if you''d like. Frieda Jung (9:22A.M.)I don''t think that''s necessary. Please be sure to highlight the revenue that we think will be brought into the region by the new businesses, as well as the positive environmental impacts our research group noted. Austin Everett (9:23 A.M.) Got it. We will make sure to do that. Cassie Alswith (9:25A.M.)Would it be okay if I submit the weekly progress report on Monday instead of Friday? That way I''ll have a little more time to prepare for the presentation. Frieda Jung (9:26 A.M.) Yes, that''s a good idea. Cassie Alswith (9:26A.M.)Great. Thank you! Frieda Jung(9:27A.M.)I might not respond to e-mail as frequently while I''m gone, but feel free to call me or text me if there''s anything urgent that comes up.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Frieda Jung (9:16A.M.)Ihave to be out of the office starting on Wednesday until next Monday. I need to present a funding request at the regional legislatureoffice. Would you both feel comfortable giving the presentation about the new River walk to the urban development committee on Friday? Cassie Alswith(9:18A.M.)Ithink we could handle that. Right, Austin? Austin Everett (9:20A.M.)Definitely.I''m not sure how available you will be, Ms.Jung, but we could send you an overview of the presentation on Thursday if you''d like. Frieda Jung (9:22A.M.)I don''t think that''s necessary. Please be sure to highlight the revenue that we think will be brought into the region by the new businesses, as well as the positive environmental impacts our research group noted. Austin Everett (9:23 A.M.) Got it. We will make sure to do that. Cassie Alswith (9:25A.M.)Would it be okay if I submit the weekly progress report on Monday instead of Friday? That way I''ll have a little more time to prepare for the presentation. Frieda Jung (9:26 A.M.) Yes, that''s a good idea. Cassie Alswith (9:26A.M.)Great. Thank you! Frieda Jung(9:27A.M.)I might not respond to e-mail as frequently while I''m gone, but feel free to call me or text me if there''s anything urgent that comes up."}],"question":"What is suggested about Ms.Alswith''s report?","bilingual":"","options":["It has never been submitted late.","It will be submitted to the legislature office.","It is submitted every Friday.","It must be reviewed by Mr.Everett on Monday."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It is submitted every Friday.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"environmental","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˌvaɪ.rənˈmen.t̬əl/","meaning":"(thuộc) môi trường"},{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"frequently","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈfrikwɛntli/","meaning":"thường xuyên; thường"}]},{"questionNum":"173","passageTitle":"Westmouth Financial Services 1311Paul Street ExeterEX89YJ, United Kingdom 1","passageText":"Westmouth Financial Services 1311Paul Street ExeterEX89YJ, United Kingdom 14 July\n\nDear Ms. Tartal,\n\nI am writing to notify you of some upcoming changes regarding your retirement investment account at Westmouth Financial.[1].Firstly, as you may already know, your primary financial services advisor, Felix Rear don, is retiring next month. [2]-.I have over fifteen years of experience working in personal finance and have worked at Westmouth Financial for thrcc of thosc years, helping over 25 clients meet their retirement goals through savvy financial planning.I am excited to help you continue this journey. Secondly, I would like to schedule a time to meet or talk with you about your current portfolio.[3] -.We could meet in person or just have a simple phone or video chat, but it would be good for us to touch base to plan your investment strategy for the next ten years as you are nearing your retirement. Along those lines, I specifically wanted to see if you were interested in shifting some of your funds into more stable assets like bonds and annuities.[4],I usually recommend shifting into these safer options as you get closer to retirement. Please feel free to call me or send an e-mail so we can arrange a time to talk. Thanks, and I look forward to speaking more.\n\nSincerely, Rita Hidayat Rita Hidayat, Account Manager","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Westmouth Financial Services 1311Paul Street ExeterEX89YJ, United Kingdom 14 July\n\nDear Ms. Tartal,\n\nI am writing to notify you of some upcoming changes regarding your retirement investment account at Westmouth Financial.[1].Firstly, as you may already know, your primary financial services advisor, Felix Rear don, is retiring next month. [2]-.I have over fifteen years of experience working in personal finance and have worked at Westmouth Financial for thrcc of thosc years, helping over 25 clients meet their retirement goals through savvy financial planning.I am excited to help you continue this journey. Secondly, I would like to schedule a time to meet or talk with you about your current portfolio.[3] -.We could meet in person or just have a simple phone or video chat, but it would be good for us to touch base to plan your investment strategy for the next ten years as you are nearing your retirement. Along those lines, I specifically wanted to see if you were interested in shifting some of your funds into more stable assets like bonds and annuities.[4],I usually recommend shifting into these safer options as you get closer to retirement. Please feel free to call me or send an e-mail so we can arrange a time to talk. Thanks, and I look forward to speaking more.\n\nSincerely, Rita Hidayat Rita Hidayat, Account Manager"}],"question":"What is indicated about Ms.Hidayat?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về cô Hidayat?","options":["Personal finance is her second career.","She has been in her current role for three years.","She was Mr.Rear don''s mentor.","She retired fifteen years ago."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"She has been in her current role for three years.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"retirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtaɪərmənt/","meaning":"sự ẩn dật, sự về hưu"},{"word":"investment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˈvest.mənt/","meaning":"sự đầu tư, vốn đầu tư"},{"word":"experience","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪr.i.əns/","meaning":"trải nghiệm, kinh nghiệm"},{"word":"financial","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/faɪˈnæn.ʃəl/","meaning":"/fəˈnæn.ʃəl/"}],"optionMeanings":["Tài chính cá nhân là nghề nghiệp thứ hai của cô.","Cô ấy đã giữ vai trò hiện tại được ba năm.","Cô ấy là cố vấn của ông Reardon.","Cô ấy đã nghỉ hưu cách đây mười lăm năm.174. Điều gì được gợi ý về danh mục tài chính của bà Tartars? (A) Nó không có nhiều giá trị. (B) Ông Reardon đã không quản lý nó tốt. (C) Bà Tartal mong đợi nó sẽ hoạt động tốt hơn. (D) Nó có một số tài sản rủi ro.175. Câu sau đây thuộc về vị trí nào trong số các vị trí được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]?“Vì vậy, tôi sẽ đảm nhận việc quản lý tài khoản của bạn.” (A) [1](B) [2](C) [3](D) [4] BÃN DỊCH: Dịch vụWestmouth Financial 1311 PhốPaulExeter EX8 9YJ, Vương quốc Anh 14 tháng 7 Bà Tartal thân mến Tôi viết thư này để thông báo cho bà về một số thay đổi sắp tới liên quan đến tàikhoản đầu tư nghỉ dưỡng của bà tại Westmouth Financial. - [1] – Đầu tiên, như bà có thể đã biết, cố gắng dịch vụ tài chính chính của bà, Felix Reardon, sẽ lưu vào tháng tới. - [2] - Tôi đã có hơn 15 năm kinh nghiệm làm việc trong lĩnh vực tài chính cá nhân và đã làm việc tại Westmouth Financialđược 3 năm, trợ giúp hơn 25 khách hàng đạt được mục tiêu hưu trí của họ thông qua kếhoạch tài chính hiệuquả. Tôi rất hào hứng khi được giúp bà tiếp tục cuộc hành trình này. Thứhai, tôi muốn sắp xếp thời gian để gặp hoặc nói chuyện với bà vềdanh mục đầu tư hiện tại của bà. – [3] –. Chúng ta có thể gặp trực tiếp hoặc đơn giản là trò chơi qua điện thoại hoặc video, nhưng sẽ thật tốt nếu chúng ta thảo luận về kế hoạch đầu tư cho bà trong mười năm tới khi bà sắp nghỉ. Đồng thời, tôi đặcbiệt muốn xem liệu bà có thú vị với việc chuyển một phần vốn của bà sang các tài sản bền vững hơn như trái phiếu và hỗ trợ hàng năm hay không. - 14] –. Tôi thường khuyên bạn nên chuyển sang các loại lựa chọn an toàn hơn khi bà sắp xếpnghỉ. Vui lòng gọi cho tôi hoặc gửi thư đến những người có thểsắp xếp thời gian nói chuyện. Cảm hứng, và hy vọng sẽ có dịp trao đổi thêm với bà. Trân trọng, Rita HidayatRita Hidayat, Quản lý tài khoản"]},{"questionNum":"174","passageTitle":"Westmouth Financial Services 1311Paul Street ExeterEX89YJ, United Kingdom 1","passageText":"Westmouth Financial Services 1311Paul Street ExeterEX89YJ, United Kingdom 14 July\n\nDear Ms. Tartal,\n\nI am writing to notify you of some upcoming changes regarding your retirement investment account at Westmouth Financial.[1].Firstly, as you may already know, your primary financial services advisor, Felix Rear don, is retiring next month. [2]-.I have over fifteen years of experience working in personal finance and have worked at Westmouth Financial for thrcc of thosc years, helping over 25 clients meet their retirement goals through savvy financial planning.I am excited to help you continue this journey. Secondly, I would like to schedule a time to meet or talk with you about your current portfolio.[3] -.We could meet in person or just have a simple phone or video chat, but it would be good for us to touch base to plan your investment strategy for the next ten years as you are nearing your retirement. Along those lines, I specifically wanted to see if you were interested in shifting some of your funds into more stable assets like bonds and annuities.[4],I usually recommend shifting into these safer options as you get closer to retirement. Please feel free to call me or send an e-mail so we can arrange a time to talk. Thanks, and I look forward to speaking more.\n\nSincerely, Rita Hidayat Rita Hidayat, Account Manager","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Westmouth Financial Services 1311Paul Street ExeterEX89YJ, United Kingdom 14 July\n\nDear Ms. Tartal,\n\nI am writing to notify you of some upcoming changes regarding your retirement investment account at Westmouth Financial.[1].Firstly, as you may already know, your primary financial services advisor, Felix Rear don, is retiring next month. [2]-.I have over fifteen years of experience working in personal finance and have worked at Westmouth Financial for thrcc of thosc years, helping over 25 clients meet their retirement goals through savvy financial planning.I am excited to help you continue this journey. Secondly, I would like to schedule a time to meet or talk with you about your current portfolio.[3] -.We could meet in person or just have a simple phone or video chat, but it would be good for us to touch base to plan your investment strategy for the next ten years as you are nearing your retirement. Along those lines, I specifically wanted to see if you were interested in shifting some of your funds into more stable assets like bonds and annuities.[4],I usually recommend shifting into these safer options as you get closer to retirement. Please feel free to call me or send an e-mail so we can arrange a time to talk. Thanks, and I look forward to speaking more.\n\nSincerely, Rita Hidayat Rita Hidayat, Account Manager"}],"question":"What is suggested about Ms.Tartal''s financial portfolio?","bilingual":"","options":["It does not have a great deal of value.","Mr.Rear don did not manage it well.","Ms.Tartal expected it to perform better.","It has several risky assets."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It has several risky assets.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"retirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtaɪərmənt/","meaning":"sự ẩn dật, sự về hưu"},{"word":"investment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˈvest.mənt/","meaning":"sự đầu tư, vốn đầu tư"},{"word":"experience","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪr.i.əns/","meaning":"trải nghiệm, kinh nghiệm"},{"word":"financial","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/faɪˈnæn.ʃəl/","meaning":"/fəˈnæn.ʃəl/"}]},{"questionNum":"175","passageTitle":"Westmouth Financial Services 1311Paul Street ExeterEX89YJ, United Kingdom 1","passageText":"Westmouth Financial Services 1311Paul Street ExeterEX89YJ, United Kingdom 14 July\n\nDear Ms. Tartal,\n\nI am writing to notify you of some upcoming 