"It is sometimes served with a flat lid."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It is sometimes served with a flat lid.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"available","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈveɪ.lə.bəl/","meaning":"có sẵn để dùng"},{"word":"excellent","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈek.səl.ənt/","meaning":"xuất sắc, ưu tú"},{"word":"customer","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌs.tə.mɚ/","meaning":"khách hàng"}]},{"questionNum":"183","passageTitle":"Blend or a Coffee Item16:Creamy Vanilla Blendelicious","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nBlend or a Coffee Item16:Creamy Vanilla Blendelicious\n\nSteps 1. Pour espresso Use dark roast or decaf. For small drinks, add 1 shot. For medium drinks, add 2 shots. For large drinks, add 3 shots.\n\n2.Pour milk | For regular drinks, use whole milk. When customers request a\n\nlight drink, usenonfat milk.\n\n3.Add flavor | Usevanillapowder. For small drinks, add2scoops. For\n\nmedium drinks, add3scoops. For large drinks, add4scoops.\n\n4.Add ice | Usethemarkings ontheicescoopforsmall, medium, and\n\nlarge drinks.\n\n5.Blend | Press the orange button on the blender. The texture should be\n\ncreamy. Pour into a plastic cup. For regular drinks, topwithwhipped 6.Finish and serve cream and use a domed lid. For light drinks, do not top with whipped cream and use a flat lid.\n\n7.Clean up | Rinseblender cover and metal blender cup. Wipe the counter.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nBlend or a Coffee Barista Training\n\nTrainee:Matt Molinelli Trainer:Kuniko Osawa\n\nDate: June 17\n\nDrink:Creamy Vanilla Blendelicious (Light)Size:Small Medium Large\n\nRate the quality of the finished beverage. Perfect Very Good M Good Accept able Unacceptabl