lingual":"","options":["He asked her for help to make the drink.","He presented a friendly appearance.","He had never used a blender before.","Hehasan excellentmemory."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"He presented a friendly appearance.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"appearance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈpɪrəns/","meaning":"ấn tượng; cách một người nhìn; hình ảnh; vẻ bề ngoài"},{"word":"excellent","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈek.səl.ənt/","meaning":"xuất sắc, ưu tú"},{"word":"customer","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌs.tə.mɚ/","meaning":"khách hàng"},{"word":"training","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈtreɪ.nɪŋ/","meaning":"sự huấn luyện, sự đào tạo"}]},{"questionNum":"186","passageTitle":"Dialed-ln:The Web Site for Professional Connections","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nDialed-ln:The Web Site for Professional Connections\n\nQuentin Rines | Position wanted:\n\nDialed-In Code number:04404782 | Director of Commercial Lending\n\nExperience: Assistant Manager, Commercial Lending First Bank of Barbados Three years, three months (present position)\n\nLoan Officer First Bank of Barbados Three years, eight months\n\nTeller First Bank of Barbados 1 year, two months\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Quentin Rines <qrines@islandlink.bb> From: | Rozella Huy <rozella.huy@ventana.com> Date: | 14 November\n\nSubject: | Job offer\n\nDear Mr.Rines: On behalf of all staff here at Ventana Bank, I want to say how pleased we were to meet you last week. We appreciate that you were able to spend so much time with us discussing your background and plans for the future. We are pleased to offer you the position of director of commercial lending. The position will be based in our George Town location on the Cayman Islands. Should you accept the position, you will receive the pay and benefits described during the interview process, as well as a relocation reimbursement of USD $1,000. Please let us know whether you accept the offer by 29 November and inform us of your preferred start date, We hope to have the position filled by mid-December. Congratulations on being selected. We look forward to welcoming you to our team. Sincerely, Rozella Huy President, Ventana Bank\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\n*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Tom as Melville <tmelville@homenetwork.bb> From: | Quentin Rines <qrines@islandlink.bb> Date: | 14 November\n\nSubject: | New position\n\nMr. Melville, I just received the job offer from Ventana Bank that we discussed on Monday. They are meeting my salary request and offering me money for relocating too. This has been my goal ever since you hired me as a teller, right out of college. But now that I have been offered my dream job, I am having doubts. The new location seems so\n\nI would welcome your help in this matter. Could we get together in the next few days for lunch or coffee? As you know, I have always valued your input, and I have missed our lunchtime conversations since you retired. Quentin","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Dialed-ln:The Web Site for Professional Connections\n\nQuentin Rines | Position wanted:\n\nDialed-In Code number:04404782 | Director of Commercial Lending\n\nExperience: Assistant Manager, Commercial Lending First Bank of Barbados Three years, three months (present position)\n\nLoan Officer First Bank of Barbados Three years, eight months\n\nTeller First Bank of Barbados 1 year, two months"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Quentin Rines <qrines@islandlink.bb> From: | Rozella Huy <rozella.huy@ventana.com> Date: | 14 November\n\nSubject: | Job offer\n\nDear Mr.Rines: On behalf of all staff here at Ventana Bank, I want to say how pleased we were to meet you last week. We appreciate that you were able to spend so much time with us discussing your background and plans for the future. We are pleased to offer you the position of director of commercial lending. The position will be based in our George Town location on the Cayman Islands. Should you accept the position, you will receive the pay and benefits described during the interview process, as well as a relocation reimbursement of USD $1,000. Please let us know whether you accept the offer by 29 November and inform us of your preferred start date, We hope to have the position filled by mid-December. Congratulations on being selected. We look forward to welcoming you to our team. Sincerely, Rozella Huy President, Ventana Bank"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Tom as Melville <tmelville@homenetwork.bb> From: | Quentin Rines <qrines@islandlink.bb> Date: | 14 November\n\nSubject: | New position\n\nMr. Melville, I just received the job offer from Ventana Bank that we discussed on Monday. They are meeting my salary request and offering me money for relocating too. This has been my goal ever since you hired me as a teller, right out of college. But now that I have been offered my dream job, I am having doubts. The new location seems so\n\nI would welcome your help in this matter. Could we get together in the next few days for lunch or coffee? As you know, I have always valued your input, and I have missed our lunchtime conversations since you retired. Quentin"}],"question":"According to the online profile, what is Mr.Rines'' s current job?","bilingual":"Theo hồ sơ trên mạng, công việc hiện tại của ông Rines là gì?","options":["Director","Assistant manager","Loan officer","Teller"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Assistant manager\".","vocabList":[{"word":"reimbursement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌriɪmˈbərsmənt/","meaning":"hành động trả lại; hoàn trả; bồi thường cho một"},{"word":"professional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/prə''feʃənl/","meaning":"(thuộc) nghề, (thuộc) nghề nghiệp; có tay nghề"},{"word":"conversation","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"A2","ipa":"/ˌkɑːnvərˈseɪʃn/","meaning":"cuộc đối thoại"},{"word":"commercial","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəˈmərʃəl/","meaning":"liên quan đến kinh doanh; liên quan đến việc mua và"}],"optionMeanings":["Giám đốc","Trợ lý giám đốc","Nhân viên cho vay","Teller187. Những gì được chỉ ra về ông Rines trong e đầu tiên - thư à? (A) Anh ấy được đề nghị 1.000 đô la để giúp chi trả cho việc di chuyển. (B) Anh ấy làm việc với cô Huy tại Ngân hàng First of Barbados. (C) Anh ấy dự định thực hiện một chuyến đi ngắn ngày đến Quần đảo Cayman. (D) Anh ấy gần đây đã mở một tài khoản tại Ngân hàng Ventana."]},{"questionNum":"187","passageTitle":"Dialed-ln:The Web Site for Professional Connections","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nDialed-ln:The Web Site for Professional Connections\n\nQuentin Rines | Position wanted:\n\nDialed-In Code number:04404782 | Director of Commercial Lending\n\nExperience: Assistant Manager, Commercial Lending First Bank of Barbados Three years, three months (present position)\n\nLoan Officer First Bank of Barbados Three years, eight months\n\nTeller First Bank of Barbados 1 year, two months\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Quentin Rines <qrines@islandlink.bb> From: | Rozella Huy <rozella.huy@ventana.com> Date: | 14 November\n\nSubject: | Job offer\n\nDear Mr.Rines: On behalf of all staff here at Ventana Bank, I want to say how pleased we were to meet you last week. We appreciate that you were able to spend so much time with us discussing your background and plans for the future. We are pleased to offer you the position of director of commercial lending. The position will be based in our George Town location on the Cayman Islands. Should you accept the position, you will receive the pay and benefits described during the interview process, as well as a relocation reimbursement of USD $1,000. Please let us know whether you accept the offer by 29 November and inform us of your preferred start date, We hope to have the position filled by mid-December. Congratulations on being selected. We look forward to welcoming you to our team. Sincerely, Rozella Huy President, Ventana Bank\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\n*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Tom as Melville <tmelville@homenetwork.bb> From: | Quentin Rines <qrines@islandlink.bb> Date: | 14 November\n\nSubject: | New position\n\nMr. Melville, I just received the job offer from Ventana Bank that we discussed on Monday. They are meeting my salary request and offering me money for relocating too. This has been my goal ever since you hired me as a teller, right out of college. But now that I have been offered my dream job, I am having doubts. The new location seems so\n\nI would welcome your help in this matter. Could we get together in the next few days for lunch or coffee? As you know, I have always valued your input, and I have missed our lunchtime conversations since you retired. Quentin","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Dialed-ln:The Web Site for Professional Connections\n\nQuentin Rines | Position wanted:\n\nDialed-In Code number:04404782 | Director of Commercial Lending\n\nExperience: Assistant Manager, Commercial Lending First Bank of Barbados Three years, three months (present position)\n\nLoan Officer First Bank of Barbados Three years, eight months\n\nTeller First Bank of Barbados 1 year, two months"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Quentin Rines <qrines@islandlink.bb> From: | Rozella Huy <rozella.huy@ventana.com> Date: | 14 November\n\nSubject: | Job offer\n\nDear Mr.Rines: On behalf of all staff here at Ventana Bank, I want to say how pleased we were to meet you last week. We appreciate that you were able to spend so much time with us discussing your background and plans for the future. We are pleased to offer you the position of director of commercial lending. The position will be based in our George Town location on the Cayman Islands. Should you accept the position, you will receive the pay and benefits described during the interview process, as well as a relocation reimbursement of USD $1,000. Please let us know whether you accept the offer by 29 November and inform us of your preferred start date, We hope to have the position filled by mid-December. Congratulations on being selected. We look forward to welcoming you to our team. Sincerely, Rozella Huy President, Ventana Bank"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Tom as Melville <tmelville@homenetwork.bb> From: | Quentin Rines <qrines@islandlink.bb> Date: | 14 November\n\nSubject: | New position\n\nMr. Melville, I just received the job offer from Ventana Bank that we discussed on Monday. They are meeting my salary request and offering me money for relocating too. This has been my goal ever since you hired me as a teller, right out of college. But now that I have been offered my dream job, I am having doubts. The new location seems so\n\nI would welcome your help in this matter. Could we get together in the next few days for lunch or coffee? As you know, I have always valued your input, and I have missed our lunchtime conversations since you retired. Quentin"}],"question":"What is indicated about Mr.Rines in the first e-mail?","bilingual":"","options":["He was offered $1,000 to help pay for moving.","He worked with Ms. Huy at First Bank of Barbados.","He plans to go on a short trip to the Cayman Islands.","He recently opened an account at Ventana Bank."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"He was offered $1,000 to help pay for moving.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"reimbursement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌriɪmˈbərsmənt/","meaning":"hành động trả lại; hoàn trả; bồi thường cho một"},{"word":"professional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/prə''feʃənl/","meaning":"(thuộc) nghề, (thuộc) nghề nghiệp; có tay nghề"},{"word":"conversation","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)",