 người làm việc cho một công ty hoặc một"}],"optionMeanings":["Một đồng nghiệp của ông Palomino","Một nhân viên khách sạn","Một nhân viên của Oma Jean’s Cakes","Một đầu bếp về hưu"]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Greg Pfaff (1:17 P.M.) Hi, Jessa. I''m running a little late for our 2:00 P.","passageText":"Greg Pfaff (1:17 P.M.) Hi, Jessa. I''m running a little late for our 2:00 P.M. appointment to troubleshoot your desktop computer. I expect to arrive around 2:20 P.M.\nJessa Kim (1:18 P.M.) That''s fine. I hope you can fix it. I depend on that desktop for my online craft supply business.\nGreg Pfaff (1:19 P.M.) I know. It might just need a tune-up. My assistant, Kevin Mulford, will also be with me. He could help you in the future when I''m working on a maintenance project at a local data center.\nJessa Kim (1:20 P.M.) That''s good to know.\nGreg Pfaff (1:21 P.M.) Good. It''s settled.\nJessa Kim (1:22 P.M.) OK. See you when you get here.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Greg Pfaff (1:17 P.M.) Hi, Jessa. I''m running a little late for our 2:00 P.M. appointment to troubleshoot your desktop computer. I expect to arrive around 2:20 P.M.\nJessa Kim (1:18 P.M.) That''s fine. I hope you can fix it. I depend on that desktop for my online craft supply business.\nGreg Pfaff (1:19 P.M.) I know. It might just need a tune-up. My assistant, Kevin Mulford, will also be with me. He could help you in the future when I''m working on a maintenance project at a local data center.\nJessa Kim (1:20 P.M.) That''s good to know.\nGreg Pfaff (1:21 P.M.) Good. It''s settled.\nJessa Kim (1:22 P.M.) OK. See you when you get here."}],"question":"Who most likely is Mr. Pfaff?","bilingual":"Ai có nhiều khả năng là ông Pfaff nhất?","options":["A studio artist","A seller of craft supplies","A computer technician","A building superi ntendent"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào thông tin trong bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"A computer technician\".","vocabList":[{"word":"appointment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɔɪnt.mənt/","meaning":"sự bổ nhiệm, cuộc hẹn gặp"},{"word":"maintenance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´meintənəns/","meaning":"sự giữ gìn, sự duy trì; sự bảo vệ"},{"word":"technician","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/tekˈnɪʃ.ən/","meaning":"kỹ thuật viên"},{"word":"assistant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈsɪstənt/","meaning":"người giúp đỡ cấp trên; phụ tá; người trợ giúp"}],"optionMeanings":["Một nghệ sĩ studio","Người bán đồ thủ công","Một kỹ thuật viên máy tính","Giám đốc tòa nhà"]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Greg Pfaff (1:17 P.M.) Hi, Jessa. I''m running a little late for our 2:00 P.","passageText":"Greg Pfaff (1:17 P.M.) Hi, Jessa. I''m running a little late for our 2:00 P.M. appointment to troubleshoot your desktop computer. I expect to arrive around 2:20 P.M.\nJessa Kim (1:18 P.M.) That''s fine. I hope you can fix it. I depend on that desktop for my online craft supply business.\nGreg Pfaff (1:19 P.M.) I know. It might just need a tune-up. My assistant, Kevin Mulford, will also be with me. He could help you in the future when I''m working on a maintenance project at a local data center.\nJessa Kim (1:20 P.M.) That''s good to know.\nGreg Pfaff (1:21 P.M.) Good. It''s settled.\nJessa Kim (1:22 P.M.) OK. See you when you get here.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Greg Pfaff (1:17 P.M.) Hi, Jessa. I''m running a little late for our 2:00 P.M. appointment to troubleshoot your desktop computer. I expect to arrive around 2:20 P.M.\nJessa Kim (1:18 P.M.) That''s fine. I hope you can fix it. I depend on that desktop for my online craft supply business.\nGreg Pfaff (1:19 P.M.) I know. It might just need a tune-up. My assistant, Kevin Mulford, will also be with me. He could help you in the future when I''m working on a maintenance project at a local data center.\nJessa Kim (1:20 P.M.) That''s good to know.\nGreg Pfaff (1:21 P.M.) Good. It''s settled.\nJessa Kim (1:22 P.M.) OK. See you when you get here."}],"question":"At 1:20 P.M., what does Ms. Kim most likely mean when she writes, “That’s good to know”?","bilingual":"Vào lúc 1:20 chiều, rất có thể cô Kim có ý gì khi viết “Thật tốt khi biết điều đó”?","options":["She is relieved that a problem was solved.","She is glad that she will have help if needed.","She is happy that Mr. Pfaff will arrive soon.","S he is satisfied with work done on a maintenance project. B ẢN D ỊCH: Câu h ỏi 149 - 150 đ ềc ập đ ến chu ỗi tin nh ắn văn b ản sau đây. Greg Pfaff (1:17 chi ều) Chào Jessa. Tôi đ ến mu ộn m ột chút vào bu ổ i h ẹn lúc 2:00 chi ều c ủa chúng ta đ ể kh ắc ph ục s ực ốv ới máy tính đ ểbàn c ủa b ạn. Tôi s ẽđ ến vào kho ảng 2:20 chi ều. Je ssa Kim (13:18) T ốt r ồi. Tôi hy v ọng b ạn có th ểs ửa ch ữa nó. Tôi ph ụthu ộc vào máy tính đ ểbàn đó cho công vi ệc kinh doanh cung c ấp đ ồth ủcông tr ực tuy ến c ủa mình. Greg Pfaff (13:19) Tôi bi ết. Nó có th ểch ỉc ần m ột đi ều ch ỉnh. Tr ợlý c ủa tôi, Kevin Mulfor d, cũng s ẽ đi cùng tôi. Anh ấy có th ểgiúp b ạn trong tương lai khi tôi làm vi ệc trong m ột d ựán b ảo trì t ại m ột trung tâm d ữ li ệu đ ịa phương. Jessa Kim (1:20 P.M.) Th ật t ốt khi bi ết đi ều đó. Greg Pfaff (1:21 CH) T ốt. Th ếlà xong. Jessa Kim (13:22) Đư ợc r ồ i. H ẹn g ặp l ại khi b ạn đ ến đây."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào thông tin trong bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"She is glad that she will have help if needed.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"maintenance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´meintənəns/","meaning":"sự giữ gìn, sự duy trì; sự bảo vệ"},{"word":"appointment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɔɪnt.mənt/","meaning":"sự bổ nhiệm, cuộc hẹn gặp"},{"word":"satisfied","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sætisfaid/","meaning":"cảm thấy hài lòng, cảm thấy vừa ý; thoả mãn"},{"word":"assistant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈsɪstənt/","meaning":"người giúp đỡ cấp trên; phụ tá; người trợ giúp"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô ấy cảm thấy nhẹ nhõm vì một vấn đề đã được giải quyết.","Cô rất vui vì sẽ được giúp đỡ nếu cần.","Cô ấy rất vui vì ông Pfaff sẽ sớm đến.","Anh ấy hài lòng với công việc được thực hiện trong một dự án bảo trì."]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"\"As my company''s regional training manager, I am often making presentations","passageText":"\"As my company''s regional training manager, I am often making presentations to groups of people and rarely in the same place. I needed a portable projector to display what''s on my computer screen, and the Veruvatron 800 is perfect because it is slim and light. I did quite a bit of research comparing different brands in terms of image resolution and other specifications. Many were comparable in terms of those specifications, but the Veruvatron 800 is especially easy to bring to all my presentations, and that is ultimately why I chose this one. One flaw is that both the power cord and the VGA cord are surprisingly short. I have needed to use an extension cord pretty much every time I use it, so be prepared to do the same.\" — Horace Offerman","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"\"As my company''s regional training manager, I am often making presentations to groups of people and rarely in the same place. I needed a portable projector to display what''s on my computer screen, and the Veruvatron 800 is perfect because it is slim and light. I did quite a bit of research comparing different brands in terms of image resolution and other specifications. Many were comparable in terms of those specifications, but the Veruvatron 800 is especially easy to bring to all my presentations, and that is ultimately why I chose this one. One flaw is that both the power cord and the VGA cord are surprisingly short. I have needed to use an extension cord pretty much every time I use it, so be prepared to do the same.\" — Horace Offerman"}],"question":"Why did Mr. Offerman choose one projector over others?","bilingual":"Tại sao ông Offerman lại chọn một máy chiếu mà không phải những máy chiếu khác?","options":["It is durable.","It is easy to carry.","It has the best image quality.","It includes more accessories."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào thông tin trong bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It is easy to carry.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"presentations","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌprɛzənˈteɪʃənz/","meaning":"Bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"comparable","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑmprəbəl/","meaning":"có thể so sánh"},{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"},{"word":"different","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈdɪfərənt/","meaning":"không giống nhau; bất thường; đặc biệt"}],"optionMeanings":["Bền bỉ.","Rất dễ mang theo.","Nó có chất lượng hình ảnh tốt nhất.","Nó bao gồm nhiều phụ kiện hơn.152. Ông Offerman cảnh báo độc giả về điều gì?(A) Tuổi thọ của một thiết bị(B) Độ dài của một số dây cáp(C) Sự cần thiết của một hộp đựng riêng (D) Thiếu khả năng tương thích với một số máy tínhB ẢN DỊCH:"]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"\"As my company''s regional training manager, I am often making presentations","passageText":"\"As my company''s regional training manager, I am often making presentations to groups of people and rarely in the same place. I needed a portable projector to display what''s on my computer screen, and the Veruvatron 800 is perfect because it is slim and light. I did quite a bit of research comparing different brands in terms of image resolution and other specifications. Many were comparable in terms of those specifications, but the Veruvatron 800 is especially easy to bring to all my presentations, and that is ultimately why I chose this one. One flaw is that both the power cord and the VGA cord are surprisingly short. I have needed to use an extension cord pretty much every time I use it, so be prepared to do the same.\" — Horace Offerman","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"\"As my company''s regional training manager, I am often making presentations to groups of people and rarely in the same place. I needed a portable projector to display what''s on my computer screen, and the Veruvatron 800 is perfect because it is slim and light. I did quite a bit of research comparing different brands in terms of image resolution and other specifications. Many were comparable in terms of those specifications, but the Veruvatron 800 is especially easy to bring to all my presentations, and that is ultimately why I chose this one. One flaw is that both the power cord and the VGA cord are surprisingly short. I have needed to use an extension cord pretty much every time I use it, so be prepared to do the same.\" — Horace Offerman"}],"question":"What does Mr. Offerman warn readers about?","bilingual":"Ông Offerman cảnh báo độc giả điều gì?","options":["The life span of a device","The length of some cables","The need for a separate case","The lack of com patibility with certain computers B ẢN D ỊCH: Câu h ỏi 151 - 152 tham kh ảo đánh giá s ản ph ẩm sau đây. Là giám đ ốc đào t ạo khu v ực c ủa công ty tôi, tôi thư ờng thuy ết trình trư ớc các nhóm ngư ời và hi ếm khi ởcùng m ột nơi. Tôi c ần m ột máy chi ếu di đ ộng đ ểhi ển th ịn ội dung trên màn hình máy tính c ủa mình và Veruvatron 800 là l ựa ch ọn hoàn h ảo vì nó m ỏng và nh ẹ.Tôi đã th ực hi ện khá nhi ều nghiên c ứu so sánh các thương hi ệu khác nhau v ềđ ộ phân gi ải hình ảnh và các thông s ốk ỹthu ật khác. Nhi ều chi ếc có th ểso sánh đư ợc v ềcác thông s ốk ỹthu ật đó, nh ưng Veruvatron 800 đ ặc bi ệt d ễdàng mang đ ến t ất c ảcác bài thuy ết trình c ủa tôi và cu ối cùng đó là lý do t ại sao tôi ch ọn chi ếc này. Có m ột khuy ết đi ểm là c ảdây ngu ồn và dây VGA đ ều ng ắn m ột cách đáng ng ạc nhiên. Tôi c ần s ửd ụng dây n ối dài khá nhi ều l ần m ỗi khi s ửd ụng nó, vì v ậy hãy chu ẩn b ịs ẵn sàng đ ểlàm đi ều tương t ự. - Horace Offerman"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào thông tin trong bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"The length of some cables\".","vocabList":[{"word":"presentations","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌprɛzənˈteɪʃənz/","meaning":"Bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"comparable","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑmprəbəl/","meaning":"có thể so sánh"},{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"},{"word":"different","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈdɪfərənt/","meaning":"không giống nhau; bất thường; đặc biệt"}],"optionMeanings":["Tuổi thọ của một thiết bị","Chiều dài của một số dây cáp","Cần có một trường hợp riêng","Việc thiếu khả năng tương thích với một số máy tính nhất định"]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"To: | Demetri Owens","passageText":"To: | Demetri Owens\n\nCc: | Theodore Scott, Halina Kibera\n\nFrom: | Janice Kovack\n\nDate: | January 10\n\nSubject: | Next interview\n\nDear Mr. Owens, It was great to speak to you about the security systems manager position. I am pleased to report that I would like you to move on to the next level of interviews. You will speak with the director of security, Mr. Scott, and his assistant, Ms. Kibera. I will send another e-mail before the meeting with instructions on how to join the virtual conference call. Meeting date/time: January 12 at 2:30 PM.Eastern Standard Time Please confirm that you can make the conference call. Sincerely, J. Kovack Human Relations Agent","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Demetri Owens\n\nCc: | Theodore Scott, Halina Kibera\n\nFrom: | Janice Kovack\n\nDate: | January 10\n\nSubject: | Next interview\n\nDear Mr. Owens, It was great to speak to you about the security systems manager position. I am pleased to report that I would like you to move on to the next level of interviews. You will speak with the director of security, Mr. Scott, and his assistant, Ms. Kibera. I will send another e-mail before the meeting with instructions on how to join the virtual conference call. Meeting date/time: January 12 at 2:30 PM.Eastern Standard Time Please confirm that you can make the conference call. Sincerely, J. Kovack Human Relations Agent"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích của e là gì - thư à?","options":["To advertise a job opening","To change the time of a virtual meeting","To offer a job to a candidate","To schedule an interview 152"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To schedule an interview 152\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"interviews","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɪntərvˌjuz/","meaning":"phỏng vấn"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"},{"word":"advertise","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈæd.vɚ.taɪz/","meaning":"quảng cáo, thông báo"}],"optionMeanings":["Để quảng cáo tuyển dụng","Để thay đổi thời gian của cuộc họp ảo","Để giới thiệu việc làm cho ứng viên","Để đặt lịch phỏng vấn154. Ông Scott là ai?(A) Nhân viên bộ phận quan hệ con người(B) Trưởng bộ phận an ninh(C) Người xin việc trong bộ phận hệ thống an ninh(D) Trợ lý cá nhân của cô KiberaB ẢN DỊCH:"]},{"questionNum":"154","passageTitle":"To: | Demetri Owens","passageText":"To: | Demetri Owens\n\nCc: | Theodore Scott, Halina Kibera\n\nFrom: | Janice Kovack\n\nDate: | January 10\n\nSubject: | Next interview\n\nDear Mr. Owens, It was great to speak to you about the security systems manager position. I am pleased to report that I would like you to move on to the next level of interviews. You will speak with the director of security, Mr. Scott, and his assistant, Ms. Kibera. I will send another e-mail before the meeting with instructions on how to join the virtual conference call. Meeting date/time: January 12 at 2:30 PM.Eastern Standard Time Please confirm that you can make the conference call. Sincerely, J. Kovack Human Relations Agent","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Demetri Owens\n\nCc: | Theodore Scott, Halina Kibera\n\nFrom: | Janice Kovack\n\nDate: | January 10\n\nSubject: | Next interview\n\nDear Mr. Owens, It was great to speak to you about the security systems manager position. I am pleased to report that I would like you to move on to the next level of interviews. You will speak with the director of security, Mr. Scott, and his assistant, Ms. Kibera. I will send another e-mail before the meeting with instructions on how to join the virtual conference call. Meeting date/time: January 12 at 2:30 PM.Eastern Standard Time Please confirm that you can make the conference call. Sincerely, J. Kovack Human Relations Agent"}],"question":"Who is Mr.Scott?","bilingual":"Ông Scott là ai?","options":["An agent in the human relations department","The head of security","An applicant for a job in the security systems department","Ms.Kibera''s personal assistant"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"The head of security\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"department","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈpɑːrt.mənt/","meaning":"khoa, bộ"},{"word":"interviews","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɪntərvˌjuz/","meaning":"phỏng vấn"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"}],"optionMeanings":["Một đại lý trong bộ phận quan hệ con người","Người đứng đầu bộ phận an ninh","Một người xin việc trong bộ phận hệ thống an ninh","Trợ lý riêng của cô Kibera"]},{"questionNum":"155","passageTitle":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalley","passageText":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalleyalliance.org Date: | Tuesday, August 17\n\nSubject: | Sunner Planning Commission meeting\n\nDear Board Members, I am preparing to speak at the upcoming Sunner Planning Commission meeting and will be creating a slideshow to accompany my presentation. I have some great data to reinforce my points, but I think it will be easier for people to understand if the information is presented visually. Is anybody interested in helping me develop the visual component of my presentation? Some pie charts and diagrams would make a big impact in the slideshow. The goal is to present the advantages and disadvantages of the three proposals for using the Holt property in northeast Sunner Valley.I am hoping that the commission accepts Ken Jansen''s offer to buy the property, which is next to his land. He would expand his orchard and this would help maintain the rural nature of northern Sunner Valley.\n\nThe speaker sign-up guidelines state that I will need to submit my presentation materials before the agenda gets posted online, but they do not specify when this will happen. I will call today to find out more details. Kathleen Huff","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalleyalliance.org Date: | Tuesday, August 17\n\nSubject: | Sunner Planning Commission meeting\n\nDear Board Members, I am preparing to speak at the upcoming Sunner Planning Commission meeting and will be creating a slideshow to accompany my presentation. I have some great data to reinforce my points, but I think it will be easier for people to understand if the information is presented visually. Is anybody interested in helping me develop the visual component of my presentation? Some pie charts and diagrams would make a big impact in the slideshow. The goal is to present the advantages and disadvantages of the three proposals for using the Holt property in northeast Sunner Valley.I am hoping that the commission accepts Ken Jansen''s offer to buy the property, which is next to his land. He would expand his orchard and this would help maintain the rural nature of northern Sunner Valley.\n\nThe speaker sign-up guidelines state that I will need to submit my presentation materials before the agenda gets posted online, but they do not specify when this will happen. I will call today to find out more details. Kathleen Huff"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích của e là gì - thư à?","options":["To coordinate speakers","To collect more statistics","To get assistance with graphics","To argue against some evidence"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"To get assistance with graphics\".","vocabList":[{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"coordinate","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/koʊˈɔrdəˌneɪt/","meaning":"bình đẳng; tương đương; có cấp bậc hoặc quyền hạn ngang nhau"},{"word":"assistance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈsɪs.təns/","meaning":"sự giúp đỡ, hỗ trợ"}],"optionMeanings":["Điều phối các diễn giả","Để thu thập thêm số liệu thống kê","Để được hỗ trợ về đồ họa","Để tranh luận chống lại một số bằng chứng156. Bà Huff hy vọng ủy ban quy hoạch sẽ làm gì? (A) Từ chối đề xuất (B) Thắt chặt hạn chế (C) Bảo tồn đất nông thôn (D) Khôi phục một số tuyến đường thủy157. Bà Huff sẽ xác nhận điều gì?(A) Ranh giới của một khu đất (B) Thời hạn nộp hồ sơ (C) Độ dài cho phép của bài thuyết trình (D) Các quy định đối với doanh nghiệp mới. BÃN DỊCH:"]},{"questionNum":"156","passageTitle":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalley","passageText":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalleyalliance.org Date: | Tuesday, August 17\n\nSubject: | Sunner Planning Commission meeting\n\nDear Board Members, I am preparing to speak at the upcoming Sunner Planning Commission meeting and will be creating a slideshow to accompany my presentation. I have some great data to reinforce my points, but I think it will be easier for people to understand if the information is presented visually. Is anybody interested in helping me develop the visual component of my presentation? Some pie charts and diagrams would make a big impact in the slideshow. The goal is to present the advantages and disadvantages of the three proposals for using the Holt property in northeast Sunner Valley.I am hoping that the commission accepts Ken Jansen''s offer to buy the property, which is next to his land. He would expand his orchard and this would help maintain the rural nature of northern Sunner Valley.\n\nThe speaker sign-up guidelines state that I will need to submit my presentation materials before the agenda gets posted online, but they do not specify when this will happen. I will call today to find out more details. Kathleen Huff","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalleyalliance.org Date: | Tuesday, August 17\n\nSubject: | Sunner Planning Commission meeting\n\nDear Board Members, I am preparing to speak at the upcoming Sunner Planning Commission meeting and will be creating a slideshow to accompany my presentation. I have some great data to reinforce my points, but I think it will be easier for people to understand if the information is presented visually. Is anybody interested in helping me develop the visual component of my presentation? Some pie charts and diagrams would make a big impact in the slideshow. The goal is to present the advantages and disadvantages of the three proposals for using the Holt property in northeast Sunner Valley.I am hoping that the commission accepts Ken Jansen''s offer to buy the property, which is next to his land. He would expand his orchard and this would help maintain the rural nature of northern Sunner Valley.\n\nThe speaker sign-up guidelines state that I will need to submit my presentation materials before the agenda gets posted online, but they do not specify when this will happen. I will call today to find out more details. Kathleen Huff"}],"question":"What does Ms.Huff hope the planning commission will do?","bilingual":"Bà Huff hy vọng ủy ban kế hoạch sẽ làm gì?","options":["Decline a proposal","Tighten a restriction","Preserverural land","Restore some waterways"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Preserverural land\".","vocabList":[{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"},{"word":"advantage","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ədˈvæn.t̬ɪdʒ/","meaning":"lợi thế"}],"optionMeanings":["Từ chối một đề xuất","Thắt chặt hạn chế","Bảo tồn đất nông thôn","Khôi phục một số tuyến đường thủy (B) Chế độ thắt chặt (C) Bảo tồn đất nông thôn (D) Khôi phục một nước sốt đường thủy"]},{"questionNum":"157","passageTitle":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalley","passageText":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalleyalliance.org Date: | Tuesday, August 17\n\nSubject: | Sunner Planning Commission meeting\n\nDear Board Members, I am preparing to speak at the upcoming Sunner Planning Commission meeting and will be creating a slideshow to accompany my presentation. I have some great data to reinforce my points, but I think it will be easier for people to understand if the information is presented visually. Is anybody interested in helping me develop the visual component of my presentation? Some pie charts and diagrams would make a big impact in the slideshow. The goal is to present the advantages and disadvantages of the three proposals for using the Holt property in northeast Sunner Valley.I am hoping that the commission accepts Ken Jansen''s offer to buy the property, which is next to his land. He would expand his orchard and this would help maintain the rural nature of northern Sunner Valley.\n\nThe speaker sign-up guidelines state that I will need to submit my presentation materials before the agenda gets posted online, but they do not specify when this will happen. I will call today to find out more details. Kathleen Huff","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: TO: | board@sunnervalleyalliance.org From: | kathleen.huff@sunnervalleyalliance.org Date: | Tuesday, August 17\n\nSubject: | Sunner Planning Commission meeting\n\nDear Board Members, I am preparing to speak at the upcoming Sunner Planning Commission meeting and will be creating a slideshow to accompany my presentation. I have some great data to reinforce my points, but I think it will be easier for people to understand if the information is presented visually. Is anybody interested in helping me develop the visual component of my presentation? Some pie charts and diagrams would make a big impact in the slideshow. The goal is to present the advantages and disadvantages of the three proposals for using the Holt property in northeast Sunner Valley.I am hoping that the commission accepts Ken Jansen''s offer to buy the property, which is next to his land. He would expand his orchard and this would help maintain the rural nature of northern Sunner Valley.\n\nThe speaker sign-up guidelines state that I will need to submit my presentation materials before the agenda gets posted online, but they do not specify when this will happen. I will call today to find out more details. Kathleen Huff"}],"question":"What will Ms.Huff confirm?","bilingual":"Cô Huff sẽ xác nhận điều gì?","options":["The boundaries of a property","The deadline for sub missions","The allowed length of a presentation","The regulations for new businesses"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"The deadline for sub missions\".","vocabList":[{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"regulations","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌrɛgjəˈleɪʃənz/","meaning":"quy chế; pháp luật; hành vi kiểm soát; sự quản lý; phương hướng"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"}],"optionMeanings":["Ranh giới của một khu đất","Hạn chót nộp hồ sơ","Độ dài cho phép của bài thuyết trình","Các quy định dành cho doanh nghiệp mới"]},{"questionNum":"158","passageTitle":"Waypave Hardscapes The Finest in Residential Driveways, Walls, and Patios E","passageText":"Waypave Hardscapes The Finest in Residential Driveways, Walls, and Patios ESTIMATE：#20987\n\nDATE:09/28\n\nTOTALAMOUNT: $4,000 PREPARED FOR Lurene Toyo 23000 S Henry Street Fairville, GA30013 JOBDESCRIPTION Remove grass and old concrete patio behind the house. Lay a cement foundation for the new patio. Install Tropical Sunset tiles per client''s approved plan.\n\nMATERIALS | RATE | QUANTITY AMOUNT\n\nCement | $50 per bag | $250\n\nTropical Sun set tiles | $3 each | 500 | $1,500\n\nDelivery of materials | $350\n\nDisposal of debris | $150\n\nLabor | $1,750\n\nTOTAL | $4,000\n\nTERMS $2,000 due upon signing of contract contract $2,ooo due upon completion of project Payable by credit card, check, or bank transfer This estimate serves as your contract, Please sign and return this documenttoestimates@waypavehardscapes.com.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Waypave Hardscapes The Finest in Residential Driveways, Walls, and Patios ESTIMATE：#20987\n\nDATE:09/28\n\nTOTALAMOUNT: $4,000 PREPARED FOR Lurene Toyo 23000 S Henry Street Fairville, GA30013 JOBDESCRIPTION Remove grass and old concrete patio behind the house. Lay a cement foundation for the new patio. Install Tropical Sunset tiles per client''s approved plan.\n\nMATERIALS | RATE | QUANTITY AMOUNT\n\nCement | $50 per bag | $250\n\nTropical Sun set tiles | $3 each | 500 | $1,500\n\nDelivery of materials | $350\n\nDisposal of debris | $150\n\nLabor | $1,750\n\nTOTAL | $4,000\n\nTERMS $2,000 due upon signing of contract contract $2,ooo due upon completion of project Payable by credit card, check, or bank transfer This estimate serves as your contract, Please sign and return this documenttoestimates@waypavehardscapes.com."}],"question":"For what type of work was the estimate created?","bilingual":"Ước tính được tạo ra cho loại công việc nào?","options":["Painting a house","Paving a driveway","Building a stone fence","Creating an outdoor patio"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Creating an outdoor patio\".","vocabList":[{"word":"foundation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/faʊnˈdeɪʃən/","meaning":"căn cứ; nền tảng; công trình phụ; thành lập; tổ chức"},{"word":"completion","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəmˈpliʃən/","meaning":"hoàn thiện; đang hoàn thiện"},{"word":"materials","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/məˈtɪriəlz/","meaning":"vật liệu"},{"word":"estimate","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈes.tə.meɪt/","meaning":"ước tính, dự đoán"}],"optionMeanings":["Vẽ một ngôi nhà","Mở đường cho xe vào","Xây hàng rào đá","Tạo một sân ngoài trời159. Điều gì rất có thể đã xảy ra trước khi Waypave đưa ra ước tính? (A) Một đề xuất thiết kế đã được chấp nhận. (B) Một sân hiên cũ đã bị dỡ bỏ. (C) Một khoản giảm giá đã được đưa ra. (D) Bụi bẩn và mảnh vụn đã được loại bỏ khỏi sân.160. Cô Toyo sẽ nợ bao nhiêu khi ký hợp đồng?(A) $1.500(B) $1.750 (C) $2,000(D) $4,00 0 BÃN DỊCH:"]},{"questionNum":"159","passageTitle":"Waypave Hardscapes The Finest in Residential Driveways, Walls, and Patios E","passageText":"Waypave Hardscapes The Finest in Residential Driveways, Walls, and Patios ESTIMATE：#20987\n\nDATE:09/28\n\nTOTALAMOUNT: $4,000 PREPARED FOR Lurene Toyo 23000 S Henry Street Fairville, GA30013 JOBDESCRIPTION Remove grass and old concrete patio behind the house. Lay a cement foundation for the new patio. Install Tropical Sunset tiles per client''s approved plan.\n\nMATERIALS | RATE | QUANTITY AMOUNT\n\nCement | $50 per bag | $250\n\nTropical Sun set tiles | $3 each | 500 | $1,500\n\nDelivery of materials | $350\n\nDisposal of debris | $150\n\nLabor | $1,750\n\nTOTAL | $4,000\n\nTERMS $2,000 due upon signing of contract contract $2,ooo due upon completion of project Payable by credit card, check, or bank transfer This estimate serves as your contract, Please sign and return this documenttoestimates@waypavehardscapes.com.","passageTextV