bẩn và mảnh vụn đã được loại bỏ khỏi sân."]},{"questionNum":"160","passageTitle":"Waypave Hardscapes The Finest in Residential Driveways, Walls, and Patios E","passageText":"Waypave Hardscapes The Finest in Residential Driveways, Walls, and Patios ESTIMATE：#20987\n\nDATE:09/28\n\nTOTALAMOUNT: $4,000 PREPARED FOR Lurene Toyo 23000 S Henry Street Fairville, GA30013 JOBDESCRIPTION Remove grass and old concrete patio behind the house. Lay a cement foundation for the new patio. Install Tropical Sunset tiles per client''s approved plan.\n\nMATERIALS | RATE | QUANTITY AMOUNT\n\nCement | $50 per bag | $250\n\nTropical Sun set tiles | $3 each | 500 | $1,500\n\nDelivery of materials | $350\n\nDisposal of debris | $150\n\nLabor | $1,750\n\nTOTAL | $4,000\n\nTERMS $2,000 due upon signing of contract contract $2,ooo due upon completion of project Payable by credit card, check, or bank transfer This estimate serves as your contract, Please sign and return this documenttoestimates@waypavehardscapes.com.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Waypave Hardscapes The Finest in Residential Driveways, Walls, and Patios ESTIMATE：#20987\n\nDATE:09/28\n\nTOTALAMOUNT: $4,000 PREPARED FOR Lurene Toyo 23000 S Henry Street Fairville, GA30013 JOBDESCRIPTION Remove grass and old concrete patio behind the house. Lay a cement foundation for the new patio. Install Tropical Sunset tiles per client''s approved plan.\n\nMATERIALS | RATE | QUANTITY AMOUNT\n\nCement | $50 per bag | $250\n\nTropical Sun set tiles | $3 each | 500 | $1,500\n\nDelivery of materials | $350\n\nDisposal of debris | $150\n\nLabor | $1,750\n\nTOTAL | $4,000\n\nTERMS $2,000 due upon signing of contract contract $2,ooo due upon completion of project Payable by credit card, check, or bank transfer This estimate serves as your contract, Please sign and return this documenttoestimates@waypavehardscapes.com."}],"question":"How much will Ms.Toyoowewhenshe signs the contract?","bilingual":"Cô Toyo sẽ nợ bao nhiêu khi ký hợp đồng?","options":["$1,500","$1,750","$2,000","$4,000"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"$2,000\".","vocabList":[{"word":"foundation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/faʊnˈdeɪʃən/","meaning":"căn cứ; nền tảng; công trình phụ; thành lập; tổ chức"},{"word":"completion","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəmˈpliʃən/","meaning":"hoàn thiện; đang hoàn thiện"},{"word":"materials","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/məˈtɪriəlz/","meaning":"vật liệu"},{"word":"contract","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtrækt/","meaning":"tạo ra một thỏa thuận chính thức; ràng buộc về mặt pháp lý; để có được"}],"optionMeanings":["$1.500","$1,750","2.000 USD","Quần jean của cô ấy làm bẩn một món đồ nội thất.162. Cô Olivier giúp cô Trần như thế nào?(A) Bằng cách gửi một chiếc quần jean mới (B) Bằng cách hoàn lại toàn bộ số tiền (C) Bằng cách giảm giá cho các đơn hàng trong tương lai (D) Bằng cách đề xuất cách khắc phục vấn đề163. Câu sau đây thuộc về vị trí nào trong số các vị trí được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]? “Mỗi chiếc quần jean đều có một nhãn lớn ghi hướng dẫn bảo quản.” (A) [1] (B) [2] (C) [3] (D) [41"]},{"questionNum":"161","passageTitle":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.f","passageText":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.fr Date: | September 22\n\nRe: | Order#93887\n\nDear Ms. Tran: Thank you for contacting Shoppe des Jeans Customer Care about order #93887. I am sorry you are not happy with your purchase. [1], The product you ordered, Women''s\n\nStretch Jeans size 36 in midnight blue, is one of our best-selling women''s styles. In order StretchJeanssize3e | our best-selling women''s styles.lnorder\n\nto get the dark blue color that makes these jeans such a stand out, the fabric is dyed twice to deepen the color of the denim.[2].The item''s label clearly states that some dye The item''s label clearly states that some dye may rub off on light-colored fabric or upholstery until the product has been washed several times. -[3] -, It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the [3] -,It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the dye may run in the wash. It is unfortunate that you did not see these warnings and that your sofa has become discolored as a result. [4] -. Our goal at Shoppe des Jeans is 100% customer\n\ncustomer service guarantee, since the issue with the dye is addressed on the product''s | TES\n\nlabel. I suggest you try treating the sofa with baking soda, followed by upholstery cleaner. Regards, Bertine Olivier Customer Care Representative, Shoppe des Jeans","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.fr Date: | September 22\n\nRe: | Order#93887\n\nDear Ms. Tran: Thank you for contacting Shoppe des Jeans Customer Care about order #93887. I am sorry you are not happy with your purchase. [1], The product you ordered, Women''s\n\nStretch Jeans size 36 in midnight blue, is one of our best-selling women''s styles. In order StretchJeanssize3e | our best-selling women''s styles.lnorder\n\nto get the dark blue color that makes these jeans such a stand out, the fabric is dyed twice to deepen the color of the denim.[2].The item''s label clearly states that some dye The item''s label clearly states that some dye may rub off on light-colored fabric or upholstery until the product has been washed several times. -[3] -, It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the [3] -,It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the dye may run in the wash. It is unfortunate that you did not see these warnings and that your sofa has become discolored as a result. [4] -. Our goal at Shoppe des Jeans is 100% customer\n\ncustomer service guarantee, since the issue with the dye is addressed on the product''s | TES\n\nlabel. I suggest you try treating the sofa with baking soda, followed by upholstery cleaner. Regards, Bertine Olivier Customer Care Representative, Shoppe des Jeans"}],"question":"Why did Ms.Tran contact Shoppedes Jeans Customer Care?","bilingual":"Tại sao chị Trần lại liên hệ với bộ phận Chăm sóc khách hàng của Shoppe des Jeans?","options":["She received jeans that were the wrong color.","Her jeans ruined her light-colored clothing.","She was unhappy with the style of her jeans.","Her jeans stained an item of furniture."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Her jeans stained an item of furniture.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"representative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,repri''zentətiv/","meaning":"miêu tả, biểu hiện"},{"word":"contacting","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtæktɪŋ/","meaning":"Liên hệ"},{"word":"furniture","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈfɝː.nɪ.tʃɚ/","meaning":"đồ đạc"},{"word":"guarantee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɡer.ənˈtiː/","meaning":"sự đảm bảo; cam kết"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô ấy nhận được chiếc quần jeans bị sai màu.","Quần jean của cô ấy đã làm hỏng ánh sáng của cô ấy - quần áo màu.","Cô ấy không hài lòng với kiểu dáng quần jean của mình.","Quần jean của cô ấy làm bẩn một món đồ nội thất.162. Cô Olivier giúp cô Trần như thế nào?(A) Bằng cách gửi một chiếc quần jean mới (B) Bằng cách hoàn lại toàn bộ số tiền (C) Bằng cách giảm giá cho các đơn hàng trong tương lai (D) Bằng cách đề xuất cách khắc phục vấn đề163. Câu sau đây thuộc về vị trí nào trong số các vị trí được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]? “Mỗi chiếc quần jean đều có một nhãn lớn ghi hướng dẫn bảo quản.” (A) [1] (B) [2] (C) [3] (D) [41"]},{"questionNum":"162","passageTitle":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.f","passageText":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.fr Date: | September 22\n\nRe: | Order#93887\n\nDear Ms. Tran: Thank you for contacting Shoppe des Jeans Customer Care about order #93887. I am sorry you are not happy with your purchase. [1], The product you ordered, Women''s\n\nStretch Jeans size 36 in midnight blue, is one of our best-selling women''s styles. In order StretchJeanssize3e | our best-selling women''s styles.lnorder\n\nto get the dark blue color that makes these jeans such a stand out, the fabric is dyed twice to deepen the color of the denim.[2].The item''s label clearly states that some dye The item''s label clearly states that some dye may rub off on light-colored fabric or upholstery until the product has been washed several times. -[3] -, It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the [3] -,It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the dye may run in the wash. It is unfortunate that you did not see these warnings and that your sofa has become discolored as a result. [4] -. Our goal at Shoppe des Jeans is 100% customer\n\ncustomer service guarantee, since the issue with the dye is addressed on the product''s | TES\n\nlabel. I suggest you try treating the sofa with baking soda, followed by upholstery cleaner. Regards, Bertine Olivier Customer Care Representative, Shoppe des Jeans","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.fr Date: | September 22\n\nRe: | Order#93887\n\nDear Ms. Tran: Thank you for contacting Shoppe des Jeans Customer Care about order #93887. I am sorry you are not happy with your purchase. [1], The product you ordered, Women''s\n\nStretch Jeans size 36 in midnight blue, is one of our best-selling women''s styles. In order StretchJeanssize3e | our best-selling women''s styles.lnorder\n\nto get the dark blue color that makes these jeans such a stand out, the fabric is dyed twice to deepen the color of the denim.[2].The item''s label clearly states that some dye The item''s label clearly states that some dye may rub off on light-colored fabric or upholstery until the product has been washed several times. -[3] -, It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the [3] -,It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the dye may run in the wash. It is unfortunate that you did not see these warnings and that your sofa has become discolored as a result. [4] -. Our goal at Shoppe des Jeans is 100% customer\n\ncustomer service guarantee, since the issue with the dye is addressed on the product''s | TES\n\nlabel. I suggest you try treating the sofa with baking soda, followed by upholstery cleaner. Regards, Bertine Olivier Customer Care Representative, Shoppe des Jeans"}],"question":"How does Ms.Olivier help Ms.Tran?","bilingual":"Cô Olivier giúp cô như thế nào? Trần?","options":["By sending a new pair of jeans","By offering a full refund","By offering a discount on future orders","By suggesting a way to fix a problem"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"By suggesting a way to fix a problem\".","vocabList":[{"word":"representative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,repri''zentətiv/","meaning":"miêu tả, biểu hiện"},{"word":"contacting","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtæktɪŋ/","meaning":"Liên hệ"},{"word":"guarantee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɡer.ənˈtiː/","meaning":"sự đảm bảo; cam kết"},{"word":"discount","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈdɪs.kaʊnt/","meaning":"sự giảm giá, chiết khấu; giảm giá, bớt giá"}],"optionMeanings":["Bằng cách gửi một chiếc quần jean mới","Bằng cách hoàn lại toàn bộ tiền","Bằng cách giảm giá cho các đơn đặt hàng trong tương lai","Bằng cách gợi ý cách khắc phục sự cố"]},{"questionNum":"163","passageTitle":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.f","passageText":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.fr Date: | September 22\n\nRe: | Order#93887\n\nDear Ms. Tran: Thank you for contacting Shoppe des Jeans Customer Care about order #93887. I am sorry you are not happy with your purchase. [1], The product you ordered, Women''s\n\nStretch Jeans size 36 in midnight blue, is one of our best-selling women''s styles. In order StretchJeanssize3e | our best-selling women''s styles.lnorder\n\nto get the dark blue color that makes these jeans such a stand out, the fabric is dyed twice to deepen the color of the denim.[2].The item''s label clearly states that some dye The item''s label clearly states that some dye may rub off on light-colored fabric or upholstery until the product has been washed several times. -[3] -, It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the [3] -,It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the dye may run in the wash. It is unfortunate that you did not see these warnings and that your sofa has become discolored as a result. [4] -. Our goal at Shoppe des Jeans is 100% customer\n\ncustomer service guarantee, since the issue with the dye is addressed on the product''s | TES\n\nlabel. I suggest you try treating the sofa with baking soda, followed by upholstery cleaner. Regards, Bertine Olivier Customer Care Representative, Shoppe des Jeans","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Quynh La Tran <tqla@tevanto.vn> From: | Customercare@shoppedesjeans.fr Date: | September 22\n\nRe: | Order#93887\n\nDear Ms. Tran: Thank you for contacting Shoppe des Jeans Customer Care about order #93887. I am sorry you are not happy with your purchase. [1], The product you ordered, Women''s\n\nStretch Jeans size 36 in midnight blue, is one of our best-selling women''s styles. In order StretchJeanssize3e | our best-selling women''s styles.lnorder\n\nto get the dark blue color that makes these jeans such a stand out, the fabric is dyed twice to deepen the color of the denim.[2].The item''s label clearly states that some dye The item''s label clearly states that some dye may rub off on light-colored fabric or upholstery until the product has been washed several times. -[3] -, It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the [3] -,It also suggests washing the jeans with dark colors only, as the dye may run in the wash. It is unfortunate that you did not see these warnings and that your sofa has become discolored as a result. [4] -. Our goal at Shoppe des Jeans is 100% customer\n\ncustomer service guarantee, since the issue with the dye is addressed on the product''s | TES\n\nlabel. I suggest you try treating the sofa with baking soda, followed by upholstery cleaner. Regards, Bertine Olivier Customer Care Representative, Shoppe des Jeans"}],"question":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3], and[4] does the following sentence best belong? \"Each pair of jeans comes with a large label displaying the care instructions.\"","bilingual":"Câu sau đây phù hợp nhất ở vị trí nào trong số các vị trí được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]?“Mỗi chiếc quần jean đều có một nhãn lớn ghi hướng dẫn cách bảo quản.”","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"[2]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"representative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,repri''zentətiv/","meaning":"miêu tả, biểu hiện"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"contacting","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtæktɪŋ/","meaning":"Liên hệ"},{"word":"guarantee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɡer.ənˈtiː/","meaning":"sự đảm bảo; cam 