 quality is our top priority!\n\nFrom: | Jonas E.Iversen <jonaseiversen@daylightcommerce.com> To: | support@lazonproducts.com Date: | August 2, 4:58 P.M.\n\nSubject: | Model#B875\n\nHello, I''m writing in regard to a defect in my Lazon Model #B875 board. I was very careful to follow all the maintenance tips that came with the product, but when I was taking off the leather strap as instructed, I noticed a small tear had formed in the middle. It''s not very large now, but it will only get bigger after a couple more months of use. Even though i purchased the product four months ago, I only started using it one month ago. Is the ieather strap still covered under your defective parts policy? I''d like to get a new one. Thank you for your assistance. Jonas E. Iversen\n\n162"}],"question":"What was Mr.Iversen most likely about to do when he noticed a problem?","bilingual":"Ông Iversen có nhiều khả năng sẽ làm gì nhất khi nhận thấy có vấn đề?","options":["Clean the product","Store the product","Display the product","Assemble the product"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Clean the product\".","vocabList":[{"word":"maintenance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´meintənəns/","meaning":"sự giữ gìn, sự duy trì; sự bảo vệ"},{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"},{"word":"assistance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈsɪs.təns/","meaning":"sự giúp đỡ, hỗ trợ"},{"word":"vegetable","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈvɛʤtəbəl/","meaning":"thực vật; quả ăn được của cây"}],"optionMeanings":["C nghiêng sản phẩm","Lưu trữ sản phẩm","Trưng bày sản phẩm","Lắp ráp sản phẩm"]},{"questionNum":"184","passageTitle":"LAZONCOLOR SWIRLCUTTINGBOARD Model#B875","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nLAZONCOLOR SWIRLCUTTINGBOARD Model#B875\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nAlways wash the product soon