, James Norville Executive Director, International Travel Industry Association"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"164\n\nFluttering Wings Resort | INVOICE\n\nName:Julioand Lisa Bardom Prepaymentreceived on:February 1 Dates of stay:February 25-27\n\nKing-size room:twonightsats95/night | $190.00\n\nGuided butterfly sanctuary tour:$40 x2 | $80.00\n\nTotal | $270.00\n\nAmount Paid: | $270.00\n\nBalance Due: | $0.00\n\nNote: Regarding your question, don''t worry-the butterflies don''t depart the reserve until early March."}],"question":"190.How will the Bardoms most likely tour the butterfly sanctuary?","bilingual":"Bardoms rất có thể sẽ tham quan như thế nào. khu bảo tồn bướm?","options":["On foot","On bicycles","On horseback","In all-terrain vehicles"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"On horseback\".","vocabList":[{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"reservation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌrez.ɚˈveɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"dự phòng"},{"word":"destination","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌdes.təˈneɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"đích đến, điểm đến"},{"word":"participate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pɑrˈtɪsəˌpeɪt/","meaning":"được tham gia; tham gia vào"}],"optionMeanings":["Đi bộ","Trên xe đạp","Trên lưng ngựa","Trong tất cả - Xe địa hìnhB ẢN DỊCH:"]},{"questionNum":"191","passageTitle":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the r","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nI5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nFeatured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Featured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez"}],"question":"What does the advertisement indicate?","bilingual":"Quảng cáo chỉ ra điều gì?","options":["The number of student discounts is limited.","The conference will last for fifteen days.","Free busing from hotels is available.","The conference center is being renovated."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Free busing from hotels is available.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertisement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/æd.vɝːˈtaɪz.mənt/","meaning":"bản tin quảng cáo"},{"word":"complimentary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkɑːm.pləˈmen.t̬ɚ.i/","meaning":"ngợi khen, đánh giá cao"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"opportunity","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɒpərˈtyunɪti/","meaning":"cơ hội, thời cơ, dịp may"}],"optionMeanings":["Số lượng giảm giá dành cho sinh viên có hạn.","Hội nghị sẽ kéo dài trong mười lăm ngày.","Có xe buýt miễn phí từ khách sạn.","Trung tâm hội nghị đang được cải tạo.192. Ông Brewster và ông Bax có nhiều khả năng gặp nhau nhất ở đâu?(A) Tại một hội nghị(B) Trên chuyến bay (C) Tại một quỹ từ thiện - người nâng cao (D) Tại văn phòng Brillante Luxlight193. Trong e đầu tiên -mail, ông Brewster nói ông sẽ làm gì? (A) Lên lịch lại cuộc họp video (B) Thuê người quản lý dự án mới (C) Thay đổi đơn đặt hàng mà anh ta đã thực hiện (D) Thêm người khác tham gia cuộc họp194. Mục đích của e thứ hai là gì - thư à? (A) Yêu cầu ông Brewster gửi một lô hàng (B) Để thảo luận về tình trạng của một đơn đặt hàng (C) Để giải thích một số thông số kỹ thuật (D) Khiếu nại về chất lượng của một sản phẩm195. Người ta gợi ý điều gì về ông Brewster?(A) Ông sở hữu đất nông nghiệp ở cả Vương quốc Anh và Bulgaria. (B) Anh ấy muốn bắt đầu một công việc kinh doanh mới với ông Bax. (C) Anh ấy đã phát triển một sản phẩm nông nghiệp mới. (D) Anh ấy đặt mua đèn cho một số cây trồng trong nhà."]},{"questionNum":"192","passageTitle":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the r","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nI5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nFeatured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Featured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez"}],"question":"Where did Mr.Brewster and Mr.Baxmost likely meet?","bilingual":"Ông Brewster và ông Bax có nhiều khả năng gặp nhau ở đâu nhất?","options":["Ata conference","On a plane flight","At a charity fund-raiser","At the Brillante Luxlight office"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Ata conference\".","vocabList":[{"word":"complimentary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkɑːm.pləˈmen.t̬ɚ.i/","meaning":"ngợi khen, đánh giá cao"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"opportunity","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɒpərˈtyunɪti/","meaning":"cơ hội, thời cơ, dịp may"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"}],"optionMeanings":["Tại một hội nghị","Trên chuyến bay","Tại quỹ từ thiện - raise","Tại văn phòng Brillante Luxlight"]},{"questionNum":"193","passageTitle":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the r","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nI5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nFeatured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Featured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez"}],"question":"In the first e-mail, what does Mr.Brewster say he will do?","bilingual":"Trong e đầu tiên -mail, ông làm gì vậy? Brewster nói ông sẽ làm gì?","options":["Reschedule a video meeting","Hire a new project manager","Change an order he made","Include someone else in a meeting"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Include someone else in a meeting\".","vocabList":[{"word":"complimentary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkɑːm.pləˈmen.t̬ɚ.i/","meaning":"ngợi khen, đánh giá cao"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"opportunity","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɒpərˈtyunɪti/","meaning":"cơ hội, thời cơ, dịp may"},{"word":"innovation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnəˈveɪʃən/","meaning":"giới thiệu một cái gì đó mới; thay đổi; phương pháp mới hoặc"}],"optionMeanings":["Lên lịch lại cuộc họp video","Thuê người quản lý dự án mới","Thay đổi đơn hàng anh ấy đã thực hiện","Mời người khác tham gia cuộc họp"]},{"questionNum":"194","passageTitle":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the r","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nI5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nFeatured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Featured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate 