ations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nFeatured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"I5th Annual Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Conference At the renovated Blane Hotel and Conference Centre, London, UK 10-12 November innovations in horticulture.org.uk"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Featured Speakers:.Chen Wan, China:Hope O''Brian, United Kingdom Piet Bax, Netherlands.Emil Savov, Bulgaria\n\nFor more information and to register, visit the Innovations in Horticulture and Agriculture Website. Student discounts available with D.A limited number of hotel rooms are available at the conference site. There is a complimentary bus service for attendees staying at nearby hotels.\n\nE-Mail Message\n\nTo: | Piet Bax <pbax@mailcrate.com> From: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> Subject: | Lighting Information\n\nDate: | 18 December\n\nDear Mr, Bax: It was wonderful meeting you in London last month. Thank you for taking the time to talk to me after your speech and for agreeing to the video meeting on 5 January.I''m going to ask my project manager, Ms. Woo-Jin Ko, to join us. Among other things, Ms, Ko has some questions about lighting for my greenhouses. I think she has some questions about the products offered by the Brillante Luxlight company. I understand you helped design some of their products, so perhaps you can offer some advice. I know we''ll both have many other questions, so I do appreciate this opportunity.I also hope I will be able to visit sometime in the spring and get an in-person look at your greenhouses. Sincerely, Jacob Brewster\n\n166"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Jacob Brewster <jbrewster@sootenfarms.co.uk> From: | Juana Galvez <jgalvez@brillanteluxlight.com.mx> Subject: | Agreement\n\nDate: | 30 January\n\nDear Mr. Brewster: We received the request and the design specifications from you. Unfortunately, the recent inclement weather has delayed the shipments of some materials we need to begin production. However, once these materials arrive, we will fast-track your order and begin production immediately. Sincerely, Juana Galvez"}],"question":"What is suggested about Mr. Brewster?","bilingual":"Điều gì được gợi ý về Mr.","options":["He owns farmland in both the United Kingdom and Bulgaria.","He wants to start a new business with Mr. Bax.","He developed a new agricultural product.","He ordered lights for some indoor plants."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"He ordered lights for some indoor plants.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"complimentary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkɑːm.pləˈmen.t̬ɚ.i/","meaning":"ngợi khen, đánh giá cao"},{"word":"agricultural","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌæɡ.rəˈkʌl.tʃɚ.əl/","meaning":"(thuộc) nông nghiệp"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"opportunity","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɒpərˈtyunɪti/","meaning":"cơ hội, thời cơ, dịp may"}],"optionMeanings":["Anh ấy sở hữu đất nông nghiệp ở cả Vương quốc Anh và Bulgaria.","Anh ấy muốn bắt đầu một công việc kinh doanh mới với Mr.. Bax.","Ông đã phát triển một sản phẩm nông nghiệp mới.","Anh ấy đã đặt hàng đèn cho một số cây trồng trong nhà. Brewster? (A) Anhấy sở hữuu đất nông nghiệpởVương quốc Anh và Bulgaria. (B) Anh muốn bắt đầu một công việc kinh doanh mới với Bax. (C) Anh đã phát triển một sản phẩm nông nghiệp mới. (D) Anhấy đã đặt mua đèn cho một cây trồng trong nhà."]},{"questionNum":"196","passageTitle":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nMax Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Max Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym"}],"question":"According to the advertisement, what is indicated about Orange Light Gym''s Orchard Road location?","bilingual":"Theo quảng cáo, điều gì được chỉ ra về vị trí Đường Orchard của Orange Light Gym?","options":["It is Orange Light Gym''s only location with a pool.","It is the first Orange Light Gym in Singapore.","It is owned by a famous bodybuilder.","It offers classes led by a popular trainer."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It is the first Orange Light Gym in Singapore.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertisement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/æd.vɝːˈtaɪz.mənt/","meaning":"bản tin quảng cáo"},{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"maintenance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´meintənəns/","meaning":"sự giữ gìn, sự duy trì; sự bảo vệ"},{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"}],"optionMeanings":["Đây là địa điểm duy nhất của OrangeLight Gym có hồ bơi.","Đây là phòng tập Orange Light Gym đầu tiên ở Singapore.","Nó thuộc sở hữu của một vận động viên thể hình nổi tiếng.","Nó cung cấp các lớp học được hướng dẫn bởi một huấn luyện viên nổi tiếng.197. Ông Halle chỉ ra điều gì về Orange Light Gym Marina Southlo cation?(A) Nó không có vị trí thuận tiện.(B) Nó không sạch sẽ lắm.(C) Nó có nhiều máy móc hơn vị trí Đường Orchard.(D) Nó nhỏ hơn vị trí Đường Orchard.198. Điều gì là đúng về việc ông Halle là thành viên của Orange Light Gym? (A) Anh ấy dự định hủy nó. (B) Anh ấy được giảm giá 10 phần trăm. (C) Anh ấy chưa bao giờ sử dụng nó để vào địa điểm Dubai. (D) Anh ấy đã bắt đầu nó trước khi các địa điểm được mở ở Singapore.199. Tại sao cô Wayanti lại gửi e - thư à? (A) Để bày tỏ mối quan ngại về công việc tồi tệ của một công ty được thuê (B) Để hỏi về việc trở thành thành viên phòng tập thể dục (C) Để thảo luận về khoản thanh toán vượt mức (D) Đề xuất tuyển dụng những giảng viên giỏi hơn200. Điều gì được đề xuất về Dịch vụ Stokner? (A) Dịch vụ này phục vụ các địa điểm Phòng tập thể dục Orange Light ở Dubai. (B) Nó sửa chữa các máy tập thể dục tại Phòng tập thể dục Orange Light ở Singapore. (C) Nó không bảo trì tốt các hồ bơi ở Orange Light Gyms. (D) Gần đây nó đã được một công ty khác mua lại. BÃN DỊCH:"]},{"questionNum":"197","passageTitle":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nMax Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Max Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym"}],"question":"What does Mr.Halle indicate about the Orange Light Gym Marina South location?","bilingual":"Mr. Halle nói gì về địa điểm Orange Light Gym Marina South?","options":["It is not conveniently located.","It is not very clean.","It has more machines than the Orchard Road location.","It is smaller than the Orchard Road location."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It is smaller than the Orchard Road location.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"conveniently","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/kənˈviː.ni.ənt.li/","meaning":"thuận tiện, tiện lợi"},{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"maintenance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´meintənəns/","meaning":"sự giữ gìn, sự duy trì; sự bảo vệ"},{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó không nằm ở vị trí thuận tiện.","Tôi không sạch sẽ lắm.","Nó có nhiều máy hơn vị trí Đường Orchard.","Nó nhỏ hơn vị trí Đường Orchard."]},{"questionNum":"198","passageTitle":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nMax Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Max Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym"}],"question":"What is true about Mr.Halle''s membership 190. in the Orange Light Gym?","bilingual":"Sự thật về việc ông Halle tham gia Orange LightGym là gì??","options":["He plans to cancel it.","He received a 10 percent discount.","He never used it to enter the Dubai location.","He started it before locations opened in Singapore. Stop! This is the end of the test. If you finish before time is called, you may go backtoParts5, 6,and7andcheckyourwork."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"He started it before locations opened in Singapore. Stop! This is the end of the test. If you finish before time is called, you may go backtoParts5, 6,and7andcheckyourwork.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"maintenance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´meintənəns/","meaning":"sự giữ gìn, sự duy trì; sự bảo vệ"},{"word":"membership","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''membəʃip/","meaning":"tư cách hội viên, địa vị hội viên"},{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"}],"optionMeanings":["Anh ấy dự định hủy bỏ nó.","Anh ấy được giảm giá 10%.","Anh ấy chưa bao giờ sử dụng nó để vào vị trí D ubai.","Anh ấy đã bắt đầu việc này trước khi các địa điểm được mở ở Singapore."]},{"questionNum":"199","passageTitle":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nMax Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Max Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym"}],"question":"Why did Ms.Wayanti send the e-mail?","bilingual":"Tại sao cô Wayanti lại gửi e -thư?","options":["To express concern about a hired company''s poor work","To ask about becoming a gym member","To discuss an overpayment","To recommend hiring better trainers"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"To express concern about a hired company''s poor work\".","vocabList":[{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"maintenance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´meintənəns/","meaning":"sự giữ gìn, sự duy trì; sự bảo vệ"},{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"},{"word":"membership","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''membəʃip/","meaning":"tư cách hội viên, địa vị hội viên"}],"optionMeanings":["Để bày tỏ sự lo lắng về cách làm việc kém cỏi của công ty được thuê","Để hỏi về việc trở thành thành viên phòng tập thể dục","Để thảo luận về khoản thanh toán vượt mức","Để khuyên bạn nên thuê những huấn luyện viên giỏi hơn"]},{"questionNum":"200","passageTitle":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nMax Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"ORANGELIGHTGYM GRANDOPENINGWEEK\n\nOrange Light Gym is coming to Singapore! Join us as we open our newest and best gym in April. This will be our first location in Singapore, and we will add two other locations later this year.\n\n10percent off for new Orange Light Gym members who signup during our Orchard Road grand opening event from 4 April until8April Singapore body building leg end Ronny Cho appearing on 5 April World-famous trainer Lina Sitamanappearingon6April\n\nORANGELIGHTGYM | 11400rchardRoad | Singapore\n\nOrange Light Gym Marina South | 183 Reviews\n\n2 October"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Max Halle ★★★ I have been a regular Orange Light Gym member for ten years and generally like their service.I live in Dubai but travel to Singapore for work regularly, so it''s great to belong to a gym with locations in both countries! The Marina South gym in Singapore is very clean and well designed, but there are two areas that need improvement. There are not enough machines, especially compared to the much larger Orchard Road location. Also, I have visited the gym about ten times and on nearly half of those occasions, the pool was not available for use. Iwill still use this gym because of the global membership, but I hope they address the cause of the pool closures.\n\n168"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Sam Adawi\n\nFrom: | Ani Wayanti\n\nDate: | 14 October\n\nSubject: | Stokner Service\n\nMr. Adawi, I know we have a one-year contract with Stokner Service, but I am very concerned. The problems that we have had at the Orange Light Gyms in Singapore are due to improper maintenance. Quite simply, I don''t think the workers that Stokner employs are trained well enough to do their jobs. Can we meet to discuss this? The sooner we resolve this issue, the better. Ms. Wayanti Regional Manager Orange Light Gym"}],"question":"What is suggested about Stokner Service?","bilingual":"Điều gì được đề xuất về","options":["It services Orange Light Gym locations in Dubai.","It fixes the exercise machines at Orange Light Gyms in Singapore.","It is not maintaining the pools at Orange Light Gyms well.","It was recently bought by another company."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It is not maintaining the pools at Orange Light Gyms well.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"maintenance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´meintənəns/","meaning":"sự giữ gìn, sự duy trì; sự bảo vệ"},{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"},{"word":"membership","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''membəʃip/","meaning":"tư cách hội viên, địa vị hội viên"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó phục vụ các địa điểm Phòng tập thể dục Orange Light ở Dubai.","Sửa máy tập tại Orange Light Gyms ở Singapore.","Việc duy trì các hồ bơi tại Orange Light Gyms không được tốt.","Gần đây nó đã được một công ty khác mua lại. Stokner?(A) Nó phục vụ các địa chỉ Phòng tập tin Orange LightởDubai. (B) Nó chỉnh sửa máy tập tạiOrange Light Gymsở Singapore. (C) Việc duy trì hồbơi tại OrangeLight Gyms không tốt. (D) Gần đây nó đã được mua bởi một loại công nghệ khác."]}]'::jsonb,
