    '{"summary":"Trọn bộ 54 câu hỏi Part 7 chuẩn ETS 2023 Test 6 từ đoạn đơn (147-175) đến đoạn kép (176-185) và ba đoạn liên kết (186-200).","rules":["Đọc câu hỏi và từ khóa trước khi quét (scan) thông tin tương ứng trong từng văn bản.","Chú ý thông tin tổng hợp (cross-reference) giữa email, biểu mẫu, lịch trình và đánh giá ở các bài nhiều đoạn."],"example":"Mayor Lizette Set to Deliver State of the City Address\n\nFALCONHEIGHTS(21 April)-Mayor Loretta Lizette will deliver her fifth State of the City address at Falcon Heights City Hall, ..."}'::jsonb,
    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Mayor Lizette Set to Deliver State of the City Address","passageText":"Mayor Lizette Set to Deliver State of the City Address\n\nFALCONHEIGHTS(21 April)-Mayor Loretta Lizette will deliver her fifth State of the City address at Falcon Heights City Hall, Room101,on Wednesday,30 April, beginning at 7:00 P.M. The event is open to the public, but seating is first come, first served. Mayor Lizette, who was reelected to her second four-year term last month, will discuss her vision for the future of the city. One issue on her agenda is the controversial application by Panhandle Eatery, a fast-food restaurant, to open a location on historic Hedgerow Boulevard. The speech will be followed by a question-and-answer period. Doors open at 6:30 PM.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Mayor Lizette Set to Deliver State of the City Address\n\nFALCONHEIGHTS(21 April)-Mayor Loretta Lizette will deliver her fifth State of the City address at Falcon Heights City Hall, Room101,on Wednesday,30 April, beginning at 7:00 P.M. The event is open to the public, but seating is first come, first served. Mayor Lizette, who was reelected to her second four-year term last month, will discuss her vision for the future of the city. One issue on her agenda is the controversial application by Panhandle Eatery, a fast-food restaurant, to open a location on historic Hedgerow Boulevard. The speech will be followed by a question-and-answer period. Doors open at 6:30 PM."}],"question":"What is NOT mentioned about the event?","bilingual":"Điều gì KHÔNG được đề cập về sự kiện này?","options":["Its starting time","Its main purpose","Its location","Its duration"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Its starting time\".","vocabList":[{"word":"application","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌæp.ləˈkeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"ứng dụng, sự áp dụng"},{"word":"restaurant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnt/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"wednesday","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈwɛnzˌdeɪ/","meaning":"Thứ Tư"},{"word":"beginning","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/bɪˈgɪnɪŋ/","meaning":"bắt đầu"}],"optionMeanings":["Thời gian bắt đầu","Mục đích chính của nó","Vị trí của nó","Thời lượng của nó"]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"Mayor Lizette Set to Deliver State of the City Address","passageText":"Mayor Lizette Set to Deliver State of the City Address\n\nFALCONHEIGHTS(21 April)-Mayor Loretta Lizette will deliver her fifth State of the City address at Falcon Heights City Hall, Room101,on Wednesday,30 April, beginning at 7:00 P.M. The event is open to the public, but seating is first come, first served. Mayor Lizette, who was reelected to her second four-year term last month, will discuss her vision for the future of the city. One issue on her agenda is the controversial application by Panhandle Eatery, a fast-food restaurant, to open a location on historic Hedgerow Boulevard. The speech will be followed by a question-and-answer period. Doors open at 6:30 PM.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Mayor Lizette Set to Deliver State of the City Address\n\nFALCONHEIGHTS(21 April)-Mayor Loretta Lizette will deliver her fifth State of the City address at Falcon Heights City Hall, Room101,on Wednesday,30 April, beginning at 7:00 P.M. The event is open to the public, but seating is first come, first served. Mayor Lizette, who was reelected to her second four-year term last month, will discuss her vision for the future of the city. One issue on her agenda is the controversial application by Panhandle Eatery, a fast-food restaurant, to open a location on historic Hedgerow Boulevard. The speech will be followed by a question-and-answer period. Doors open at 6:30 PM."}],"question":"What is indicated about Mayor Lizette?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về MayorLizette?","options":["She owns a fast-food restaurant.","She recently won an election.","She has a home on Hedgerow Boulevard.","She will present an award to a city employee."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She owns a fast-food restaurant.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"application","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌæp.ləˈkeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"ứng dụng, sự áp dụng"},{"word":"restaurant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnt/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"wednesday","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈwɛnzˌdeɪ/","meaning":"Thứ Tư"},{"word":"beginning","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/bɪˈgɪnɪŋ/","meaning":"bắt đầu"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô ấy sở hữu một nhà hàng thức ăn nhanh.","Cô ấy vừa thắng cử.","Cô ấy có một ngôi nhà ở HedgerowBoulevard.","Cô ấy sẽ trao giải thưởng cho nhân viên thành phố."]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"YOU''REINVITED! Corozal Digital''s Tenth Anniversary Join us to celebrate you","passageText":"YOU''REINVITED! Corozal Digital''s Tenth Anniversary Join us to celebrate your hard work and dedication that got us to this miles tone! Saturday, June 15 6:00 P.M. Appetizers and Music 7:00 P.M. Dinner Bayshore Hotel 22 Atlantic Avenue RSVPbyJune1to j.bovel@corozaldigital.com.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"YOU''REINVITED! Corozal Digital''s Tenth Anniversary Join us to celebrate your hard work and dedication that got us to this miles tone! Saturday, June 15 6:00 P.M. Appetizers and Music 7:00 P.M. Dinner Bayshore Hotel 22 Atlantic Avenue RSVPbyJune1to j.bovel@corozaldigital.com."}],"question":"For whom is the invitation intended?","bilingual":"Lời mời dành cho ai?","options":["Corozal Digital''s clients","Corozal Digital''s employees","Bayshore Hotel staff","Bayshore Hotel patrons"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Corozal Digital''s clients\".","vocabList":[{"word":"anniversary","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌænəˈvərsəri/","meaning":"ngày hàng năm kỷ niệm một sự kiện đặc biệt; sinh nhật"},{"word":"invitation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnvɪˈteɪʃən/","meaning":"yêu cầu sự hiện diện của một người; triệu tập; gọi"},{"word":"dedication","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌdɛdəˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"tách ra; sự tận tâm; dòng chữ (trong một cuốn sách, bài thơ,"},{"word":"celebrate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈsel.ə.breɪt/","meaning":"kỉ niệm, tán dương"}],"optionMeanings":["Khách hàng của Corozal Digital","Nhân viên của Corozal Digital","Nhân viên khách sạn Bayshore","Khách hàng quen của Khách sạn Bayshore"]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"YOU''REINVITED! Corozal Digital''s Tenth Anniversary Join us to celebrate you","passageText":"YOU''REINVITED! Corozal Digital''s Tenth Anniversary Join us to celebrate your hard work and dedication that got us to this miles tone! Saturday, June 15 6:00 P.M. Appetizers and Music 7:00 P.M. Dinner Bayshore Hotel 22 Atlantic Avenue RSVPbyJune1to j.bovel@corozaldigital.com.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"YOU''REINVITED! Corozal Digital''s Tenth Anniversary Join us to celebrate your hard work and dedication that got us to this miles tone! Saturday, June 15 6:00 P.M. Appetizers and Music 7:00 P.M. Dinner Bayshore Hotel 22 Atlantic Avenue RSVPbyJune1to j.bovel@corozaldigital.com."}],"question":"What is mentioned about the event?","bilingual":"Những gì được đề cập về sự kiện này?","options":["It will mark a retirement.","No response is required.","Food will be served.","Guestsofinviteesarewelcome."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It will mark a retirement.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"anniversary","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌænəˈvərsəri/","meaning":"ngày hàng năm kỷ niệm một sự kiện đặc biệt; sinh nhật"},{"word":"retirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtaɪərmənt/","meaning":"sự ẩn dật, sự về hưu"},{"word":"dedication","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌdɛdəˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"tách ra; sự tận tâm; dòng chữ (trong một cuốn sách, bài thơ,"},{"word":"celebrate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈsel.ə.breɪt/","meaning":"kỉ niệm, tán dương"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó sẽ đánh dấu việc nghỉ hưu.","Không cần phản hồi.","Thức ăn sẽ được phục vụ.","Xin chào đón những vị khách được mời."]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"https://www.firststreetcinema.com/classic_film Season Program | News | Tick","passageText":"https://www.firststreetcinema.com/classic_film Season Program | News | Tickets | Contact\n\nClassic Film Festival The new First Street Cinema is celebrating its opening in June by welcoming filmgoerswiththesefreescreeningsforfansofclassicfilms. Thefilmswill start at 7:00 P.M. Seating is limited, and guests are asked to reserve tickets on our Web site, as tickets will not be offered on-site.\n\nThe Hillside Farm | Saturday, June 2\n\nThe story features a mysterious farm on a hill and three generations of the family living there.\n\nJust Two Wheels | Saturday, June 9\n\nA young cyclist spends years preparing for an elite race. This is a heartwarming story of overcoming adversity.\n\nThe Missing Papers | Saturday, June 16\n\nThe puzzling theft of a writer''s manuscript causes a search for the culprit. A Rambling Homecoming Saturday, June 23 The Khan''s familyreunion celebration is marked by a series of comical incidents and misunderstandings. If you need a good laugh, this is the film for you.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"https://www.firststreetcinema.com/classic_film Season Program | News | Tickets | Contact\n\nClassic Film Festival The new First Street Cinema is celebrating its opening in June by welcoming filmgoerswiththesefreescreeningsforfansofclassicfilms. Thefilmswill start at 7:00 P.M. Seating is limited, and guests are asked to reserve tickets on our Web site, as tickets will not be offered on-site.\n\nThe Hillside Farm | Saturday, June 2\n\nThe story features a mysterious farm on a hill and three generations of the family living there.\n\nJust Two Wheels | Saturday, June 9\n\nA young cyclist spends years preparing for an elite race. This is a heartwarming story of overcoming adversity.\n\nThe Missing Papers | Saturday, June 16\n\nThe puzzling theft of a writer''s manuscript causes a search for the culprit. A Rambling Homecoming Saturday, June 23 The Khan''s familyreunion celebration is marked by a series of comical incidents and misunderstandings. If you need a good laugh, this is the film for you."}],"question":"What is true about the classic film screenings?","bilingual":"Điều gì đúng về các buổi chiếu phim kinh điển?","options":["They are offered to the public for a small fee.","They are scheduled throughout one month.","They are shown during the morning.","They are being held outdoors."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"They are scheduled throughout one month.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"celebration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌsel.əˈbreɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"lễ kỉ niệm"},{"word":"throughout","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/θruaʊt/","meaning":"ở mọi phần; tại mọi thời điểm hoặc thời điểm"},{"word":"generation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌʤɛnərˈeɪʃən/","meaning":"sản xuất; tạo ra; nhóm người sinh ra xung quanh"},{"word":"scheduled","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈskɛʤʊld/","meaning":"đã lên lịch"}],"optionMeanings":["Chúng được cung cấp cho công chúng với một khoản phí nhỏ.","Chúng được lên lịch trong suốt một tháng.","Chúng được chiếu vào buổi sáng.","Họ đang được tổ chức ngoài trời."]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"https://www.firststreetcinema.com/classic_film Season Program | News | Tick","passageText":"https://www.firststreetcinema.com/classic_film Season Program | News | Tickets | Contact\n\nClassic Film Festival The new First Street Cinema is celebrating its opening in June by welcoming filmgoerswiththesefreescreeningsforfansofclassicfilms. Thefilmswill start at 7:00 P.M. Seating is limited, and guests are asked to reserve tickets on our Web site, as tickets will not be offered on-site.\n\nThe Hillside Farm | Saturday, June 2\n\nThe story features a mysterious farm on a hill and three generations of the family living there.\n\nJust Two Wheels | Saturday, June 9\n\nA young cyclist spends years preparing for an elite race. This is a heartwarming story of overcoming adversity.\n\nThe Missing Papers | Saturday, June 16\n\nThe puzzling theft of a writer''s manuscript causes a search for the culprit. A Rambling Homecoming Saturday, June 23 The Khan''s familyreunion celebration is marked by a series of comical incidents and misunderstandings. If you need a good laugh, this is the film for you.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"https://www.firststreetcinema.com/classic_film Season Program | News | Tickets | Contact\n\nClassic Film Festival The new First Street Cinema is celebrating its opening in June by welcoming filmgoerswiththesefreescreeningsforfansofclassicfilms. Thefilmswill start at 7:00 P.M. Seating is limited, and guests are asked to reserve tickets on our Web site, as tickets will not be offered on-site.\n\nThe Hillside Farm | Saturday, June 2\n\nThe story features a mysterious farm on a hill and three generations of the family living there.\n\nJust Two Wheels | Saturday, June 9\n\nA young cyclist spends years preparing for an elite race. This is a heartwarming story of overcoming adversity.\n\nThe Missing Papers | Saturday, June 16\n\nThe puzzling theft of a writer''s manuscript causes a search for the culprit. A Rambling Homecoming Saturday, June 23 The Khan''s familyreunion celebration is marked by a series of comical incidents and misunderstandings. If you need a good laugh, this is the film for you."}],"question":"What film is most likely to be humorous?","bilingual":"Bộ phim nào có khả năng hài hước nhất?","options":["The Hillside Farm","Just Two Wheels","The Missing Papers","A Rambling Homecoming"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"The Hillside Farm\".","vocabList":[{"word":"celebration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌsel.əˈbreɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"lễ kỉ niệm"},{"word":"generation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌʤɛnərˈeɪʃən/","meaning":"sản xuất; tạo ra; nhóm người sinh ra xung quanh"},{"word":"program","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈproʊˌgræm/","meaning":"lên lịch; lập kế hoạch; viết hệ điều hành"},{"word":"contact","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtækt/","meaning":"thiết lập giao tiếp; để tạo kết nối; ĐẾN"}],"optionMeanings":["The Hillside Farm","Chỉ cần hai bánh xe","Những giấy tờ bị thiếu","Một chuyến trở về quê hương lan man"]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Aisa Ito[10:08A.M.] I''m so glad I found this forum for users of Canomatik p","passageText":"Aisa Ito[10:08A.M.] I''m so glad I found this forum for users of Canomatik products! Has anyone tried the S20can opener? Theelectriccanopener I''ve had for years finally broke. Tanveer Kumar [10:100 A.M.JI bought one several years ago, but I don''t think it was worth the money Ispent. Ingrid Vogel [11:15 A.M. JI like mine. I used to struggle opening cans. This one makes it easier to open cans of all sizes. Laurie Jacobs[2:12 P.M. JT he commercial version is expensive, but there is also a consumer version that costs less. John Burwood [2:14 P.M.]Iordered mine online, and it was defective. I contacted the company''s customer service department, and they sent mea new one that works just fine. Laurie Jacobs[2:16 P.M. Jlused to be a cook at a restaurant years ago, and we had a commercial-grade Canomatikcanopenerbackthen.I''ve been using the consumer version at home for nearly a decade. It open scans safely and easily. Aisa Ito [5:15P.M.]Thanks, everyone.I''ll give it a try.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Aisa Ito[10:08A.M.] I''m so glad I found this forum for users of Canomatik products! Has anyone tried the S20can opener? Theelectriccanopener I''ve had for years finally broke. Tanveer Kumar [10:100 A.M.JI bought one several years ago, but I don''t think it was worth the money Ispent. Ingrid Vogel [11:15 A.M. JI like mine. I used to struggle opening cans. This one makes it easier to open cans of all sizes. Laurie Jacobs[2:12 P.M. JT he commercial version is expensive, but there is also a consumer version that costs less. John Burwood [2:14 P.M.]Iordered mine online, and it was defective. I contacted the company''s customer service department, and they sent mea new one that works just fine. Laurie Jacobs[2:16 P.M. Jlused to be a cook at a restaurant years ago, and we had a commercial-grade Canomatikcanopenerbackthen.I''ve been using the consumer version at home for nearly a decade. It open scans safely and easily. Aisa Ito [5:15P.M.]Thanks, everyone.I''ll give it a try."}],"question":"Who responded to Ms.Ito''s question?","bilingual":"Ai đã trả lời câu hỏi của cô Ito?","options":["Customer service agents","Advertising salesrepresentatives","Participants in an online cooking course","Owner sofa particular type of appliance"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Customer service agents\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200