e.I''m just glad wei be able to get those lights.I should be back by late morning. Have you looked\n\nLaura Huu [9:05 A.M.] I''ve only been here about ten minutes. Gerald Anast [9:06 A.M.] No problem. When you are caught up, let me know if we''re short on any items. Laura Huu [9:07 A.M.] Will do.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Gerald Anast [8:58 A.M.] Hi, Laura. You have enough people to work in our showroom this morning, right? Laura Huu [8:59 A.M.] I do. Brenda, our part-time helper, is here now. Gerald Anast [9:01 A.M.] Good.I''m at the distributor''s warehouse on Crosby Street. It turns out they have the exact style of pendant lights we need for our latest client, Alsford Guesthouse. Laura Huu [9:02 A.M.] I''m surprised you had to go there. We have such a large variety of styles here. Gerald Anast [9:04 A.M.] Well, Alsford''s management was very specific about their design preference.I''m just glad wei be able to get those lights.I should be back by late morning. Have you looked\n\nLaura Huu [9:05 A.M.] I''ve only been here about ten minutes. Gerald Anast [9:06 A.M.] No problem. When you are caught up, let me know if we''re short on any items. Laura Huu [9:07 A.M.] Will do."}],"question":"At9:05A.M., what does Ms.Huumost likely mean when she writes,\"I''ve only been here about ten minutes\"?","bilingual":"Lúc 9:05 sáng, rất có thể cô Huu có ý gì khi viết, “Tôi mới ở đây được khoảng mười phút”?","options":["She has not yet reviewed some documents.","She had to make a delivery to a client.","She will not be able to substitute for an absent employee.","She has not had time to unpack some boxes."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She has not yet reviewed some documents.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"distributor","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/dɪˈstrɪbjətər/","meaning":"cá nhân, công ty hoặc tổ chức tiếp thị một sản phẩm"},{"word":"management","pos":"Danh từ