ut to residents and homeowners so that work can begin as soon as possible. The moves follow an announcement made earlier this year that Raxconnect had invested f350 million to expand its network. Local officials hope that the project brings new business and spending to their neighbourhoods."},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"Notice of Temporary Road Closure\n\nPlease be aware that construction at 29 Lefroy Street will result in the closure of the entire street. The closure will last from Monday,31 May, until Tuesday,8 June. During that period, automobile access will be limited to residents who live on Lefroy Street."}],"question":"What is suggested about Finnieston in the article?","bilingual":"","options":["It recently experienced power out ages.","It houses Raxconnect''s headquarters.","It will require only one connection hub.","It will soon have upgraded Internet service."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It recently experienced power out ages.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"headquarters","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈhedˌkwɔːr.t̬ɚz/","meaning":"sở chỉ huy, bộ chỉ huy"},{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"xây dựng; kết cấu; ngành xây dựng tòa nhà"},{"word":"announcement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈnaʊnsmɛnt/","meaning":"tuyên ngôn; để ý; hành động thông báo cho công chúng"},{"word":"experienced","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪə.ri.ənst/","meaning":"người từng trải, người có kinh nghiệm"}]},{"questionNum":"188","passageTitle":"Brandy Mortimer Raxconnect, Inc. 620WeirRoad Glasgow G919HX","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nBrandy Mortimer Raxconnect, Inc. 620WeirRoad Glasgow G919HX\n\n11 March\n\nAlyssa Susilo 29 Lefroy Street GlasgowG37BQ\n\nDear Ms. Susilo,\n\nAs you may know, Raxconnect has been expanding its services in the Glasgow area over the past year. Our new fibre-optic cable lines offer faster and more reliable\n\nwork, we need to install Internet connection devices throughout the city. Phase 1 of our construction work involved City Centre. Phase2involvedWestEnd. Although Phase2tooklongerthan expected, we were able to expeditePhase3andgetback on schedule. Phase 4 is now ready to begin in your area.\n\nRaxconnect would like to place a small Internet connection hub on your property at 29LefroyStreet. Because of its central location on the street, your front yard would make an optimal connection point. Please call us at 0141 496 0001 by 10 April to let us know whether we may proceed. Thank you.\n\nSincerely, Brandy Mortimer Brandy Mortimer, Utilities Adviser\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nRaxconnect Expands Service\n\nGLASGOW (14 March)—After unexpected delays in West End, Raxconnect has finally completed the latest phase of its project to install fibre-optic cable throughout the city. Residents and businesses in Southside are now enjoying faster Internet service. For the next phase of the project, in Finnieston, Raxconnect has identified key locations for connection hubs and is currently reaching out to residents and homeowners so that work can begin as soon as possible. The moves follow an announcement made earlier this year that Raxconnect had invested f350 million to expand its network. Local officials hope that the project brings new business and spending to their neighbourhoods.\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nNotice of Temporary Road Closure\n\nPlease be aware that construction at 29 Lefroy Street will result in the closure of the entire street. The closure will last from Monday,31 May, until Tuesday,8 June. During that period, automobile access will be limited to residents who live on Lefroy Street.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Brandy Mortimer Raxconnect, Inc. 620WeirRoad Glasgow G919HX\n\n11 March\n\nAlyssa Susilo 29 Lefroy Street GlasgowG37BQ\n\nDear M