ly, Brandy Mortimer Brandy Mortimer, Utilities Adviser"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Raxconnect Expands Service\n\nGLASGOW (14 March)—After unexpected delays in West End, Raxconnect has finally completed the latest phase of its project to install fibre-optic cable throughout the city. Residents and businesses in Southside are now enjoying faster Internet service. For the next phase of the project, in Finnieston, Raxconnect has identified key locations for connection hubs and is currently reaching out to residents and homeowners so that work can begin as soon as possible. The moves follow an announcement made earlier this year that Raxconnect had invested f350 million to expand its network. Local officials hope that the project brings new business and spending to their neighbourhoods."},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"Notice of Temporary Road Closure\n\nPlease be aware that construction at 29 Lefroy Street will result in the closure of the entire street. The closure will last from Monday,31 May, until Tuesday,8 June. During that period, automobile access will be limited to residents who live on Lefroy Street."}],"question":"What can be concluded about Ms.Susilo?","bilingual":"Có thể kết luận gì về Ms. Susilo?","options":["She agreed to Ms.Mortimer''s request.","She is employed by Raxconnect.","She plans to move to a different Glasgow neighborhood.","She produces video content for the Internet."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She agreed to Ms.Mortimer''s request.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"neighborhood","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈneɪbərˌhʊd/","meaning":"hàng xóm"},{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"xây dựng; kết cấu; ngành xây dựng tòa nhà"},{"word":"announcement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈnaʊnsmɛnt/","meaning":"tuyên ngôn; để ý; hành động thông báo cho công chúng"},{