uggest about Orinti, Inc.?","bilingual":"","options":["It is considering some packaging alternatives.","It is changing its leadership team.","It wants to keep its recipes confidential.","It gets information from an electronic tracking system."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It gets information from an electronic tracking system.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"considering","pos":"Giới từ (Preposition)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈsɪdərɪŋ/","meaning":"có tính đến; trong ánh sáng của"},{"word":"alternative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɑːlˈtɝː.nə.t̬ɪv/","meaning":"xen kẽ, luân phiên"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"committed","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəˈmɪtɪd/","meaning":"bắt buộc; đính hôn; siêng năng; tham vọng; trung thành"}]},{"questionNum":"158","passageTitle":"Learn about Wood working Multonia Hardware, Inc., is offering an online vid","passageText":"Learn about Wood working Multonia Hardware, Inc., is offering an online video course about basic wood working.[1] -. The course is fun and can be completed at your own pace, and, best of all, it''s free! It is divided into four pre recorded sections. Section I is an introduction to wood working equipment, tools, and safety. Section 2 describes various types of wood and their appropriate uses. Section3 introduces the fundamentals of cabinet and furniture repair. -[4]-. The final section describes the preparation of wood surfaces and a variety of popular and beautiful finishing techniques. The course includes a downloadable instruction guide and an online chat feature that can connect participants with an experienced wood working artisan. Sign up today at multoniahardware.com/tips/basic wood working.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Learn about Wood working Multonia Hardware, Inc., is offering an online video course about basic wood working.[1] -. The course is fun and can be completed at your own pace, and, best of all, it''s free! It is divided into four pre recorded sections. Section I is an introduction to wood working equipment, tools, and safety. Section 2 describes various types of wood and their appropriate uses. Section3 introduces the fundamentals of cabinet and furniture repair. -[4]-. The final section describes the preparation of wood surfaces and a variety of popular and beautiful finishing techniques. The course includes a downloadable instruction guide and an online chat feature that can connect participants with an experienced wood working artisan. Sign up today at multoniahardware.com/tips/basic wood working."}],"question":"What section most likely covers how to choose wood for a project?","bilingual":"Phần nào có nhiều khả năng đề cập đến cách chọn gỗ cho một dự án nhất?","options":["Section 1","Section 2","Section 3","Section 4"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Section 2\".","vocabList":[{"word":"introduction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪntrəˈdəkʃən/","meaning":"hành động làm quen người này với người khác; lời nói đầu"},{"word":"appropriate","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈproʊpriˌeɪt/","meaning":"thích hợp; lắp"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"participant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pa:´tisipənt/","meaning":"người tham gia, người tham dự"}],"optionMeanings":["Phần 1","Phần 2","Phần 3","Mục 4"]},{"questionNum":"159","passageTitle":"Learn about Wood working Multonia Hardware, Inc., is offering an online vid","passageText":"Learn about Wood working Multonia Hardware, Inc., is offering an 