, tools, and safety. Section 2 describes various types of wood and their appropriate uses. Section3 introduces the fundamentals of cabinet and furniture repair. -[4]-. The final section describes the preparation of wood surfaces and a variety of popular and beautiful finishing techniques. The course includes a downloadable instruction guide and an online chat feature that can connect participants with an experienced wood working artisan. Sign up today at multoniahardware.com/tips/basic wood working."}],"question":"In which of the positions marked[1],[2],[3], and[4] does the following sentence best belong? \"Participants may take and retake as many of the sections as they wish.\"","bilingual":"","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"[2]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"introduction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪntrəˈdəkʃən/","meaning":"hành động làm quen người này với người khác; lời nói đầu"},{"word":"participant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pa:´tisipənt/","meaning":"người tham gia, người tham dự"},{"word":"appropriate","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈproʊpriˌeɪt/","meaning":"thích hợp; lắp"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}]},{"questionNum":"161","passageTitle":"*E-mail*","passageText":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Kristen Coetzee <kcoetzee@rhyta.co.za> From: | Anita Ngubane <angubane@clubfreshenup.co.za> Subject: | Welcome to Club Freshen-Up\n\nDate: | 12 January\n\nDear Ms. Coetzee,\n\nThank you for joining Club Freshen-Up. We are delighted to be a part of your continuing journey to well-being for the next twelve months. Your membership in Club Freshen-Up entitles you to a monthly delivery of six essential health-care and beauty products. Each shipment will contain a variety of individually packaged items in attractive and reusable containers. Accompanying every shipment will be an itemised receipt listing product numbers. Please refer to these numbers when contacting us with questions about a product. Everything from vitamins to lotions to cosmetics will be chosen just for you based on the eight answers you provided in the personal-preferences questionnaire. Every item you receive is guaranteed for one full year from the date of shipment. If you wish to return an item, simply send us the unused portion along with a short note describing the reason for your dissatisfaction. Upon receipt, we will send you an alternative of equal value.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAnita Ngubane Member Services Specialist, Club Freshen-Up","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Kristen Coetzee <kcoetzee@rhyta.co.za> From: | Anita Ngubane <angubane@clubfreshenup.co.za> Subject: | Welcome to Club Freshen-Up\n\nDate: | 12 January\n\nDear Ms. Coetzee,\n\nThank you for joining Club Freshen-Up. We are delighted to be a part of your continuing journey to well-being for the next twelve months. Your membership in Club Freshen-Up entitles you to a monthly delivery of six essential health-care and beauty products. Each shipment will contain a variety of individually packaged items in attractive and reusable containers. Accompanying every shipment will be an itemised receipt listing product numbers. Please refer to these numbers when contacting us with questions about a product. Everything from vitamins to lotions to cosmetics will be chosen just for you based on the eight answers you provided in the personal-preferences questionnaire. Every item you receive is guaranteed for one full year from the date of shipment. If you wish to return an item, simply send us the unused portion along with a short note describing the reason for your dissatisfaction. Upon receipt, we will send you an alternative of equal value.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAnita Ngubane Member Services Specialist, Club Freshen-Up"}],"question":"What will a Club Freshen-Up subscriber receive every month?","bilingual":"Club Freshen sẽ như thế nào -Up thuê bao nhận được mỗi tháng?","options":["Vegetarian cooking ingredients","Fitness training equipment","Household cleaning supplies","Personal care merchandise"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Personal care merchandise\".","vocabList":[{"word":"questionnaire","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkwɛstʃəˈnɛər/","meaning":"bản câu hỏi (để điều tra, để thăm dò ý kiến)"},{"word":"merchandise","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"B2","ipa":"/ˈmɜːrtʃəndaɪs/","meaning":"hàng hóa"},{"word":"alternative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɑːlˈtɝː.nə.t̬ɪv/","meaning":"xen kẽ, luân phiên"},{"word":"vegetarian","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌvɛʤəˈtɛˌriən/","meaning":"người không ăn thịt; động vật ăn cỏ"}],"optionMeanings":["Nguyên liệu nấu chay","Dụng cụ tập thể dục","Dụng cụ vệ sinh gia đình","Hàng hóa chăm sóc cá nhân"]},{"questionNum":"162","passageTitle":"*E-mail*","passageText":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Kristen Coetzee <kcoetzee@rhyta.co.za> From: | Anita Ngubane <angubane@clubfreshenup.co.za> Subject: | Welcome to Club Freshen-Up\n\nDate: | 12 January\n\nDear Ms. Coetzee,\n\nThank you for joining Club Freshen-Up. We are delighted to be a part of your continuing journey to well-being for the next twelve months. Your membership in Club Freshen-Up entitles you to a monthly delivery of six essential health-care and beauty products. Each shipment will contain a variety of individually packaged items in attractive and reusable containers. Accompanying every shipment will be an itemised receipt listing product numbers. Please refer to these numbers when contacting us with questions about a product. Everything from vitamins to lotions to cosmetics will be chosen just for you based on the eight answers you provided in the personal-preferences questionnaire. Every item you receive is guaranteed for one full year from the date of shipment. If you wish to return an item, simply send us the unused portion along with a short note describing the reason for your dissatisfaction. Upon receipt, we will send you an alternative of equal value.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAnita Ngubane Member Services Specialist, Club Freshen-Up","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Kristen Coetzee <kcoetzee@rhyta.co.za> From: | Anita Ngubane <angubane@clubfreshenup.co.za> Subject: | Welcome to Club Freshen-Up\n\nDate: | 12 January\n\nDear Ms. Coetzee,\n\nThank you for joining Club Freshen-Up. We are delighted to be a part of your continuing journey to well-being for the next twelve months. Your membership in Club Freshen-Up entitles you to a monthly delivery of six essential health-care and beauty products. Each shipment will contain a variety of individually packaged items in attractive and reusable containers. Accompanying every shipment will be an itemised receipt listing product numbers. Please refer to these numbers when contacting us with questions about a product. Everything from vitamins to lotions to cosmetics will be chosen just for you based on the eight answers you provided in the personal-preferences questionnaire. Every item you receive is guaranteed for one full year from the date of shipment. If you wish to return an item, simply send us the unused portion along with a short note describing the reason for your dissatisfaction. Upon receipt, we will send you an alternative of equal value.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAnita Ngubane Member Services Specialist, Club Freshen-Up"}],"question":"What does Club Freshen-Up offer its customers?","bilingual":"Club Freshen có tác dụng gì -Up cung cấp cho khách hàng của mình?","options":["Monthly consultations","Free shipping (B)Freeshir","A product guarantee","A print catalog"],"correctIn