erely,\n\nAnita Ngubane Member Services Specialist, Club Freshen-Up","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Kristen Coetzee <kcoetzee@rhyta.co.za> From: | Anita Ngubane <angubane@clubfreshenup.co.za> Subject: | Welcome to Club Freshen-Up\n\nDate: | 12 January\n\nDear Ms. Coetzee,\n\nThank you for joining Club Freshen-Up. We are delighted to be a part of your continuing journey to well-being for the next twelve months. Your membership in Club Freshen-Up entitles you to a monthly delivery of six essential health-care and beauty products. Each shipment will contain a variety of individually packaged items in attractive and reusable containers. Accompanying every shipment will be an itemised receipt listing product numbers. Please refer to these numbers when contacting us with questions about a product. Everything from vitamins to lotions to cosmetics will be chosen just for you based on the eight answers you provided in the personal-preferences questionnaire. Every item you receive is guaranteed for one full year from the date of shipment. If you wish to return an item, simply send us the unused portion along with a short note describing the reason for your dissatisfaction. Upon receipt, we will send you an alternative of equal value.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAnita Ngubane Member Services Specialist, Club Freshen-Up"}],"question":"According to the e-mail, what should accompany every product return?","bilingual":"","options":["The original shipping material","A written explanation","A copy of the receipt","The preferences questionnaire"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"A written explanation\".","vocabList":[{"word":"questionnaire","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkwɛstʃəˈnɛər/","meaning":"bản câu hỏi (để điều tra, để thăm dò ý kiến)"},{"word":"alternative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɑːlˈtɝː.nə.t̬ɪv/","meaning":"xen kẽ, luân phiên"},{"word":"membership","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''membəʃip/","meaning":"tư cách hội viên, địa vị hội viên"},{"word":"contacting","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtæktɪŋ/","meaning":"Liên hệ"}]},{"questionNum":"164","passageTitle":"*E-mail*","passageText":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Kristen Coetzee <kcoetzee@rhyta.co.za> From: | Anita Ngubane <angubane@clubfreshenup.co.za> Subject: | Welcome to Club Freshen-Up\n\nDate: | 12 January\n\nDear Ms. Coetzee,\n\nThank you for joining Club Freshen-Up. We are delighted to be a part of your continuing journey to well-being for the next twelve months. Your membership in Club Freshen-Up entitles you to a monthly delivery of six essential health-care and beauty products. Each shipment will contain a variety of individually packaged items in attractive and reusable containers. Accompanying every shipment will be an itemised receipt listing product numbers. Please refer to these numbers when contacting us with questions about a product. Everything from vitamins to lotions to cosmetics will be chosen just for you based on the eight answers you provided in the personal-preferences questionnaire. Every item you receive is guaranteed for one full year from the date of shipment. If you wish to return an item, simply send us the unused portion along with a short note describing the reason for your dissatisfaction. Upon receipt, we will send you an alternative of equal value.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAnita Ngubane Member Services Specialist, Club Freshen-Up","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"*E-mail*\n\nTo: | Kristen Coetzee <kcoetzee@rhyta.co.za> From: | Anita Ngubane <angubane@clubfreshenup.co.za> Subject: | Welcome to Club Freshen-Up\n\nDate: | 12 January\n\nDear Ms. Coetzee,\n\nThank you for joining Club Freshen-Up. We are delighted to be a part of your continuing journey to well-being for the next twelve months. Your membership in Club Freshen-Up entitles you to a monthly delivery of six essential health-care and beauty products. Each shipment will contain a variety of individually packaged items in attractive and reusable containers. Accompanying every shipment will be an itemised receipt listing product numbers. Please refer to these numbers when contacting us with questions about a product. Everything from vitamins to lotions to cosmetics will be chosen just for you based on the eight answers you provided in the personal-preferences questionnaire. Every item you receive is guaranteed for one full year from the date of shipment. If you wish to return an item, simply send us the unused portion along with a short note describing the reason for your dissatisfaction. Upon receipt, we will send you an alternative of equal value.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAnita Ngubane Member Services Specialist, Club Freshen-Up"}],"question":"What will Club Freshen-Up do when it receives a product return?","bilingual":"","options":["Provide the customer with a discount on a future membership fee","Refund the purchase price","Replace the item with another product","Increase the number of products included in a future shipment"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Replace the item with another product\".","vocabList":[{"word":"questionnaire","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkwɛstʃəˈnɛər/","meaning":"bản câu hỏi (để điều tra, để thăm dò ý kiến)"},{"word":"alternative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɑːlˈtɝː.nə.t̬ɪv/","meaning":"xen kẽ, luân phiên"},{"word":"membership","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''membəʃip/","meaning":"tư cách hội viên, địa vị hội viên"},{"word":"contacting","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtæktɪŋ/","meaning":"Liên hệ"}]},{"questionNum":"165","passageTitle":"9 September","passageText":"9 September\n\nSoraya Delgado Carrer de Bergara, 2, 08139 Sant Cugat del Valles Barcelona, Spain Dear Ms. Delgado, I am writing to notify you that the board of directors has selected you to receive the Ondae Award for Leadership for the Mediterranean region. Your contributions to Allegrino Travel Agency helped place our company on the radar this year. Due to your relentless work, your direction of the“Find a New Way\"marketing initiative, and your strategic development and placement of advertising, our travel agency is now one of the most recognized brands in Europe. The award ceremony will be held at the next shareholders'' meeting of Allegrino Travel Agency in Copenhagen on 19 November. I would like to ask you to consider being a featured speaker at the meeting in addition to accepting your award. I believe your in sights into boosting market share and finding new ways to reframe our services would be incredibly valuable for shareholders and other employees to hear. Of course, all the expenses associated with your travel to Copenhagen would hear. Of course, all the expenses associatedw nyourtravelto Copenhagenwould be covered by the company. Please let me know whether you will be available to accept your award and speak about your recent initiatives. Sincerely, Noor Darwish Noor Darwish, CEO Allegrino Travel Agency","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"9 September\n\nSoraya Delgado Carrer de Bergara, 2, 08139 Sant Cugat del Valles Barcelona, Spain Dear Ms. Delgado, I am writing to notify you that the board of directors has selected you to receive the Ondae Award for Leadership for the Mediterranean region. Your contributions to Allegrino Travel Agency helped place our company on the radar this year. Due to your relentless work, your direction of the“Find a New Way\"marketing initiative, and your strategic development and placement of advertising, our travel agency is now one of the most recognized brands in Europe. The award ceremony will be held at the next shareholders'' meeting of Allegrino Travel Agency in Copenhagen on 19 November. I would like to ask you to consider being a featured speaker at the meeting in addition to accepting your award. I believe your in sights into boosting market share and finding new ways to reframe our services would be incredibly valuable for shareholders and other employees to hear. Of course, all the expenses associated with your travel to Copenhagen would hear. Of course, all the expenses associatedw nyourtravelto Copenhagenwould be covered by the company. Please let me know whether you will be available to accept your award and speak about your recent initiatives. Sincerely, Noor Darwish Noor Darwish, CEO Allegrino Travel Agency"}],"question":"What is indicated about Ms.Delgado''s work?","bilingual":"Nội dung công việc của bà Delgado thể hiện điều gì?","options":["It has increased public awareness of her company.","It involves evaluating contributions made by employees.","It includes collecting feedback from consumer surveys.","It was instrumental in launching a new award."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It has increased public awareness of her company.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"advertising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈædvərˌtaɪzɪŋ/","meaning":"Quảng cáo"},{"word":"shareholder","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈʃɛˌrhoʊldər/","meaning":"cá nhân hoặc tổ chức sở hữu một phần của công ty"},{"word":"recognized","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛkəgˌnaɪzd/","meaning":"được công nhận"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó đã nâng cao nhận thức của công chúng về công ty của cô ấy.","Nó liên quan đến việc đánh giá những đóng góp của nhân viên.","Nó bao gồm việc thu thập phản hồi từ các cuộc khảo sát người tiêu dùng.","Nó là công cụ để đưa ra một giải thưởng mới.166. Cô Delgado được yêu cầu làm gì? (A) Chia sẻ việc sắp xếp chuyến đi của mình (B) Trao giải thưởng cho đồng nghiệp (C) Cân nhắc việc trở thành cổ đông (D) Phát biểu tại cuộc họp công ty167. Từ “được che” ở đoạn 2, dòng 1, gần nghĩa nhất với(A) đã trả(B) ẩn(C) được bảo hiểm(D) được bảo vệB ẢN DỊCH: Ngày 9 tháng 9Soraya DelgadoCarrer de Bergara, 2, 08139Sant Cugat del VallesBarcelona, Tây Ban NhaKính gửi Ms. Delgado, Tôi viết thư này để thông báo cho cô rằng ban giám đốc đã chọn cô để nhận Giải thưởng Lãnh đạo Ondae cho khu vực Địa Trung Hải. Những lời đóng góp của cô tại Công ty Du lịch Allegrino đã giúp cho công ty của chúng tôi được nhận xét mới trong năm nay. Hỗ trợ công việc không ngừng nghỉ của bạn, phương hướngý tưởng tiếp tục “Tìm Con Đường Mới” của bạn, và phát triển mang tính chiến lược và vị trí quảng cáo, đại lý du lịch của chúng ta hiện nay là 1 trong những hãng được biết đến nhiều nhất tại Châu Âu. Lễ trao giải sẽ được tổ chức tại cuộc thi cổ đông năm sau Đại lý Du lịchAllegrino tại Copenhagen vào ngày 19/11. Tôi muốn bạn cânnhắc việc trở thành diễn giả chính tại cuộc thi bên lề việc nhận giải. Tôi tin rằng những điều bạn đã biết về phần công việc tăng thị trường và tìm ra những phương pháp hướng dẫn mới để điều chỉnh các dịch vụ của chúng tôi sẽ vô cùng quý giá đối với các cổ đông và nhânviên khác. Tất nhiên, Toàn bộ phí kèm theo trong chuyến đi tới Copenhagen sẽ được chi trả công ty. Vui lòng cho tôi biết tài liệu bạn có thể nhận được giải thưởng và nói về kiến ​​trúc hiện tại hay không. Trân trọng, XNoor Darwish, Giám đốc điều hành Đại lý Du lịch Allegrino"]},{"questionNum":"166","passageTitle":"9 September","passageText":"9 September\n\nSoraya Delgado Carrer de Bergara, 2, 08139 Sant Cugat del Valles Barcelona, Spain Dear Ms. Delgado, I am writing to notify you that the board of directors has selected you to receive the Ondae Award for Leadership for the Mediterranean region. Your contributions to Allegrino Travel Agency helped place our company on the radar this year. Due to your relentless work, your direction of the“Find a New Way\"marketing initiative, and your strategic development and placement of advertising, our travel agency is now one of the most recognized brands in Europe. The award ceremony will be held at the next shareholders'' meeting of Allegrino Travel Agency in Copenhagen on 19 November. I would like to ask you to consider being a featured speaker at the meeting in addition to accepting your award. I believe your in sights into boosting market share and finding new ways to reframe our services would be incredibly valuable for shareholders and other employees to hear. Of course, all the expenses associated with your travel to Copenhagen would hear. Of course, all the expenses associatedw nyourtravelto Copenhagenwould be covered by the company. Please let me know whether you will be available to accept your award and speak about your recent initiatives. Sincerely, Noor Darwish Noor Darwish, CEO Allegrino Travel Agency","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"9 September\n\nSoraya Delgado Carrer de Bergara, 2, 08139 Sant Cugat del Valles Barcelona, Spain Dear Ms. Delgado, I am writing to notify you that the board of directors has selected you to receive the Ondae Award for Leadership for the Mediterranean region. Your contributions to Allegrino Travel Agency helped place our company on the radar this year. Due to your relentless work, your direction of the“Find a New Way\"marketing initiative, and your strategic development and placement of advertising, our travel agency is now one of the most recognized brands in Europe. The award ceremony will be held at the next shareholders'' meeting of Allegrino Travel Agency in Copenhagen on 19 November. I would like to ask you to consider being a featured speaker at the meeting in addition to accepting your award. I believe your in sights into boosting market share and finding new ways to reframe our services would be incredibly valuable for shareholders and other employees to hear. Of course, all the expenses associated with your travel to Copenhagen would hear. Of course, all the expenses associatedw nyourtravelto Copenhagenwould be covered by the company. Please let me know whether you will be available to accept your award and speak about your recent initiatives. Sincerely, Noor Darwish Noor Darwish, CEO Allegrino Travel Agency"}],"question":"What is Ms.Delgado asked to do?","bilingual":"","options":["Share her travel arrangements","Present an award to a colleague","Consider becoming a shareholder","Give a speech at a company meeting 216"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Give a speech at a company meeting 216\".","vocabList":[{"word":"arrangement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈreɪndʒ.mənt/","meaning":"sự sắp đặt"},{"word":"shareholder","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈʃɛˌrhoʊldər/","meaning":"cá nhân hoặc tổ chức sở hữu một phần của công ty"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"advertising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈædvərˌtaɪzɪŋ/","meaning":"Quảng cáo"}]},{"questionNum":"167","passageTitle":"9 September","passageText":"9 September\n\nSoraya Delgado Carrer de Bergara, 2, 08139 Sant Cugat del Valles Barcelona, Spain Dear Ms. Delgado, I am writing to notify you that the board of directors has selected you to receive the Ondae Award for Leadership for the Mediterranean region. Your contributions to Allegrino Travel Agency helped place our company on the radar this year. Due to your relentless work, your direction of the“Find a New Way\"marketing initiative, and your strategic development and placement of advertising, our travel agency is now one of the most recognized brands in Europe. The award ceremony will be held at the next shareholders'' meeting of Allegrino Travel Agency in Copenhagen on 19 November. I would like to ask you to consider being a featured speaker at the meeting in addition to accepting your award. I believe your in sights into boosting market share and finding new ways to reframe our services would be incredibly valuable for shareholders and other employees to hear. Of course, all the expenses associated with your travel to Copenhagen would hear. Of course, all the expenses associatedw nyourtravelto Copenhagenwould be covered by the company. Please let me know whether you will be available to accept your award and speak about your recent initiatives. Sincerely, Noor Darwish Noor Darwish, CEO Allegrino Travel Agency","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"9 September\n\nSoraya Delgado Carrer de Bergara, 2, 08139 Sant Cugat del Valles Barcelona, Spain Dear Ms. Delgado, I am writing to notify you that the board of directors has selected you to receive the Ondae Award for Leadership for the Mediterranean region. Your contributions to Allegrino Travel Agency helped place our company on the radar this year. Due to your relentless work, your direction of the“Find a New Way\"marketing initiative, and your strategic development and placement of advertising, our travel agency is now one of the most recognized brands in Europe. The award ceremony will be held at the next shareholders'' meeting of Allegrino Travel Agency in Copenhagen on 19 November. I would like to ask you to consider being a featured speaker at the meeting in addition to accepting your award. I believe your in sights into boosting market share and finding new ways to reframe our services would be incredibly valuable for shareholders and other employees to hear. Of course, all the expenses associated with your travel to Copenhagen would hear. Of course, all the expenses associatedw nyourtravelto Copenhagenwould be covered by the company. Please let me know whether you will be available to accept your award and speak about your recent initiatives. Sincerely, Noor Darwish Noor Darwish, CEO Allegrino Travel Agency"}],"question":"The word\"covered”in paragraph 2, line 7, is closest in meaning to","bilingual":"","options":["paid","hidden","insured","guarded"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"paid\".","vocabList":[{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"advertising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈædvərˌtaɪzɪŋ/","meaning":"Quảng cáo"},{"word":"shareholder","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈʃɛˌrhoʊldər/","meaning":"cá nhân hoặc tổ chức sở hữu một phần của công ty"},{"word":"recognized","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛkəgˌnaɪzd/","meaning":"được công nhận"}]},{"questionNum":"168","passageTitle":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given y","passageText":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given your\n\ncontact information by my neighbor, Ms.Ryan. You did some work in her home yesterday.I was wondering if you would be able to move a power outlet in my house. Matt Clayton (9:55 A.M.) We can help with that. Where is the outlet? By the way, I''m adding my business partner, Denise Bosworth, to this message. Vincent Benedict (9:57A.M.)It''s in my living room, near the floor. I want to move it up. I am going to have a television screen mounted on my wall, and it will look ugly if there are cords hanging down to the outlet. Matt Clayton (10:00 A.M.) OK. We can do this type of work for you. Vincent Benedict (10:02 A.M.) How much would something like that cost? Matt Clayton (10:03A.M.)That will probably be between one and two hours of labor. We charge $50 per hour. Denise Bosworth (10:05 A.M.) However, we might find pipes, insulation, or other wiring in the wall once we open it. Vincent Benedict (10:08 A.M.) I understand. Thank you for the information. Are you available to come out and see what needs to be done? Matt Clayton (10:12 A.M.) I will have someone from our office get in touch with you by phone to schedule a visit.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given your\n\ncontact information by my neighbor, Ms.Ryan. You did some work in her home yesterday.I was wondering if you would be able to move a power outlet in my house. Matt Clayton (9:55 A.M.) We can help with that. Where is the outlet? By the way, I''m adding my business partner, Denise Bosworth, to this message. Vincent Benedict (9:57A.M.)It''s in my living room, near the floor. I want to move it up. I am going to have a television screen mounted on my wall, and it will look ugly if there are cords hanging down to the outlet. Matt Clayton (10:00 A.M.) OK. We can do this type of work for you. Vincent Benedict (10:02 A.M.) How much would something like that cost? Matt Clayton (10:03A.M.)That will probably be between one and two hours of labor. We charge $50 per hour. Denise Bosworth (10:05 A.M.) However, we might find pipes, insulation, or other wiring in the wall once we open it. Vincent Benedict (10:08 A.M.) I understand. Thank you for the information. Are you available to come out and see what needs to be done? Matt Clayton (10:12 A.M.) I will have someone from our office get in touch with you by phone to schedule a visit."}],"question":"Why did Mr.Benedict contact Mr.Clayton?","bilingual":"Tại sao ông Benedict lại liên lạc với ông Clayton?","options":["To apply for a job","To request a service","To complain about a repair","To welcome a new neighbor"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To request a service\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"television","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈtɛləˌvɪʒən/","meaning":"Truyền hình"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"},{"word":"available","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈveɪ.lə.bəl/","meaning":"có sẵn để dùng"}],"optionMeanings":["Để xin việc","Để yêu cầu dịch vụ","Để khiếu nại về việc sửa chữa","Chào mừng hàng xóm mới169. Công việc của ông Clayton có khả năng nhất là gì? (A) Thợ điện(B) Thanh tra(C) Thợ sửa ống nước(D) Nhân viên bán hàng170. Vào lúc 10:08 sáng, rất có thể ông Benedict có ý gì khi viết, “Tôi hiểu”?(A) Ông ấy sẽ lên lịch lại chuyến thăm.(B) Ông ấy sẽ liên lạc với cô Bosworth.(C) Ông ấy biết rằng chi phí cuối cùng có thể thay đổi so với ước tính.(D) Ông ấy biết những vật liệu nào cần phải mua.171. Ông Benedict nên mong đợi điều gì tiếp theo? (A) Việc giao một chiếc tivi (B) Tháo bỏ một số dây dẫn(C) Cuộc gọi từ văn phòng ông Clayton(D) Hóa đơn cho công việc đã hoàn thànhB ẢN DỊCH: Vincent Benedict (9h45 sáng): Xin chào. Tôi có thông tin liên lạc của bạn từ hàng xóm của tôi, Ms. Ryan. Bạn đã làm một số công việc tại nhà cô hôm qua. Tôi tự hỏi bạn có thể chuyển điện tử vào nhà tôi không?Matt Clayton (9 h55 sáng): Chúng tôi có thể hỗ trợ việc đó. Ổ điện mở đâu vậy? Có thể, tôi sẽthêm đồng nghiệp của tôi, Denise Bosworth, vào tin nhắn này. Vincent Benedict (9h57 sáng): Nó trong phòng khách, gần sàn nhà. Tôi muốn chuyển nó lên trên. Tôi sẽ có 1 cái màn hình TV gắn trên Tường, và nó sẽ xuất hiện nếu như có nhiềungày điện tửkết nối xuốngổcắm. Matt Clayton (10h00 sáng): OK. Chúng tôi có thể làm công việc này giúp bạnVincent Benedict (10h02 sáng): Chi phí cho công việc này làm bao nhiêu vậy? Matt Clayton (10h03 sáng): Công việc sẽ mất khoảng 1 – 2 tiếng để làm việc. Chúng tôi lấy phí $50 mỗi giờ. Denise Bosworth (10h05 sáng): Tuy nhiên, chúng ta có thểgặp các đườngống, tấm cáchnhiệt, và các dây kết nối khác trong Tường một khi chúng ta bãoraVincent Benedict (10h08 sáng): Tôi hiểu. Cảm ơn vì thông tin này. Bạn có rảnh để ghé quaxem cần phải làm những gì không? Matt Clayton (10h12 sáng): Tôi sẽ là người khácở văn phòng kết nối với bạn qua điện thoại để sắp xếp cuộc hẹn."]},{"questionNum":"169","passageTitle":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given y","passageText":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given your\n\ncontact information by my neighbor, Ms.Ryan. You did some work in her home yesterday.I was wondering if you would be able to move a power outlet in my house. Matt Clayton (9:55 A.M.) We can help with that. Where is the outlet? By the way, I''m adding my business partner, Denise Bosworth, to this message. Vincent Benedict (9:57A.M.)It''s in my living room, near the floor. I want to move it up. I am going to have a television screen mounted on my wall, and it will look ugly if there are cords hanging down to the outlet. Matt Clayton (10:00 A.M.) OK. We can do this type of work for you. Vincent Benedict (10:02 A.M.) How much would something like that cost? Matt Clayton (10:03A.M.)That will probably be between one and two hours of labor. We charge $50 per hour. Denise Bosworth (10:05 A.M.) However, we might find pipes, insulation, or other wiring in the wall once we open it. Vincent Benedict (10:08 A.M.) I understand. Thank you for the information. Are you available to come out and see what needs to be done? Matt Clayton (10:12 A.M.) I will have someone from our office get in touch with you by phone to schedule a visit.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given your\n\ncontact information by my neighbor, Ms.Ryan. You did some work in her home yesterday.I was wondering if you would be able to move a power outlet in my house. Matt Clayton (9:55 A.M.) We can help with that. Where is the outlet? By the way, I''m adding my business partner, Denise Bosworth, to this message. Vincent Benedict (9:57A.M.)It''s in my living room, near the floor. I want to move it up. I am going to have a television screen mounted on my wall, and it will look ugly if there are cords hanging down to the outlet. Matt Clayton (10:00 A.M.) OK. We can do this type of work for you. Vincent Benedict (10:02 A.M.) How much would something like that cost? Matt Clayton (10:03A.M.)That will probably be between one and two hours of labor. We charge $50 per hour. Denise Bosworth (10:05 A.M.) However, we might find pipes, insulation, or other wiring in the wall once we open it. Vincent Benedict (10:08 A.M.) I understand. Thank you for the information. Are you available to come out and see what needs to be done? Matt Clayton (10:12 A.M.) I will have someone from our office get in touch with you by phone to schedule a visit."}],"question":"What most likely is Mr. Clayton''s job?","bilingual":"","options":["Electrician","Inspector","Plumber","Salesperson"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Electrician\".","vocabList":[{"word":"electrician","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ɪlɛkˈtrɪʃən/","meaning":"người lắp đặt hoặc bảo trì hệ thống dây điện"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"television","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈtɛləˌvɪʒən/","meaning":"Truyền hình"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"}]},{"questionNum":"170","passageTitle":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given y","passageText":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given your\n\ncontact information by my neighbor, Ms.Ryan. You did some work in her home yesterday.I was 