 find pipes, insulation, or other wiring in the wall once we open it. Vincent Benedict (10:08 A.M.) I understand. Thank you for the information. Are you available to come out and see what needs to be done? Matt Clayton (10:12 A.M.) I will have someone from our office get in touch with you by phone to schedule a visit."}],"question":"At 10:08A.M., what does Mr.Benedict most likely mean when he writes,\"I understand\"?","bilingual":"","options":["He will reschedule a visit.","He will follow up with Ms. Bosworth.","He knows that the final cost may vary from the estimate.","He knows what materials need to be purchased."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"He knows that the final cost may vary from the estimate.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"},{"word":"television","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈtɛləˌvɪʒən/","meaning":"Truyền hình"},{"word":"materials","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/məˈtɪriəlz/","meaning":"vật liệu"}]},{"questionNum":"171","passageTitle":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given y","passageText":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given your\n\ncontact information by my neighbor, Ms.Ryan. You did some work in her home yesterday.I was wondering if you would be able to move a power outlet in my house. Matt Clayton (9:55 A.M.) We can help with that. Where is the outlet? By the way, I''m adding my business partner, Denise Bosworth, to this message. Vincent Benedict (9:57A.M.)It''s in my living room, near the floor. I want to move it up. I am going to have a television screen mounted on my wall, and it will look ugly if there are cords hanging down to the outlet. Matt Clayton (10:00 A.M.) OK. We can do this type of work for you. Vincent Benedict (10:02 A.M.) How much would something like that cost? Matt Clayton (10:03A.M.)That will probably be between one and two hours of labor. We charge $50 per hour. Denise Bosworth (10:05 A.M.) However, we might find pipes, insulation, or other wiring in the wall once we open it. Vincent Benedict (10:08 A.M.) I understand. Thank you for the information. Are you available to come out and see what needs to be done? Matt Clayton (10:12 A.M.) I will have someone from our office get in touch with you by phone to schedule a visit.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Vincent Benedict (9:45A.M.)Hello.I was given your Vincent Ben | was given your\n\ncontact information by my neighbor, Ms.Ryan. You did some work in her home yesterday.I was wondering if you would be able to move a power outlet in my house. Matt Clayton (9:55 A.M.) We can help with that. Where is the outlet? By the way, I''m adding my business partner, Denise Bosworth, to this message. Vincent Benedict (9:57A.M.)It''s in my living room, near the floor. I want to move it up. I am going to have a television screen mounted on my wall, and it will look ugly if there are cords hanging down to the outlet. Matt Clayton (10:00 A.M.) OK. We can do this type of work for you. Vincent Benedict (10:02 A.M.) How much would something like that cost? Matt Clayton (10:03A.M.)That will probably be between one and two hours of labor. We charge $50 per hour. Denise Bosworth (10:05 A.M.) However, we might find pipes, insulation, or other wiring in the wall once we open it. Vincent Benedict (10:08 A.M.) I understand. Thank you for the information. Are you available to come out and see what needs to be done? Matt Clayton (10:12 A.M.) I will have someone from our office get in touch with you by phone to schedule a visit."}],"question":"What should Mr.Benedict expect next?","bilingual":"","options":["Delivery of a television","Removal of some wires","A call from Mr.Clayton''s office","An invoice for completed work"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"A call from Mr.Clayton''s office\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"television","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈtɛləˌvɪʒən/","meaning":"Truyền hình"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"},{"word":"completed","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/kəmˈplitɪd/","meaning":"đã hoàn thành"}]},{"questionNum":"172","passageTitle":"From: | Sita J.Kumar","passageText":"From: | Sita J.Kumar\n\nTo: | Homestead Natural Pharmaceuticals Staff\n\nSubject: | News\n\nDate: | October 10\n\n[1] -, Thank you all for the wonderful fifteen years I have spent with Homestead Natural Pharmaceuticals. I am especially grateful for all the coworkers and mentors I have worked with over the years. Moreover, for those who worked on the projects that I directed, your commitment to developing safe, effective medicines has always been appreciated.—[2]. I will be returning to India to be near my extended family.—[3] —. However, I am not leaving the field. I will be taking a job with Aithal Research, where I will continue the work of making natural pharmaceuticals.[4]. I wish you all the best. Keep up the great work! Sincerely, Sita Kumar\n\n218","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"From: | Sita J.Kumar\n\nTo: | Homestead Natural Pharmaceuticals Staff\n\nSubject: | News\n\nDate: | October 10\n\n[1] -, Thank you all for the wonderful fifteen years I have spent with Homestead Natural Pharmaceuticals. I am especially grateful for all the coworkers and mentors I have worked with over the years. Moreover, for those who worked on the projects that I directed, your commitment to developing safe, effective medicines has always been appreciated.—[2]. I will be returning to India to be near my extended family.—[3] —. However, I am not leaving the field. I will be taking a job with Aithal Research, where I will continue the work of making natural pharmaceuticals.[4]. I wish you all the best. Keep up the great work! Sincerely, Sita Kumar\n\n218"}],"question":"What is one purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Một mục đích của e là gì - thư à?","options":["To request a job transfer","To describe some pharmaceutical products","To ask for help with a new project","To announce a decision to colleagues"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To announce a decision to colleagues\".","vocabList":[{"word":"especially","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈspɛʃəli/","meaning":"cụ thể"},{"word":"commitment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəˈmɪtmənt/","meaning":"nghĩa vụ; hứa"},{"word":"appreciate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpriː.ʃi.eɪt/","meaning":"đánh giá cao, cảm kích"},{"word":"colleague","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑlig/","meaning":"đồng nghiệp; đồng nghiệp"}],"optionMeanings":["Để yêu cầu chuyển công việc","Để mô tả một số sản phẩm dược phẩm","Để yêu cầu trợ giúp về một dự án mới","Để thông báo quyết định cho đồng nghiệp173. Vị trí của cô Kumar có nhiều khả năng nhất ở Homestead Natural Pharmaceuticals là gì?(A) Kế toán (B ) Giám đốc dự án(C) Giám đốc điều hành(D) Trợ lý hành chính174. Điều gì được chỉ ra về cô Kumar? (A) Cô ấy sắp nghỉ việc. (B) Cô ấy đã thành lập công ty riêng của mình. (C) Cô ấy đang chuyển nơi ở để gần người thân hơn. (D) Cô ấy đã hoàn thành khóa thực tập tại Aithal Research."]},{"questionNum":"173","passageTitle":"From: | Sita J.Kumar","passageText":"From: | Sita J.Kumar\n\nTo: | Homestead Natural Pharmaceuticals Sta