iewers, since initially I had been reluctant to interview journalists for the book. It is true that I could have included a greater variety of in sights, but unfortunately the people whose views he most wanted to hear were just too busy to an updated edition of the book. speak with me before the publishing deadline. Perhaps this is something I can address in\n\nQi Chien\n\n220","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"In the Kitchen Reviewed by Peter Gottlieb Qi Chien understands how restaurants work. Her new book, In the Kitchen: How to Thrive in the Restaurant Business, expertly advises restaurant managers on handling challenges in the industry, from creating reasonable schedules for chefs to appeasing picky diners. Throughout the book, Chien offers concise, practical suggestions with easy-to-understand concepts. Overall, the book offers a colorful snapshot of the various tasks involved in the day-to-day operations of a restaurant. Chien''s book is unique among other industry guides in that she interviewed restaurant owners, managers, and customers as part of her research. She even spoke to journalists who write restaurant reviews to get a good sense of what they most prize in a dining experience, My only criticism is that the book should have also included the perspective of chefs, especially since their role is crucial to a restaurant''s success. This caveat aside, In the Kitchen is an insightful and instructive read."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | editor@lakecountyherald.com From: | qichien@rapidonline.com Date: | August 5\n\nSubject: | In the Kitchen\n\nTo the Editor: I was delighted to read Peter Gottlieb''s review of my latest book, In the Kitchen, in your newspaper.I have appreciated his thoughtful comments about my works over the years, even if they are sometimes negative. In this case, I was especialiy glad that he liked the chapter about restaurant reviewers, since initially I had been reluctant to interview journalists for the book. It is true that I could have included a greater variety of in sights, but unfortunately the people whose views he most wanted to hear were just too busy to an updated edition of the book. speak with me before the publishing deadline. Perhaps this is something I can address in\n\nQi Chien\n\n220"}],"question":"What group of people was Ms.Chien unable to speak to before her deadline?","bilingual":"Cô Chiến không thể nói chuyện với nhóm người nào trước thời hạn?","options":["Chefs","Diners","Journalists","Restaurant owners"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Chefs\".","vocabList":[{"word":"restaurants","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnts/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"journalist","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈʤərnəlɪst/","meaning":"phóng viên; người viết cho một tờ báo hoặc"},{"word":"restaurant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnt/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"}],"optionMeanings":["Các đầu bếp","Thực khách","Nhà báo","Chủ nhà hàngB ẢN DỊCH: Trong Nhà Nhận xét bởi Peter GottliebQi Chiến hiểu cách vận hành của những nhà hàng. Cuốn sách mới của côấy, TrongNhà Bếp: Cách phát triển việc Kinh doanh Nhà hàng, đưa ra tip ý chuyên môn cho các nhà quản lý hàng về xử lý các công thức thô trong nền công nghiệp này, từ công việc tạo lịch trình phù hợp cho những đầu bếp đến hiệp hiệp với những thực khách khó chiều. Xuyênsuốt cuốn sách, Chien đưa ra những mẹo ngắn gọn gàng, mang tính thực tiễn với những ý tưởng dễ hiểu. Tổng quan lại, cuốn sách chưa ra 1 thông tin tổng quan thú vị những điềunhiệm vụ trong hoạt động kinh doanh hàng ngày của nhà hàng. Sách của Chiến vô cùng độ đá trong các hướng dẫn của ngành công nghiệp khácchỗcôấy đã viết phỏng vấn chủ nhà hàng, quản lý và những khách hàng như 1 phần nghiên cứu của cô ấy. Cô thấy còn nói chuyện với các nhà báo viết nhận xét cho nhà hàng để hiểu rõ những điều họ giá cao nhất trong trải nghiệm ăn uống. Lời phê bình duy nhất của tôi là cuốn sách lẽra nên bao gồm cả quan điểm của các đầu bếp, đặc biệt khi vai trò của họrất quan trọng đối với sự thành công của nhà hàng. Bỏ qua điều này, Trong Nhà Bếp là một cuốn sách sâu sắc và mang tính hướng dẫn. Đến: editor@lakecountyherald.comTừ: qichien@rapidonline.comNgày: 5 tháng 8 Chủ đề: Trong Nhà BếpGửi tới người biên tập Tôi rất vui khi đọc bài nhận xét của Peter Gottlien vềcuốn sách mới nhất của tôi, Trong NhàBáo, trên tờbáo của bạn. Tôi đánh giá cao những nhận xét sâu sắc của anh thấy về các tác phẩm của tôi qua các năm, ngay cả khi họ có bất kỳ tiêu điểm nào. Trong trường hợp này, tôi đặc biệt vui mừng khi anh thích chương trình nói về những người có giá nhà hàng, bởi ban đầu tôi rất khó khăn khi phỏng vấn các nhà báo cho cuốn sách này. Đúng là tôi có thể không có nhiều hiểu biết sâu sắc hơn, nhưng không có thể là những người mà anh ta muốn nghe quan điểm từ họnhất lại quá bận để nói chuyện với tôi trước khi xuất bản. Có lẽ đây là điều tôi có thể giải quyết trong bản cập nhật sắp xếp của cuốn sách. Tề Chiến"]},{"questionNum":"181","passageTitle":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nHarriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Harriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222"}],"question":"What does Mr. Vinton suggest in the e-mail?","bilingual":"Ông Vinton gợi ý gì trong e - thư à?","options":["He has worked with Ms. Trimble before.","A neon sign has already been delivered to Vint Apparel''s new location.","He plans to inspect the store on Monday.","Vint Apparel''s new location is in a shopping center."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"He has worked with Ms. Trimble before.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"merchandise","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"B2","ipa":"/ˈmɜːrtʃəndaɪs/","meaning":"hàng hóa"},{"word":"attachment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtætʃ.mənt/","meaning":"sự gắn thêm; phần kèm thêm"},{"word":"delighted","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈlaɪ.t̬ɪd/","meaning":"hài lòng, vui mừng"}],"optionMeanings":["Anh ấy đã từng làm việc với cô Trimble trước đây.","Một bảng hiệu đèn neon đã được chuyển đến địa điểm mới của Vint Apparel.","Anh ấy dự định sẽ kiểm tra cửa hàng vào thứ Hai.","Địa điểm mới của Vint Apparel là ở trung tâm mua sắm."]},{"questionNum":"182","passageTitle":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nHarriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Harriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222"}],"question":"According to the e-mail, how many rectangular light fixtures will be delivered?","bilingual":"","options":["One","Two","Three","Four"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Four\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"merchandise","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"B2","ipa":"/ˈmɜːrtʃəndaɪs/","meaning":"hàng hóa"},{"word":"attachment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtætʃ.mənt/","meaning":"sự gắn thêm; phần kèm thêm"},{"word":"delighted","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈlaɪ.t̬ɪd/","meaning":"hài lòng, vui mừng"}]},{"questionNum":"183","passageTitle":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nHarriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Harriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222"}],"question":"Where will the mannequin display be installed?","bilingual":"","options":["Against the back wall","In the center of the store","To the left of the entrance","To the right of the cashier station"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"To the left of the entrance\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"merchandise","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"B2","ipa":"/ˈmɜːrtʃəndaɪs/","meaning":"hàng hóa"},{"word":"attachment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtætʃ.mənt/","meaning":"sự gắn thêm; phần kèm thêm"},{"word":"delighted","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈlaɪ.t̬ɪd/","meaning":"hài lòng, vui mừng"}]},{"questionNum":"184","passageTitle":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nHarriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Harriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222"}],"question":"What does Ms.Trimble suggest is the date of the new Vint Apparel location''s grand opening?","bilingual":"","options":["May 26","June 15 (B)JureT5","June 20","July 1"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"July 1\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"merchandise","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"B2","ipa":"/ˈmɜːrtʃəndaɪs/","meaning":"hàng hóa"},{"word":"attachment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtætʃ.mənt/","meaning":"sự gắn thêm; phần kèm thêm"},{"word":"delighted","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈlaɪ.t̬ɪd/","meaning":"hài lòng, vui mừng"}]},{"questionNum":"185","passageTitle":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nHarriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Harriet Trimble <htrimble@decobusinessdesign.com> From: | Karl Vinton <karl.vinton@vintapparel.com> Date: | May 26\n\nSubject: | Layout for Vint Apparel store\n\nAttachment: Store layout\n\nHello, Harriet, I am delighted you are available for this latest project; we were very pleased with your previous work. Here are some general instructions to start. On the back wall, hang the Vint Apparel neon sign high enough to be seen over other furniture in the store. The sign has already shipped and should be delivered next Monday. The rectangular light fixtures will also arrive on Monday. There should be four two for each of the side walls. The racks and shelving to display clothing are already there. Please place the three circular racks in the center of the store and put the two shelving units along the left side as you enter the store. Finally, place the cashier station to the right as you enter the store. I have attached a drawing of the layout that includes more detail. Regards, Karl Vinton, Owner"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Harriet Trimble [8:05 A.M.] I stopped by the Vint Apparel job site. We will have to put everything in place by june 15 because the grand opening is fast approaching. Mr.Vinton stressed that they need to start stocking merchandise the week of June 20 to be ready for the official event on July 1. Jackson Ortega[8:06 A.M.] We can do that. Harriet Trimble [8:07 A.M.] Also, there has been a change to the layout drawing. Now we are to install a mannequin display where the two shelving units were and then move the shelving units to the side walls. I will bring an updated copy for you when I come over this afternoon.\n\n222"}],"question":"What will Ms. Trimble do with the updated layout drawing?","bilingual":"","options":["She will hang it in her office.","She will review it with Mr.Vinton.","She will take it to Mr. Ortega.","She will mail it to Vint Apparel."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"She will take it to Mr. Ortega.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"merchandise","pos":"Noun (Danh từ)","level":"B2","ipa":"/ˈmɜːrtʃəndaɪs/","meaning":"hàng hóa"},{"word":"attachment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtætʃ.mənt/","meaning":"sự gắn thêm; phần kèm thêm"},{"word":"delighted","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈlaɪ.t̬ɪd/","meaning":"hài lòng, vui mừng"}]},{"questionNum":"186","passageTitle":"Four square Housing offers corporate housing with apartment units in the gr","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nFour square Housing offers corporate housing with apartment units in the greater Miltonville area. The apartments are fully furnished and include wire less Internet service. Floor plans and photos of apartment interiors can be viewed online. Center Tower Located in downtown Miltonville, the ten-story building has shops on the ground level. Center Tower is on the south west corner of Beeman Square, features a rooftop garden, and is close to public transportation. Angora Plaza Located near downtown Miltonville, the building has a self-service laundromat and a large parking garage. It is also close to two subway stations. Regent Apartments Located approximately six miles outside of Miltonville, the building features an on-site business center and is within walking distance of public transportation. Cityview Gardens Cityview Gardens is a complex of four two-story buildings located in Dayton, about a twenty-minute drive from downtown Miltonville. The property boasts a fitness center and a swimming pool and is adjacent to a community park.A bus line operates a route through the neighborhood.\n\nFrom: | gsteuber@wardertechnology.com\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | info@foursquarehousing.com Date: | July 12\n\nSubject: | Inquiry\n\nFour square Housing, I work in the human resources office of Warder Technology''s Miltonville division. We are seeking an apartment that can be used by employees from outside the area who will work at our headquarters temporarily. We need an apartment for employees who will be in Miltonville for two months or more. The apartment should have amenities like a gym and a pool. Sincerely, Gina Steuber\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\n224\n\nFrom: | info@foursquarehousing.com To: | gsteuber@wardertechnology.com Date: | July 12\n\nSubject: | Information you requested\n\nAttachment: Pricing Leases.pdf\n\nDear Ms.Steuber, Thank you for your interest in Four square Housing. We have a two-bedroom apartment that wii be available on August 15 that should meet your requirements. I have attached a price list for this unit and our other apartments as well. If you agree that this meets your needs, I can send a contract. I should point out that your corporate headquarters in Beeman Square is next to apartments owned by Four square. One apartment here will also become available in August. This would be very convenient if you have short-term visitors. Sincerely, Sam Flannery Leasing Agent","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Four square Housing offers corporate housing with apartment units in the greater Miltonville area. The apartments are fully furnished and include wire less Internet service. Floor plans and photos of apartment interiors can be viewed online. Center Tower Located in downtown Miltonville, the ten-story building has shops on the ground level. Center Tower is on the south west corner of Beeman Square, features a rooftop garden, and is close to public transportation. Angora Plaza Located near downtown Miltonville, the building has a self-service laundromat and a large parking garage. It is also close to two subway stations. Regent Apartments Located approximately six miles outside of Miltonville, the building features an on-site business center and is within walking distance of public transportation. Cityview Gardens Cityview Gardens is a complex of four two-story buildings located in Dayton, about a twenty-minute drive from downtown Miltonville. The property boasts a fitness center and a swimming pool and is adjacent to a community park.A bus line operates a route through the neighborhood.\n\nFrom: | gsteuber@wardertechnology.com"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | info@foursquarehousing.com Date: | July 12\n\nSubject: | Inquiry\n\nFour square Housing, I work in the human resources office of Warder Technology''s Miltonville division. We are seeking an apartment that can be used by employees from outside the area who will work at our headquarters temporarily. We need an apartment for employees who will be in Miltonville for two months or more. The apartment should have amenities like a gym and a pool. Sincerely, Gina Steuber"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"224\n\nFrom: | info@foursquarehou