    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"CALLADANCESTUDIOISNOWOPEN! Come to our beautiful, spacious studio in Hopkin","passageText":"CALLADANCESTUDIOISNOWOPEN! Come to our beautiful, spacious studio in Hopkins Bay for our grand opening on Saturday, March 5, and Sunday, March 6, from noon to 5:00 P.M. During the celebration, you can mingle and chat with our highly trained instructors; enjoy fun, free, easy going dance classes; and receive a 10 percent discount on one of our dance lesson packages. We believe that everyone can benefit from dancing, sowhetheryouareabeginner or an expert, we have a class for you! Visit us online at www.calladancestudio.com for class descriptions, instructor profiles, directions to the studio, and more.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"CALLADANCESTUDIOISNOWOPEN! Come to our beautiful, spacious studio in Hopkins Bay for our grand opening on Saturday, March 5, and Sunday, March 6, from noon to 5:00 P.M. During the celebration, you can mingle and chat with our highly trained instructors; enjoy fun, free, easy going dance classes; and receive a 10 percent discount on one of our dance lesson packages. We believe that everyone can benefit from dancing, sowhetheryouareabeginner or an expert, we have a class for you! Visit us online at www.calladancestudio.com for class descriptions, instructor profiles, directions to the studio, and more."}],"question":"What is NOT listed as something visitors can do during the celebration?","bilingual":"Điều gì KHÔNG được liệt kê là những điều du khách có thể làm trong lễ kỷ niệm?","options":["They can meet dance instructors.","They can take a dance class.","They can get a discount.","They can purchase gift cards."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"They can purchase gift cards.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"celebration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌsel.əˈbreɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"lễ kỉ niệm"},{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"instructor","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəktər/","meaning":"nhà giáo dục; giáo viên; huấn luyện viên"},{"word":"beautiful","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈbjuː.t̬ə.fəl/","meaning":"xinh đẹp, tốt đẹp"}],"optionMeanings":["Họ có thể gặp những người hướng dẫn khiêu vũ.","Họ có thể tham gia một lớp học khiêu vũ.","Họ có thể được giảm giá.","Họ có thể mua thẻ quà tặng."]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"CALLADANCESTUDIOISNOWOPEN! Come to our beautiful, spacious studio in Hopkin","passageText":"CALLADANCESTUDIOISNOWOPEN! Come to our beautiful, spacious studio in Hopkins Bay for our grand opening on Saturday, March 5, and Sunday, March 6, from noon to 5:00 P.M. During the celebration, you can mingle and chat with our highly trained instructors; enjoy fun, free, easy going dance classes; and receive a 10 percent discount on one of our dance lesson packages. We believe that everyone can benefit from dancing, sowhetheryouareabeginner or an expert, we have a class for you! Visit us online at www.calladancestudio.com for class descriptions, instructor profiles, directions to the studio, and more.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"CALLADANCESTUDIOISNOWOPEN! Come to our beautiful, spacious studio in Hopkins Bay for our grand opening on Saturday, March 5, and Sunday, March 6, from noon to 5:00 P.M. During the celebration, you can mingle and chat with our highly trained instructors; enjoy fun, free, easy going dance classes; and receive a 10 percent discount on one of our dance lesson packages. We believe that everyone can benefit from dancing, sowhetheryouareabeginner or an expert, we have a class for you! Visit us online at www.calladancestudio.com for class descriptions, instructor profiles, directions to the studio, and more."}],"question":"What is true about Call a Dance Studio?","bilingual":"Điều gì là đúng về Calla Dance Studio?","options":["It has locations in multiple cities.","It provides certification for dance instructors.","It offers classes for a range of experience levels.","Its grand opening will be held on a single day."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It offers classes for a range of experience levels.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"celebration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌsel.əˈbreɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"lễ kỉ niệm"},{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"instructor","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəktər/","meaning":"nhà giáo dục; giáo viên; huấn luyện viên"},{"word":"experience","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪr.i.əns/","meaning":"trải nghiệm, kinh nghiệm"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó có địa điểm ở nhiều thành phố.","Nó cung cấp chứng chỉ cho người hướng dẫn khiêu vũ. (c) Nó cung cấp các lớp học cho nhiều cấp độ kinh nghiệm. (D) Lễ khai trương sẽ được tổ chức vào một ngày duy nhất. BAN ĐÍCH: CALLA DANCE STUDIO HIỂN DA MÔ CUA! Hay den vdi phong tap nhdy xinh dep và rong rai cua chung toi Vinh Hopkinsde du le khai truong vao thu Bdy, ngày 5 thdng 3 và Chu nhật ngày 6 thdng 3, tu buoi trua den 5:00 gioi chieu. Trong suốt nhúng lèn, ban co the: hoa nhap và tro chuyện cung nhung hương dan viên ngày chuyện môn; tân hương nhung lôp khieu vu vui vé, mien phi và thoại mai; vaduoc giam gia 10% cho 1 trong các khoa học khieu vu cua chung tôi Chung tôi tin rang moi nguoi deu co the nhân dugc lgi ich tu viec khieu vu, vithe cho du ban la nguoi mdi bat đầu hay chuyện gia, chung tôi deu co lop hocdanh cho ban! Hay truy cap www.calladancestudio.com de biết chúng thông tin về lập học, lylich cua hương dân viên, chí đàn đến phong tập,... TOP 1 TRUNG TÂM CƠ NHIỆU Học VIÊN SỰ HỮU CHUNG CHÍ QUỐC TẾ NHẬT VIỆT NAM - 2028 Zenlish","Nó chỉ cung cấp thông tin cho các sân bay lớn.","Các chuyên gia du lịch đã phát triển nó."]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Travel with Confidence the Simple Trip Way! Does your travel plan include t","passageText":"Travel with Confidence the Simple Trip Way! Does your travel plan include taking one or more flights? Save time and avoid industry, the award-winning Simple Trip application allows Web check-in at the airport and keeps you up-to-date regarding local weather conditions and any changes to departure and arrival times.[1] Download Simple Trip from any app store onto your mobile phone.-[2]-. Simple information hidden from hackers. Once your documentation has been successfully loaded into the app, Simple Trip provides you with digital passes that can be scanned at security check points, check-in kiosks, and boarding gates.[3]\n\nup-to-date with the latest entry requirements at your destination.-—[4],Make your journey a breeze with Simple Trip!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Travel with Confidence the Simple Trip Way! Does your travel plan include taking one or more flights? Save time and avoid industry, the award-winning Simple Trip application allows Web check-in at the airport and keeps you up-to-date regarding local weather conditions and any changes to departure and arrival times.[1] Download Simple Trip from any app store onto your mobile phone.-[2]-. Simple information hidden from hackers. Once your documentation has been successfully loaded into the app, Simple Trip provides you with digital passes that can be scanned at security check points, check-in kiosks, and boarding gates.[3]\n\nup-to-date with the latest entry requirements at your destination.-—[4],Make your journey a breeze with Simple Trip!"}],"question":"What is suggested about the Simple Trip application?","bilingual":"Ứng dụng Simple Trip có đề xuất gì?","options":["An update for the app will be released soon.","It is focused on air travel.","It provides information only for major airports.","Travel experts developed it."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It is focused on air travel.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"application","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌæp.ləˈkeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"ứng dụng, sự áp dụng"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"requirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈkwaɪr.mənt/","meaning":"yêu cầu, cần thiết"},{"word":"destination","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌdes.təˈneɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"đích đến, điểm đến"}],"optionMeanings":["Bản cập nhật cho ứng dụng sẽ sớm được phát hành.","Nó tập trung vào du lịch hàng không.","Nó chỉ cung cấp thông tin cho các sân bay lớn.","Các chuyên gia du lịch đã phát triển nó."]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Travel with Confidence the Simple Trip Way! Does your travel plan include t","passageText":"Travel with Confidence the Simple Trip Way! Does your travel plan include taking one or more flights? Save time and avoid industry, the award-winning Simple Trip application allows Web check-in at the airport and keeps you up-to-date regarding local weather conditions and any changes to departure and arrival times.[1] Download Simple Trip from any app store onto your mobile phone.-[2]-. Simple information hidden from hackers. Once your documentation has been successfully loaded into the app, Simple Trip provides you with digital passes that can be scanned at security check points, check-in kiosks, and boarding gates.[3]\n\nup-to-date with the latest entry requirements at your destination.-—[4],Make your journey a breeze with Simple Trip!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Travel with Confidence the Simple Trip Way! Do