i","ipa":"/ˌæp.ləˈkeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"ứng dụng, sự áp dụng"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"requirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈkwaɪr.mənt/","meaning":"yêu cầu, cần thiết"},{"word":"destination","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌdes.təˈneɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"đích đến, điểm đến"}],"optionMeanings":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4] BAN ĐÍCH: TOP 1 TRUNG TÂM CƠ NHIỆU Học VIÊN SỰ HỮU CHUNG CHÍ QUỐC TẾ NHẬT VIỆT NAM - 2028 ZenlishTu tin di du lich - cung Simple Trip! Kế hoạch du lịch của ban co bao gom một hay nhieu chuyen baykhong? Tiết kiếm thời gian và trdnh su bát tiến bang cdch si dungSimple Trip. Dugc de xuat bdi cdc cong ty hang dau trong nganh dulich, ung dung Simple Trip tung dogt giai thuong nay cho phep Weblam thu tuc check-in tai san bay va cap nhat cho ban ve dieu kien thoitiet dja phuong cung nhu bat ky thay doi nao ve thoi gian khdi hanh vdden noi. - [1] -. Tai xuong Simple Trip tur bat ky cira hang ung dung nao tren dien thogidi dong cua ban. [2] No se hương dan ban qua cdc buoc de thiet lap vdcd nhan hoa tai khodn cua ban -. Simple Trip hoan toan bdo mat, baogom nhieu lop ma hoa de giu kin thong tin cd nhan cua ban khoi bidanh cap. Khi thông tin của bgn da đàoc tdi thanh công và ứng dung, Simple Trip cung cdp cho bản kỹ thuật số, co thể dugc que tai cacdiem kiem tra an ninh, quay lam thu tuc check-in và cong len may bay. - [3] -Bò qua quay bản về và làm thủ tục check-in cho chuyện bay cia bản"]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"Manuel Cabrera [9:18A.M.] Hello, Sara. Our client Mr. Forsyth is changing h","passageText":"Manuel Cabrera [9:18A.M.] Hello, Sara. Our client Mr. Forsyth is changing his mind about the color scheme for his kitchen. Can you send me the photos from the Maroney project we completed last autumn?\n\nSara Baird [9:20 A.M.] Sure. Do you want me to send just the kitchen pictures? Manuel Cabrera [9:21A.M.] Send those of the kitchen and living room, please. Sara Baird [9:22A.M.] They are on their way.I have also included pictures of the Thackers'' kitchen from a couple of years ago. We created a similar style for them. Manuel Cabrera [9:23A.M.] Good thinking. Thank you!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Manuel Cabrera [9:18A.M.] Hello, Sara. Our client Mr. Forsyth is changing his mind about the color scheme for his kitchen. Can you send me the photos from the Maroney project we completed last autumn?\n\nSara Baird [9:20 A.M.] Sure. Do you want me to send just the kitchen pictures? Manuel Cabrera [9:21A.M.] Send those of the kitchen and living room, please. Sara Baird [9:22A.M.] They are on their way.I have also included pictures of the Thackers'' kitchen from a couple of years ago. We created a similar style for them. Manuel Cabrera [9:23A.M.] Good thinking. Thank you!"}],"question":"In what type of business do the writers most likely work?","bilingual":"Các nhà văn thường làm việc trong loại hình kinh doanh nào?","options":["Interior decorating","Fine dining","Photography","Appliance sales"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Interior decorating\".","vocabList":[{"word":"appliance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈplaɪ.əns/","meaning":"thiết bị, dụng cụ"},{"word":"completed","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/kəmˈplitɪd/","meaning":"đã hoàn thành"},{"word":"business","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɪznɪs/","meaning":"công ty; doanh nghiệp; buôn bán; thương mại; vấn đề"},{"word":"interior","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈtɪriər/","meaning":"bên trong một tòa nhà; phần nội địa của một quốc gia"}],"optionMeanings":["Trang trí nội thất","Ăn ngon","Chụp ảnh","Bán thiết bị"]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Manuel Cabrera [9:18A.M.] Hello, Sara. Our client Mr. Forsyth is changing h","passageText":"Manuel Cabrera [9:18A.M.] Hello, Sara. Our client Mr. Forsyth is changing his mind about the color scheme for his kitchen. Can you send me the photos from the Maroney project we completed last autumn?\n\nSara Baird [9:20 A.M.] Sure. Do you want me to send just the kitchen pictures? Manuel Cabrera [9:21A.M.] Send those of the kitchen and living room, please. Sara Baird [9:22A.M.] They are on their way.I have also included pictures of the Thackers'' kitchen from a couple of years ago. We created a similar style for them. Manuel Cabrera [9:23A.M.] Good thinking. Thank you!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Manuel Cabrera [9:18A.M.] Hello, Sara. Our client Mr. Forsyth is changing his mind about the color scheme for his kitchen. Can you send me the photos from the Maroney project we completed last autumn?\n\nSara Baird [9:20 A.M.] Sure. Do you want me to send just the kitchen pictures? Manuel Cabrera [9:21A.M.] Send those of the kitchen and living room, please. Sara Baird [9:22A.M.] They are on their way.I have also included pictures of the Thackers'' kitchen from a couple of years ago. We created a similar style for them. Manuel Cabrera [9:23A.M.] Good thinking. Thank you!"}],"question":"At9:23A.M., what does Mr.Cabreramost likely mean when he writes,\"Good thinking\"?","bilingual":"Lúc 9:23 sáng, rất có thể ông Cabrera có ý gì khi viết \"Goodthinking\"?","options":["He expects that the additional pictures Ms.Baird sent will be helpful.","He is certain that the client will ike the new color scheme.","He is impressed with the work Ms.Baird did on the Maroney project.","Here members how much the Thackers liked their kitchen."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"He expects that the additional pictures Ms.Baird sent will be helpful.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"impressed","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪmˈprɛst/","meaning":"ấn tượng"},{"word":"completed","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/kəmˈplitɪd/","meaning":"đã hoàn thành"},{"word":"picture","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈpɪkʧər/","meaning":"chụp ảnh; vẽ; vẽ; để mô tả ; để miêu tả"}],"optionMeanings":["Anh ấy mong rằng những hình ảnh bổ sung mà cô Baird gửi sẽ hữu ích.","Anh ấy chắc chắn rằng khách hàng sẽ thích cách phối màu mới.","Anh ấy rất ấn tượng với công việc mà cô Baird đã làm trong dự án Maroney.","Anh ấy nhớ gia đình Thackers thích căn bếp của họ đến nhường nào. BAN ĐÍCH: Manuel Cabrera [9:18 sáng] Xin chao, Sara.Khdch hang cua chung ta, ong Forsyth dang thay doi suynghi ve cdch phoi mau cho can bep cua ong ay. Bạn có thể gui cho toinam ngodi không? Sara Baird [9:20 sáng] Chắc chắn rồi. Ban co muon toi chi guri nhung buc anh cua nha bep? Manuel Cabrera [9:21 sáng] Hãy gii cd nhung buc anh cua bep va phong khach. Sara Baird [9:22 sáng] về nhà gửi cia Thackers bạn đóng vai trước. Chung ta da tqo ra một thiết kế kết hợp tử cho hồ. Manuel Cabrera [9:23 sáng] Ý kiến hay ngày. Cố lên! TOP1TRUNGTAM CONHIEU HOCVIEN SOHUU CHUNGCHi QUOCTENHATVIỆT NAM-2O28 Zenlish"]},{"questionNum":"154","passageTitle":"Please Note The views expressed by the speakers shown in this documentary f","passageText":"Please Note The views expressed by the speakers shown in this documentary flm are their own and do not necessarily reflect the opinions of the filmmakers. The filmmakers'' goal was to present the topic from diverse points of view. The inclusion of the speakers filmmakers'' support for any organization that those speakers may represent.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Please Note The views expressed by the speakers shown in this documentary flm are their own and do not necessarily reflect the opinions of the filmmakers. The filmmakers'' goal was to present the topic from diverse points of view. The inclusion of the speakers filmmakers'' support for any organization that those speakers may represent."}],"question":"What is the purpose of the notice?","bilingual":"Mục đích của thông báo là gì?","options":["To generate enthusiasm for an upcoming film","To express support for a charitable organization","To apologize for some factual errors","To discourage assumptions about the filmmakers"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To discourage assumptions about the filmmakers\".","vocabList":[{"word":"organization","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,ɔ:gənai''zeiʃn/","meaning":"sự tổ chức, sự cấu tạo"},{"word":"apologize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɑː.lə.dʒaɪz/","meaning":"xin lỗi"},{"word":"represent","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌrep.rɪˈzent/","meaning":"miêu tả, hình dung"},{"word":"upcoming","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈʌpˌkʌm.ɪŋ/","meaning":"sắp xảy ra"}],"optionMeanings":["Để tạo hứng thú cho bộ phim sắp ra mắt","Để bày tỏ sự ủng hộ đối với một tổ chức từ thiện","Xin lỗi vì một số sai sót thực tế","Để ngăn cản những giả định về Nhà làm phim"]},{"questionNum":"155","passageTitle":"Please Note The views expressed by the speakers shown in this documentary f","passageText":"Please Note The views expressed by the speakers shown in this documentary flm are their own and do not necessarily reflect the opinions of the filmmakers. The filmmakers'' goal was to present the topic from diverse points of view. The inclusion of the speakers filmmakers'' support for any organization that those speakers may represent.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Please Note The views expressed by the speakers shown in this documentary flm are their own and do not necessarily reflect the opinions of the filmmakers. The filmmakers'' goal was to present the topic from diverse points of view. The inclusion of the speakers filmmakers'' support for any organization that those speakers may represent."}],"question":"What does the notice suggest about the speakers in the film?","bilingual":"Thông báo gợi ý điều gì về các diễn giả trong phim?","options":["They are members of the same organization.","They will participate in follow-up interviews.","They were all paid the same fee by the filmmakers.","They expressed different opinions about a topic."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"They expressed different opinions about a topic.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"organization","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,ɔ:gənai''zeiʃn/","meaning":"sự tổ chức, sự cấu tạo"},{"word":"participate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pɑrˈtɪsəˌpeɪt/","meaning":"được tham gia; tham gia vào"},{"word":"interviews","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɪntərvˌjuz/","meaning":"phỏng vấn"},{"word":"different","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈdɪfərənt/","meaning":"không giống nhau; bất thường; đặc biệt"}],"optionMeanings":["Họ là thành viên của cùng một tổ chức.","Họ sẽ tham gia vào các cuộc phỏng vấn tiếp theo.","Tất cả đều được các nhà làm phim trả mức phí như nhau.","Họ bày tỏ những quan điểm khác nhau về một chủ đề. BAN ĐÍCH: Xin lưu ýQuan diém cua cdc dien gid the hien trong bo phim tai lieu ndy la cua rieng hova no không nhất thiet phan anh quan diem cua cdc nha lam phim.Muc tieucua cdc nha lam phim la trinh bay chu de tu nhieu quan diem khdc nhau. Viecbao gom cdc dien gia trong phim khong phdi la xdc nhân quan diem cua ho, cung không phdi la su ung ho cua cdc nha lam phim doi vdi bat ky to chuc naoma nhung dien gid do co the dgi dien. TOP 1 TRUNG TÂM CƠ NHIỆU Học VIÊN SỰ HỮU CHUNG CHÍ QUỐC TẾ NHẬT VIỆT NAM - 2028 Zenlish"]},{"questionNum":"156","passageTitle":"Centre Touts New Adventure","passageText":"Centre Touts New Adventure\n\nTORONTO (28 May)The trustees of Toronto''s Earth and Space Centre announced the opening of an exciting new educational film. The two-hour immersive experience called Out of This World explains through live footage, interviews, and first-rate animation what the next outer-space missions might involve with respect to both vehicles and people. Out of This World will be presented on the Envelop system, which has been installed in the theatre and is now undergoing testing and fine-tuning. The system promises to delight the senses, not only through vivid visuals but also through superb, life like sound projected to the listeners from all sides. Single-ticket prices for adults and special rates for youngsters, families, and school groups will be announced soon. The anticipated public debut for the program me is 1 July.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Centre Touts New Adventure\n\nTORONTO (28 May)The trustees of Toronto''s Earth and Space Centre announced the opening of an exciting new educational film. The two-hour immersive experience called Out of This World explains through live footage, interviews, and first-rate animation what the next outer-space missions might involve with respect to both vehicles and people. Out of This World will be presented on the Envelop system, which has been installed in the theatre and is now undergoing testing and fine-tuning. The system promises to delight the senses, not only through vivid visuals but also through superb, life like sound projected to the listeners from all sides. Single-ticket prices for adults and special rates for youngsters, families, and school groups will be announced soon. The anticipated public debut for the program me is 1 July."}],"question":"What is indicated about Out of This World?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về Out of This World?","options":["It requires a tour guide.","It includesanimatedvideo.","It will run for only one month.","It is open only to school groups."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It includesanimatedvideo.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"educational","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɛʤəˈkeɪʃənəl/","meaning":"giáo dục"},{"word":"experience","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪr.i.əns/","meaning":"trải nghiệm, kinh nghiệm"},{"word":"interviews","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɪntərvˌjuz/","meaning":"phỏng vấn"},{"word":"anticipate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ænˈtɪs.ə.peɪt/","meaning":"phỏng đoán, dự đoán"}],"optionMeanings":["Cần có hướng dẫn viên du lịch.","Nó bao gồm video hoạt hình.","Nó sẽ chỉ diễn ra trong một tháng.","Nó chỉ dành cho các nhóm trường học."]},{"questionNum":"157","passageTitle":"Centre Touts New Adventure","passageText":"Centre Touts New Adventure\n\nTORONTO (28 May)The trustees of Toronto''s Earth and Space Centre announced the opening of an exciting new educational film. The two-hour immersive experience called Out of This World explains through live footage, interviews, and first-rate animation what the next outer-space missions might involve with respect to both vehicles and people. Out of This World will be presented on the Envelop system, which has been installed in the theatre and is now undergoing testing and fine-tuning. The system promises to delight the senses, not only through vivid visuals but also through superb, life like sound projected to the listeners from all sides. Single-ticket prices for adults and special rates for youngsters, families, and school groups will be announced soon. The anticipated public debut for the program me is 1 July.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Centre Touts New Adventure\n\nTORONTO (28 May)The tru