ion for too long, said have any specific dietary preferences or tour-company owner Ed Lopez. A former requirements.\n\nchef, Lopez also once worked as a journalist | Local officials are excited about the tour\n\nand wrote about cuisine for the Texas company''s move into the area.\n\nBeacon. | “We''re thrilled to have Yum and Walk\n\nYum and Walk Food Tours offers Food Toursadd us to their list of outings in nine other cities in Texas and destinations,\" said College Station Mayor brings visitors to restaurants, bakeries, and Maria Garcia. \"Their presence is sure to specialty stores to sample both sweet and have a positive impact on our area''s dining savory treats. Visitors walk through the city establishments.\"\n\nwith an experienced guide, who also shares | Tickets are $50 each. The ten-week\n\ninformation about each neighborhood''s touring season beginsonJuly2 and lasts history. Mr.Lopez himself will serve as the until September 3.Tours take place on tour guide in College Station, his home Sundays from1 PM.to 4 PM. before working in San Antonio and then returning to the area."}],"question":"What is true about Ms.Garcia?","bilingual":"Điều gì đúng về cô Garcia?","options":["She thinks the tours will be good for local businesses.","She owns the Spice Rub Stop.","She has participated in the food tour.","She is from San Antonio."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She thinks the tours will be good for local businesses.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"neighborhood","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈneɪbərˌhʊd/","meaning":"hàng xóm"},{"word":"participate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pɑrˈtɪsəˌpeɪt/","meaning":"được tham gia; tham gia vào"},{"word":"destination","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌdes.təˈneɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"đích đến, điểm đến"},{"word":"requirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈkwaɪr.mənt/","meaning":"yêu cầu, cần thiết"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô nghĩ các chuyến tham quan sẽ tốt cho các doanh nghiệp địa phương.","Cô ấy sở hữu Spice Rub Stop.","Cô ấy đã tham gia chuyến tham quan ẩm thực.","Cô ấy đến từ San Antonio. BAN ĐÍCH: Chuyện tham quan Yum và Walk Food \"Ngay từ đầu,muc tieu của tôi là giup moiBo sung họ mot diem den mdinguoi kham pha ra nhung mon an tuyet voi,\" ông Lopez chia se. TRẠM ĐẠI HỌC (Ngày 15 thdng 5)-Hành trinh dja phương bao gom ndm điểmVao ngày 2 tháng 6, chuyện tham quandung trong khodng thời gian ba giờ: Yum and Walk Food Tours se they CollegeGiuseppina''s Trattoria, Yucatan Plate, KeralaStation và sdch cdc diem den am Kebabs, Spice Rub Stop và Deliciousthuc tren toan tieu bang. Bánh rán. Khách hang có thế lên lịch trìnhEd Lopez, chu so huru cong ty du lich chocho chuyện du lich rieng tu neu ho co bat kybiet: \"College Station da dugc coi la motso thich hodc yeu cau cu the ndo ve chế do andiem den dm thực trong thời gian dai.\" Ưng. Tung là đầu bếp, Lopez cùng tung lâm nhdCac quan chuc dja phuong rat vui mung vebdo và viet ve dm thuc cho Texas Beacon. viec cong ty du lich chuyen vao khu vuc nay. Yum and Walk Food Tours cung cdp cdc \"Chung tôi rdt vui khi Yum and Walk Foodchuyen di chin thanh phokhdc TexasTours chúng chung tôi vào danh sdch cdc diemva dua du khdch den cdc nha hang, tiemden cua ho,\" Thi trường College Station Mariabdnh và cia hang dac sdn de nem thi cdGarcia cho biết. \"Su hien dien cua ho chacmon an vi ngot và vi man. Du khach di bochan se co tdc dong tich cuc den cdc co sd antrong thanh pho vdi một hương dan vienuong trong khu vuc cua chung toi.\" ngày kinh nghiệm, người cung chia se thôngGia về la $50. Chuyện tham quan kéo daitin ve lich sir cua tung khu vuc lan can. muoi tudn bat dau vao ngày 2 thdng 7 và keoOng Lopez se lam hương dan vien du lichdai den ngày 3 thdng 9. Các câu thamCollege Station, nhd cua anh dy truoc khiquan dien ra vao Chu nhat tu1 gio chieu. denlam viec San Antonio vad sau do trd lai 4 qiao chiêu. TOP1TRUNG TÂM CƠ NHIỆU Học Viện VIÊN SỰ HỮU CHUNG CHÍ QUỐC TẾ NHẬT VIỆT NAM - 2028 15 Zenlish (A) De tan dung kinh nghiem dan dat cach tham quan cua anh dy (B) De chia sé tình yêu âm thực của minh với moi nguoibuonyd pip bupy pyu opo ouo opo bupnb loy oo dpo buno gG (O) (D) Để làm việc gan nhà hơn"]},{"questionNum":"172","passageTitle":"To: | All employees","passageText":"To: | All employees\n\nFrom: | Janice Capaldi\n\nDate: | October 23\n\nSubject: | Guests\n\nGood afternoon, everyone,\n\nWe will soon host a group of employees from Seongnam Electronics.-[1]-.They will arrive on November io and be with us for a week to observe our research and production methods. We encourage everyone to interact with the visitors while they are here. - [2] —,\n\nThe executives in the group are leaders in the field of electronics development and manufacturing. Dr.Sung-Hye Kim leads Research and Development. Her individual contributions have focused on how magnetic fields influence the efficiency of components within electrical devices. She has also been called on by other physicists and professors to write and edit texts that explain electromagnetic phenomena. Dr.Kim''s work is influential throughout the international electronics industry. Also, Jin-Woong Lee, chief production officer at Seongnam Electronics, heads the team that designed the manufacturing processes at the plant near Seoul. [3] The award-winning techniques developed by Mr.Lee''s team assure both cost-effectiveness and quality.\n\nOn the afternoon of November 10,we will hold a reception in the conference room on the third floor to welcome our guests. Specifics will be sent to the entire staff in an e-mail from Stewart Lark, who is serving as the event''s coordinator,[4]-,Please plan on attending. Contact Mr. Lark and me with any questions you may have.\n\nThank you,\n\nJanice Capaldi, Director of Operations, Dolesley Electronics, Inc.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | 