rk, who is serving as the event''s coordinator,[4]-,Please plan on attending. Contact Mr. Lark and me with any questions you may have.\n\nThank you,\n\nJanice Capaldi, Director of Operations, Dolesley Electronics, Inc.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | All employees\n\nFrom: | Janice Capaldi\n\nDate: | October 23\n\nSubject: | Guests\n\nGood afternoon, everyone,\n\nWe will soon host a group of employees from Seongnam Electronics.-[1]-.They will arrive on November io and be with us for a week to observe our research and production methods. We encourage everyone to interact with the visitors while they are here. - [2] —,\n\nThe executives in the group are leaders in the field of electronics development and manufacturing. Dr.Sung-Hye Kim leads Research and Development. Her individual contributions have focused on how magnetic fields influence the efficiency of components within electrical devices. She has also been called on by other physicists and professors to write and edit texts that explain electromagnetic phenomena. Dr.Kim''s work is influential throughout the international electronics industry. Also, Jin-Woong Lee, chief production officer at Seongnam Electronics, heads the team that designed the manufacturing processes at the plant near Seoul. [3] The award-winning techniques developed by Mr.Lee''s team assure both cost-effectiveness and quality.\n\nOn the afternoon of November 10,we will hold a reception in the conference room on the third floor to welcome our guests. Specifics will be sent to the entire staff in an e-mail from Stewart Lark, who is serving as the event''s coordinator,[4]-,Please plan on attending. Contact Mr. Lark and me with any questions you may have.\n\nThank you,\n\nJanice Capaldi, Director of Operations, Dolesley Electronics, Inc."}],"question":"What is Mr.Lee responsible for?","bilingual":"Ông Lee chịu trách nhiệm về việc gì?","options":["Negotiating sales deals","Choosing marketing strategies","Establishing a product assembly process","Managing a human resources department"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Establishing a product assembly process\".","vocabList":[{"word":"manufacturing","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/¸mænju´fæktʃəriη/","meaning":"sự sản xuất; sự chế tạo; sự gia công"},{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"effectiveness","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈfek.tɪv.nəs/","meaning":"sự hiệu quả"},{"word":"responsible","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ri''spɔnsəbl/","meaning":"chịu trách nhiệm"}],"optionMeanings":["Đàm phán các giao dịch bán hàng","Lựa chọn chiến lược tiếp thị (c) Thiết lập quy trình lắp ráp sản phẩm (D) Quản lý bộ phận nhân sự","Một địa điểm","thời gian"]},{"questionNum":"174","passageTitle":"To: | All employees","passageText":"To: | All employees\n\nFrom: | Janice Capaldi\n\nDate: | October 23\n\nSubject: | Guests\n\nGood afternoon, everyone,\n\nWe will soon host a group of employees from Seongnam Electronics.-[1]-.They will arrive on November io and be with us for a week to observe our research and production methods. We encourage everyone to interact with the visitors while they are here. - [2] —,\n\nThe executives in the group are leaders in the field of electronics development and manufacturing. Dr.Sung-Hye Kim leads Research and Development. Her individual contributions have focused on how magnetic fields influence the efficiency of components within electrical devices. She has also been called on by other physicists and professors to write and edit texts that explain electromagnetic phenomena. Dr.Kim''s work is influential throughout the international electronics industry. Also, Jin-Woong Lee, chief production officer at Seongnam Electronics, heads the team that designed the manufacturing processes at the plant near Seoul. [3] The award-winning techniques developed by Mr.Lee''s team assure both cost-effectiveness and quality.\n\nOn the afternoon of November 10,we will hold a reception in the conference room on the third floor to welcome our guests. Specifics will be sent to the entire staff in an e-mail from Stewart Lark, who is serving as the event''s coordinator,[4]-,Please plan on attending. Contact Mr. Lark and me with any questions you may have.\n\nThank you,\n\nJanice Capaldi, Director of Operations, Dolesley Electronics, Inc.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | All employees\n\nFrom: | Janice Capaldi\n\nDate: | October 23\n\nSubject: | Guests\n\nGood afternoon, everyone,\n\nWe will soon host a group of employees from Seongnam Electronics.-[1]-.They will arrive on November io and be with us for a week to observe our research and production methods. We encourage everyone to interact with the visitors while they are here. - [2] —,\n\nThe executives in the group are leaders in the field of electronics development and manufacturing. Dr.Sung-Hye Kim leads Research and Development. Her individual contributions have focused on how magnetic fields influence the efficiency of components within electrical devices. She has also been called on by other physicists and professors to write and edit texts that explain electromagnetic phenomena. Dr.Kim''s work is influential throughout the international electronics industry. Also, Jin-Woong Lee, chief production officer at Seongnam Electronics, heads the team that designed the manufacturing processes at the plant near Seoul. [3] The award-winning techniques developed by Mr.Lee''s team assure both cost-effectiveness and quality.\n\nOn the afternoon of November 10,we will hold a reception in the conference room on the third floor to welcome our guests. Specifics will be sent to the entire staff in an e-mail from Stewart Lark, who is serving as the event''s coordinator,[4]-,Please plan on attending. Contact Mr. Lark and me with any questions you may have.\n\nThank you,\n\nJanice Capaldi, Director of Operations, Dolesley Electronics, Inc."}],"question":"What new information about the reception will Mr. Lark most likely include in his e-mail?","bilingual":"Thông tin mới nào về buổi tiếp tân rất có thể sẽ được ông Lark đưa vào e-mail của mình?","options":["A purpose","The date","Alocation","The time"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"The time\".","vocabList":[{"word":"manufacturing","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/¸mænju´fæktʃəriη/","meaning":"sự sản xuất; sự chế tạo; sự gia công"},{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"effectiveness","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈfek.tɪv.nəs/","meaning":"sự hiệu quả"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"}],"optionMeanings":["Một mục đích","Ngày","Một địa điểm","Thời gian"]},{"questionNum":"175","passageTitle":"To: | All employees","passageText":"To: | All employees\n\nFrom: | Janice Capaldi\n\nDate: | October 23\n\nSubject: | Guests\n\nGood afternoon, everyone,\n\nWe will soon host a group of employees from Seongnam Electronics.-[1]-.They will arrive on November io and be with us for a week to observe our research and production methods. We encourage everyone to interact with the visitors while they are here. - [2] —,\n\nThe executives in the group are leaders in the field of electronics development and manufacturing. Dr.Sung-Hye Kim leads Research and Development. Her individual contributions have focused on how magnetic fields influence the efficiency of components within electrical devices. She has also been called on by other physicists and professors to write and edit texts that explain electromagnetic phenomena. Dr.Kim''s work is influential throughout the international electronics industry. Also, Jin-Woong Lee, chief production officer at Seongnam Electronics, heads the team that designed the manufacturing processes at the plant near Seoul. [3] The award-winning techniques developed by Mr.Lee''s team assure both cost-effectiveness and quality.\n\nOn the afternoon of November 10,we will hold a reception in the conference room on the third floor to welcome our guests. Specifics will be sent to the entire staff in an e-mail from Stewart Lark, who is serving as the event''s coordinator,[4]-,Please plan on attending. Contact Mr. Lark and me with any questions you may have.\n\nThank you,\n\nJanice Capaldi, Director of Operations, Dolesley Electronics, Inc.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | All employees\n\nFrom: | Janice Capaldi\n\nDate: | October 23\n\nSubject: | Guests\n\nGood afternoon, everyone,\n\nWe will soon host a group of employees from Seongnam Electronics.-[1]-.They will arrive on November io and be with us for a week to observe our research and production methods. We encourage everyone to interact with the visitors while they are here. - [2] —,\n\nThe executives in the group are leaders in the field of electronics development and manufacturing. Dr.Sung-Hye Kim leads Research and Development. Her individual contributions have focused on how magnetic fields influence the efficiency of components within electrical devices. She has also been called on by other physicists and professors to write and edit texts that explain electromagnetic phenomena. Dr.Kim''s work is influential throughout the international electronics industry. Also, Jin-Woong Lee, chief production officer at Seongnam Electronics, heads the team that designed the manufacturing processes at the plant near Seoul. [3] The award-winning techniques developed by Mr.Lee''s team assure both cost-effectiveness and quality.\n\nOn the afternoon of November 10,we will hold a reception in the conference room on the third floor to welcome our guests. Specifics will be sent to the entire staff in an e-mail from Stewart Lark, who is serving as the event''s coordinator,[4]-,Please plan on attending. Contact Mr. Lark and me with any questions you may have.\n\nThank you,\n\nJanice Capaldi, Director of Operations, Dolesley Electronics, Inc."}],"question":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3], and [4] does the following sentence best belong? \"Please share your work processes with them and answer any of their questions.\"","bilingual":"Câu được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4] dưới đây thuộc về vị trí nào?","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"[2]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"manufacturing","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/¸mænju´fæktʃəriη/","meaning":"sự sản xuất; sự chế tạo; sự gia công"},{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"effectiveness","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈfek.tɪv.nəs/","meaning":"sự hiệu quả"},{"word":"electronics","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪˌlɛkˈtrɑnɪks/","meaning":"Điện tử"}],"optionMeanings":["[1]","[2]","[3] TOP1TRUNG TÂM CƠ NHIỆU Học Viện VIÊN SỰ HỮU CHUNG CHÍ QUỐC TẾ NHẬT VIỆT NAM - 2028 17 Zenlish","[4] BAN ĐÍCH: Tất cả cdnhanvienTU: Janice CapaldiNgay: 23 thd 10 Chu Đức: Các vì khdchChao buoi chieu, moi người, Chung ta sé som tiep don mot nhom nhan vien tuSeongnamElectronics. - [1] -. Ho se den vdo ngady 10 thdng 11 vd cung chung toitrong một tudn de quan sdt cdc phuong phdp nghien curu và sdn xudtcua chung ta. Tôi khuyên khich mới người tưởng tác với khdch khi ngày hôm nay. [2] Hay chia sé quy trinh lam viec cua ban voi ho va trd loi bat kycau hoi ndo cua ho. Các gidm doc dieu hanh trong nhom la nhung nguoi di dau trong linhvuc phdt trien vd sdn xudt dien ti. Tien si Sung-Hye Kim lanh dgo bophan Nghiên cứu và Phdt trien. Nhung dong gop cd nhan cua co taptrung vao cdch tu truong anh huong den hieu qud cua cdc bo phanben trong thiet bi dien. Co cung da dugc cdc nha vật lý và gido su khackeu goi việt và chính sura cdc văn bản giai thich cdc hien tuong dien tu. Công viec của tiến sĩ Kim cơ anh hương khap nganh công nghiệp dientir quốc tế. Ngodi ra, Jin-Woong Lee, gidm doc sdn xudt cuaSeongnam Electronics, dung ddu nhom thiet ke cdc quy trinh sdn xudttai mot nha mdy gan Seoul. - [3] -. Các kỹ thuật thuật chót gidi thương dugcphdt trien bdi doingu cua ong Lee dam bdo cd ve hieu qud ve chi phiva chat lugng. Và chieu ngady 10 thdng 11, chung ta se to chuc tiec chieu dai taiphong hoi nghi tang ba de chao don cdc vi khdch quy. Thông tin cuthe se dugc guri den toan bo nhan vien qua e-mail tur Stewart Lark, nguoi dang giu vai tro dieu phoi vien cua su kien. - [4] -. Hay len ke'' hoch tham du. Liên hệ ông Lark và tôi neu ban co bat ky cau hoi ndo."]},{"questionNum":"176","passageTitle":"*E-mail*","passageText":"*E-mail*\n\nFrom: | efeehan@rossfieldhotels.ie:OL | customerservice@parleganispublishing.com Date: | 15 December\n\nSent: | Course books\n\nDear Customer Service Representative: In October my company ordered 60 paper back copies of the Food Safety Course Book for our employees so they could study for their mandatory food safety certification.I just learned from one of our managers that you offer this course book in languages other than English. May I send back twenty of the English language versions and get ten Polish and ten Portuguese books instead? Some of our new employees said they would really appreciate being able to read the crucial information in their first language. The books I wish to return are still in their original packaging. I can have them boxed and shipped quickly, but Iwill wait for your acknowledgement and instructions regarding paperwork. Sincerely, Ella Feehan Food Services Director Rossfield Hotels Ltd.\n\nParleganis Publishing\n\nReturns and Exchanges Policy We accept products under the following conditions. Unmarked, unused materials may be returned or exchanged within 90 days of purchase. •Items returned or exchanged more than 30 days after purchase are subject to a restocking fee equal t020%of the cover price. Paper back books come in plastic-wrapped bundles of ten. Unopened bundles may be returned for full credit. Individual paper back books will receive partial credit. Software products and subscription fees are not refundable. No credit will be issued for damaged or out-of-print books.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"*E-mail*\n\nFrom: | efeehan@rossfieldhotels.ie:OL | customerservice@parleganispublishing.com Date: | 15 December\n\nSent: | Course books\n\nDear Customer Service Representative: In October my company ordered 60 paper back copies of the Food Safety Course Book for our employees so they could study for their mandatory food safety certification.I just learned from one of our managers that you offer this course book in languages other than English. May I send back twenty of the English language versions and get ten Polish and ten Portuguese books instead? Some of our new employees said they would really appreciate being able to read the crucial information in their first language. The books I wish to return are still in their original packaging. I can have them boxed and shipped quickly, but Iwill wait for your acknowledgement and instructions regarding paperwork. Sincerely, Ella Feehan Food Services Director Rossfield Hotels Ltd.\n\nParleganis Publishing\n\nReturns and Exchanges Policy We accept products under the following conditions. Unmarked, unused materials may be returned or exchanged within 90 days of purchase. •Items returned or exchanged more than 30 days after purchase are subject to a restocking fee equal t020%of the cover price. Paper back books come in plastic-wrapped bundles of ten. Unopened bundles may be returned for full credit. Individual paper back books will receive partial credit. Software products and subscription fees are not refundable. No credit will be issued for damaged or out-of-print books."}],"question":"Why did Ms.Feehanwriteto Parleganis Publishing?","bilingual":"Tại sao bà Feehan lại viết thư cho Nhà xuất bản Parleganis?","options":["She offered feedback on a publication.","She would like to exchange some training materials.","She received an incorrect shipment.","She needs to return some damaged books."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"She would like to exchange some training materials.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"representative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,repri''zentətiv/","meaning":"miêu tả, biểu hiện"},{"word":"subscription","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səbˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đăng ký"},{"word":"publication","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌpəblɪˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"quy trình sản xuất và phát hành ấn phẩm;"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô ấy đưa ra phản hồi về một ấn phẩm.","Cô ấy muốn trao đổi một số tài liệu đào tạo.","Cô ấy đã nhận được một lô hàng không chính xác.","Cô ấy cần trả lại một số cuốn sách bị hư hỏng."]},{"questionNum":"177","passageTitle":"*E-mail*","passageText":"*E-mail*\n\nFrom: | efeehan@rossfieldhotels.ie:OL | customerservice@parleganispublishing.com Date: | 15 December\n\nSent: | Course books\n\nDear Customer Service Representative: In October my company ordered 60 paper back copies of the Food Safety Course Book for our employees so they could study for their mandatory food safety certification.I just learned from one of our managers that you offer this course book in language