f-print books.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"*E-mail*\n\nFrom: | efeehan@rossfieldhotels.ie:OL | customerservice@parleganispublishing.com Date: | 15 December\n\nSent: | Course books\n\nDear Customer Service Representative: In October my company ordered 60 paper back copies of the Food Safety Course Book for our employees so they could study for their mandatory food safety certification.I just learned from one of our managers that you offer this course book in languages other than English. May I send back twenty of the English language versions and get ten Polish and ten Portuguese books instead? Some of our new employees said they would really appreciate being able to read the crucial information in their first language. The books I wish to return are still in their original packaging. I can have them boxed and shipped quickly, but Iwill wait for your acknowledgement and instructions regarding paperwork. Sincerely, Ella Feehan Food Services Director Rossfield Hotels Ltd.\n\nParleganis Publishing\n\nReturns and Exchanges Policy We accept products under the following conditions. Unmarked, unused materials may be returned or exchanged within 90 days of purchase. •Items returned or exchanged more than 30 days after purchase are subject to a restocking fee equal t020%of the cover price. Paper back books come in plastic-wrapped bundles of ten. Unopened bundles may be returned for full credit. Individual paper back books will receive partial credit. Software products and subscription fees are not refundable. No credit will be issued for damaged or out-of-print books."}],"question":"What is stated about the Food Safety Course Book?","bilingual":"Sách Khóa học An toàn Thực phẩm có nội dung gì?","options":["It is available in electronic format.","It was published in October.","It will soon be out of print.","It is sold in packs of ten."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It is sold in packs of ten.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"representative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,repri''zentətiv/","meaning":"miêu tả, biểu hiện"},{"word":"subscription","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səbˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đăng ký"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó có sẵn ở dạng điện tử.","Nó được xuất bản vào tháng 10.","Nó sẽ sớm hết bản in.","Nó được bán với số lượng nhỏ tenBAN *Thư điện tử* Tú: efeehan@rossfieldhotels.iecustomerservice@parleganispublishing.comNgay: 15 thd 12 Vâng: Sdch gido khoaGuri đại dich vu khach hang: TOP 1 TRUVao thdng 10, công ty cua tôi da đất mua 60 cuốn Sdch gido khoa 20 An todn thuc pham bia mem cho nhanviendeho co the hocvd coZenlishNHA XUAT BAN PARLEGANISChinh sdch hoan trd và trao doiChung toi chap nhan sdn phdm theo cdc dieu kien sáu day. Các tài liệu không được danh ddu, chua sư dung có thédugc trd lai hoac trao đổi trong vòng 90 ngày kế bạn ngaymua. Các mặt hàng dược trd lai hoac trao doi sáu hon 30 ngayke tu ngay mua phdi chiu phi hoan kho bang 20% ​​gid bia. Sách bia mem dược đồng thanh tung tập muối cuốn dượcboc nhua. Các tập chua mo co thể dược trà lai với ngày dugid tiến. Sách bia mem ca nhân sé nhân dược một phần gidtién. San pham phan mem va phi dang kỷ khong duoc hoan lai. Sé khong co khoan chi phi nao duoc cap cho nhung cuoncrhhihirhanahnarkhanararanhanin"]},{"questionNum":"181","passageTitle":"Review:Pizza in Bobbingworth | Submitted by:Gerard Landis","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nReview:Pizza in Bobbingworth | Submitted by:Gerard Landis\n\n★★★★★ There is a new pizza restaurant in town called Maple Pizza House. Not to my surprise, it offers a number of signature pizzas withmapleflavoring, including dessert pizzas. While I personally did not like the maple-flavored pizza at all, the rest of my party enjoyed a large maple-hampizza as a main course. The others in my group also devoured the maple-walnutdessertpizza, which, to me, tasted like an overly sweet, sticky pie. Fortunately for me, the menu includes some pizzas that do not have maple flavoring. Iordered a traditional cheese pizza. It was served piping hot and was delicious. Because there were tasty menu options that pleased everyone, I rate the Maple Pizza House4stars outof5,and I would recommend visiting.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nMaple Pizza House 83FoxLane, Bobbingworth, CM29B 07750140314 We now accept credit cards.\n\nSignature Maple Pizzas (with red sauce) | Personal | Large\n\nChicken maple | 4.5 | f15\n\nMapleham | f17\n\nPineapple | F4 | f14\n\nTraditional Pizzas (select red or white sauce)\n\nCheese | f13\n\nVegetable | f13\n\nMeatball | f13\n\nDessert Pizzas (with brown butter sauce)\n\nCinnamon maple | f11\n\nMaplewalnut | f11\n\nALLBEVERAGES:F2","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Review:Pizza in Bobbingworth | Submitted by:Gerard Landis\n\n★★★★★ There is a new pizza restaurant in town called Maple Pizza House. Not to my surprise, it offers a number of signature pizzas withmapleflavoring, including dessert pizzas. While I personally did not like the maple-flavored pizza at all, the rest of my party enjoyed a large maple-hampizza as a main course. The others in my group also devoured the maple-walnutdessertpizza, which, to me, tasted like an overly sweet, sticky pie. Fortunately for me, the menu includes some pizzas that do not have maple flavoring. Iordered a traditional cheese pizza. It was served piping hot and was delicious. Because there were tasty menu options that pleased everyone, I rate the Maple Pizza House4stars outof5,and I would recommend visiting."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Maple Pizza House 83FoxLane, Bobbingworth, CM29B 07750140314 We now 