rth | Submitted by:Gerard Landis\n\n★★★★★ There is a new pizza restaurant in town called Maple Pizza House. Not to my surprise, it offers a number of signature pizzas withmapleflavoring, including dessert pizzas. While I personally did not like the maple-flavored pizza at all, the rest of my party enjoyed a large maple-hampizza as a main course. The others in my group also devoured the maple-walnutdessertpizza, which, to me, tasted like an overly sweet, sticky pie. Fortunately for me, the menu includes some pizzas that do not have maple flavoring. Iordered a traditional cheese pizza. It was served piping hot and was delicious. Because there were tasty menu options that pleased everyone, I rate the Maple Pizza House4stars outof5,and I would recommend visiting."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Maple Pizza House 83FoxLane, Bobbingworth, CM29B 07750140314 We now accept credit cards.\n\nSignature Maple Pizzas (with red sauce) | Personal | Large\n\nChicken maple | 4.5 | f15\n\nMapleham | f17\n\nPineapple | F4 | f14\n\nTraditional Pizzas (select red or white sauce)\n\nCheese | f13\n\nVegetable | f13\n\nMeatball | f13\n\nDessert Pizzas (with brown butter sauce)\n\nCinnamon maple | f11\n\nMaplewalnut | f11\n\nALLBEVERAGES:F2"}],"question":"What is suggested about the restaurant?","bilingual":"Điều gì được gợi ý về nhà hàng?","options":["It prepares dessert pizza in only one size.","It accepts payments in cash only.","It makes home deliveries.","It has moved to a larger location."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It prepares dessert pizza in only one size.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"restaurant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnt/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"including","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈkludɪŋ/","meaning":"bao gồm; chứa đựng; ôm ấp"},{"word":"delicious","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/dɪˈlɪʃəs/","meaning":"ngon; có một hương vị dễ chịu hoặc mùi"},{"word":"recommend","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rekə''mend/","meaning":"giới thiệu, tiến cử (người, vật...)"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó chuẩn bị bánh pizza tráng miệng chỉ với một kích cỡ.","Nó chỉ chấp nhận thanh toán bằng tiền mặt.","Nó thực hiện giao hàng tận nhà.","Nó đã được chuyển đến một vị trí lớn hơn. BAN ĐÍCH: Danh gid: Pizzaé BobbingworthThuc hien boi: Gerard Landis ★★★★☆ Cô một nhà hang pizza mdi trong thi trdn ten la Maple Pizza House. Toivi la phong,bao gom cd pizza trdng mieng.Mac du ca nhân tôi khongcon lai trong bura tiec cua tôi lai thương thực một chiếc bánh pizza chdbong - la phong lon nhu một món chính. Nhung người khắc trong nhomcia tôi cung ngdu nghien mon bdnh pizza trdng mieng bang qud oc cho, ma doi vdi toi, no co vi nhu mot chiec bdnh qud ngot va dinh. May man cho tôi, thực đơn có một số loại loai pizza khong co hương vi ldphong. Tôi da goi một chiếc bdnh pizza phở mai truyền thông. Không dugcphuc vu nong hoi va rat ngon. tat cd moi người, tôi đnh gid Maple Pizza House 4 trên 5 sao vd toikhuyen ban nên ghe tham nha hang nay. Nhà Pizza Maple 83 Fox Lane, Bobbingworth, CM2 9BChung tôi chap nhân thanh todn bang the tin dung. NhiSignature Maple Pizzas (vdi sot do) LonLa phong gd 4,5 15 La phong cha bong 17 Qud duaf4 14 Pizza truyen thong (chon sot do hogc trang) Phở maiF4 13 Rau ci qudF4 13 Thị vienf4 13 181 Pizza trdng mieng (sot bò nau) (A) Lá phong que 11 (B) Cây oc cho 11 TÁC ĐỖ UONG: 2 TOP 1 TRUNG TÂM CƠ NHIỆU Học VIÊN SỰ HỮU CHUNG CHÍ QUỐC TẾ NHẬT VIỆT NAM - 2028 24 Zenlish (C) Nhung chiéc bdnh pizza trdng mieng qud dat. (D) Anh ay không quan tâm đến hương vị của nhung chiéc pizza đặc trung."]},{"questionNum":"186","passageTitle":"https://www.northamcarparts.co.uk/home Home | Catalogue | Contact Form | Ab","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nhttps://www.northamcarparts.co.uk/home Home | Catalogue | Contact Form | About Us\n\nWe Have the Parts You Need\n\nNortham Car Parts is a leading seller of rare and hard-to-find car parts. We have a huge selection of car transmissions, body and frame parts, and steering-repair kits, just to name a few. Check out our online catalogue page for a detailed list of parts currently available in our warehouse. We specialise in vintage European cars, but we have plenty of parts for American-made and Japanese-made vehicles. If you do not see what you need in our catalogue, please fill out a contact form-we can help you find the part you need! Please note that our response time is now two to four business days because of a rise in the number of requests we receive.\n\nParts can be delivered to any address within the United Kingdom, France, Belgium, or Spain.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nNortham Car Parts Contact Form\n\nContact Information | Vehicle Information\n\nName: Gerald Aldegunde | Manufacturer: Exceller\n\nE-mail: carmanga55@saffronmail.de Model: | Dragonfire\n\nPhone: +52(164)5559183 | Year: | 1988\n\nAddress: Kanalstrasse60 | Transmission: Manual\n\n01067Dresden, Germany\n\nDate: 6 August | Drive: | 2WD\n\nMessage: I''ve been looking for a part for a transmission ina 1988 Exceller Dragonfire I purchased last year. Ihave been unable to find this part, so afriend who found a new steering wheel through your company recommended that I contact you. I was wondering how much you would charge for locating a vintage British car part like this. Also,! noticed that Germany is not listed on your Web site as a shipping destination. Do you ever ship to areas other than the countries that are currently listed there? Thanks for your help!Working on this car has been a great experience, but I''m eager to get this thing on the road!\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Gerald Aldegunde <carmanga55@saffronmail.de> From: | Bethany Turnhout <bturnhout@northamcarparts.co.uk> Date: | 28 August\n\nSubject: | Shipping notification\n\nDear Mr. Aldegunde:\n\nYour item will arrive on 30 August, no later than 8:00 P.M., at the following address: Kanalstrasse 60, 01067 Dresden, Germany. It will be arriving via the IHE insured delivery service, so you or a designated representative must be present to accept and sign for the package. IHE will contact you in advance of the driver''s arrival. Please make sure that the path from the street to your door is clear of obstructions so the driver can have free access. Thank you for choosing Northam Car Parts to help find your part!\n\nBethany Turnhout Sales Representative, Northam Car Parts","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"https://www.northamcarparts.co.uk/home Home | Catalogue | Contact Form | About Us\n\nWe Have the Parts You Need\n\nNortham Car Parts is a leading seller of rare and hard-to-find car parts. We have a huge selection of car transmissions, body and frame parts, and steering-repair kits, just to name a few. Check out our online catalogue page for a detailed list of parts currently available in our warehouse. We specialise in vintage European cars, but we have plenty of parts for American-made and Japanese-made vehicles. If you do not see what you need in our catalogue, please fill out a contact form-we can help you find the part you need! Please note that our response time is now two to four business days because of a rise in the number of requests we receive.\n\nParts can be delivered to any address within the United Kingdom, France, Belgium, or Spain."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Northam Car Parts Contact Form\n\nContact Information | Vehicle Information\n\nName: Gerald Aldegunde | Manufacturer: Exceller\n\nE-mail: carmanga55@saffronmail.de Model: | Dragonfire\n\nPhone: +52(164)5559183 | Year: | 1988\n\nAddress: Kanalstrasse60 | Transmission: Manual\n\n01067Dresden, Germany\n\nDate: 6 August | Drive: | 2WD\n\nMessage: I''ve been looking for a part for a transmission ina 1988 Exceller Dragonfire I purchased last year. Ihave been unable to find this part, so afriend who found a new steering wheel through your company recommended that I contact you. I was wondering how much you would charge for locating a vintage British car part like this. Also,! noticed that Germany is not listed on your Web site as a shipping destination. Do you ever ship to areas other than the countries that are currently listed there? Thanks for your help!Working on this car has been a great experience, but I''m eager to get this thing on the road!"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Gerald Aldegunde <carmanga55@saffronmail.de> From: | Bethany Turnhout <bturnhout@northamcarparts.co.uk> Date: | 28 August\n\nSubject: | Shipping notification\n\nDear Mr. Aldegunde:\n\nYour item will arrive on 30 August, no later than 8:00 P.M., at the following address: Kanalstrasse 60, 01067 Dresden, Germany. It will be arriving via the IHE insured delivery service, so you or a designated representative must be present to accept and sign for the package. IHE will contact you in advance of the driver''s arrival. Please make sure that the path from the street to your door is clear of obstructions so the driver can have free access. Thank you for choosing Northam Car Parts to help find your part!\n\nBethany Turnhout Sales Representative, Northam Car Parts"}],"question":"According to the Webpage, what has changed recently at Northam Car Parts?","bilingual":"Theo trang Web, điều gì đã thay đổi gần đây tại Northam CarParts?","options":["The hours of operation","The number of customer inquiries","The amount of warehouse space","The availability of Japanese car parts"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"The number of customer inquiries\".","vocabList":[{"word":"representative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,repri''zentətiv/","meaning":"miêu tả, biểu hiện"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"destination","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌdes.təˈneɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"đích đến, điểm đến"},{"word":"experience","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪr.i.əns/","meaning":"trải nghiệm, kinh nghiệm"}],"optionMeanings":["Giờ hoạt động","Số lượng thắc mắc của khách hàng","Diện tích kho hàng","Sự sẵn có của phụ tùng ô tô Nhật Bản"]},{"questionNum":"187","passageTitle":"https://www.northamcarparts.co.uk/home Home | Catalogue | Contact Form | Ab","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nhttps://www.northamcarparts.co.uk/home Home | Catalogue | Contact Form | About Us\n\nWe Have the Parts You Need\n\nNortham Car Parts is a leading seller of rare and hard-to-find car parts. We have a huge selection of car transmissions, body and frame parts, and steering-repair kits, just to name a few. Check out our online catalogue page for a detailed list of parts currently available in our warehouse. We specialise in vintage European cars, but we have plenty of parts for American-made and Japanese-made vehicles. If you do not see what you need in our catalogue, please fill out a contact form-we can help you find the part you need! Please note that our response time is now two to four business days because of a rise in the number of requests we receive.\n\nParts can be delivered to any address within the United Kingdom, France, Belgium, or Spain.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nNortham Car Parts Contact Form\n\nContact Information | Vehicle Information\n\nName: Gerald Aldegunde | Manufacturer: Exceller\n\nE-mail: carmanga55@saffronmail.de Model: | Dragonfire\n\nPhone: +52(164)5559183 | Year: | 1988\n\nAddress: Kanalstrasse60 | Transmission: Manual\n\n01067Dresden, Germany\n\nDate: 6 August | Drive: | 2WD\n\nMessage: I''ve been looking for a part for a transmission ina 1988 Exceller Dragonfire I purchased last year. Ihave been unable to find this part, so afriend who found a new steering wheel through your company recommended that I contact you. I was wondering how much you would charge for locating a vintage British car part like this. Also,! noticed that Germany is not listed on your Web site as a shipping destination. Do you ever ship to areas other than the countries that are currently listed there? Thanks for your help!Working on this car has been a great experience, but I''m eager to get this thing on the road!\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nTo: | Gerald Aldegunde <carmanga55@saffronmail.de> From: | Bethany Turnhout <bturnhout@northamcarparts.co.uk> Date: | 28 August\n\nSubject: | Shipping notification\n\nDear Mr. Aldegunde:\n\nYour item will arrive on 30 August, no later than 8:00 P.M., at the following address: Kanalstrasse 60, 01067 Dresden, Germany. It will be arriving via the IHE insured delivery service, so you or a designated representative must be present to accept and sign for the package. IHE will contact you in advance of the driver''s arrival. Please make sure that the path from the street to your door is clear of obstructions so the driver can have free access. Thank you for choosing Northam Car Parts to help find your part!\n\nBethany Turnhout Sales Representative, Northam Car Parts","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"https://www.northamcarparts.co.uk/home Home | Catalogue | Contact Form | About Us\n\nWe Have the Parts You Need\n\nNortham Car Parts is a leading seller of rare and hard-to-find car parts. We have a huge selection of car transmissions, body and frame parts, and steering-repair kits, just to name a few. Check out our online catalogue page for a detailed list of parts currently available in our warehouse. We specialise in vintage European cars, but we have plenty of parts for American-made and Japanese-made vehicles. If you do not see what you need in our catalogue, please fill out a contact form-we can help you find the part you need! Please note that our response time is now two to four business days because of a rise in the number of requests we receive.\n\nParts can be delivered to any add