of requests we receive.\n\nParts can be delivered to any address within the United Kingdom, France, Belgium, or Spain."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Northam Car Parts Contact Form\n\nContact Information | Vehicle Information\n\nName: Gerald Aldegunde | Manufacturer: Exceller\n\nE-mail: carmanga55@saffronmail.de Model: | Dragonfire\n\nPhone: +52(164)5559183 | Year: | 1988\n\nAddress: Kanalstrasse60 | Transmission: Manual\n\n01067Dresden, Germany\n\nDate: 6 August | Drive: | 2WD\n\nMessage: I''ve been looking for a part for a transmission ina 1988 Exceller Dragonfire I purchased last year. Ihave been unable to find this part, so afriend who found a new steering wheel through your company recommended that I contact you. I was wondering how much you would charge for locating a vintage British car part like this. Also,! noticed that Germany is not listed on your Web site as a shipping destination. Do you ever ship to areas other than the countries that are currently listed there? Thanks for your help!Working on this car has been a great experience, but I''m eager to get this thing on the road!"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"To: | Gerald Aldegunde <carmanga55@saffronmail.de> From: | Bethany Turnhout <bturnhout@northamcarparts.co.uk> Date: | 28 August\n\nSubject: | Shipping notification\n\nDear Mr. Aldegunde:\n\nYour item will arrive on 30 August, no later than 8:00 P.M., at the following address: Kanalstrasse 60, 01067 Dresden, Germany. It will be arriving via the IHE insured delivery service, so you or a designated representative must be present to accept and sign for the package. IHE will contact you in advance of the driver''s arrival. Please make sure that the path from the street to your door is clear of obstructions so the driver can have free access. Thank you for choosing Northam Car Parts to help find your part!\n\nBethany Turnhout Sales Representative, Northam Car Parts"}],"question":"What can be concluded about Northam Car Parts?","bilingual":"Có thể kết luận gì về Phụ tùng ô tô Northam?","options":["It was recently purchased by Ms.Turnhout.","It maintains warehouses in several countries.","It ships to countries that are not listed on its Web page.","It does not respond to customer inquiries after 8:00p.M."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It ships to countries that are not listed on its Web page.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"representative","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,repri''zentətiv/","meaning":"miêu tả, biểu hiện"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"destination","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌdes.təˈneɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"đích đến, điểm đến"},{"word":"experience","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪr.i.əns/","meaning":"trải nghiệm, kinh nghiệm"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó đã được bà Turnhout mua gần đây.","Nó có kho hàng ở một số quốc gia. (c) Nó vận chuyển đến các quốc gia không được liệt kê trên trang Web của nó. (D) Nó không trả lời các câu hỏi của khách hàng sau 8 giờ tối. BAN ĐÍCH: https://www.northamcarparts.co.uk/homeDanh mụcBiểu mẫu liên heTrang chuVe chung toiChung tôi có cdc bo phan bgn canTOP 1 T 27 Northam Car Parts la nha cung cdp hang dau ve nhung phu tung xe hoiZenlishGerald Aldegunde <carmanga55@saffronmail.de> Tú: Bethany Turnhout <bturnhout@northamcarparts.co.uk> Ngay: 28 thd 8 Chu Đức: Thông bdoviecvan chuyenGiri ong Aldegunde: Mắt hàng của bản se đến vào ngày 30 thdng 8, không muon hon 8:00 tôi, tai dja chi sáu: Kanalstrasse 60, 01067 Dresden, Đức. Goi hang se đàoc giriTOF 28 se lien he voi ban truoc khi tai xe den. Vui long dam bdo rang loi di tuZenlish","Điền tích nha kho","Su san co cua phu tung xe hoi Nhật Bản"]},{"questionNum":"191","passageTitle":"RHC Continues to Impress","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nRHC Continues to Impress\n\nFORIMMEDIATERELEASE | minister of Housing and Urban\n\nContact:Dora Su,+6505551294 | Development, who applauded RHC''s\n\nSINGAPORE (3 August)—In operation | contribution to the nation''s housing\n\nfor five years, Rayder Holdings | supply.\n\nCorporation (RHC)is announcing the | RHC completed its first conversion\n\ncompletion of its sixth renovation project, project four years ago the Kallang Bay Commons. The company, founded by Overlook apartment complex. Since then,\n\nreal estate agents Rayna Wong and | RHC has completed five more projects:\n\nDerrick Lim, specializes in converting | Asten Estates, Tampines Tower, Lakeside\n\nindustrial buildings into apartment | Manor, Yishun Terrace, and now Bay\n\ncomplexes. | Commons.\n\n\"Turning commercial buildings into\n\nresidential spaces has its challenges,\" | from our previous projects,\"Ms. Wong\n\nMs. Wong said.\"However, we are | noted.“This housing complex is designed\n\ncommitted to repurposing buildings | primarily for students at the nearby\n\ninstead of constructing new ones.\" | Changi Technological Institute.\"\n\nThis commitment was recently cited in a | Units at Bay Commons are now available\n\nspeech by Yamina Badawi, Singapore''s | for rent or purchase, she added.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.rayderholdingscorporation.com.sg/current-listings About Us | Current Listings | News | Careers\n\nRayder Holdings Corporation turns vacant commercial properties into pleasant residential buildings. Below are our current offerings in alphabetical order. Asten Estates:14-unit building with pool, fitness centre, and carpark Bay Commons:60studioapartments with shared kitchen areas and other common rooms Kallang Overlook:40-unit apartment complex situated on the Kallang River Lakeside Manor:28-unit building with indoor pool, outdoortennis and basketball courts, playground, and on-site cafeteria Tampines Tower:36-unit apartment complex with pool and fitness room Yishun Terrace: 55-unit apartment complex with outdoor sports facilities (tennis, basketball, football),indoor swimming pool, catch-and-release fishing pond, and picnic area For details andotherqueries, contact info@rayderholdingscorporation.com.sg.\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nToday 9:53 A.M. Hello, Mr.Goh. A fellow resident found your wallet on the cafeteria counter and dropped it off here at the RHC leasing office. Please stop by to pick it up. We are open until 6:00 PM. For after-hours service, call 09046802,and someone will assist you. Alicia Rajani, Office Manager","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"RHC Continues to Impress\n\nFORIMMEDIATERELEASE | minister of Housing and Urban\n\nContact:Dora Su,+6505551294 | Development, who applauded RHC''s\n\nSINGAPORE (3 August)—In operation | contribution to the nation''s housing\n\nfor five years, Rayder Holdings | supply.\n\nCorporation (RHC)is announcing the | RHC completed its first conversion\n\ncompletion of its sixth renovation project, project four years ago the Kallang Bay Commons. The company, founded by Overlook apartment complex. Since then,\n\nreal estate agents Rayna Wong and | RHC has completed five more projects:\n\nDerrick Lim, specializes in converting | Asten Estates, Tampines Tower, Lakeside\n\nindustrial buildings into apartment | Manor, Yishun Terrace, and now Bay\n\ncomplexes. | Commons.\n\n\"Turning commercial buildings into\n\nresidential spaces has its challenges,\" | from our previous projects,\"Ms. Wong\n\nMs. Wong said.\"However, we are | noted.“This housing complex is designed\n\ncommitted to repurposing buildings | primarily for students at the nearby\n\ninstead of constructing new ones.\" | Changi Technological Institute.\"\n\nThis commitment was recently cited in a | Units at Bay Commons are now available\n\nspeech by Yamina Badawi, Singapore''s | for rent or purchase, she added."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"https://www.rayderholdingscorporation.com.sg/current-listings About Us | Current Listings | News | Careers\n\nRayder Holdings Corporation turns vacant commercial properties into pleasant residential buildings. Below are our current offerings in alphabetical order. Asten Estates:14-unit building with pool, fitness centre, and carpark Bay Commons:60studioapartments with shared kitchen areas and other common rooms Kallang Overlook:40-unit apartment complex situated on the Kallang River Lakeside Manor:28-unit building with indoor pool, outdoortennis and basketball courts, playground, and on-site cafeteria Tampines Tower:36-unit apartment complex with pool and fitness room Yishun Terrace: 55-unit apartment complex with outdoor sports facilities (tennis, basketball, football),indoor swimming pool, catch-and-release fishing pond, and picnic area For details andotherqueries, contact info@rayderholdingscorporation.com.sg."},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"Today 9:53 A.M. Hello, Mr.Goh. A fellow resident found your wallet on the cafeteria counter and dropped it off here at the RHC leasing office. Please stop by to pick it up. We are open until 6:00 PM. For after-hours service, call 09046802,and someone will assist you. Alicia Rajani, Office Manager"}],"question":"According to the press release, what is true about RHC?","bilingual":"Theo thông cáo báo chí, điều gì đúng về RHC?","options":["It has an international presence.","It specializes in designing work spaces.","It was founded by two construction engineers.","It has been in business for five years."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It has been in business for five years.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"xây dựng; kết cấu; ngành xây dựng tòa nhà"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"specialize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈspeʃ.ə.laɪz/","meaning":"chuyên môn hóa"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó có sự hiện diện quốc tế.","Nó chuyên thiết kế không gian làm việc.","Nó được thành lập bởi hai kỹ sư xây dựng.","Nó đã hoạt động được 5 năm."]},{"questionNum":"192","passageTitle":"RHC Continues to Impress","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nRHC Continues to Impress\n\nFORIMMEDIATERELEASE | minister of Housing and Urban\n\nContact:Dora Su,+6505551294 | Development, who applauded RHC''s\n\nSINGAPORE (3 August)—In operation | contribution to the nation''s housing\n\nfor five years, Rayder Holdings | supply.\n\nCorporation (RHC)is announcing the | RHC completed its first conversion\n\ncompletion of its sixth renovation project, project four years ago the Kallang Bay Commons. The company, founded by Overlook apartment complex. Since then,\n\nreal estate agents Rayna Wong and | RHC has completed five more projects:\n\nDerrick Lim, specializes in converting | Asten Estates, Tampines Tower, Lakeside\n\nindustrial buildings into apartment | Manor, Yishun Terrace, and now Bay\n\ncomplexes. | Commons.\n\n\"Turning commercial buildings into\n\nresidential spaces has its challenges,\" | from our previous projects,\"Ms. Wong\n\nMs. Wong said.\"However, we are | noted.“This housing complex is designed\n\ncommitted to repurposing buildings | primarily for students at the nearby\n\ninstead of constructing new ones.\" | Changi Technological Institute.\"\n\nThis commitment was recently cited in a | Units at Bay Commons are now available\n\nspeech by Yamina Badawi, Singapore''s | for rent or purchase, she added.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.rayderholdingscorporation.com.sg/current-listings About Us | Current Listings | News | Careers\n\nRayder Holdings Corporation turns vacant commercial properties into pleasant residential buildings. Below are our current offerings in alphabetical order. Asten Estates:14-