her common rooms Kallang Overlook:40-unit apartment complex situated on the Kallang River Lakeside Manor:28-unit building with indoor pool, outdoortennis and basketball courts, playground, and on-site cafeteria Tampines Tower:36-unit apartment complex with pool and fitness room Yishun Terrace: 55-unit apartment complex with outdoor sports facilities (tennis, basketball, football),indoor swimming pool, catch-and-release fishing pond, and picnic area For details andotherqueries, contact info@rayderholdingscorporation.com.sg."},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"Today 9:53 A.M. Hello, Mr.Goh. A fellow resident found your wallet on the cafeteria counter and dropped it off here at the RHC leasing office. Please stop by to pick it up. We are open until 6:00 PM. For after-hours service, call 09046802,and someone will assist you. Alicia Rajani, Office Manager"}],"question":"Where does Mr.Goh most likely live?","bilingual":"Ông Goh có thể sống ở đâu nhất?","options":["At Asten Estates","At Lakeside Manor","At Tampines Tower","At Yishun Terrace"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"At Lakeside Manor\".","vocabList":[{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"completion","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəmˈpliʃən/","meaning":"hoàn thiện; đang hoàn thiện"},{"word":"renovation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌren.əˈveɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"sự nâng cấp, sự cải tiến"},{"word":"specialize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈspeʃ.ə.laɪz/","meaning":"chuyên môn hóa"}],"optionMeanings":["Tại Asten Estates","Tại Lakeside Manor","Tại Tháp Tampines","Tại Yishun TerraceBAN DICH: RHC TIỆP TÚC GÂY AN TƯỜNGDE PHÁT HÀNH NGAY LẬP TUCda đàoc trích dân trong một bài phátLiên anh: Dora Su, +65 05551294 biểu của Yamina Badawi, bo trường BoPhat trién Nhà và Đồ thị cua Singapore, SINGAPORE (ngày 3 thdng 8) - Danguoi da hoan nghenh dong gop cuahoat dong dugc 5nam, RayderRHC doi vi nguon cung cdp nhdé cuaHoldings Corporation (RHC) thongquoc gia. bdo hoan thanh du an doi moi thuRHC da hoan thanh du an chuyen doisdu, Bay Commons. Công ty dugcdau tiến cdch ngày 4 nam -khu chungthanh lập bội cdc dai ly bat dongcu Kallang Overlook. Ke tu do, RHC dasdn Rayna Wong và Derrick Lim, hoan thanh họ 5 du dn: Astenchuyén chuyên doi cdc toa nhdEstates, Tampines Tower, Lakesidecong nghiep thanh cac khu chungManor, Yishun Terrace, vd gio la Baycu. Cộng đồng. Ba Wong noi: \"Viec bien cdc toa \"Bay Commons dai dien cho mot sunha thuong mgi thanh khong giankhdc biết so vdi cdc du dn truoc day cuadan cu co nhung thach thuc. Tuychung toi,\"ba noi. Vương lưu y. \"Tô hợpnhien, chung tôi cam kết tdi sinhaé nay dugc thiet ke chu yeu danhdung cdc toa nha thay vi xay dungcho sinh vien tai Học viện Công nghenhung toa nha mdi.\" Changi gan do.\" Có ay noi họ rang Cam kết nay gan ngàycdc chung cư tai Bay Commons hien cosan de cho thue hogc mua. https://www.rayderholdingscorporation.com.sg/current-listingsDanh sdch hien taiTin turcVe chung toiNghe nghiepRayder Holdings Corporation biên cdc bát đồng sdn thương mgi boTOPtrong thanh cdc toa nhà cho dân cư. Dudi day la cdc dịch vũ hiền tài cia 32 chung tôi theo thu tu bdng chu cdi. ZenlishHQCTOEIC1LAN LADAT"]},{"questionNum":"196","passageTitle":"https://www.camsfurniture.ca/about_us About Us | Catalogue | Reviews | Cont","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nhttps://www.camsfurniture.ca/about_us About Us | Catalogue | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nCam''s FurniturehasbeenafixtureinOttawaformorethan50years. With our focus on exceptional customer service, we guarantee that your time in our store will be both pleasant and worthwhile!\n\nOur daily business operations are overseen by George Meara, the eldestson of founder Cam Meara. George is joined by his sister, Elise Meara, and an enthusiastic team of sales associates who will help you choose the best furniture for your needs. Ourenormousshowroomfeatures abroad selection of high-quality furniture arranged in different types of residential rooms and office spaces. And, along with all the top brands of furniture, we are proud to carry unique and environmentally friendly items sourced from the Green Directions Trade Fair. Our head buyer, Debbie Sarno, attends this event annually to choose fantastic new products for our store.\n\nWe offer complimentary delivery and setup for all customers whose home or business is within the boundaries of the city of Ottawa.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nLinda Fei(1:57P.M.) Toby, I''m at Cam''s Furniture. The items you chose for our reception area look great!The salesperson told me the bill is going to be a little more than expected because there will be a charge for delivery and setup. The crew can come out to our office on Friday, so we''ll definitely be able to have everything in place before our clients arrive on Monday. Toby Pesenti(1:59P.M.) Great!The slightly higher cost shouldn''t bea problem. We have enough in our budget.\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nOnline Reviews\n\nCustomerreviewpostedbyLindaFeion23Julyat5:32P.M. The staff at Cam''s Furniture is extraordinarily helpful and professional.I was pleased\n\nbeautiful-we''ve been receiving many compliments. Cam''s delivery team spent extra time at our new office space to make sure that the furniture was arranged in exactly the right way. We look forward to shopping at Cam''s again!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"https://www.camsfurniture.ca/about_us About Us | Catalogue | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nCam''s FurniturehasbeenafixtureinOttawaformorethan50years. With our focus on exceptional customer service, we guarantee that your time in our store will be both pleasant and worthwhile!\n\nOur daily business operations are overseen by George Meara, the eldestson of founder Cam Meara. George is joined by his sister, Elise Meara, and an enthusiastic team of sales associates who will help you choose the best furniture for your needs. Ourenormousshowroomfeatures abroad selection of high-quality furniture arranged in different types of residential rooms and office spaces. And, along with all the top brands of furniture, we are proud to carry unique and environmentally friendly items sourced from the Green Directions Trade Fair. Our head buyer, Debbie Sarno, attends this event annually to choose fantastic new products for our store.\n\nWe offer complimentary delivery and setup for all customers whose home or business is within the boundaries of the city of Ottawa."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Linda Fei(1:57P.M.) Toby, I''m at Cam''s Furniture. The items you chose for our reception area look great!The salesperson told me the bill is going to be a little more than expected because there will be a charge for delivery and setup. The crew can come out to our office on Friday, so we''ll definitely be able to have everything in place before our clients arrive on Monday. Toby Pesenti(1:59P.M.) Great!The slightly higher cost shouldn''t bea problem. We have enough in our budget."},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"Online Reviews\n\nCustomerreviewpostedbyLindaFeion23Julyat5:32P.M. The staff at Cam''s Furniture is extraordinarily helpful and professional.I was pleased\n\nbeautiful-we''ve been receiving many compliments. Cam''s delivery team spent extra time at our new office space to make sure that the furniture was arranged in exactly the right way. We look forward to shopping at Cam''s again!"}],"question":"What does the Web page indicate about Cam''s Furniture?","bilingual":"Trang Web nói gì về Cam''s Furniture?","options":["It is currently hiring new staff.","It has two store locations.","It is a family business.","It specializes in used furniture."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It is a family business.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"complimentary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":