,"meaning":"sự vận chuyển"},{"word":"considering","pos":"Giới từ (Preposition)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈsɪdərɪŋ/","meaning":"có tính đến; trong ánh sáng của"},{"word":"surrounding","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səˈraʊn.dɪŋ/","meaning":"bao quanh"},{"word":"regulations","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌrɛgjəˈleɪʃənz/","meaning":"quy chế; pháp luật; hành vi kiểm soát; sự quản lý; phương hướng"}]},{"questionNum":"158","passageTitle":"Morves Laboratories of Seoul is seeking an associate research scientist who","passageText":"Morves Laboratories of Seoul is seeking an associate research scientist who will work collaboratively with a team of other scientists within the Research and Development Division. Morves Laboratories has more than 85,000 employees in offices and laboratories in Asia, Europe, and North America who are involved in developing, manufacturing, and selling cutting-edge medicines. The Research and Development Division is responsible for achieving the company''s primary goal of creating new and effective medications for worldwide use. Primary Job Functions: • Design and conduct laboratory experiments • Perform rigorous data analysis • Collaborate to write detailed reports • Present research findings internally and externally to clients at specific meetings Position Requirements: • A master''s degree in biology At least five years of laboratory experience Excellent oral and written communication skills To apply, submit a resume and cover letter to www.morveslaboratories.co.kr/careers by November 10.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Morves Laboratories of Seoul is seeking an associate research scientist who will work collaboratively with a team of other scientists within the Research and Development Division. Morves Laboratories has more than 85,000 employees in offices and laboratories in Asia, Europe, and North America who are involved in developing, manufacturing, and selling cutting-edge medicines. The Research and Development Division is responsible for achieving the company''s primary goal of creating new and effective medications for worldwide use. Primary Job Functions: • Design and conduct laboratory experiments • Perform rigorous data analysis • Collaborate to write detailed reports • Present research findings internally and externally to clients at specific meetings Position Requirements: • A master''s degree in biology At least five years of laboratory experience Excellent oral and written communication skills To apply, submit a resume and cover letter to www.morveslaboratories.co.kr/careers by November 10."}],"question":"What does the job posting indicate about Morves Laboratories?","bilingual":"Tin tuyển dụng nói lên điều gì về Phòng thí nghiệm Morves?","options":["It offers excellent employee benefits.","Its workforce is primarily based in Europe.","Its main purpose is to develop new medicines.","It partners with another company for product distribution."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Its main purpose is to develop new medicines.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"manufacturing","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/¸mænju´fæktʃəriη/","meaning":"sự sản xuất; sự chế tạo; sự gia công"},{"word":"communication","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kəmˌjunəˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"trao đổi thông tin hoặc ý tưởng; chuyển khoản; đi qua"},{"word":"distribution","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌdɪs.trɪˈbjuː.ʃən/","meaning":"sự phân phát"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó mang lại những lợi ích tuyệt vời cho nhân viên.","Lực lượng lao động của nó chủ yếu có trụ sở tại Châu Âu.","Mục đích chính của nó là phát triển các loại thuốc mới.","Nó hợp tác với một công ty khác để phân phối sản phẩm.159. Một trách nhiệm của vị trí này là gì? (A) Phân tích thông tin từ các thí nghiệm (B) Thiết kế vật liệu đóng gói an toàn (C) Đánh giá hoạt động của thiết bị sản xuất (D) Trả lời các câu hỏi của bệnh nhân"]},{"questionNum":"159","passageTitle":"Morves Laboratories of Seoul is seeking an associate research scientist who","passageText":"Morves Laboratories of Seoul is seeking an associate research scientist who will work collaboratively with a team of other scientists within the Research and Development Division. Morves Laboratories has more than 85,000 employees in offices and laboratories in Asia, Europe, and North America who are involved in developing, manufacturing, and selling cutting-edge medicines. The Research and Development Division is responsible for achieving the company''s primary goal of creating new and effective medications for worldwide use. Primary Job Functions: • Design and conduct laboratory experiments • Perform rigorous data analysis • Collaborate to write detailed reports • Present research findings internally and externally to clients at specific meetings Position Requirements: • A master''s degree in biology At least five years of laboratory experience Excellent oral and written communication skills To apply, submit a resume and cover letter to www.morveslaboratories.co.kr/careers by November 10.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Morves Laboratories of Seoul is seeking an associate research scientist who will work collaboratively with a team of other scientists within the Research and Development Division. Morves Laboratories has more than 85,000 employees in offices and laboratories in Asia, Europe, and North America who are involved in developing, manufacturing, and selling cutting-edge medicines. The Research and Development Division is responsible for achieving the company''s primary goal of creating new and effective medications for worldwide use. Primary Job Functions: • Design and c