e had been asked to give a short in the GNA and the community at large came speech about the city''s plans to build a through admirably,\"the mayor continued.\n\nnew recreational center, after which she | The GNA reception was held in the\n\nwas presented with a special plaque to Gardendale Botanical Garden, which offered thank her for her role in the Westside Park a beautiful setting. The food was provided project. According to GNA president by Dawn Sky Catering, which included an Manuel Yuen,\"Mayor Fugate was individual chocolate cake for each guest instrumental in making last year''s decorated with the GNA logo. fund-raising festival for the park a huge success.\"The festival raised thousands of"}],"question":"How many people most likely attended the GNA reception?","bilingual":"","options":["5","50","100","200"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"50\".","vocabList":[{"word":"neighborhood","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈneɪbərˌhʊd/","meaning":"hàng xóm"},{"word":"association","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˌsoʊʃiˈeɪʃən/","meaning":"tổ chức; xã hội; công đoàn; liên minh; sự thành lập"},{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}]},{"questionNum":"181","passageTitle":"Chisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Ja","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nChisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Japan Toby Heisenberger 1226LarkStreet Albany, NewYork12210 USA May 7 Product Recall: CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer\n\nDear Mr.Heisenberger, This is to inform you that the CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer has beenrecalled. We have received reports of units over heating and becoming unusable. To address this issue, an additional fan needs to be installed in your computer. Please return the gaming system to the store in which it was purchased, using your personal customer identification number, PCI-70734. Your system will then be sent back to the manufacturer and repaired at no expense to you. We apologize for any inconvenience. Sincerely, Kobu Matsui Kobu Matsui, Vice President Chisaka Gaming Systems\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nVirginia Granger <v.granger@chisakagamingsystems.jp> From: | Jennifer Kinkaid <jkinkaid@albancgm.com> Date: | June 12\n\nSubject: | Product recall\n\nDcar Ms. Grangcr, Our retail stores have been accepting your CGs-P27High-Speed Gaming Computers for repairs as arranged. As you may know, owners of your gaming system are reluctant to give up their devices for repair once they find that they will be without the system for two to three weeks. Today alone, three customers(PCI-70734,PCI-17503,and PCI-90022) declined to have their systems repaired. The good news is that users of your gaming system are very loyal. However, to increase compliance with the recall and as a public relations gesture, you could provide us with several devices as part of a loaner program. Let mc know how I can assist with this arrangement. Thank you!\n\nJennifer Kinkaid Alban Computers, Games, and More","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Chisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Japan Toby Heisenberger 1226LarkStreet Albany, NewYork12210 USA May 7 Product Recall: CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer\n\nDear Mr.Heisenberger, This is to inform you that the CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer has beenrecalled. We have received reports of units over heating and becoming unusable. To address this issue, an additional fan needs to be installed in your computer. Please return the gaming system to the store in which it was purchased, using your personal customer identification number, PCI-70734. Your system will then be sent back to the manufacturer and repaired at no expense to you. We apologize for any inconvenience. Sincerely, Kobu Matsui Kobu Matsui, Vice President Chisaka Gaming Systems"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Virginia Granger <v.granger@chisakagamingsystems.jp> From: | Jennifer Kinkaid <jkinkaid@albancgm.com> Date: | June 12\n\nSubject: | Product recall\n\nDcar Ms. Grangcr, Our retail stores have been accepting your CGs-P27High-Speed Gaming Computers for repairs as arranged. As you may know, owners of your gaming system are reluctant to give up their devices for repair once they find that they will be without the system for two to three weeks. Today alone, three customers(PCI-70734,PCI-17503,and PCI-90022) declined to have their systems repaired. The good news is that users of your gaming system are very loyal. However, to increase compliance with the recall and as a public relations gesture, you could provide us with several devices as part of a loaner program. Let mc know how I can assist with this arrangement. Thank you!\n\nJennifer Kinkaid Alban Computers, Games, and More"}],"question":"Why did Mr.Matsuisendtheletter?","bilingual":"","options":["To advertise a new product","To alert a customer to a problem","To confirm that a refund had been issued","To offer a customer an upgrade"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To alert a customer to a problem\".","vocabList":[{"word":"arrangement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈreɪndʒ.mənt/","meaning":"sự sắp đặt"},{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"advertise","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈæd.vɚ.taɪz/","meaning":"quảng cáo, thông báo"},{"word":"apologize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɑː.lə.dʒaɪz/","meaning":"xin lỗi"}]},{"questionNum":"182","passageTitle":"Chisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Ja","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nChisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Japan Toby Heisenberger 1226LarkStreet Albany, NewYork12210 USA May 7 Product Recall: CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer\n\nDear Mr.Heisenberger, This is to inform you that the CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer has beenrecalled. We have received reports of units over heating and becoming unusable. To address this issue, an additional fan needs to be installed in your computer. Please return the gaming system to the store in which it was purchased, using your personal customer identification number, PCI-70734. Your system will then be sent back to the manufacturer and repaired at no expense to you. We apologize for any inconvenience. Sincerely, Kobu Matsui Kobu Matsui, Vice President Chisaka Gaming Systems\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nVirginia Granger <v.granger@chisakagamingsystems.jp> From: | Jennifer Kinkaid <jkinkaid@albancgm.com> Date: | June 12\n\nSubject: | Product recall\n\nDcar Ms. Grangcr, Our retail stores have been accepting your CGs-P27High-Speed Gaming Computers for repairs as arranged. As you may know, owners of your gaming system are reluctant to give up their devices for repair once they find that they will be without the system for two to three weeks. Today alone, three customers(PCI-70734,PCI-17503,and PCI-90022) declined to have their systems repaired. The good news is that users of your gaming system are very loyal. However, to increase compliance with the recall and as a public relations gesture, you could provide us with several devices as part of a loaner program. Let mc know how I can assist with this arrangement. Thank you!\n\nJennifer Kinkaid Alban Computers, Games, and More","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Chisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Japan Toby Heisenberger 1226LarkStre