Alban Computers, Games, and More"}],"question":"In the e-mail, the word program\"in paragraph 2, line3, is closest in meaning to","bilingual":"","options":["schedule","plan","broadcast","software"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"plan\".","vocabList":[{"word":"arrangement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈreɪndʒ.mənt/","meaning":"sự sắp đặt"},{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"apologize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɑː.lə.dʒaɪz/","meaning":"xin lỗi"},{"word":"president","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈprɛzɪdənt/","meaning":"cái đầu; lãnh đạo; chủ tịch; người đứng đầu"}]},{"questionNum":"184","passageTitle":"Chisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Ja","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nChisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Japan Toby Heisenberger 1226LarkStreet Albany, NewYork12210 USA May 7 Product Recall: CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer\n\nDear Mr.Heisenberger, This is to inform you that the CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer has beenrecalled. We have received reports of units over heating and becoming unusable. To address this issue, an additional fan needs to be installed in your computer. Please return the gaming system to the store in which it was purchased, using your personal customer identification number, PCI-70734. Your system will then be sent back to the manufacturer and repaired at no expense to you. We apologize for any inconvenience. Sincerely, Kobu Matsui Kobu Matsui, Vice President Chisaka Gaming Systems\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nVirginia Granger <v.granger@chisakagamingsystems.jp> From: | Jennifer Kinkaid <jkinkaid@albancgm.com> Date: | June 12\n\nSubject: | Product recall\n\nDcar Ms. Grangcr, Our retail stores have been acceptin