. Today alone, three customers(PCI-70734,PCI-17503,and PCI-90022) declined to have their systems repaired. The good news is that users of your gaming system are very loyal. However, to increase compliance with the recall and as a public relations gesture, you could provide us with several devices as part of a loaner program. Let mc know how I can assist with this arrangement. Thank you!\n\nJennifer Kinkaid Alban Computers, Games, and More"}],"question":"What can be concluded about Mr. Heisenberger?","bilingual":"","options":["He was not satisfied with his purchase.","He called Ms. Granger to discuss options.","He did not bring his system in for repair.","He requested a two-week turn around."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"He did not bring his system in for repair.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"arrangement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈreɪndʒ.mənt/","meaning":"sự sắp đặt"},{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"satisfied","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sætisfaid/","meaning":"cảm thấy hài lòng, cảm thấy vừa ý; thoả mãn"},{"word":"apologize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɑː.lə.dʒaɪz/","meaning":"xin lỗi"}]},{"questionNum":"185","passageTitle":"Chisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Ja","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nChisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Japan Toby Heisenberger 1226LarkStreet Albany, NewYork12210 USA May 7 Product Recall: CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer\n\nDear Mr.Heisenberger, This is to inform you that the CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer has beenrecalled. We have received reports of units over heating and becoming unusable. To address this issue, an additional fan needs to be installed in your computer. Please return the gaming system to the store in which it was purchased, using your personal customer identification number, PCI-70734. Your system will then be sent back to the manufacturer and repaired at no expense to you. We apologize for any inconvenience. Sincerely, Kobu Matsui Kobu Matsui, Vice President Chisaka Gaming Systems\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nVirginia Granger <v.granger@chisakagamingsystems.jp> From: | Jennifer Kinkaid <jkinkaid@albancgm.com> Date: | June 12\n\nSubject: | Product recall\n\nDcar Ms. Grangcr, Our retail stores have been accepting your CGs-P27High-Speed Gaming Computers for repairs as arranged. As you may know, owners of your gaming system are reluctant to give up their devices for repair once they find that they will be without the system for two to three weeks. Today alone, three customers(PCI-70734,PCI-17503,and PCI-90022) declined to have their systems repaired. The good news is that users of your gaming system are very loyal. However, to increase compliance with the recall and as a public relations gesture, you could provide us with several devices as part of a loaner program. Let mc know how I can assist with this arrangement. Thank you!\n\nJennifer Kinkaid Alban Computers, Games, and More","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Chisaka Gaming Systems 410-1109,Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo-ku Kyoto-shi Kyoto, Japan Toby Heisenberger 1226LarkStreet Albany, NewYork12210 USA May 7 Product Recall: CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer\n\nDear Mr.Heisenberger, This is to inform you that the CGS-P27High-Speed Gaming Computer has beenrecalled. We have received reports of units over heating and becoming unusable. To address this issue, an additional fan needs to be installed in your computer. Please return the gaming system to the store in which it was purchased, using your personal customer identification number, PCI-70734. Your system will then be sent back to the manufacturer and repaired at no expense to you. We apologize for any inconvenience. Sincerely, Kobu Matsui Kobu Matsui, Vice President Chisaka Gaming Systems"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"Virginia Granger <v.granger@chisakagamingsystems.jp> From: | Jennifer Kinkaid <jkinkaid@albancgm.com> Date: | June 12\n\nSubject: | Product recall\n\nDcar Ms. Grangcr, Our retail stores have been accepting your CGs-P27High-Speed Gaming Computers for repairs as arranged. As you may know, owners of your gaming system are reluctant to give up their devices for repair once they find that they will be without the system for two to three weeks. Today alone, three customers(PCI-70734,PCI-17503,and PCI-90022) declined to have their systems repaired. The good news is that users of your gaming system are very loyal. However, to increase compliance with the recall and as a public relations gesture, you could provide us with several devices as part of a loaner program. Let mc know how I can assist with this arrangement. Thank you!\n\nJennifer Kinkaid Alban Computers, Games, and More"}],"question":"What does Ms.Kinkaid request in her e-mail?","bilingual":"Cô Kinkaid yêu cầu gì trong e - thư à?","options":["Free products","System upgrades","Computer monitors","Temporary replacements"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Temporary replacements\".","vocabList":[{"word":"arrangement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈreɪndʒ.mənt/","meaning":"sự sắp đặt"},{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"temporary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈtem.pə.rer.i/","meaning":"tạm thời"},{"word":"apologize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɑː.lə.dʒaɪz/","meaning":"xin lỗi"}],"optionMeanings":["Sản phẩm miễn phí","Nâng cấp hệ thống","Màn hình máy tính","Thay thế tạm thờiB ẢN DỊCH: Hệ thống chơi game Chisaka 410 -1109, Nijo Dencho, Nakagyo - ku Kyoto - shiKyoto, Nhật BảnToby Heisenberger 1226 PhốLarkAlbany, New York 12210 Hoa Kỳngày 7 tháng 5 Sản phẩm thu hồi: Máy tính chơi game tốc độ CGS - P27 Thưa ông Heisenberger, Thông báo này nhắm thông báo cho rằng máy chơi game tốc độcao CGS - P27 đã được thu hồi. Chúng tôi đã nhận được báo cáo về các thiết bịquá nóng và không sử dụng được. Để giải quyết vấn đề này, chúng tôi cần lắp thêm một quạt vào máy tính. Vui lòng trả lờilại máy cho cửa hàng đã mua, sử dụng mã số nhận dạng cá nhân khách hàng, PCI - 70734. Hệmáy chủ sau đó sẽ được gửi lại cho nhà sản xuất và sửa chữa miễn phí. Chúng tôi xin lỗi vì bất cứ sự việc nào. Trân trọng, Kobu Matsui Kobu Matsui, Phó chủ nhàtíchChisaka GamingSystemsTừ: Virginia Granger <v.granger@chisakagamingsystems.jp> Tới: Jennifer Kinkaid <jkinkaid@albancgm.com> Ngày: 12 tháng 6 Chủ đề: Thu hồi sản phẩmKính gửi cô Granger, Cửa hàng bán lẻchúng tôi đã nhận được máy tính chơi game tốc độ caoCGS - P27 của cô để sửa chữa theo thỏa thuận. Như cô đã biết, chủ sở hữu bộmáy chơi game không muốn thiết bị của họ được sửa chữa sau khi họnhận thấy rằng họ Sẽ không thể sử dụng trong hai tuần tới. Riêng hôm nay, ba khách hàng (PCI - 70734, PCI - 17503 và PCI - 90022) đã chọn sửa chữa bộ máy của họ. Tin tốt là người dùng máy chơi game của cô rất trung thành. Tuy nhiên, để Tăng tính thủ thuật của công việc thu hồi và tư vấn cách quan hệ công nghệ, chúng tôi có thể cho phép chúng tôi mượn một số thiết bị trong thời gian sửa chữa. Hãy chọn tôi biết tôi có thể hỗ trợ việc sắp xếp này như thế nào. Cảm ơn! Jennifer Kinkaid Alban Máy tính, Trò chơi, v.v"]},{"questionNum":"186","passageTitle":"To: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Buny","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Bunyasi <h.bunyasi@theushindigroup.co.ke> Date: | 3 February\n\nSubject: | Survey\n\nDear Ms. Wairimu, The management team has asked us to find out how satisfied our clients are with our digital marketing services. To that end, we will conduct a survey during the month of April. Given your expertise in survey design and analysis, I would like you to develop a customer satisfaction survey that includes an evaluation of the digital marketing services we advertise on our Web site. It will be sent to each of our long time clients here in Kenya. Please have a draft ready by 17 February and distribute it to the members of the management team for their review. You and I will present the draft at the management team''s meetingon23Februaryat2:00pM. Regards, Henry Bunyasi\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nSatisfaction Survey 1 May At The Ushindi Group, we strive to provide you with top-quality marketing services. That is why we are asking our long time clients to complete this short survey about our digital marketing services. With the information you provide, we can identify areas for improvement. Please submit your responses on or before19May. Thank you for helping us to serve you better. Please type one of the following values into the appropriate box for each service. 1=very dissatisfied,2=dissatisfied,3=no opinion,4=satisfied,5=very satisfied\n\nDigital Marketing Services A.Advertising on social media B.Content creation, including written content, photos, and videos C.E-mail marketing to existing and potential customers D.Web and mobile app development and design\n\nClient name (optional):[\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nhttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/companynews About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nImprovements to Our Services In response to customer feedback, The Ushindi Group will introduce a new e-mail marketing strategy on 15 July. Our new focus will be on triggered e-mails. Triggered e-mails are sent out automatically based on customerbehaviour and have a much higher response rate than traditional marketing e-mails. Triggered e-mails help companies turn casual buyers into loyal customers. We anticipate that this change will result in a noticeable increase in repeat customers for our clients. The price of our services will remain the same. For more information, you may contact your marketing account manager directly, call The Ushindi Group at0800205555,orsendane-mail to info@theushindigroup.co.ke.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Bunyasi <h.bunyasi@theushindigroup.co.ke> Date: | 3 February\n\nSubject: | Survey\n\nDear Ms. Wairimu, The management team has asked us to find out how satisfied our clients are with our digital marketing services. To that end, we will conduct a survey during the month of April. Given your expertise in survey design and analysis, I would like you to develop a customer satisfaction survey that includes an evaluation of the digital marketing services we advertise on our Web site. It will be sent to each of our long time clients here in Kenya. Please have a draft ready by 17 February and distribute it to the members of the management team for their review. You and I will present the draft at the management team''s meetingon23Februaryat2:00pM. Regards, Henry Bunyasi"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"https://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nSatisfaction Survey 1 May At The Ushindi Group, we strive to provide you with top-quality marketing services. That is why we are asking our long time clients to complete this short survey about our digital marketing services. With the information you provide, we can identify areas for improvement. Please submit your responses on or before19May. Thank you for helping us to serve you better. Please type one of the following values into the appropriate box for each service. 1=very dissatisfied,2=dissatisfied,3=no opinion,4=satisfied,5=very satisfied\n\nDigital Marketing Services A.Advertising on social media B.Content creation, including written content, photos, and videos C.E-mail marketing to existing and potential customers D.Web and mobile app development and design\n\nClient name (optional):["},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"https://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/companynews About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nImprovements to Our Services In response to customer feedback, The Ushindi Group will introduce a new e-mail marketing strategy on 15 July. Our new focus will be on triggered e-mails. Triggered e-mails are sent out automatically based on customerbehaviour and have a much higher response rate than traditional marketing e-mails. Triggered e-mails help companies turn casual buyers into loyal customers. We anticipate that this change will result in a noticeable increase in repeat customers for our clients. The price of our services will remain the same. For more information, you may contact your marketing account manager directly, call The Ushindi Group at0800205555,orsendane-mail to info@theushindigroup.co.ke."}],"question":"What is stated about Ms.Wairimu in the e-mail?","bilingual":"Những gì được nói về cô Wairimu trong e - thư à?","options":["She resolved a complaint from one of her clients.","She responded to an employee questionnaire.","She is a member of the management team.","She is highly skilled in survey development."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"She is highly skilled in survey development.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"questionnaire","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkwɛstʃəˈnɛər/","meaning":"bản câu hỏi (để điều tra, để thăm dò ý kiến)"},{"word":"satisfaction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌsætɪsˈfækʃən/","meaning":"sự thỏa mãn một nhu cầu; thù lao; sự hoàn thành"},{"word":"development","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈvel.əp.mənt/","meaning":"sự phát triển"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô đã giải quyết khiếu nại từ một trong những khách hàng của mình.","Cô ấy đã trả lời bảng câu hỏi của nhân viên.","Cô ấy là thành viên của ban quản lý.","Cô ấy là người phát triển khảo sát có tay nghề cao."]},{"questionNum":"187","passageTitle":"To: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Buny","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Bunyasi <h.bunyasi@theushindigroup.co.ke> Date: | 3 February\n\nSubject: | Survey\n\nDear Ms. Wairimu, The management team has asked us to find out how satisfied our clients are with our digital marketing services. To that end, we will conduct a survey during the month of April. Given your expertise in survey design and analysis, I would like you to develop a customer satisfaction survey that includes an evaluation of the digital marketing services we advertise on our Web site. It will be sent to each of our long time clients here in Kenya. Please have a draft ready by 17 February and distribute it to the members of the management team for their review. You and I will present the draft at the management team''s meetingon23Februaryat2:00pM. Regards, Henry Bunyasi\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nSatisfaction Survey 1 May At The Ushindi Group, we strive to provide you with top-quality marketing services. That is why we are asking our long time clients to complete this short survey about our digital marketing services. With the information you provide, we can identify areas for improvement. Please submit your responses on or before19May. Thank you for helping us to serve you better. Please type one of the following values into the appropriate box for each service. 1=very dissatisfied,2=dissatisfied,3=no opinion,4=satisfied,5=very satisfied\n\nDigital Marketing Services A.Advertising on social media B.Content creation, including written content, photos, and videos C.E-mail marketing to existing and potential customers D.Web and mobile app development and design\n\nClient name (optional):[\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nhttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/companynews About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nImprovements to Our Services In response to customer feedback, The Ushindi Group will introduce a new e-mail marketing strategy on 15 July. Our new focus will be on triggered e-mails. Triggered e-mails are sent out automatically based on customerbehaviour and have a much higher response rate than traditional marketing e-mails. Triggered e-mails help companies turn casual buyers into loyal customers. We anticipate that this change will result in a noticeable increase in repeat customers for our clients. The price of our services will remain the same. For more information, you may contact your marketing account manager directly, call The Ushindi Group at0800205555,orsendane-mail to info@theushindigroup.co.ke.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Bunyasi <h.bunyasi@theushindigroup.co.ke> Date: | 3 February\n\nSubject: | Survey\n\nDear Ms. Wairimu, The management team has asked us to find out how satisfied our clients are with our digital marketing services. To that end, we will conduct a survey during the month of April. Given your expertise in survey design and analysis, I would like you to develop a customer satisfaction survey that includes an evaluation of the digital marketing services we advertise on our Web site. It will be sent to each of our long time clients here in Kenya. Please have a draft ready by 17 February and distribute it to the members of the management team for their review. You and I will present the draft at the management team''s meetingon23Februaryat2:00pM. Regards, Henry Bunyasi"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"https://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nSatisfaction Survey 1 May At The Ushindi Group, we strive to provide you with top-quality marketing services. That is why we are asking our long time clients to complete this short survey about our digital marketing services. With the information you provide, we can identify areas for improvement. Please submit your responses on or before19May. Thank you for helping us to serve you better. Please type one of the following values into the appropriate box for each service. 1=very dissatisfied,2=dissatisfied,3=no opinion,4=satisfied,5=very satisfied\n\nDigital Marketing Services A.Advertising on social media B.Content creation, including written content, photos, and videos C.E-mail marketing to existing and potential customers D.Web and mobile app development and design\n\nClient name (optional):["},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"https://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/companynews About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nImprovements to Our Services In response to customer feedback, The Ushindi Group will introduce a new e-mail marketing strategy on 15 July. Our new focus will be on triggered e-mails. Triggered e-mails are sent out automatically based on customerbehaviour and have a much higher response rate than traditional marketing e-mails. Triggered e-mails help companies turn casual buyers into loyal customers. We anticipate that this change will result in a noticeable increase in repeat customers for our clients. The price of our services will remain the same. For more information, you may contact your marketing account manager directly, call The Ushindi Group at0800205555,orsendane-mail to info@theushindigroup.co.ke."}],"question":"What will most likely happen on February 23？","bilingual":"Điều gì rất có thể sẽ xảy ra vào ngày 23 tháng 2?","options":["The Ushindi Group''s Web site will be updated.","Mr. Bunyasi will review the advertising budget.","Ms.Wairimu will attend a meeting in the afternoon.","The management team will vote on a policy revision."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Ms.Wairimu will attend a meeting in the afternoon.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"satisfaction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌsætɪsˈfækʃən/","meaning":"sự thỏa mãn một nhu cầu; thù lao; sự hoàn thành"},{"word":"advertising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈædvərˌtaɪzɪŋ/","meaning":"Quảng cáo"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"}],"optionMeanings":["Trang web của Tập đoàn Ushindi sẽ được cập nhật.","Ông Bunyasi sẽ xem xét ngân sách quảng cáo.","Cô Wairimu sẽ tham dự một cuộc họp vào buổi chiều.","Nhóm quản lý sẽ bỏ phiếu về việc sửa đổi chính sách."]},{"questionNum":"188","passageTitle":"To: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Buny","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Bunyasi <h.bunyasi@theushindigroup.co.ke> Date: | 3 February\n\nSubject: | Survey\n\nDear Ms. Wairimu, The management team has asked us to find out how satisfied our clients are with our digital marketing services. To that end, we will conduct a survey during the month of April. Given your expertise in survey design and analysis, I would like you to develop a customer satisfaction survey that includes an evaluation of the digital marketing services we advertise on our Web site. It will be sent to each of our long time clients here in Kenya. Please have a draft ready by 17 February and distribute it to the members of the management team for their review. You and I will present the draft at the management team''s meetingon23Februaryat2:00pM. Regards, Henry Bunyasi\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nSatisfaction Survey 1 May At The Ushindi Group, we strive to provide you with top-quality marketing services. That is why we are asking our long time clients to complete this short survey about our digital marketing services. With the information you provide, we can identify areas for improvement. Please submit your responses on or before19May. Thank you for helping us to serve you better. Please type one of the following values into the appropriate box for each service. 1=very dissatisfied,2=dissatisfied,3=no opinion,4=satisfied,5=very satisfied\n\nDigital Marketing Services A.Advertising on social media B.Content creation, including written content, photos, and videos C.E-mail marketing to existing and potential customers D.Web and mobile app development and design\n\nClient name (optional):[\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nhttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/companynews About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nImprovements to Our Services In response to customer feedback, The Ushindi Group will introduce a new e-mail marketing strategy on 15 July. Our new focus will be on triggered e-mails. Triggered e-mails are sent out automatically based on customerbehaviour and have a much higher response rate than traditional marketing e-mails. Triggered e-mails help companies turn casual buyers into loyal customers. We anticipate that this change will result in a noticeable increase in repeat customers for our clients. The price of our services will remain the same. For more information, you may contact your marketing account manager directly, call The Ushindi Group at0800205555,orsendane-mail to info@theushindigroup.co.ke.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Bunyasi <h.b