un)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"appropriate","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈproʊpriˌeɪt/","meaning":"thích hợp; lắp"}],"optionMeanings":["Giá dịch vụ sẽ sớm tăng lên.","Một giám đốc tiếp thị đã được thay thế.","Các cuộc khảo sát sẽ được thực hiện hàng tháng.","Một hệ thống liên hệ khách hàng tự động sẽ khởi chạy."]},{"questionNum":"190","passageTitle":"To: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Buny","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Bunyasi <h.bunyasi@theushindigroup.co.ke> Date: | 3 February\n\nSubject: | Survey\n\nDear Ms. Wairimu, The management team has asked us to find out how satisfied our clients are with our digital marketing services. To that end, we will conduct a survey during the month of April. Given your expertise in survey design and analysis, I would like you to develop a customer satisfaction survey that includes an evaluation of the digital marketing services we advertise on our Web site. It will be sent to each of our long time clients here in Kenya. Please have a draft ready by 17 February and distribute it to the members of the management team for their review. You and I will present the draft at the management team''s meetingon23Februaryat2:00pM. Regards, Henry Bunyasi\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nSatisfaction Survey 1 May At The Ushindi Group, we strive to provide you with top-quality marketing services. That is why we are asking our long time clients to complete this short survey about our digital marketing services. With the information you provide, we can identify areas for improvement. Please submit your responses on or before19May. Thank you for helping us to serve you better. Please type one of the following values into the appropriate box for each service. 1=very dissatisfied,2=dissatisfied,3=no opinion,4=satisfied,5=very satisfied\n\nDigital Marketing Services A.Advertising on social media B.Content creation, including written content, photos, and videos C.E-mail marketing to existing and potential customers D.Web and mobile app development and design\n\nClient name (optional):[\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nhttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/companynews About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nImprovements to Our Services In response to customer feedback, The Ushindi Group will introduce a new e-mail marketing strategy on 15 July. Our new focus will be on triggered e-mails. Triggered e-mails are sent out automatically based on customerbehaviour and have a much higher response rate than traditional marketing e-mails. Triggered e-mails help companies turn casual buyers into loyal customers. We anticipate that this change will result in a noticeable increase in repeat customers for our clients. The price of our services will remain the same. For more information, you may contact your marketing account manager directly, call The Ushindi Group at0800205555,orsendane-mail to info@theushindigroup.co.ke.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> From: | Henry Bunyasi <h.bunyasi@theushindigroup.co.ke> Date: | 3 February\n\nSubject: | Survey\n\nDear Ms. Wairimu, The management team has asked us to find out how satisfied our clients are with our digital marketing services. To that end, we will conduct a survey during the month of April. Given your expertise in survey design and analysis, I would like you to develop a customer satisfaction survey that includes an evaluation of the digital marketing services we advertise on our Web site. It will be sent to each of our long time clients here in Kenya. Please have a draft ready by 17 February and distribute it to the members of the management team for their review. You and I will present the draft at the management team''s meetingon23Februaryat2:00pM. Regards, Henry Bunyasi"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"https://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nSatisfaction Survey 1 May At The Ushindi Group, we strive to provide you with top-quality marketing services. That is why we are asking our long time clients to complete this short survey about our digital marketing services. With the information you provide, we can identify areas for improvement. Please submit your responses on or before19May. Thank you for helping us to serve you better. Please type one of the following values into the appropriate box for each service. 1=very dissatisfied,2=dissatisfied,3=no opinion,4=satisfied,5=very satisfied\n\nDigital Marketing Services A.Advertising on social media B.Content creation, including written content, photos, and videos C.E-mail marketing to existing and potential customers D.Web and mobile app development and design\n\nClient name (optional):["},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"https://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/companynews About Us | Services | Plans and Pricing | Company News\n\nImprovements to Our Services In response to customer feedback, The Ushindi Group will introduce a new e-mail marketing strategy on 15 July. Our new focus will be on triggered e-mails. Triggered e-mails are sent out automatically based on customerbehaviour and have a much higher response rate than traditional marketing e-mails. Triggered e-mails help companies turn casual buyers into loyal customers. We anticipate that this change will result in a noticeable increase in repeat customers for our clients. The price of our services will remain the same. For more information, you may contact your marketing account manager directly, call The Ushindi Group at0800205555,orsendane-mail to info@theushindigroup.co.ke."}],"question":"What digital marketing service will The Ushindi Group change based on responses to its survey?","bilingual":"Tập đoàn Ushindi sẽ thay đổi dịch vụ tiếp thị kỹ thuật số nào dựa trên phản hồi từ cuộc khảo sát của mình?","options":["Service A","Service B","Service C","Service D"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Service C\".","vocabList":[{"word":"satisfaction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌsætɪsˈfækʃən/","meaning":"sự thỏa mãn một nhu cầu; thù lao; sự hoàn thành"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"improvement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈpruːv.mənt/","meaning":"sự cải thiện, cải tiến"},{"word":"appropriate","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈproʊpriˌeɪt/","meaning":"thích hợp; lắp"}],"optionMeanings":["Dịch vụ A","Dịch vụ B","Dịch vụ C","Dịch vụ DB ẢN DỊCH: Tới: Marcella Wairimu <m.wairimu@theushindigroup.co.ke> Từ: Henry Bunyasi < h.bunyasi@theushindigroup.co.ke> Ngày: 3 tháng 2 Chủ đề: Khảo sátKính gửi cô Wairimu, Chúng tôi đã yêu cầu quản lý để tìm hiểu mức độ hài lòng của khách hàng đối với dịch vụ tiếp theo là số lượng kỹ thuật của chúng tôi. Để đạt được mục tiêu đó, chúng tôi sẽ tiến hành một cuộc khảo sát trong tháng tư. Với chuyên môn của cô trong thiết kế và phân tích khảo sát, tôi muốn cô phát hiện một khảo sátsự hài lòng của khách hàng bao gồm giá cả các dịch vụ tiếp theo thịkỹthuật số mà chúng tôi quảng cáo trên trang web của mình. Nó sẽ được gửi đến từng khách hàng trong thời gian dài của chúng tôi ởKenya. Vui lòng chuẩn bị sẵn một bản nháp trước ngày 17 tháng 2 và gửi nó cho các thành viên trong nhóm quản lý để xem xét. Cô và tôi sẽ trình bày ý kiến ​​tại cuộc họp của nhóm quản lý vào ngày 23 tháng 2 lúc 2:00 chiều. Trân trọng, Henry Bunyasihttps://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey Về chúng tôi Dịch vụ Kế hoạch và giá cả Xin vui lòng cung cấp công cụ khả thi 1 tháng 5 Tại Tập đoàn Ushindi, chúng tôi cố gắng cung cấp cho bạn các dịch vụtiếp theo hiển thị chất lượng hàng đầu. Đó là lý do tại sao chúng tôi yêu cầu các khách hàng lâu năm của mình đã hoàn thành bản khảo sát ngắn về các dịch vụ nàytiếp theo kỹ thuật số của chúng tôi. Với thông tin bạn cung cấp, chúng tôi có thể xác định các lĩnh vực cần cải thiện. Vui lòng gửi câu trả lờilời khuyên của bạn vào hoặc trước ngày 19 tháng 5. Cảm ơn bạn đã giúp chúng tôi phục vụ bạn tốt hơn. Vui lòng nhập một trong các giá trị thích hợp cho từng dịch vụ. 1 = rất không hài lòng, 2 = không hài lòng, 3 = không cóý kiến, 4 = hài lòng, 5 = rấthài lòngDịch vụ tiếp thịkỹthuật số A. Quảng cáo trên mạng xã hộiB. Tạo nội dung, bao gồm nội dung bằng văn bản, hình ảnh và videoC. Tiếp thị qua email tới khách hàng hiện tại và tiềm năng khách hàngD. Phát triển và thiết kế ứng dụng di động và web Tên khách hàng (tùy chọn):[ https://www.theushindigroup.co.ke/services_survey Về chúng tôi Dịch vụ Kếhoạch và giá cả Tin tức công nghệNhững cải tiến đối thoại với dịch vụ của chúng tôi để ngăn chặn phản hồi của khách hàng, Tập đoàn Ushindi sẽ giới thiệu chiến lược tiếp theo email mới vào ngày 15 tháng 7. Trọng tâm mới của chúng tôi sẽ là các e - tôi ôi. E - thư được gửi tự động dựa trên hành vi của khách hàng và có tỷ lệlỗi trả lời cao hơn nhiều so với các e - hệ thống truyền thư tiếp theo. Các e -mail giúp các công ty mua bình thường thành khách hàng trung thành. Chúng tôi dự kiến ​​rằng sự thay đổi này sẽ dẫn đến sự tăng cường kể về số lượng khách hàng thường xuyên cho khách hàng của chúng tôi. Giá của các dịch vụ của chúng tôi sẽ giữ Nguyên. Để biết thêm thông tin, bạn có thể liên kết hệ thống tiếp theo với người quản lý tài khoản tiếp theo của mình, hãy gọi Tập đoànUshindi theo số0800 205 555 hoặc gửi e - gửi thư đến info@theushindigroup.co.ke."]},{"questionNum":"191","passageTitle":"Director Rubio Celebrated | the horror classic That House.","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nDirector Rubio Celebrated | the horror classic That House.\n\nMERRINGTON(July 20)—Although Pedro | Rubioretired from film making atage65\n\nRubio retired from directing ten years ago, after almost 40 years of directing, but he has his award-winning film sstill influence kept busy. Most recently, he has been\n\ntoday''s cinema. | working as a guest lecturer at the nearby\n\nRubio''s childhood home was near a Weberton Film School.\n\nmovie house, where he fell in love with the | Readers will be pleased to hear that our\n\nart form. He saw several movies a week, own Merrington Cinema will be showing sometimes watching the same movie Rubio''s films throughout August. Whether\n\nmultiple times. | you are a long time fan or have never seen a\n\nHis extensive familiarity with a range of Rubio film, you will surely enjoy this genres is-app a rent in his work. Titles range offering at Merrington Cinema. from the romantic Send Me Some Roses to\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.merringtoncinema.com Home | Schedule | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nChoose Your Own Double Feature\n\nIn August, we will celebrate the acclaimed director Pedro Rubio''s birthday by showing many of his movies. And you can purchase tickets to two movies for the price of one! Rubio made the films listed below at the beginning of his directing career. See the Schedule page for the complete list of films and their weekly viewing times.\n\nPut a Roof on It, Comedy,102minutes Construction workers do their best to build a wealthyman''s dream home while his brothertries to take over the project.\n\nThrough a Diamond Rain, Science Fiction,124minutes Two teams of researchers travel to Neptune and try to send their findings back to Earth.\n\nWeekends and Memories, Drama,115minutes A group of old friends gather at a country house and discover that much has changed since they were last together. This film won the Gold Dreamer Award.\n\nThe Strange Drive, Western,107minutes Cowboys on a cattle drive encounter a series of interesting and unusual strangers.\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nhttps://www.merringtoncinema.com/reviews Home | Schedule | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nI recently read a great article about director Pedro Rubio. It contained a lot of information about his work and life, including some surprising information about what he has been doing since he retired from film making. The article also mentioned that Merrington Cinema would be showing his films. So I went to the cinema''s Web site and saw the two-for-one deal. I thought this would be an excellent way to spend a Saturday, so I wentl I saw two wonderful movies. One of the films I saw was new to me:it was about scientists ona mission in space.I loved it!\n\nFor a movie fan like me, Merrington Cinema''s promotion was perfect. I understand there will be a similar promotion for Meredeth Bui''s films in October. I''ll be sure to take advantage of great offers like this again.\n\n-Talia Pak","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Director Rubio Celebrated | the horror classic That House.\n\nMERRINGTON(July 20)—Although Pedro | Rubioretired from film making atage65\n\nRubio retired from directing ten years ago, after almost 40 years of directing, but he has his award-winning film sstill influence kept busy. Most recently, he has been\n\ntoday''s cinema. | working as a guest lecturer at the nearby\n\nRubio''s childhood home was near a Weberton Film School.\n\nmovie house, where he fell in love with the | Readers will be pleased to hear that our\n\nart form. He saw several movies a week, own Merrington Cinema will be showing sometimes watching the same movie Rubio''s films throughout August. Whether\n\nmultiple times. | you are a long time fan or have never seen a\n\nHis extensive familiarity with a range of Rubio film, you will surely enjoy this genres is-app a rent in his work. Titles range offering at Merrington Cinema. from the romantic Send Me Some Roses to"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"https://www.merringtoncinema.com Home | Schedule | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nChoose Your Own Double Feature\n\nIn August, we will celebrate the acclaimed director Pedro Rubio''s birthday by showing many of his movies. And you can purchase tickets to two movies for the price of one! Rubio made the films listed below at the beginning of his directing career. See the Schedule page for the complete list of films and their weekly viewing times.\n\nPut a Roof on It, Comedy,102minutes Construction workers do their best to build a wealthyman''s dream home while his brothertries to take over the project.\n\nThrough a Diamond Rain, Science Fiction,124minutes Two teams of researchers travel to Neptune and try to send their findings back to Earth.\n\nWeekends and Memories, Drama,115minutes A group of old friends gather at a country house and discover that much has changed since they were last together. This film won the Gold Dreamer Award.\n\nThe Strange Drive, Western,107minutes Cowboys on a cattle drive encounter a series of interesting and unusual strangers."},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"https://www.merringtoncinema.com/reviews Home | Schedule | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nI recently read a great article about director Pedro Rubio. It contained a lot of information about his work and life, including some surprising information about what he has been doing since he retired from film making. The article also mentioned that Merrington Cinema would be showing his films. So I went to the cinema''s Web site and saw the two-for-one deal. I thought this would be an excellent way to spend a Saturday, so I wentl I saw two wonderful movies. One of the films I saw was new to me:it was about scientists ona mission in space.I loved it!\n\nFor a movie fan like me, Merrington Cinema''s promotion was perfect. I understand there will be a similar promotion for Meredeth Bui''s films in October. I''ll be sure to take advantage of great offers like this again.\n\n-Talia Pak"}],"question":"According to the article, how did Mr.Rubio become interested in the cinema?","bilingual":"Theo bài báo, ông Rubio đã quan tâm đến điện ảnh như thế nào?","options":["His family worked in the movie business.","He participated in a film club at school.","He visited a movie theater frequently in his youth.","He used to be a ticket seller in a movie theater."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"He visited a movie theater frequently in his youth.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"xây dựng; kết cấu; ngành xây dựng tòa nhà"},{"word":"participate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pɑrˈtɪsəˌpeɪt/","meaning":"được tham gia; tham gia vào"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"frequently","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈfrikwɛntli/","meaning":"thường xuyên; thường"}],"optionMeanings":["Gia đình anh làm nghề kinh doanh điện ảnh.","Anh ấy đã tham gia câu lạc bộ điện ảnh ở trường.","Anh ấy thường xuyên đến rạp chiếu phim khi còn trẻ.","Anh ấy từng là nhân viên bán vé ở rạp chiếu phim."]},{"questionNum":"192","passageTitle":"Director Rubio Celebrated | the horror classic That House.","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nDirector Rubio Celebrated | the horror classic That House.\n\nMERRINGTON(July 20)—Although Pedro | Rubioretired from film making atage65\n\nRubio retired from directing ten years ago, after almost 40 years of directing, but he has his award-winning film sstill influence kept busy. Most recently, he has been\n\ntoday''s cinema. | working as a guest lecturer at the nearby\n\nRubio''s childhood home was near a Weberton Film School.\n\nmovie house, where he fell in love with the | Readers will be pleased to hear that our\n\nart form. He saw several movies a week, own Merrington Cinema will be showing sometimes watching the same movie Rubio''s films throughout August. Whether\n\nmultiple times. | you are a long time fan or have never seen a\n\nHis extensive familiarity with a range of Rubio film, you will surely enjoy this genres is-app a rent in his work. Titles range offering at Merrington Cinema. from the romantic Send Me Some Roses to\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.merringtoncinema.com Home | Schedule | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nChoose Your Own Double Feature\n\nIn August, we will celebrate the acclaimed director Pedro Rubio''s birthday by showing many of his movies. And you can purchase tickets to two movies for the price of one! Rubio made the films listed below at the beginning of his directing career. See the Schedule page for the complete list of films and their weekly viewing times.\n\nPut a Roof on It, Comedy,102minutes Construction workers do their best to build a wealthyman''s dream home while his brothertries to take over the project.\n\nThrough a Diamond Rain, Science Fiction,124minutes Two teams of researchers travel to Neptune and try to send their findings back to Earth.\n\nWeekends and Memories, Drama,115minutes A group of old friends gather at a country house and discover that much has changed since they were last together. This film won the Gold Dreamer Award.\n\nThe Strange Drive, Western,107minutes Cowboys on a cattle drive encounter a series of interesting and unusual strangers.\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nhttps://www.merringtoncinema.com/reviews Home | Schedule | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nI recently read a great article about director Pedro Rubio. It contained a lot of information about his work and life, including some surprising information about what he has been doing since he retired from film making. The article also mentioned that Merrington Cinema would be showing his films. So I went to the cinema''s Web site and saw the two-for-one deal. I thought this would be an excellent way to spend a Saturday, so I wentl I saw two wonderful movies. One of the films I saw was new to me:it was about scientists ona mission in space.I loved it!\n\nFor a movie fan like me, Merrington Cinema''s promotion was perfect. I understand there will be a similar promotion for Meredeth Bui''s films in October. I''ll be sure to take advantage of great offers like this again.\n\n-Talia Pak","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Director Rubio Celebrated | the horror classic That House.\n\nMERRINGTON(July 20)—Although Pedro | Rubioretired from film making atage65\n\nRubio retired from directing ten years ago, after almost 40 years of directing, but he has his award-winning film sstill influence kept busy. Most recently, he has been\n\ntoday''s cinema. | working as a guest lecturer at the nearby\n\nRubio''s childhood home was near a Weberton Film School.\n\nmovie house, where he fell in love with the | Readers will be pleased to hear that our\n\nart form. He saw several movies a week, own Merrington Cinema will be showing sometimes watching the same movie Rubio''s films throughout August. Whether\n\nmultiple times. | you are a long time fan or have never seen a\n\nHis extensive familiarity with a range of Rubio film, you will surely enjoy this genres is-app a rent in his work. Titles range offering at Merrington Cinema. from the romantic Send Me Some Roses to"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"https://www.merringtoncinema.com Home | Schedule | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nChoose Your Own Double Feature\n\nIn August, we will celebrate the acclaimed director Pedro Rubio''s birthday by showing many of his movies. And you can purchase tickets to two movies for the price of one! Rubio made the films listed below at the beginning of his directing career. See the Schedule page for the complete list of films and their weekly viewing times.\n\nPut a Roof on It, Comedy,102minutes Construction workers do their best to build a wealthyman''s dream home while his brothertries to take over the project.\n\nThrough a Diamond Rain, Science Fiction,124minutes Two teams of researchers travel to Neptune and try to send their findings back to Earth.\n\nWeekends and Memories, Drama,115minutes A group of old friends gather at a country house and discover that much has changed since they were last together. This film won the Gold Dreamer Award.\n\nThe Strange Drive, Western,107minutes Cowboys on a cattle drive encounter a series of interesting and unusual strangers."},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"https://www.merringtoncinema.com/reviews Home | Schedule | Reviews | Contact Us\n\nI recently read a great article about director Pedro Rubio. It contained a lot of information about his work and life, including some surprising information about what he has been doing since he retired from film making. The article also mentioned that Merrington Cinema would be showing his films. So I went to the cinema''s Web site and saw the two-for-one deal. I thought this would be an excellent way to spend a Saturday, so I wentl I saw two wonderful movies. One of the films I saw was new to me:it was about scientists ona mission in space.I loved it!\n\nFor a movie fan like me, Merrington Cinema''s promotion was perfect. I understand there will be a similar promotion for Meredeth Bui''s films in October. I''ll be sure to take advantage of great offers like this again.\n\n-Talia Pak"}],"question":"According to the first Web page, why is Merrington Cinema offering a promotion?","bilingual":"","options":["It recently opened and wants to attract customers.","It is celebrating a director''s birthday.","It has partnered with a movie studio to show certain movies.","It wants to advertise its new upgraded premises."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It is celebrating a director''s birthday.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","me