    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Cardinal Street Project-Update","passageText":"Cardinal Street Project-Update\n\nBecause of unusually wet and cold weather conditions, the road closure on Cardinal Street between Lee Drive and Petunia Lane will be extended until late spring. Construction will continue; however, final paving on Cardinal Street cannot occur until the weather conditions improve. Workers will begin the pavement work once construction of the bridge on Cardinal Street has been completed. If you have questions or comments, please contact Vy Nguyen in the city planning office at615-555-0184.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Cardinal Street Project-Update\n\nBecause of unusually wet and cold weather conditions, the road closure on Cardinal Street between Lee Drive and Petunia Lane will be extended until late spring. Construction will continue; however, final paving on Cardinal Street cannot occur until the weather conditions improve. Workers will begin the pavement work once construction of the bridge on Cardinal Street has been completed. If you have questions or comments, please contact Vy Nguyen in the city planning office at615-555-0184."}],"question":"What is a purpose of the notice?","bilingual":"Mục đích của thông báo là gì?","options":["To report a change in weather patterns","To announce a new detour route","To explain a change in road construction plans","To highlight causes of road deterioration"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"To explain a change in road construction plans\".","vocabList":[{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"xây dựng; kết cấu; ngành xây dựng tòa nhà"},{"word":"conditions","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈdɪʃənz/","meaning":"điều kiện"},{"word":"highlight","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"