e farm"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Free buckets for fruit gathering\".","vocabList":[{"word":"wednesday","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈwɛnzˌdeɪ/","meaning":"Thứ Tư"},{"word":"purchase","pos":"Verb (Động từ)","level":"B1","ipa":"/ˈpɜːrtʃəs/","meaning":"mua hàng"},{"word":"visitor","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈvɪzɪtər/","meaning":"khách mời; chim di cư"},{"word":"provide","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/prəˈvaɪd/","meaning":"cung cấp; cấp ; để thiết lập; cung cấp"}],"optionMeanings":["Xô thu thập trái cây miễn phí (B ) Giỏ dã ngoại theo yêu cầu (C) Các mẫu bánh nướng và mứt (D) Chuyến tham quan trang trại150. Điều gì được chỉ ra về khu chợ? (A) Nó có một khu vực đậu xe mới.","Nó bán các sản phẩm làm từ đào.","Nó thuộc quyền quản lý mới.","Chương trình này mở cửa hàng ngày trong tuần."]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"George''s Orchard Farm 2232AlpineLane Pick your own! Select from five variet","passageText":"George''s Orchard Farm 2232AlpineLane Pick your own! Select from five varieties of juicy peaches in our orchard! Buckets provided at no cost. Stop by our market to purchase jams, pies, andsaucesmadefrom farm-fresh fruit. We sell lunches to enjoy in our picnic area. Follow the signs ahead for designated parking areas.\n\nWednesday to Friday,12 noon t05:00 P.M. Saturday and Sunday,10:00 A.M. t06:00p.M.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"George''s Orchard Farm 2232AlpineLane Pick your own! Select from five varieties of juicy peaches in our orchard! Buckets provided at no cost. Stop by our market to purchase jams, pies, andsaucesmadefrom farm-fresh fruit. We sell lunches to enjoy in our picnic area. Follow the signs ahead for designated parking areas.\n\nWednesday to Friday,12 noon t05:00 P.M. Saturday and Sunday,10:00 A.M. t06:00p.M."}],"question":"What is indicated about the market?","bilingual":"","options":["It has a new parking area.","It sells products made with peaches.","It is under new management.","It is open every day of the week."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It sells products made with peaches.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"management","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈmænɪʤmənt/","meaning":"người của nhóm người điều hành và quản lý một"},{"word":"wednesday","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈwɛnzˌdeɪ/","meaning":"Thứ Tư"},{"word":"products","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈprɑdəkts/","meaning":"sản phẩm"},{"word":"purchase","pos":"Verb (Động từ)","level":"B1","ipa":"/ˈpɜːrtʃəs/","meaning":"mua hàng"}]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"To: | Thandiwe Ngxongo <tngxongo@fancyandformal.co.uk> From: | Customer Ser","passageText":"To: | Thandiwe Ngxongo <tngxongo@fancyandformal.co.uk> From: | Customer Service <service@homethings.co.uk> Date: | 260ctober\n\nSubject: | Perform a lintroller(ModelPL293)\n\nDear Ms. Ngxongo,\n\nI am sorry to inform you that the Perform a lint roller you selected is on back order because of a shortage of its ultra-strong adhesive. We expect a new shipment within three to four weeks. However, if you prefer not to wait, Home Things will be glad to ship the Extreme2 lint roller to you at no extra charge. The Extreme2 model includes a perforated sticky tape for ease of use and comes with two refills. Like the Perform a model, it has a strong adhesive that effectively removes hair, fuzz, lint, and dust from most fabrics.\n\nYou can request this similar product to be shipped to you in place of the one you ordered, as long as you make the change to your order before the original item ships. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nSincerely,\n\nGlen McCraine Customer Service Specialist Home Things","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Thandiwe Ngxongo <tngxongo@fancyandformal.co.uk> From: | Customer Service <service@homethings.co.uk> Date: | 260ctober\n\nSubject: | Perform a lintroller(ModelPL293)\n\nDear Ms. Ngxongo,\n\nI am sorry to inform you that the Perform a lint roller you selected is on back order because of a shortage of its ultra-strong adhesive. We expect a new shipment within three to four weeks. However, if you prefer not to wait, Home Things will be glad to ship the Extreme2 lint roller to you at no extra charge. The Extreme2 model includes a perforated sticky tape for ease of use and comes with two refills. Like the Perform a model, it has a strong adhesive that effectively removes hair, fuzz, lint, and dust from most fabrics.\n\nYou can request this similar product to be shipped to you in place of the one you ordered, as long as you make the change to your order before the original item ships. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nSincerely,\n\nGlen McCraine Customer Service Specialist Home Things"}],"question":"Why did Mr. McCraine write the e-mail?","bilingual":"Tại sao ông McCraine lại viết e - thư à?","options":["To highlight a new product","To apologize for a delay","To respond to a question","To provide details about a return"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To apologize for a delay\".","vocabList":[{"word":"effectively","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈfek.tɪv.li/","meaning":"có hiệu quả"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"},{"word":"highlight","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈhaɪ.laɪt/","meaning":"điểm nổi bật; làm nổi bật"},{"word":"apologize","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɑː.lə.dʒaɪz/","meaning":"xin lỗi"}],"optionMeanings":["Để làm nổi bật một sản phẩm mới","Xin lỗi vì sự chậm trễ","Để trả lời một câu hỏi","Để cung cấp thông tin chi tiết về việc hoàn trả"]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"To: | Thandiwe Ngxongo <tngxongo@fancyandformal.co.uk> From: | Customer Ser","passageText":"To: | Thandiwe Ngxongo <tngxongo@fancyandformal.co.uk> From: | Customer Service <service@homethings.co.uk> Date: | 260ctober\n\nSubject: | Perform a lintroller(ModelPL293)\n\nDear Ms. Ngxongo,\n\nI am sorry to inform you that the Perform a lint roller you selected is on back order because of a shortage of its ultra-strong adhesive. We expect a new shipment within three to four weeks. However, if you prefer not to wait, Home Things will be glad to ship the Extreme2 lint roller to you at no extra charge. The Extreme2 model includes a perforated sticky tape for ease of use and comes with two refills. Like the Perform a model, it has a strong adhesive that effectively removes hair, fuzz, lint, and dust from most fabrics.\n\nYou can request this similar product to be shipped to you in place of the one you ordered, as long as you make the change to your order before the original item ships. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nSincerely,\n\nGlen McCraine Customer Service Specialist Home Things","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Thandiwe Ngxongo <tngxongo@fancyandformal.co.uk> From: | Customer Service <service@homethings.co.uk> Date: | 260ctober\n\nSubject: | Perform a lintroller(ModelPL293)\n\nDear Ms. Ngxongo,\n\nI am sorry to inform you that the Perform a lint roller you selected is on back order because of a shortage of its ultra-strong adhesive. We expect a new shipment within three to four weeks. However, if you prefer not to wait, Home Things will be glad to ship the Extreme2 lint roller to you at no extra charge. The Extreme2 model includes a perforated sticky tape for ease of use and comes with two refills. Like the Perform a model, it has a strong adhesive that effectively removes hair, fuzz, lint, and dust from most fabrics.\n\nYou can request this similar product to be shipped to you in place of the one you ordered, as long as you make the change to your order before the original item ships. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nSincerely,\n\nGlen McCraine Customer Service Specialist Home Things"}],"question":"What is indicated about the Extreme2 lint roller?","bilingual":"Con lăn xơ vải Extreme 2 được chỉ định gì?","options":["It is less expensive than the Perform a model.","It comes with additional tape.","It is more effective than the Perform a model.","It has received high user ratings."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It comes with additional tape.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"effectively","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈfek.tɪv.li/","meaning":"có hiệu quả"},{"word":"additional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"thêm vào, phụ thêm"},{"word":"understand","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌʌn.dɚˈstænd/","meaning":"hiểu, nắm bắt được"},{"word":"expensive","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspen.sɪv/","meaning":"đắt tiền, đắt đỏ"}],"optionMeanings":["Rẻ hơn mẫu Performancea.","Nó đi kèm với băng bổ sung.","Nó hiệu quả hơn mô hình Performancea.","Nó đã nhận được xếp hạng người dùng cao. BÃN DỊCH:"]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Sen Chai (6:51 P.M.): We''re on a dinner break from the negotiation meeting.","passageText":"Sen Chai (6:51 P.M.): We''re on a dinner break from the negotiation meeting. Mr.Geraci did not accept our offer. Mateo Michelacci(6:52P.M.): That''s frustrating. Do you think if we offered another10,000hewouldsell? You and Ihave agreed that this is the right facility:it''s ina convenient location for customers, the access from the highway is perfect for incoming and outgoing deliveries, and potential tenants have already expressed interest.\n\nSen Chai (6:53 P.M.): I can''t see that happening. But I''ll try again. How high can Igo? Mateo Michelacci (6:54P.M.): The bank approved us for another 20,000. Offer Mr.Geraci10,000more, plus we will fix any building code violations at our expense. Goup to the full 20,000 only if necessary. Sen Chai (6:55P.M.): I''ll do my best.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Sen Chai (6:51 P.M.): We''re on a dinner break from the negotiation meeting. Mr.Geraci did not accept our offer. Mateo Michelacci(6:52P.M.): That''s frustrating. Do you think if we offered another10,000hewouldsell? You and Ihave agreed that this is the right facility:it''s ina convenient location for customers, the access from the highway is perfect for incoming and outgoing deliveries, and potential tenants have already expressed interest.\n\nSen Chai (6:53 P.M.): I can''t see that happening. But I''ll try again. How high can Igo? Mateo Michelacci (6:54P.M.): The bank approved us for another 20,000. Offer Mr.Geraci10,000more, plus we will fix any building code violations at our expense. Goup to the full 20,000 only if necessary. Sen Chai (6:55P.M.): I''ll do my best."}],"question":"What is suggested about Mr. Geraci?","bilingual":"Điều gì được gợi ý về ông Geraci?","options":["He owns a building.","He recently renovated a facility.","He will approve a loan.","He will meet with Mr.Michelacci."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"He owns a building.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"convenient","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈvinjənt/","meaning":"thoải mái; hữu ích; có thể sử dụng được"},{"word":"renovated","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛnəˌveɪtɪd/","meaning":"đã được cải tạo"},{"word":"potential","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pəˈtenʃl/","meaning":"tiềm năng; tiềm tàng"},{"word":"necessary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈnɛsəˌsɛri/","meaning":"một cái gì đó là cần thiết hoặc bắt buộc; yếu tố cần thiết của"}],"optionMeanings":["Anh ấy sở hữu một tòa nhà.","Gần đây anh ấy đã cải tạo một cơ sở.","Anh ta sẽ chấp thuận một khoản vay.","Anh ấy sẽ gặp Mr.. Michelacci."]},{"questionNum":"154","passageTitle":"Sen Chai (6:51 P.M.): We''re on a dinner break from the negotiation meeting.","passageText":"Sen Chai (6:51 P.M.): We''re on a dinner break from the negotiation meeting. Mr.Geraci did not accept our offer. Mateo Michelacci(6:52P.M.): That''s frustrating. Do you think if we offered another10,000hewouldsell? You and Ihave agreed that this is the right facility:it''s ina convenient location for customers, the access from the highway is perfect for incoming and outgoing deliveries, and potential tenants have already expressed interest.\n\nSen Chai (6:53 P.M.): I can''t see that happening. But I''ll try again. How high can Igo? Mateo Michelacci (6:54P.M.): The bank approved us for another 20,000. Offer Mr.Geraci10,000more, plus we will fix any building code violations at our expense. Goup to the full 20,000 only if necessary. Sen Chai (6:55P.M.): I''ll do my best.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Sen Chai (6:51 P.M.): We''re on a dinner break from the negotiation meeting. Mr.Geraci did not accept our offer. Mateo Michelacci(6:52P.M.): That''s frustrating. Do you think if we offered another10,000hewouldsell? You and Ihave agreed that this is the right facility:it''s ina convenient location for customers, the access from the highway is perfect for incoming and outgoing deliveries, and potential tenants have already expressed interest.\n\nSen Chai (6:53 P.M.): I can''t see that happening. But I''ll try again. How high can Igo? Mateo Michelacci (6:54P.M.): The bank approved us for another 20,000. Offer Mr.Geraci10,000more, plus we will fix any building code violations at our expense. Goup to the full 20,000 only if necessary. Sen Chai (6:55P.M.): I''ll do my best."}],"question":"At6:53p.M.,what does Ms.Chaimost likely mean when she writes,\"I can''t see that happening\"?","bilingual":"Vào lúc 6:53 chiều, rất có thể cô Chai có ý gì khi viết “Tôi không thể thấy điều đó xảy ra”?","options":["She thinks that renters will be difficult to attract.","She believes that an offer will still be rejected.","She doubts that shipping will be easy to organize.","She thinks that clients will have trouble finding a location."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"She believes that an offer will still be rejected.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"convenient","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈvinjənt/","meaning":"thoải mái; hữu ích; có thể sử dụng được"},{"word":"difficult","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈdɪfəkəlt/","meaning":"cứng; rắc rối; phức tap; tổ hợp"},{"word":"potential","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pəˈtenʃl/","meaning":"tiềm năng; tiềm tàng"},{"word":"necessary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈnɛsəˌsɛri/","meaning":"một cái gì đó là cần thiết hoặc bắt buộc; yếu tố cần thiết của"}],"optionMeanings":["Cô cho rằng sẽ khó thu hút được người thuê nhà.","Cô ấy tin rằng lời đề nghị vẫn sẽ bị từ chối.","Cô nghi ngờ rằng việc vận chuyển sẽ dễ dàng tổ chức.","Cô ấy nghĩ rằng khách hàng sẽ gặp khó khăn khi tìm địa điểm. BÃN DỊCH:"]},{"questionNum":"155","passageTitle":"Blossom Sales Systems","passageText":"Blossom Sales Systems\n\nBlossom Sales Systems (BSS) makes running your business a breeze with its sleek, intuitive point-of-sale devices. As a small business owner, you have many responsibilities and a reputation to build.BSS has all the tools needed to make transactions safe, seamless, and hassle-free.\n\nEnjoy the convenience of a system that has you covered wherever you conduct your business. Whether you sell ina store, over the phone, or online, BsS simplifies the transaction process 