) Cô ấy cần ít nhất hai người để giúp cô ấy ở Chợ Willi. (B) Cô ấy đã đặt trước hai vé cho một sự kiện ở Công viên Thành phố. (C) Cô ấy dự định gặp ông Suh trong khoảng hai giờ nữa. (D) Cô ấy muốn rời văn phòng vào khoảng hai giờ chiều nay."]},{"questionNum":"171","passageTitle":"Monica Zia(8:27A.M.)Hi, Yuji and Sung-ho.I wonder if one of you could help ","passageText":"Monica Zia(8:27A.M.)Hi, Yuji and Sung-ho.I wonder if one of you could help me later today. Dejani Jones was going to help, but she''s going to be out of the office today. Yuji Saito (8:28A.M.)That''s too bad. Did she say why? Monica Zia (8:28 A.M.) She said she had a slight cold but that she should be able to work fromhomeonthedataanalysesforherclients. Sung-ho Suh (8:29 A.M.) So, she won''t be coming in at all today? Monica Zia (8:31 A.M.) No. And Dejani and I were going to go to Willi''s Market to buy food and beverages for tomorrow''s office picnic. You remember, right? Saturday at noon at City Park. Anyhow, Dejani has a car and was going to drive us to the store and use her credit card to purchase the supplies. I know that both of you drive to work, so I thought one of you could help. Sung-ho Suh (8:32 A.M.) When were you thinking of going? Yuji Saito (8:32 A.M.) Sure. I can help, and we can use my credit card. Monica Zia (8:33A.M.)Around two. Yuji Saito (8:34 A.M.) No problem. Just stop by my cubicle, and we can take my car to go to the store. Sung-ho Suh (8:35 A.M.) That''s great, Yuji.I have several meetings this afternoon, so I wouldn''t be able to get away. Monica Zia (8:35 A.M.) Thanks, Yuji. I''ll see you this afternoon.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Monica Zia(8:27A.M.)Hi, Yuji and Sung-ho.I wonder if one of you could help me later today. Dejani Jones was going to help, but she''s going to be out of the office today. Yuji Saito (8:28A.M.)That''s too bad. Did she say why? Monica Zia (8:28 A.M.) She said she had a slight cold but that she should be able to work fromhomeonthedataanalysesforherclients. Sung-ho Suh (8:29 A.M.) So, she won''t be coming in at all today? Monica Zia (8:31 A.M.) No. And Dejani and I were going to go to Willi''s Market to buy food and beverages for tomorrow''s office picnic. You remember, right? Saturday at noon at City Park. Anyhow, Dejani has a car and was going to drive us to the store and use her credit card to purchase the supplies. I know that both of you drive to work, so I thought one of you could help. Sung-ho Suh (8:32 A.M.) When were you thinking of going? Yuji Saito (8:32 A.M.) Sure. I can help, and we can use my credit card. Monica Zia (8:33A.M.)Around two. Yuji Saito (8:34 A.M.) No problem. Just stop by my cubicle, and we can take my car to go to the store. Sung-ho Suh (8:35 A.M.) That''s great, Yuji.I have several meetings this afternoon, so I wouldn''t be able to get away. Monica Zia (8:35 A.M.) Thanks, Yuji. I''ll see you this afternoon."}],"question":"At 8:33A.M., what does Ms.Zia mean when she writes,\"Around two\"?","bilingual":"","options":["She needs at least two people to help her at Willi''s Market.","She has reserved two tickets for an event at City Park.","She plans to meet with Mr. Suh in about two hours.","She wants to leave the office this afternoon at about two o''clock."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"She wants to leave the office this afternoon at about two o''clock.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"beverages","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɛvrɪʤɪz/","meaning":"Đồ uống"},{"word":"tomorrow","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/təˈmɑˌroʊ/","meaning":"Ngày mai"},{"word":"remember","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈmɛmbər/","meaning":"nhớ lại tâm trí; để giữ lại trong tâm trí của một người; để có một"},{"word":"purchase","pos":"Verb (Động từ)","level":"B1","ipa":"/ˈpɜːrtʃəs/","meaning":"mua hàng"}]},{"questionNum":"172","passageTitle":"To: | Dorota Kucharski <dkucharski@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> F","passageText":"To: | Dorota Kucharski <dkucharski@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> From: | Lucia no Moretti <lmoretti@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> Date: | 8 August\n\nSubject: | Research results\n\nMs.Kucharski,\n\nThe following is a summary of what I have learned in my research about where to hold our next annual technology conference in June of next year. In Rome, the best option I have found is Hotel al Ponte. The total cost for conference eventstherewouldbeE31,500.[1]—.Individual hotel roomswouldcost80pernight for participants. In the event that attendance is high, we could also house participants in the nearby Hotel Milvio at 120 per night. - [2] -- I also looked into hotels in Genoa and Florence, but I could not find any that would be much cheaper in overall conference costs.—[3],More importantly, I am concerned that the greater cost of flights to those smaller cities could discourage some attendees. Rome, on the other hand, has affordable direct flights from most European cities.[4]- It will also be more affordable for our colleagues coming from Buenos Aires. If you would like to pursue the Hotel al Ponte option, I will provide a detailed write-up of the anticipated costs and of the amenities offered by the hotel. Best, Lucia no Moretti Secretary, International Technological Society","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Dorota Kucharski <dkucharski@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> From: | Lucia no Moretti <lmoretti@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> Date: | 8 August\n\nSubject: | Research results\n\nMs.Kucharski,\n\nThe following is a summary of what I have learned in my research about where to hold our next annual technology conference in June of next year. In Rome, the best option I have found is Hotel al Ponte. The total cost for conference eventstherewouldbeE31,500.[1]—.Individual hotel roomswouldcost80pernight for participants. In the event that attendance is high, we could also house participants in the nearby Hotel Milvio at 120 per night. - [2] -- I also looked into hotels in Genoa and Florence, but I could not find any that would be much cheaper in overall conference costs.—[3],More importantly, I am concerned that the greater cost of flights to those smaller cities could discourage some attendees. Rome, on the other hand, has affordable direct flights from most European cities.[4]- It will also be more affordable for our colleagues coming from Buenos Aires. If you would like to pursue the Hotel al Ponte option, I will provide a detailed write-up of the anticipated costs and of the amenities offered by the hotel. Best, Lucia no Moretti Secretary, International Technological Society"}],"question":"What is the main purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích chính của e là gì - thư à?","options":["To book travel for a conference","To compare possible venues for a conference","To request a budget increase for organizing a conference","To inquire about the cost of attending a conference"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To compare possible venues for a conference\".","vocabList":[{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"participant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pa:´tisipənt/","meaning":"người tham gia, người tham dự"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"},{"word":"technology","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/tɛkˈnɑləʤi/","meaning":"khoa học nghệ thuật công nghiệp; khoa học ứng dụng"}],"optionMeanings":["Để đặt chuyến du lịch cho một hội nghị","Để so sánh các địa điểm có thể tổ chức hội nghị","Để yêu cầu tăng ngân sách để tổ chức một hội nghị","Để hỏi về chi phí tham dự một hội nghị173. Điều gì được chỉ ra về hội nghị? (A) Nó dành cho các chuyên gia trong ngành du lịch. (B) Nó diễn ra hàng năm. (C) Nó thường được tổ chức ở Buenos Aires. (D) Nó sẽ xảy ra vào tháng 8 năm"]},{"questionNum":"173","passageTitle":"To: | Dorota Kucharski <dkucharski@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> F","passageText":"To: | Dorota Kucharski <dkucharski@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> From: | Lucia no Moretti <lmoretti@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> Date: | 8 August\n\nSubject: | Research results\n\nMs.Kucharski,\n\nThe following is a summary of what I have learned in my research about where to hold our next annual technology conference in June of next year. In Rome, the best option I have found is Hotel al Ponte. The total cost for conference eventstherewouldbeE31,500.[1]—.Individual hotel roomswouldcost80pernight for participants. In the event that attendance is high, we could also house participants in the nearby Hotel Milvio at 120 per night. - [2] -- I also looked into hotels in Genoa and Florence, but I could not find any that would be much cheaper in overall conference costs.—[3],More importantly, I am concerned that the greater cost of flights to those smaller cities could discourage some attendees. Rome, on the other hand, has affordable direct flights from most European cities.[4]- It will also be more affordable for our colleagues coming from Buenos Aires. If you would like to pursue the Hotel al Ponte option, I will provide a detailed write-up of the anticipated costs and of the amenities offered by the hotel. Best, Lucia no Moretti Secretary, International Technological Society","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Dorota Kucharski <dkucharski@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> From: | Lucia no Moretti <lmoretti@internationaltechnologicalsociety.org> Date: | 8 August\n\nSubject: | Research results\n\nMs.Kucharski,\n\nThe following is a summary of what I have learned in my research about where to hold our next annual technology conference in June of next year. In Rome, the best option I have found is Hotel al Ponte. The total cost for conference eventstherewouldbeE31,500.[1]—.Individual hotel roomswouldcost80pernight for participants. In the event that attendance is high, we could also house participants in the nearby Hotel Milvio at 120 per night. - [2] -- I also looked into hotels in Genoa and Florence, but I could not find any that would be much cheaper in overall conference costs.—[3],More importantly, I am concerned that the greater cost of flights to those smaller cities could discourage some attendees. Rome, on the other hand, has affordable direct flights from most European cities.[4]- It will also be more affordable for our colleagues coming from Buenos Aires. If you would like to pursue the Hotel al Ponte option, I will provide a detailed write-up of the anticipated costs and of the amenities offered by the hotel. Best, Lucia no Moretti Secretary, International Technological Society"}],"question":"What is indicated about the conference?","bilingual":"","options":["It is for professionals in the travel industry.","It takes place every year.","It is usually held in Buenos Aires.","It will occur in August."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It takes place every year.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"international","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.t̬ɚˈnæʃ.ən.əl/","meaning":"quốc tế, đa quốc gia"},{"word":"professional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/prə''feʃənl/","meaning":"(thuộc) nghề, (thuộc) nghề nghiệp; có tay nghề"},{"word":"participant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pa:´tisipənt/","meaning":"người tham gia, người tham dự"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"}]},{"questionNum":"174