d by:Ari Kipp Dateposted:August 4 This is my second year subscribing to the Central University Health Newsletter, which! read cover to cover.I''m particularly impressed with the Ask an Expert column, andl always learn something new. This month, for instance, Dr.Stella Boothgives a surprising answer to the question of which pasta is most nutritious.I didn''t know that be an-based pasta even existed, much less how much fiber it contains.I tried it and will never go"}],"question":"What is indicated about the Central University School of Nutrition?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về Trường Dinh dưỡng Đại học Trung ương?","options":["It creates lesson plans for local teachers.","It is headed by Dr. Booth.","It offers online cooking classes.","It has a job opening for a researcher."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It is headed by Dr. Booth.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"subscription","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səbˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đăng ký"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"publication","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌpəblɪˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"quy trình sản xuất và phát hành ấn phẩm;"},{"word":"newsletter","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈnuzˌlɛtər/","meaning":"tạp chí thông tin ngắn định kỳ thường được phân phối"}],"optionMeanings":["Nó tạo giáo án cho giáo viên địa phương.","Nó do Tiến sĩ Booth đứng đầu.","Nơi đây cung cấp các lớp học nấu ăn trực tuyến.","Nó đang có cơ hội việc làm cho nhà nghiên cứu."]},{"questionNum":"180","passageTitle":"https://www.centraluniversity.edu/nutrition/newsletter Home | Customer Serv","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nhttps://www.centraluniversity.edu/nutrition/newsletter Home | Customer Service | Subscribe | Account | Log In\n\nCentral University Health Newsletter-Your Guide to Nutrition and Well-Being\n\nTips on healthful eating are available almost everywhere from TV shows to online cooking forums. It''s often difficult to know whether the advice you encounter is based on scientific evidence. That''s why the Central University Health Newsletter is indispensable. Each month, it delivers informative, easy-to-understand articles that summarize findings by researchers at the Central University School of Nutrition. For example, last April''s issue evaluated nutritional supplements that are sold in supermarkets. The back page features our Ask an Expert column, in which the director of the School of Nutrition answers readers'' questions. A one-year subscription is$20andincludesonlineaccesstoall previous issues. We also offer a 10 percent discount on your first subscription renewal. What''s more, subscribers receive our free weekly\"Healthy Living\"e-mail update, which includes special reports plus links to videos and podcasts. To get started, simply go to our Subscribe page and follow the instructions.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nhttps://www.centraluniversity.edu/nutrition/newsletter/reviews Publication:Central University Health Newsletter ★★★★★ Reviewed by:Ari Kipp Dateposted:August 4 This is my second year subscribing to the Central University Health Newsletter, which! read cover to cover.I''m particularly impressed with the Ask an Expert column, andl always learn something new. This month, for instance, Dr.Stella Boothgives a surprising answer to the question of which pasta is most nutritious.I didn''t know that be an-based pasta even existed, much less how much fiber it contains.I tried it and will never go","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"https://www.centraluniversity.edu/nutrition/newsletter Home | Customer Service | Subscribe | Account | Log In\n\nCentral University Health Newsletter-Your Guide to Nutrition and Well-Being\n\nTips on healthful eating are available almost everywhere from TV shows to online cooking forums. It''s often difficult to know whether the advice you encounter is based on scientific evidence. That''s why the Central University Health Newsletter is indispensable. Each month, it delivers informative, easy-to-understand articles that summarize findings by researchers at the Central University School of Nutrition. For example, last April''s issue evaluated nutritional supplements that are sold in supermarkets. The back page features our Ask an Expert column, in which the director of the School of Nutrition answers readers'' questions. A one-year subscription is$20andincludesonlineaccesstoall previous issues. We also offer a 10 percent discount on your first subscription renewal. What''s more, subscribers receive our free weekly\"Healthy Living\"e-mail update, which includes special reports plus links to videos and podcasts. To get started, simply go to our Subscribe page and follow the instructions."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"https://www.centraluniversity.edu/nutrition/newsletter/reviews Publication:Central University Health Newsletter ★★★★★ Reviewed by:Ari Kipp Dateposted:August 4 This is my second year subscribing to the Central University Health Newsletter, which! read cover to cover.I''m particularly impressed with the Ask an Expert column, andl always learn something new. This month, for instance, Dr.Stella Boothgives a surprising answer to the question of which pasta is most nutritious.I didn''t know that be an-based pasta even existed, much less how much fiber it contains.I tried it and will never go"}],"question":"According to the online review, what isa weakness of the newsletter?","bilingual":"","options":["The limited range of topics","The complexity of the articles","The lack of photographs","The overall length"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"The overall length\".","vocabList":[{"word":"subscription","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səbˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đăng ký"},{"word":"photographs","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈfoʊtəˌgræfs/","meaning":"Ảnh"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"},{"word":"publication","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌpəblɪˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"quy trình sản xuất và phát hành ấn phẩm;"}]},{"questionNum":"181","passageTitle":"Brit-Revision Editing Services Invoice","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nBrit-Revision Editing Services Invoice\n\nFreelance Editor:Lisa Yamashita Invoice Date:30 September Address:178UpsalaRoad LONDON E161DJ Contact:(020)79460612 lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk Stashcash ID: Lisa. Yamashita8\n\nClient Name | Project Description | Date Completed Time\n\nEddie Kent | University thesis editing | 5 September | 2 hours\n\nBen Gallagher | Grant proposal editing | 9 September | 10hours\n\nLydia Quinn of Hyden Interiors Marketing copy editing | 17 September 8.5 hours\n\nWinona Rogers | Journal article editing | 22 September | 2 hours\n\nTony Withers | CV and cover letter editing 28 September 2.5hours\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Lisa Yamashita <lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk> From: | Claudio Aguilar <caguilar@britrevision.co.uk> Date: | 1 October\n\nSubject: | Your recent invoice\n\nDear Lisa, Thank you for sending your invoice for services rendered in the month of September. I Want to com mend you on your superb start as one of our independent freelance editors. Our clients had nothing but positive things to say about your work. As you know, we do not dictate how you structure your workday; instead, Brit-Revision (BRV)guidelines require simply that deadlines be met and that work quality be maintained. You have done both admirably. Also, we will pay you for an additional 30 minutes of work that you did for Mr.Kent. He reported that you did consulting work for him over the phone on a short oral presentation that he created. As for the work that you did for our long-standing corporate client Lydia Quinn, you will see on your receipt that we have paid you at a higher hourly rate. I have initiated the transfer of f750 into your Stashcash account. The funds should appear in your account by tomorrow morning. Sincerely, Claudio Aguilar Accounts Payable, Brit-Revision Editing Services","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Brit-Revision Editing Services Invoice\n\nFreelance Editor:Lisa Yamashita Invoice Date:30 September Address:178UpsalaRoad LONDON E161DJ Contact:(020)79460612 lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk Stashcash ID: Lisa. Yamashita8\n\nClient Name | Project Description | Date Completed Time\n\nEddie Kent | University thesis editing | 5 September | 2 hours\n\nBen Gallagher | Grant proposal editing | 9 September | 10hours\n\nLydia Quinn of Hyden Interiors Marketing copy editing | 17 September 8.5 hours\n\nWinona Rogers | Journal article editing | 22 September | 2 hours\n\nTony Withers | CV and cover letter editing 28 September 2.5hours"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Lisa Yamashita <lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk> From: | Claudio Aguilar <caguilar@britrevision.co.uk> Date: | 1 October\n\nSubject: | Your recent invoice\n\nDear Lisa, Thank you for sending your invoice for services rendered in the month of September. I Want to com mend you on your superb start as one of our independent freelance editors. Our clients had nothing but positive things to say about your work. As you know, we do not dictate how you structure your workday; instead, Brit-Revision (BRV)guidelines require simply that deadlines be met and that work quality be maintained. You have done both admirably. Also, we will pay you for an additional 30 minutes of work that you did for Mr.Kent. He reported that you did consulting work for him over the phone on a short oral presentation that he created. As for the work that you did for our long-standing corporate client Lydia Quinn, you will see on your receipt that we have paid you at a higher hourly rate. I have initiated the transfer of f750 into your Stashcash account. The funds should appear in your account by tomorrow morning. Sincerely, Claudio Aguilar Accounts Payable, Brit-Revision Editing Services"}],"question":"What client of BRV''s is most likely seeking new employment?","bilingual":"Khách hàng nào của BRV có khả năng tìm kiếm việc làm mới nhất?","options":["Mr.Gallagher","Ms. Quinn","Ms. Rogers","Mr. Withers"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Mr. Withers\".","vocabList":[{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"independent","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪndɪˈpɛndənt/","meaning":"miễn phí; tự trị; có chủ quyền; tự chủ; bản thân-"},{"word":"employment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪmˈplɔɪ.mənt/","meaning":"việc làm, sự thuê người làm"}],"optionMeanings":["Ông Gallagher","Cô Quinn","Cô Rogers","Ông Withers182. e làm gì -mail cho biết về cô Yamashita? (A) Cô ấy có thể tự đặt giờ cho mình. (B) Cô ấy đến văn phòng BRV hàng tuần. (C) Cô ấy phải tìm khách hàng mới cho BRV. (D) Cô ấy sẽ sớm đủ điều kiện để được thăng chức."]},{"questionNum":"182","passageTitle":"Brit-Revision Editing Services Invoice","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nBrit-Revision Editing Services Invoice\n\nFreelance Editor:Lisa Yamashita Invoice Date:30 September Address:178UpsalaRoad LONDON E161DJ Contact:(020)79460612 lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk Stashcash ID: Lisa. Yamashita8\n\nClient Name | Project Description | Date Completed Time\n\nEddie Kent | University thesis editing | 5 September | 2 hours\n\nBen Gallagher | Grant propos