ce Editor:Lisa Yamashita Invoice Date:30 September Address:178UpsalaRoad LONDON E161DJ Contact:(020)79460612 lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk Stashcash ID: Lisa. Yamashita8\n\nClient Name | Project Description | Date Completed Time\n\nEddie Kent | University thesis editing | 5 September | 2 hours\n\nBen Gallagher | Grant proposal editing | 9 September | 10hours\n\nLydia Quinn of Hyden Interiors Marketing copy editing | 17 September 8.5 hours\n\nWinona Rogers | Journal article editing | 22 September | 2 hours\n\nTony Withers | CV and cover letter editing 28 September 2.5hours\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Lisa Yamashita <lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk> From: | Claudio Aguilar <caguilar@britrevision.co.uk> Date: | 1 October\n\nSubject: | Your recent invoice\n\nDear Lisa, Thank you for sending your invoice for services rendered in the month of September. I Want to com mend you on your superb start as one of our independent freelance editors. Our clients had nothing but positive things to say about your work. As you know, we do not dictate how you structure your workday; instead, Brit-Revision (BRV)guidelines require simply that deadlines be met and that work quality be maintained. You have done both admirably. Also, we will pay you for an additional 30 minutes of work that you did for Mr.Kent. He reported that you did consulting work for him over the phone on a short oral presentation that he created. As for the work that you did for our long-standing corporate client Lydia Quinn, you will see on your receipt that we have paid you at a higher hourly rate. I have initiated the transfer of f750 into your Stashcash account. The funds should appear in your account by tomorrow morning. Sincerely, Claudio Aguilar Accounts Payable, Brit-Revision Editing Services","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"Brit-Revision Editing Services Invoice\n\nFreelance Editor:Lisa Yamashita Invoice Date:30 September Address:178UpsalaRoad LONDON E161DJ Contact:(020)79460612 lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk Stashcash ID: Lisa. Yamashita8\n\nClient Name | Project Description | Date Completed Time\n\nEddie Kent | University thesis editing | 5 September | 2 hours\n\nBen Gallagher | Grant proposal editing | 9 September | 10hours\n\nLydia Quinn of Hyden Interiors Marketing copy editing | 17 September 8.5 hours\n\nWinona Rogers | Journal article editing | 22 September | 2 hours\n\nTony Withers | CV and cover letter editing 28 September 2.5hours"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Lisa Yamashita <lisa.yamashita@bluesun.co.uk> From: | Claudio Aguilar <caguilar@britrevision.co.uk> Date: | 1 October\n\nSubject: | Your recent invoice\n\nDear Lisa, Thank you for sending your invoice for services rendered in the month of September. I Want to com mend you on your superb start as one of our independent freelance editors. Our clients had nothing but positive things to say about your work. As you know, we do not dictate how you structure your workday; instead, Brit-Revision (BRV)guidelines require simply that deadlines be met and that work quality be maintained. You have done both admirably. Also, we will pay you for an additional 30 minutes of work that you did for Mr.Kent. He reported that you did consulting work for him over the phone on a short oral presentation that he created. As for the work that you did for our long-standing corporate client Lydia Quinn, you will see on your receipt that we have paid you at a higher hourly rate. I have initiated the transfer of f750 into your Stashcash account. The funds should appear in your account by tomorrow morning. Sincerely, Claudio Aguilar Accounts Payable, Brit-Revision Editing Services"}],"question":"When can Ms.Yamashita expect a payment to arrive?","bilingual":"","options":["OnSeptember28","On September 30","On October 1","On October 2"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"On October 2\".","vocabList":[{"word":"presentation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌpriːzenˈteɪʃn/","meaning":"bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"independent","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪndɪˈpɛndənt/","meaning":"miễn phí; tự trị; có chủ quyền; tự chủ; bản thân-"},{"word":"maintained","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪnˈteɪnd/","meaning":"duy trì"}]},{"questionNum":"186","passageTitle":"To: | New Employees","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano"}],"question":"According to the first e-mail, what was previously sent to new employees?","bilingual":"Theo e đầu tiên -mail, những gì trước đây đã được gửi cho nhân viên mới?","options":["An advertisement","An application form","An employee ID number","Directions to an office complex"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"An employee ID number\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertisement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/æd.vɝːˈtaɪz.mənt/","meaning":"bản tin quảng cáo"},{"word":"registration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,redʤis''treiʃn/","meaning":"sự đăng ký, sự ghi vào sổ"},{"word":"application","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌæp.ləˈkeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"ứng dụng, sự áp dụng"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"}],"optionMeanings":["Một quảng cáo","Đơn đăng ký","Mã số nhân viên","Chỉ đường đến khu phức hợp văn phòng"]},{"questionNum":"187","passageTitle":"To: | New Employees","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano"}],"question":"According to the first e-mail, what is the deadline to complete an online task?","bilingual":"","options":["June 8","June 10","June 15","June 17"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"June 17\".","vocabList":[{"word":"registration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,redʤis''treiʃn/","meaning":"sự đăng ký, sự ghi vào sổ"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"engineering","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌen.dʒɪˈnɪr.ɪŋ/","meaning":"công việc kỹ sư"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}]},{"questionNum":"188","passageTitle":"To: | New Employees","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano"}],"question":"What step is Ms.Dimaano having trouble with?","bilingual":"","options":["Step 1","Step 2","Step 3","Step 4"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Step 1\".","vocabList":[{"word":"registration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,redʤis''treiʃn/","meaning":"sự đăng ký, sự ghi vào sổ"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"engineering","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌen.dʒɪˈnɪr.ɪŋ/","meaning":"công việc kỹ sư"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}]},{"questionNum":"189","passageTitle":"To: | New Employees","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano"}],"question":"What department will Ms.Dimaano join?","bilingual":"","options":["Marketing","Customer Service","Engineering","Technology Services"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Engineering\".","vocabList":[{"word":"registration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,redʤis''treiʃn/","meaning":"sự đăng ký, sự ghi vào sổ"},{"word":"engineering","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌen.dʒɪˈnɪr.ɪŋ/","meaning":"công việc kỹ sư"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}]},{"questionNum":"190","passageTitle":"To: | New Employees","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions.\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nTo: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | New Employees\n\nFrom: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 8\n\nSubject: | Welcome to Motman Motors\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear New Employees, Welcome! We are thrilled that all of you are joining Motman Motors. New-employee orientation for all is on June 10 from 9:00 A.M. to 12:00 noon. Please report to the proper room in the Pimzler Building on our campus as indicated below. I will come around to each room to meet the new employees briefly. •Marketing and Customer Service: both groups report to room 320. ●Engineering:report to room215. Technology Services:report to room 158. I can confirm that the employee paperwork has been finalized for most of you, so at this point we just need to ensure that your Motman Motors portal account is set up using the employee identification number recently sent to you and that your bank account information is entered there. Please foliow the attached instructions to complete this final step. It should not take any more than fifteen minutes, and I ask that you do this by June 17. Don''t hesitate to reach out if you have any questions. Welcome aboard! Hemi Amos Human Resources, Motman Motors\n\nPlease follow these steps to create and activate your new Motman Motors portal account. Goto https://motmanmotors.com/portal/activationtobegin. 1.Go to the\"New User Registration page and enter your employee ID number. 2.Your name and address will appear. Confirm that this information is correct. 3.A new screen titled\"Bank Account\"will appear. Fill in your bank account information. 4.Finally, you will be asked to select two security questions and provide the answers.\n\nOnce you have created your account, your account will become active, the payroll department will be alerted, and your payment schedule will be set. Please e-mail Mr.Hemi Amos at hamos@motmanmotors.com if you have any difficulties or questions."},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"To: | Hemi Amos <hamos@motmanmotors.com> From: | Karuna Dimaano <kdimaano@motmanmotors.com> Date: | June 9\n\nSubject: | Trouble with Motman Motors portal\n\nDear Mr. Amos, Thank you for the kind welcome e-mail yesterday. I am trying to set up my Motman Motors portal account, but I seem to be having trouble with my employee iD number. Each time I put the information into the system, I get an error message. I might not have the right number. Can you please advise me on how to address this? I also have another question. Will the orientation include any information for newcomers to San Antonio? I am excited to start exploring everything here that this great city offers. I look forward to meeting you tomorrow in room 215 in the Pimzler Building. Thank you, Karuna Dimaano"}],"question":"In the second e-mail, what is suggested about Ms.Dimaano?","bilingual":"","options":["She has just graduated from university.","She has met Mr.Amos before.","She is concerned about finding a building.","She has recently moved to San Antonio."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"She has recently moved to San Antonio.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"registration","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/,redʤis''treiʃn/","meaning":"sự đăng ký, sự ghi vào sổ"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"engineering","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌen.dʒɪˈnɪr.ɪŋ/","meaning":"công việc kỹ sư"},{"word":"instruction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"giảng dạy; phương hướng; hướng dẫn; đào tạo; giáo dục;"}]},{"questionNum":"191","passageTitle":"To: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai ","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai <smathai@thehospitalequipmentco.com> Date: | September 17\n\nSubject: | Notes on rough cut of video\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear Mr. Herman,\n\nThank you for sending the rough version of the informational video for our new Fluorolook Imager. I think that the video looks great so far. It clearly demonstrates why the Fluorolook is the best medical imaging device available.I have just a few notes before you proceed to create the final version. ·At 20 seconds: Could you insert a short timeline of the history of The Hospital Equipment Company? I have attached the relevant information to this e-mail. At l minute: I had a hard time seeing the details of the control panel in this scene. Could you please replace it with a close-up shot? At2minutes:The sequence in which the medical technician positions the patient and adjusts the machine moves too quickly. Can this be slowed down? I look forward to seeing the final version on September 23. As always, thank you and your colleagues at Video Genie Productions for the excellent work.\n\nSincerely,\n\nMs.Sapna Mathai, Project Manager The Hospital Equipment Company\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nThe Hospital Equipment Company Invoice9984 Billing date: October 25 Installation date:October 26\n\nBill to: All-City Hospital 3ShorelineRoad Clear Lake, Minnesota 55319\n\nQuantity Item Number Description | Unit Price Total\n\n62630 | Fluorolook Imager $242,300 $484,600\n\nDelivery and Installation | $2,350\n\nTotal $486,950\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nMEMO\n\nTo: All The Hospital Equipment Company Employees\n\nFrom: Marcia Oliver, Vice President of Sales\n\nDate: October 27\n\nRe: Good work!\n\nCongratulations on the successful launch of the Fluorolook Imager! The Hospital Equipment Company has made its first sale-to a hospital in Clear Lake. And MDP Delivery has informed us that the two devices have been delivered. I would especially like to com mend Ms.Mathai. She was instrumental in getting us to this point. The administrator of the hospital that made the purchase, Mr.Fabrice Lamontagne, credited his decision to the informational video. He remarked that the video effectively demonstrated why the Fluorolook Imager was the right device for his medical institution.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai <smathai@thehospitalequipmentco.com> Date: | September 17\n\nSubject: | Notes on rough cut of video\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear Mr. Herman,\n\nThank you for sending the rough version of the informational video for our new Fluorolook Imager. I think that the video looks great so far. It clearly demonstrates why the Fluorolook is the best medical imaging device available.I have just a few notes before you proceed to create the final version. ·At 20 seconds: Could you insert a short timeline of the history of The Hospital Equipment Company? I have attached the relevant information to this e-mail. At l minute: I had a hard time seeing the details of the control panel in this scene. Could you please replace it with a close-up shot? At2minutes:The sequence in which the medical technician positions the patient and adjusts the machine moves too quickly. Can this be slowed down? I look forward to seeing the final version on September 23. As always, thank you and your colleagues at Video Genie Productions for the excellent work.\n\nSincerely,\n\nMs.Sapna Mathai, Project Manager The Hospital Equipment Company"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"The Hospital Equipment Company Invoice9984 Billing date: October 25 Installation date:October 26\n\nBill to: All-City Hospital 3ShorelineRoad Clear Lake, Minnesota 55319\n\nQuantity Item Number Description | Unit Price Total\n\n62630 | Fluorolook Imager $242,300 $484,600\n\nDelivery and Installation | $2,350\n\nTotal $486,950"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"MEMO\n\nTo: All The Hospital Equipment Company Employees\n\nFrom: Marcia Oliver, Vice President of Sales\n\nDate: October 27\n\nRe: Good work!\n\nCongratulations on the successful launch of the Fluorolook Imager! The Hospital Equipment Company has made its first sale-to a hospital in Clear Lake. And MDP Delivery has informed us that the two devices have been delivered. I would especially like to com mend Ms.Mathai. She was instrumental in getting us to this point. The administrator of the hospital that made the purchase, Mr.Fabrice Lamontagne, credited his decision to the informational video. He remarked that the video effectively demonstrated why the Fluorolook Imager was the right device for his medical institution."}],"question":"What is attached to the e-mail?","bilingual":"Những gì được gắn vào e - thư à?.","options":["Details about an invoice","Reviews of Video Genie Productions","A timeline for completing a project","A graphic outlining a company''s history"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"A graphic outlining a company''s history\".","vocabList":[{"word":"administrator","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ədˈmɪnɪˌstreɪtər/","meaning":"quản trị viên"},{"word":"installation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.stəˈleɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"sự cài đặt"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"demonstrate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈdem.ən.streɪt/","meaning":"làm mẫu, giải thích"}],"optionMeanings":["Chi tiết về hóa đơn","Nhận xét của Video Genie Productions","Dòng thời gian để hoàn thành một dự án","Một đồ họa phác thảo lịch sử của công ty192. Tại sao cô Mathai muốn thay thế cảnh 1 phút?(A) Một số nội dung không hiển thị rõ ràng.(B) Một số thiết bị được dán nhãn không chính xác. (C) Video hiện trường chuyển động quá nhanh. (D) Kỹ thuật viên y tế nói quá nhỏ.193. Hóa đơn cho biết gì về Máy chụp ảnh Fluorolook?(A) Chúng được bán với giá chiết khấu. (B) Giao hàng miễn phí. (C) Người mua đã đặt mua hai chiếc. (D) Chúng được lắp đặt vào ngày 25 tháng 10 năm"]},{"questionNum":"192","passageTitle":"To: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai ","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai <smathai@thehospitalequipmentco.com> Date: | September 17\n\nSubject: | Notes on rough cut of video\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear Mr. Herman,\n\nThank you for sending the rough version of the informational video for our new Fluorolook Imager. I think that the video looks great so far. It clearly demonstrates why the Fluorolook is the best medical imaging device available.I have just a few notes before you proceed to create the final version. ·At 20 seconds: Could you insert a short timeline of the history of The Hospital Equipment Company? I have attached the relevant information to this e-mail. At l minute: I had a hard time seeing the details of the control panel in this scene. Could you please replace it with a close-up shot? At2minutes:The sequence in which the medical technician positions the patient and adjusts the machine moves too quickly. Can this be slowed down? I look forward to seeing the final version on September 23. As always, thank you and your colleagues at Video Genie Productions for the excellent work.\n\nSincerely,\n\nMs.Sapna Mathai, Project Manager The Hospital Equipment Company\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nThe Hospital Equipment Company Invoice9984 Billing date: October 25 Installation date:October 26\n\nBill to: All-City Hospital 3ShorelineRoad Clear Lake, Minnesota 55319\n\nQuantity Item Number Description | Unit Price Total\n\n62630 | Fluorolook Imager $242,300 $484,600\n\nDelivery and Installation | $2,350\n\nTotal $486,950\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nMEMO\n\nTo: All The Hospital Equipment Company Employees\n\nFrom: Marcia Oliver, Vice President of Sales\n\nDate: October 27\n\nRe: Good work!\n\nCongratulations on the successful launch of the Fluorolook Imager! The Hospital Equipment Company has made its first sale-to a hospital in Clear Lake. And MDP Delivery has informed us that the two devices have been delivered. I would especially like to com mend Ms.Mathai. She was instrumental in getting us to this point. The administrator of the hospital that made the purchase, Mr.Fabrice Lamontagne, credited his decision to the informational video. He remarked that the video effectively demonstrated why the Fluorolook Imager was the right device for his medical institution.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai <smathai@thehospitalequipmentco.com> Date: | September 17\n\nSubject: | Notes on rough cut of video\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear Mr. Herman,\n\nThank you for sending the rough version of the informational video for our new Fluorolook Imager. I think that the video looks great so far. It clearly demonstrates why the Fluorolook is the best medical imaging device available.I have just a few notes before you proceed to create the final version. ·At 20 seconds: Could you insert a short timeline of the history of The Hospital Equipment Company? I have attached the relevant information to this e-mail. At l minute: I had a hard time seeing the details of the control panel in this scene. Could you please replace it with a close-up shot? At2minutes:The sequence in which the medical technician positions the patient and adjusts the machine moves too quickly. Can this be slowed down? I look forward to seeing the final version on September 23. As always, thank you and your colleagues at Video Genie Productions for the excellent work.\n\nSincerely,\n\nMs.Sapna Mathai, Project Manager The Hospital Equipment Company"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"The Hospital Equipment Company Invoice9984 Billing date: October 25 Installation date:October 26\n\nBill to: All-City Hospital 3ShorelineRoad Clear Lake, Minnesota 55319\n\nQuantity Item Number Description | Unit Price Total\n\n62630 | Fluorolook Imager $242,300 $484,600\n\nDelivery and Installation | $2,350\n\nTotal $486,950"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"MEMO\n\nTo: All The Hospital Equipment Company Employees\n\nFrom: Marcia Oliver, Vice President of Sales\n\nDate: October 27\n\nRe: Good work!\n\nCongratulations on the successful launch of the Fluorolook Imager! The Hospital Equipment Company has made its first sale-to a hospital in Clear Lake. And MDP Delivery has informed us that the two devices have been delivered. I would especially like to com mend Ms.Mathai. She was instrumental in getting us to this point. The administrator of the hospital that made the purchase, Mr.Fabrice Lamontagne, credited his decision to the informational video. He remarked that the video effectively demonstrated why the Fluorolook Imager was the right device for his medical institution."}],"question":"Why does Ms.Mathaiwanttoreplacethe scene at 1minute?","bilingual":"","options":["Some content is not clearly visible.","Some equipment is labeled incorrectly.","The video of the scene moves too quickly.","The medical technician speaks too quietly."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Some content is not clearly visible.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"administrator","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ədˈmɪnɪˌstreɪtər/","meaning":"quản trị viên"},{"word":"installation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.stəˈleɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"sự cài đặt"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"demonstrate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈdem.ən.streɪt/","meaning":"làm mẫu, giải thích"}]},{"questionNum":"193","passageTitle":"To: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai ","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nTo: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai <smathai@thehospitalequipmentco.com> Date: | September 17\n\nSubject: | Notes on rough cut of video\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear Mr. Herman,\n\nThank you for sending the rough version of the informational video for our new Fluorolook Imager. I think that the video looks great so far. It clearly demonstrates why the Fluorolook is the best medical imaging device available.I have just a few notes before you proceed to create the final version. ·At 20 seconds: Could you insert a short timeline of the history of The Hospital Equipment Company? I have attached the relevant information to this e-mail. At l minute: I had a hard time seeing the details of the control panel in this scene. Could you please replace it with a close-up shot? At2minutes:The sequence in which the medical technician positions the patient and adjusts the machine moves too quickly. Can this be slowed down? I look forward to seeing the final version on September 23. As always, thank you and your colleagues at Video Genie Productions for the excellent work.\n\nSincerely,\n\nMs.Sapna Mathai, Project Manager The Hospital Equipment Company\n\n=== Văn bản 2 ===\nThe Hospital Equipment Company Invoice9984 Billing date: October 25 Installation date:October 26\n\nBill to: All-City Hospital 3ShorelineRoad Clear Lake, Minnesota 55319\n\nQuantity Item Number Description | Unit Price Total\n\n62630 | Fluorolook Imager $242,300 $484,600\n\nDelivery and Installation | $2,350\n\nTotal $486,950\n\n=== Văn bản 3 ===\nMEMO\n\nTo: All The Hospital Equipment Company Employees\n\nFrom: Marcia Oliver, Vice President of Sales\n\nDate: October 27\n\nRe: Good work!\n\nCongratulations on the successful launch of the Fluorolook Imager! The Hospital Equipment Company has made its first sale-to a hospital in Clear Lake. And MDP Delivery has informed us that the two devices have been delivered. I would especially like to com mend Ms.Mathai. She was instrumental in getting us to this point. The administrator of the hospital that made the purchase, Mr.Fabrice Lamontagne, credited his decision to the informational video. He remarked that the video effectively demonstrated why the Fluorolook Imager was the right device for his medical institution.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1","text":"To: | Felix Herman <felixh@videogenieproductions.com> From: | Sapna Mathai <smathai@thehospitalequipmentco.com> Date: | September 17\n\nSubject: | Notes on rough cut of video\n\nAttachment: Information\n\nDear Mr. Herman,\n\nThank you for sending the rough version of the informational video for our new Fluorolook Imager. I think that the video looks great so far. It clearly demonstrates why the Fluorolook is the best medical imaging device available.I have just a few notes before you proceed to create the final version. ·At 20 seconds: Could you insert a short timeline of the history of The Hospital Equipment Company? I have attached the relevant information to this e-mail. At l minute: I had a hard time seeing the details of the control panel in this scene. Could you please replace it with a close-up shot? At2minutes:The sequence in which the medical technician positions the patient and adjusts the machine moves too quickly. Can this be slowed down? I look forward to seeing the final version on September 23. As always, thank you and your colleagues at Video Genie Productions for the excellent work.\n\nSincerely,\n\nMs.Sapna Mathai, Project Manager The Hospital Equipment Company"},{"label":"Văn bản 2","text":"The Hospital Equipment Company Invoice9984 Billing date: October 25 Installation date:October 26\n\nBill to: All-City Hospital 3ShorelineRoad Clear Lake, Minnesota 55319\n\nQuantity Item Number Description | Unit Price Total\n\n62630 | Fluorolook Imager $242,300 $484,600\n\nDelivery and Installation | $2,350\n\nTotal $486,950"},{"label":"Văn bản 3","text":"MEMO\n\nTo: All The Hospital Equipment Company Employees\n\nFrom: Marcia Oliver, Vice President of Sales\n\nDate: October 27\n\nRe: Good work!\n\nCongratulations on the successful launch of the Fluorolook Imager! The Hospital Equipment Company has made its first sale-to a hospital in Clear Lake. And MDP Delivery has informed us that the two devices have been delivered. I would especially like to com mend Ms.Mathai. She was instrumental in getting us to this point. The administrator of the hospital that made the purchase, Mr.Fabrice Lamontagne, credited his decision to the informational video. He remarked that the video effectively demonstrated why the Fluorolook Imager was the right device for his medical institution."}],"question":"What does the invoice indicate about the Fluorolook Imagers?","bilingual":"","options":["They were sold at a discount.","The delivery was free of charge","The purchaser ordered two of them.","They were installed onOctober25."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \