the next five to ten business days because of our mistake. We are currently celebrating peak olive season by offering 10 percent off of your next order. Also, during our Olive Harvest Festival in December, every shipment includes samples of our company''s classic olive oil that we encourage you to give to your shoppers with our compliments. We hope to continue providing Best Products Supermarket with the finest olive oils. Sincerely yours, Pablo Nadal Export Division Manager, Reina Olive Oil Company"}],"question":"What item number does Ms.Seong refer to?","bilingual":"","options":["EV0160","EV0161","EV0162","EV0163"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"EV0163\".","vocabList":[{"word":"distribution","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌdɪs.trɪˈbjuː.ʃən/","meaning":"sự phân phát"},{"word":"description","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/","meaning":"bản mô tả, sự mô tả"},{"word":"appreciate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpriː.ʃi.eɪt/","meaning":"đánh giá cao, cảm kích"},{"word":"assistance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈsɪs.təns/","meaning":"sự giúp đỡ, hỗ trợ"}]},{"questionNum":"198","passageTitle":"Packing Slip","passageText":"=== Văn bản 1 ===\nPacking Slip\n\nFrom: Reina Olive Oil Company To: Bcst Products Supermarket\n\nCalleTablas820 | 241 Yeonhae-ro, Jung-gu\n\n18002Granada, Spain | Incheon22382,Republicof Korea\n\nOrder Date:28 November Order Number:SK6224\n\nItem Number Description | Quantity\n\nEV0160 | 750-millilitreexlra-virginoliveoil standard sizeglasscruet 15 cases\n\nwith handle\n\nEV0161 | 1-litre extra-virgin olive oil family size glass bottle | 20 cases\n\nEV0162 | 1.5-litre extra-virgin olive oil chef size glass bottle | 10 cases\n\nEV0163 | 3-litre extra-virgin olive oil bulk size Reina logo tin | 5 cases\n\nEV0001 | 50-millilitre extra-virgin oliveoil December samp