    '{"summary":"54 câu hỏi đọc hiểu Part 7 chuẩn ETS 2022 Test 1 gồm đầy đủ đoạn đơn (147-175), đoạn đôi (176-185) và đoạn ba (186-200).","rules":["Đọc lướt tiêu đề, người gửi/nhận để định vị thông tin nhanh.","Câu hỏi liên kết nhiều văn bản cần đối chiếu dữ kiện giữa các đoạn."],"example":"What is the purpose of the announcement?"}'::jsonb,
    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following Web page.","passageText":"(http://www.moonglowairways.com.au)©\nSpecial Announcement by Geoff Clifford, President of Moon Glow Airways\nAs many of you are aware, there was a problem with Pelman Technology, the system\nthat handles our airline reservations. This outage has affected several airlines. It’s been\na rough week, but the good news is that it has been repaired, and we are re-setting our\nsystem. However, Moon Glow passengers may still face delays for a day or two. This\nmost likely will include longer lines at airports. We have added more on-site customer\nservice representatives at airports in all of our destination cities to assist customers\nwith their flights and information. We appreciate your understanding and patience.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"(http://www.moonglowairways.com.au)©\nSpecial Announcement by Geoff Clifford, President of Moon Glow Airways\nAs many of you are aware, there was a problem with Pelman Technology, the system\nthat handles our airline reservations. This outage has affected several airlines. It’s been\na rough week, but the good news is that it has been repaired, and we are re-setting our\nsystem. However, Moon Glow passengers may still face delays for a day or two. This\nmost likely will include longer lines at airports. We have added more on-site customer\nservice representatives at airports in all of our destination cities to assist customers\nwith their flights and information. We appreciate your understanding and patience."}],"question":"What is the purpose of the announcement?","bilingual":"Mục đích của thông báo là gì?","options":["To report on airport renovations","To give an update on a technical problem","To introduce a new reservation system","To advertise airline routes to some new cities"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To give an update on a technical problem\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"announcement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈnaʊnsmɛnt/","meaning":"tuyên ngôn; để ý; hành động thông báo cho công chúng"},{"word":"report","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ri''pɔ:t/","meaning":"bản báo cáo, bản tường thuật; biên bản"},{"word":"airport","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɛrˌpɔrt/","meaning":"nơi máy bay cất cánh và hạ cánh"}]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following Web page.","passageText":"(http://www.moonglowairways.com.au)©\nSpecial Announcement by Geoff Clifford, President of Moon Glow Airways\nAs many of you are aware, there was a problem with Pelman Technology, the system\nthat handles our airline reservations. This outage has affected several airlines. It’s been\na rough week, but the good news is that it has been repaired, and we are re-setting our\nsystem. However, Moon Glow passengers may still face delays for a day or two. This\nmost likely will include longer lines at airports. We have added more on-site customer\nservice representatives at airports in all of our destination cities to assist customers\nwith their flights and information. We appreciate your understanding and patience.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"(http://www.moonglowairways.com.au)©\nSpecial Announcement by Geoff Clifford, President of Moon Glow Airways\nAs many of you are aware, there was a problem with Pelman Technology, the system\nthat handles our airline reservations. This outage has affected several airlines. It’s been\na rough week, but the good news is that it has been repaired, and we are re-setting our\nsystem. However, Moon Glow passengers may still face delays for a day or two. This\nmost likely will include longer lines at airports. We have added more on-site customer\nservice representatives at airports in all of our destination cities to assist customers\nwith their flights and information. We appreciate your understanding and patience."}],"question":"According to Mr. Clifford, what has the airline temporarily increased?","bilingual":"Theo ông Clifford, hãng hàng không này tạm thời tăng giá những gì?","options":["The number of flights available","Dining options on flights","Assistance for customers at airports","Prices for international flights"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Assistance for customers at airports\".","vocabList":[{"word":"airline","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈer.laɪn/","meaning":"công ty hàng không"},{"word":"temporarily","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌtɛmpərˈɛrəli/","meaning":"tạm thời"},{"word":"number","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈnəmbər/","meaning":"đếm; bằng nhau về số lượng; hạn chế; phân bổ"},{"word":"flight","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/flaɪt/","meaning":"chuyến bay, sự rút chạy"}]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following job advertisement.","passageText":"Video Captioners ------- Work from Home\nKiesel Video is seeking detail-oriented people to use our software to add text captions to a\nwide variety of video material, such as television programs, movies, and university lectures.\nWe will provide free online training. Successful applicants must possess strong language\nskills and have a computer, a head set, and high-speed Internet access.\nThe position features:\n•Flexible hours ------- you work as much or as little as you want.\n•Choice of projects ------- we have work in many types of content.\n•Good pay ------- our captioners earn $350 to $1,100 a week, depending on the assignment.\nApply today at www.kieselvideo.com/jobs","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Video Captioners ------- Work from Home\nKiesel Video is seeking detail-oriented people to use our software to add text captions to a\nwide variety of video material, such as television programs, movies, and university lectures.\nWe will provide free online training. Successful applicants must possess strong language\nskills and have a computer, a head set, and high-speed Internet access.\nThe position features:\n•Flexible hours ------- you work as much or as little as you want.\n•Choice of projects ------- we have work in many types of content.\n•Good pay ------- our captioners earn $350 to $1,100 a week, depending on the assignment.\nApply today at www.kieselvideo.com/jobs"}],"question":"What are applicants for this position required to have?","bilingual":"Ứng viên cho vị trí này yêu cầu phải có những gì?","options":["Experience in video production","Certain pieces of equipment","A university degree in language studies","An office with a reception area"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Certain pieces of equipment\".","vocabList":[{"word":"applicant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈæp.lə.kənt/","meaning":"người ứng tuyển, nguyên cáo"},{"word":"position","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pəˈzɪʃən/","meaning":"vị trí, chỗ (của một vật gì)"},{"word":"required","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/rikˈwaɪərd/","meaning":"bắt buộc"},{"word":"experience","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪr.i.əns/","meaning":"trải nghiệm, kinh nghiệm"}]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following job advertisement.","passageText":"Video Captioners ------- Work from Home\nKiesel Video is seeking detail-oriented people to use our software to add text captions to a\nwide 