ɪnˈvɑlv/","meaning":"gây ra mối quan tâm; tham gia; để chiếm lĩnh"},{"word":"foreign","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈfɔːr.ən/","meaning":"nước ngoài, ngoại quốc"}]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following report.","passageText":"February 1\nSOFTWARE TESTING REPORT\nVersion of Software Program: Konserted 2.5\nTesting Dates: January 10-12\nNumber of Participants: 8\nSoftware Testing Overview: Participants were asked to complete a\nseries of tasks testing the functionality of the revised Konserted\ninterface. In task number 1, participants searched for a concert in\na designated area. In task number 2, participants searched for new\nfriends on the site. In task number 3, participants invited friends\nto a concert. In task number 4, participants posted concert reviews,\nphotos, and videos.\nInitial Findings: Task number 3 proved the most challenging, with\nthree participants unable to complete it in under two minutes. A\npotential cause for this difficulty may be the choice of icons in the\nmenu bar. Clearer, more intuitive icons could make this task easier\nto complete for participants.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"February 1\nSOFTWARE TESTING REPORT\nVersion of Software Program: Konserted 2.5\nTesting Dates: January 10-12\nNumber of Participants: 8\nSoftware Testing Overview: Participants were asked to complete a\nseries of tasks testing the functionality of the revised Konserted\ninterface. In task number 1, participants searched for a concert in\na designated area. In task number 2, participants searched for new\nfriends on the site. In task number 3, participants invited friends\nto a concert. In task number 4, participants posted concert reviews,\nphotos, and videos.\nInitial Findings: Task number 3 proved the most challenging, with\nthree participants unable to complete it in under two minutes. A\npotential cause for this difficulty may be the choice of icons in the\nmenu bar. Clearer, more intuitive icons could make this task easier\nto complete for participants."}],"question":"What is true about the software testing?","bilingual":"Điều gì đúng về kiểm thử phần mềm?","options":["It included multiple versions of Konserted.","It was done over several days.","It required participants to complete a survey.","It took place at a series of concerts."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It was done over several days.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"software","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈsɑːft.wer/","meaning":"phần mềm"},{"word":"version","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈvərʒən/","meaning":"hình thức cụ thể của một cái gì đó; khác nhau; kết xuất;"},{"word":"over","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈoʊvər/","meaning":"trên"},{"word":"several","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sevrəl/","meaning":"vài, riêng, cá nhân; khác nhau"}]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following report.","passageText":"February 1\nSOFTWARE TESTING REPORT\nVersion of Software Program: Konserted 2.5\nTesting Dates: January 10-12\nNumber of Participants: 8\nSoftware Testing Overview: Participants were asked to complete a\nseries of tasks testing the functionality of the revised Konserted\ninterface. In task number 1, participants searched for a concert in\na designated area. In task number 2, participants searched for new\nfriends on the site. In task number 3, participants invited friends\nto a concert. In task number 4, participants posted concert reviews,\nphotos, and videos.\nInitial Findings: Task number 3 proved the most challenging, with\nthree participants unable to complete it in under two minutes. A\npotential cause for this difficulty may be the choice of icons in the\nmenu bar. Clearer, more intuitive icons could make this task easier\nto complete for participants.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"February 1\nSOFTWARE TESTING REPORT\nVersion of Software Program: Konserted 2.5\nTesting Dates: January 10-12\nNumber of Participants: 8\nSoftware Testing Overview: Participants were asked to complete a\nseries of tasks testing the functionality of the revised Konserted\ninterface. In task number 1, participants searched for a concert in\na designated area. In task number 2, participants searched for new\nfriends on the site. In task number 3, participants invited friends\nto a concert. In task number 4, participants posted concert reviews,\nphotos, and videos.\nInitial Findings: Task number 3 proved the most challenging, with\nthree participants unable to complete it in under two minutes. A\npotential cause for this difficulty may be the choice of icons in the\nmenu bar. Clearer, more intuitive icons could make this task easier\nto complete for participants."}],"question":"What action was difficult for users to complete?","bilingual":"Hành động nào khiến người dùng khó hoàn thành?","options":["Searching for an event","Searching for friends","Inviting friends to a performance","Posting reviews to a Web site"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Inviting friends to a performance\".","vocabList":[{"word":"difficult","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈdɪfəkəlt/","meaning":"cứng; rắc rối; phức tap; tổ hợp"},{"word":"users","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈjuzərz/","meaning":"người dùng"},{"word":"complete","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/kəmˈpliːt/","meaning":"đầy đủ, hoàn thiện"},{"word":"event","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪˈvent/","meaning":"sự kiện, sự việc"}]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Questions 153-155 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: catiyeh @ my mailroom.au\nFrom: a chen @mutamark.au\nDate: l July\nSubject: Mutamark conference\nDear Ms. Atiyeh,\nTo follow up on our phone conversation earlier today, I would like to extend to you a\nformal written invitation to speak at the eighth annual Mutamark conference, scheduled\nto take place this year from 17 to 20 September in Zagros. Because you drew a size able\ncrowd when you appeared at the conference in the past, we will be making special\narrangements for your visit this time. The Blue Room at the Debeljak Hotel holds only\n120, so this year we are also booking the Koros Hall, which has a capacity of 270. We\ncan offer you a 40-to-50-minute slot on the last day of the conference, when attendance\nshould be at its peak. Please e-mail me to confirm your acceptance and to let me know\nmore about your audiovisual requirements. We can provide overhead projection for still\nimages if you will be using them again.\nVery best regards,\nAlex Chen, Conference Planning\nMutamark Headquarters, Melbourne","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"*E-mail*\nTo: catiyeh @ my mailroom.au\nFrom: a chen @mutamark.au\nDate: l July\nSubject: Mutamark conference\nDear Ms. Atiyeh,\nTo follow up on our phone conversation earlier today, I would like to extend to you a\nformal written invitation to speak at the eighth annual Mutamark conference, scheduled\nto take place this year from 17 to 20 September in Zagros. Because you drew a size able\ncrowd when you appeared at the conference in the past, we will be making special\narrangements for your visit this time. The Blue Room at the Debeljak Hotel holds only\n120, so this year we are also booking the Koros Hall, which has a capacity of 270. We\ncan offer you a 40-to-50-minute slot on the last day of the conference, when attendance\nshould be at its peak. Please e-mail me to confirm your acceptance and to let me know\nmore about your audiovisual requirements. We can provide overhead projection for still\nimages if you will be using them 