t ways to protect your private information.\nCommunity Shredding Day is brought to you by radio station 82.9 WQYX and\nSecurity Too. ------- [4] -------.\nFor more information, visit www.watfordtownship/shreddingday.org."}],"question":"What is the purpose of the notice?","bilingual":"Mục đích của thông báo là gì?","options":["To notify residents of a due date","To promote a service","To welcome a new business to town","To advertise a contest"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To promote a service\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"notice","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''nəƱtis/","meaning":"thông tri, yết thị, thông báo"},{"word":"notify","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/nəʊ.tɪ.faɪ/","meaning":"báo, khai báo; thông báo"},{"word":"residents","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛzɪdənts/","meaning":"cư dân"}]},{"questionNum":"157","passageTitle":"Questions 156-158 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Watford Shredding Day\nDo you need to safely dispose of piles of confidential paperwork? Come to Watford\nCommunity Shredding Day on April 8 from 8:00 A.M. to 11:00 A.M.\nA number of Security Too shredders will be conveniently located behind the\nWatford municipal parking garage. ------- [1] -------. Bring any unneeded bank statements,\ntax documents, and bills. ------- [2] -------. They will be securely shredded and recycled on\nthe spot. Please note that the event is open to Watford Township residents only, and\nthere is a five-kilo limit per household. ------- [3] -------. Security Too representatives will be\non hand to talk about ways to protect your private information.\nCommunity Shredding Day is brought to you by radio station 82.9 WQYX and\nSecurity Too. ------- [4] ----