 three-minute survey\nto rate your time with us. Please visit www.sandringsuites.com.au and click the survey link\nin the top right corner of the Web page. Use code SAN5341 to complete the survey. To\nthank you for participating, we will enter your name in our monthly raffle to win a\ncomplimentary two-night stay at one of our hotels.\nRegards,\nSilvia Monier\nCustomer Service, Sandring Suites"}],"question":"What is Ms. Das being asked to do?","bilingual":"Cô Das được yêu cầu làm gì?","options":["Confirm her contact information","Provide some feedback","Complete a purchase","Renew a subscription"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Provide some feedback\".","vocabList":[{"word":"confirm","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈfərm/","meaning":"phê duyệt; để xác minh; để xác định"},{"word":"contact","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtækt/","meaning":"thiết lập giao tiếp; để tạo kết nối; ĐẾN"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"provide","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/prəˈvaɪd/","meaning":"cung cấp; cấp ; để thiết lập; cung cấp"}]},{"questionNum":"160","passageTitle":"Questions 159-160 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"To: Kamini Das <k.das @armail.net>\nFrom: Customer Service <customerservice@sandringsuites.com.au> Date: 7 February\nSubject: Regarding your visit\nDear Ms. Das,\nThank you for your recent stay with us at Sandring Suites. Our top priority is to provide\nour guests with an exceptional experience. We ask that you complete a three-minute survey\nto rate your time with us. Please visit www.sandringsuites.com.au and click the survey link\nin the top right corner of the Web page. Use code SAN5341 to complete the survey. To\nthank you for participating, we will enter your name in our monthly raffle to win a\ncomplimentary two-night stay at one of our hotels.\nRegards,\nSilvia Monier\nCustomer Service, Sandring Suites","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Kamini Das <k.das @armail.net>\nFrom: Customer Service <customerservice@sandringsuites.com.au> Date: 7 February\nSubject: Regarding your visit\nDear Ms. Das,\nThank you for your recent stay with us at Sandring Suites. Our top priority is to provide\nour guests with an exceptional experience. We ask that you complete a three-minute survey\nto rate your time with us. Please visit www.sandringsuites.com.au and click the survey link\nin the top right corner of the Web page. Use code SAN5341 to complete the survey. To\nthank you for participating, we will enter your name in our monthly raffle to win a\ncomplimentary two-night stay at one of our hotels.\nRegards,\nSilvia Monier\nCustomer Service, Sandring Suites"}],"question":"What does Ms. Monier indicate she will do for Ms. Das?","bilingual":"Cô Monier cho biết cô sẽ làm gì cho cô Das?","options":["Extend her hotel stay free of charge","Assist her in using a Web site","Give her a chance to win a prize","Provide a discount code for a future hotel stay"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Give her a chance to win a prize\".","vocabList":[{"word":"indicate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈɪn.də.keɪt/","meaning":"chỉ ra, chứng tỏ, biểu thị"},{"word":"extend","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈstend/","meaning":"duỗi thẳng, nới rộng, gia hạn"},{"word":"stay","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/steɪ/","meaning":"hành động dừng lại; thăm nom; tạm trú; đình chỉ"},{"word":"charge","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/tʃɑːrdʒ/","meaning":"chi phí, tiền công; tính giá, đòi trả"}]},{"questionNum":"161","passageTitle":"Questions 161-163 refer to the following advertisement.","passageText":"AKBAR STORAGE COMPANY\n227 Wexham Road, Bridgetown\nPhone: 246-555-0147\nSatisfying storage needs in Barbados for 30 years!\n•Units are available in small, standard, and premium sizes to fit your storage needs.\n•Your clean, dry storage unit is available to you around the clock.\n•Our storage facility is monitored by high-quality security cameras, and each\ncustomer is given a pass code. Our secure electronic gate can be released only\nby entering this code.\n•Our business office is open 9 A.M. to 6 P.M., Monday to Friday, and 9 A.M. to\n2 P.M. on Saturday. Stop in to speak with one of our representatives.\nAnd now, get 20 percent off with a twelve-month rental of our largest type of unit!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"AKBAR STORAGE COMPANY\n227 Wexham Road, Bridgetown\nPhone: 246-555-0147\nSatisfying storage needs in Barbados for 30 years!\n•Units are available in small, standard, and premium sizes to fit your storage needs.\n•Your clean, dry storage unit is available to you around the clock.\n•Our storage facility is monitored by high-quality security cameras, and each\ncustomer is given a pass code. Our secure electronic gate can be released only\nby entering this code.\n•Our business office is open 9 A.M. to 6 P.M., Monday to Friday, and 9 A.M. to\n2 P.M. on Saturday. Stop in to speak with one of our representatives.\nAnd now, get 20 percent off with a twelve-month rental of our largest type of unit!"}],"question":"According to the advertisement, when can customers access their storage units?","bilingual":"Theo quảng cáo, khi nào khách hàng có thể truy cập vào kho lưu trữ của mình?","options":["At any time","Monday to Friday only","On Saturday and Sunday only","When accompanied by a security person"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"At any time\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertisement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/æd.vɝːˈtaɪz.mən