premium sizes to fit your storage needs.\n•Your clean, dry storage unit is available to you around the clock.\n•Our storage facility is monitored by high-quality security cameras, and each\ncustomer is given a pass code. Our secure electronic gate can be released only\nby entering this code.\n•Our business office is open 9 A.M. to 6 P.M., Monday to Friday, and 9 A.M. to\n2 P.M. on Saturday. Stop in to speak with one of our representatives.\nAnd now, get 20 percent off with a twelve-month rental of our largest type of unit!"}],"question":"How can customers receive a discount?","bilingual":"Làm thế nào khách hàng có thể được giảm giá?","options":["By cutting back on their storage space by 20 percent","By renting a premium-size unit for one year","By showing the advertisement to a service representative","By agreeing to rent a unit for a second year"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"By renting a premium-size unit for one year\".","vocabList":[{"word":"customer","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌs.tə.mɚ/","meaning":"khách hàng"},{"word":"receive","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ri''si:v/","meaning":"nhận, lĩnh, thu"},{"word":"discount","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈdɪs.kaʊnt/","meaning":"sự giảm giá, chiết khấu; giảm giá, bớt giá"},{"word":"back","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/bæk/","meaning":"một phần của ghế; phần sau của cơ thể con người"}]},{"questionNum":"164","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following article.","passageText":"Gamer Arcades Joins Forces with premises. With this partnership, however,\nFrankie’s Burgers Franchises\nLEEDS (9 July) ------- Gamer Arcades and fast-\nfood franchise Frankie’s Burgers have\ncustomers will be able to take a break for a\ndelicious meal and then get back to enjoying\nour state-of-the-art gaming centers.”\nThis is not th