re the comfort and\nsafety of the customers. I have also learned first hand that poor cell service along\nHighway 1 will make the wire less networks at most PRO stations unreliable, so we will\nneed a technological solution for that as well. I will send a full report by the end of the\nweek.\nChuck Trigg"}],"question":"According to the chart, what region is expected to have the most customers?","bilingual":"Theo biểu đồ, khu vực nào được dự đoán sẽ có nhiều khách hàng nhất?","options":["Elondell","Southern Borelvia","Western Borelvia","North Shore"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Elondell\".","vocabList":[{"word":"chart","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ʧɑrt/","meaning":"đồ thị; sơ đồ"},{"word":"region","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈriʤən/","meaning":"khu vực; lãnh thổ; lãnh địa; cánh đồng; lĩnh vực hoạt động hoặc sở thích;"},{"word":"expected","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɛktɪd/","meaning":"hy vọng"},{"word":"customer","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌs.tə.mɚ/","meaning":"khách hàng"}]},{"questionNum":"193","passageTitle":"Questions 191-195 refer to the following article, chart, and e-mail.","passageText":"TRIVESS (l February) ------- Alacritum, Inc., has\nannounced plans to build charging stations for\nelectric vehicles along Highway 1. With over\n400 stations across Asia already, Alacritum\nbrings a wealth of experience to this large-\nscale undertaking. The Highway 1 stations,\nknown as PRO stations, will provide vehicles\nwith up to 200 kilowatts of power, achieving\nan 80 percent charge in 30 minutes. The\nsystem will periodically notify waiting drivers\nof the status of their battery charge by sending\ntexts to their cell phones or other mobile\ndevices. The company promises to provide\nmotorists with clean, comfortable, brightly lit\nwaiting facilities. A testing location will open\nat the beginning of next month in Logred..ii\n\\3\nPRO Stations: Proposed Distribution\nRegion Number of Stations Customers per Day\nElondell 26\nSouthern Borelvia 14\nWestern Borelvia 20\nNorth Shore 10\n9,220\n4,970\n6,390\n3,560\n\nTo: 1hsiao@a1acritum.com From: ctrigg@alacritum.com Date: 15 March\nSubject: Meeting\nDear Mr. Hsiao,\nFollowing the meeting with our community partners in Western Borelvia this week, I\nsuggest adding air-conditioning to the waiting areas in that region because of the desert\nconditions there. Although the addition entails higher costs, it will ensure the comfort and\nsafety of the customers. I have also learned first hand that poor cell service along\nHighway 1 will make the wire less networks at most PRO stations unreliable, so we will\nneed a technological solution for that as well. I will send a full report by the end of the\nweek.\nChuck Trigg","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"TRIVESS (l February) ------- Alacritum, Inc., has\nannounced plans to build charging stations for\nelectric vehicles along Highway 1. With over\n400 stations across Asia already, Alacritum\nbrings a wealth of experience to this large-\nscale undertaking. The Highway 1 stations,\nknown as PRO stations, will provide vehicles\nwith up to 200 kilowatts of power, achieving\nan 80 percent charge in 30 minutes. The\nsystem will periodically notify waiting drivers\nof the status of their battery charge by sending\ntexts to their cell phones or other mobile\ndevices. The company promises to provide\nmotorists with clean, comfortable, brightly lit\nwaiting facilities. A testing location will open\nat the beginning of next month in Logred..ii\n\\3\nPRO Stations: Proposed Distribution\nRegion Number of Stations Customers per Day\nElondell 26\nSouthern Borelvia 14\nWestern Borelvia 20\nNorth Shore 10\n9,220\n4,970\n6,390\n3,560\n\nTo: 1hsiao@a1acritum.com From: ctrigg@alacritum.com Date: 15 March\nSubject: Meeting\nDear Mr. Hsiao,\nFollowing the meeting with our community partners in Western Borelvia this week, I\nsuggest adding air-conditioning to the waiting areas in that region because of the desert\nconditions there. Although the addition entails higher costs, it will ensure the comfort and\nsafety of the customers. I have also learned first hand that poor cell service along\nHighway 1 will make the wire less networks at most PRO stations unreliable, so we will\nneed a technological solution for that as well. I will send a full report by the end of the\nweek.\nChuck Trigg"}],"question":"What is the main purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích chính của e-mail là gì?","options":["To negotiate costs","To provide advice","To explain why a delivery was late","To suggest a new partnership"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To provide advice\".","vocabList":[{"word":"main","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪn/","meaning":"đường ống hoặc ống dẫn chính trong hệ thống; phần chính của"},{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"negotiate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/nɪˈgoʊʃiˌeɪt/","meaning":"mặc cả; để giải quyết; để làm việc; thỏa hiệp; để xóa"}]},{"questionNum":"194","passageTitle":"Questions 191-195 refer to the following article, chart, and e-mail.","passageText":"TRIVESS (l February) ------- Alacritum, Inc., has\nannounced plans to build charging stations for\nelectric vehicles along Highway 1. With over\n400 stations across Asia already, Alacritum\nbrings a wealth of experience to this large-\nscale undertaking. The Highway 1 stations,\nknown as PRO stations, will provide vehicles\nwith up to 200 kilowatts of power,