net Cc: lroytenberg@charlottes.com Date: January 28, 8:34 A.M.\nSubject: RE: First draft of press release\nHi Ms. Beker,\nMr. Roytenberg is in Boston for the next several days, and he has asked me to take the\nlead on the press release. I know you had asked to come by the site ------- are you available\ntomorrow, January 29, at 3:00 P.M.? I will be there all day decorating for the grand\nopening.\nYou have put together an excellent first draft. The only major problem I see is that you\nhave mixed up the location of our corporate office and the cafe. The cafe is actually on\nthe corner of Avenue C and Maple Street. Also, Mr. Roytenberg would like to include the\noperating hours, which are 8:00 A.M. to 4:00 P.M. daily. Please call Chef Vaux at\n952-555-0133 for a quotation about specialty items on the menu.\nAll my best,\nAubree Jordan"}],"question":"What type of business is Charlotte’s?","bilingual":"Charlotte''s là loại hình kinh doanh gì?","options":["A farm","A catering service","A cafe","A supermarket chain Stop! This is the end of the test. If you back to Parts 5, 6, and"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"A cafe\".","vocabList":[{"word":"business","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɪznɪs/","meaning":"công ty; doanh nghiệp; buôn bán; thương mại; vấn đề"},{"word":"catering","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkeɪtərɪŋ/","meaning":"kinh doanh cung cấp và phục vụ thực phẩm"},{"word":"service","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sə:vis/","meaning":"sự phục vụ, sự hầu hạ"},{"word":"chain","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/tʃeɪn/","meaning":"dây xích, chuỗi"}]},{"questionNum":"199","passageTitle":"Questions 196-200 refer to the following e-mails and press release.","passageText":"From: cbeker@yourworkstyle.net To: lroytenberg@eharlottes.com; ajordan @charlottes.com\nDate: 