    '{"summary":"54 câu hỏi đọc hiểu Part 7 chuẩn ETS 2022 Test 3 gồm đầy đủ đoạn đơn (147-175), đoạn đôi (176-185) và đoạn ba (186-200).","rules":["Đọc lướt tiêu đề, người gửi/nhận để định vị thông tin nhanh.","Câu hỏi liên kết nhiều văn bản cần đối chiếu dữ kiện giữa các đoạn."],"example":"Who most likely is Mr. Tanaka?"}'::jsonb,
    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"Jun Kambayashi [10:12 A.M.] Rachel, ir\nlooks as if Mr. Tanakas flight will be arriving\n30 minutes earlier this afternoon. I’m on my\nway to pick him up.\nRachel New man [10:13 A.M.] The staff\nare excited that he finally is going to be\nworking with us here. Do you think the\ntwo of you have time to stop here in the\noffice before the end of the workday?\nJun Kambayashi [10:14 A.M.] Probably.\nAnd I agree; Mr. Tanaka has done great work\nat our Chiba branch.\nRachel New man [10:15 A.M.] So I’ve always\nheard. It would be nice for him to get a quick\ntour of the lab and meet some members of\nthe team before our welcome dinner.\nJun Kambayashi [10:16 A.M.] Sounds good.\nSince flight schedules can be unpredictable,\nI’ll keep you posted as I arrive at the airport.\nRachel New man [10:17 A.M.] Perfect. See\nyou later.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Jun Kambayashi [10:12 A.M.] Rachel, ir\nlooks as if Mr. Tanakas flight will be arriving\n30 minutes earlier this afternoon. I’m on my\nway to pick him up.\nRachel New man [10:13 A.M.] The staff\nare excited that he finally is going to be\nworking with us here. Do you think the\ntwo of you have time to stop here in the\noffice before the end of the workday?\nJun Kambayashi [10:14 A.M.] Probably.\nAnd I agree; Mr. Tanaka has done great work\nat our Chiba branch.\nRachel New man [10:15 A.M.] So I’ve always\nheard. It would be nice for him to get a quick\ntour of the lab and meet some members of\nthe team before our welcome dinner.\nJun Kambayashi [10:16 A.M.] Sounds good.\nSince flight schedules can be unpredictable,\nI’ll keep you posted as I arrive at the airport.\nRachel New man [10:17 A.M.] Perfect. See\nyou later."}],"question":"Who most likely is Mr. Tanaka?","bilingual":"Rất có thể ông Tanaka là ai?","options":["A new laboratory owner","An important client","A transferred staff member","An airline pilot"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"A transferred staff member\".","vocabList":[{"word":"tanaka","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/tɑˈnɑkə/","meaning":"Tanaka"},{"word":"owner","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈoʊnər/","meaning":"chủ sở hữu"},{"word":"important","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪmˈpɔrtənt/","meaning":"có ý nghĩa; có ảnh hưởng; thiết yếu; chủ yếu; phê bình"},{"word":"client","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈklaɪ.ənt/","meaning":"khách hàng (của luật sư, cửa hàng...)"}]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"Jun Kambayashi [10:12 A.M.] Rachel, ir\nlooks as if Mr. Tanakas flight will be arriving\n30 minutes earlier this afternoon. I’m on my\nway to pick him up.\nRachel New man [10:13 A.M.] The staff\nare excited that he finally is going to be\nworking with us here. Do you think the\ntwo of you have time to stop here in the\noffice before the end of the workday?\nJun Kambayashi [10:14 A.M.] Probably.\nAnd I agree; Mr. Tanaka has done great work\nat our Chiba branch.\nRachel New man [10:15 A.M.] So I’ve always\nheard. It would be nice for him to get a quick\ntour of the lab and meet some members of\nthe team before our welcome dinner.\nJun Kambayashi [10:16 A.M.] Sounds good.\nSince flight schedules can be unpredictable,\nI’ll keep you posted as I arrive at the airport.\nRachel New man [10:17 A.M.] Perfect. See\nyou later.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Jun Kambayashi [10:12 A.M.] Rachel, ir\nlooks as if Mr. Tanakas flight will be arriving\n30 minutes earlier this afternoon. I’m on my\nway to pick him up.\nRachel New man [10:13 A.M.] The staff\nare excited that he finally is going to be\nworking with us here. Do you think the\ntwo of you have time to stop here in the\noffice before the end of the workday?\nJun Kambayashi [10:14 A.M.] Probably.\nAnd I agree; Mr. Tanaka has done great work\nat our Chiba branch.\nRachel New man [10:15 A.M.] So I’ve always\nheard. It would be nice for him to get a quick\ntour of the lab and meet some members of\nthe team before our welcome dinner.\nJun Kambayashi [10:16 A.M.] Sounds good.\nSince flight schedules can be unpredictable,\nI’ll keep you posted as I arrive at the airport.\nRachel New man [10:17 A.M.] Perfect. See\nyou later."}],"question":"At 10:16 A.M., what does Mr. Kambayashi mean when he writes, “Sounds good”?","bilingual":"Vào lúc 10:16 sáng, ông Kambayashi có ý gì khi viết “Nghe hay đấy”?","options":["He is pleased with the dinner arrangements.","He likes the idea of stopping by the office before dinner.","He appreciates Mr. Tanaka’s professional reputation.","He is glad that team members have completed their work."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"He likes the idea of stopping by the office before dinner.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"mean","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/min/","meaning":"điểm giữa; ở giữa; cách xa hai thái cực như nhau;"},{"word":"write","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/raɪt/","meaning":"viết, sáng tác"},{"word":"sound","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/saʊnd/","meaning":"những rung động mà tai người có thể phát hiện được;"},{"word":"pleased","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/plizd/","meaning":"nội dung; no; được thỏa mãn mong muốn của mình"}]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"E-Mail Message\nFrom: jenkins@ourmarketfocus.au To: hardesty @gallusmail.au\nDate: 11 August\nSubject: Workshop Notice\nDear Ms. Hardesty,\nO\nt\nThis is to share an important change concerning the 18 August, 4 P.M. Marketing Skills\nWorkshop. Because many more attendees have signed up, we have changed the location\nof our event to\nThe Rill Inn; PERTH\nPlease acknowledge you are aware of the update. I would appreciate it if you could\ntreat this request as urgent and reply as soon as convenient. Should you have any\nquestions about participation, you can e-mail me.\nThank you,\nAndrew Jenkins\nWorkshop Organizer\n¥\nw","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"E-Mail Message\nFrom: jenkins@ourmarketfocus.au To: hardesty @gallusmail.au\nDate: 11 August\nSubject: Workshop Notice\nDear Ms. Hardesty,\nO\nt\nThis is to share an important change concerning the 18 August, 4 P.M. Marketing Skills\nWorkshop. Because many more attendees have signed up, we have changed the location\nof our event to\nThe Rill Inn; PERTH\nPlease acknowledge you are aware of the update. I would appreciate it if you could\ntreat this request as urgent and reply as soon as convenient. Should you have any\nquestions about participation, you can e-mail me.\nThank you,\nAndrew Jenkins\nWorkshop Organizer\n¥\nw"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích của email là gì?","options":["To cancel an event","To announce a new venue","To recruit new workshop presenters","To request volunteers for a workshop"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To announce a new venue\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"cancel","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkæn.səl/","meaning":"hủy bỏ, xóa"},{"word":"event","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪˈvent/","meaning":"sự kiện, sự việc