nothing","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈnəθɪŋ/","meaning":"Không có gì"},{"word":"need","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/nid/","meaning":"yêu cầu; thiếu một mặt hàng không thể thiếu;"}]},{"questionNum":"165","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following online chat discussion.","passageText":"0-0-0\nLindsay Pokora (2:15 P.M.) Hello, Mr. Kopalinski. I need to place the monthly office *\nsupplies order. In addition to the regular items, can you let me know if anything extra is\nneeded?\nCraig Kopalinski (2:17 P.M.) Let me check with the other managers. Kaitlyn and Jeffrey,\ndo you have any requests for office supplies in your departments?\nKaitlyn Daley (2:18 P.M.) Yes, we need more whiteboard markers.\nCraig Kopalinski (2:19 P.M.) And how about accounting?\nJeffrey Carden (2:20 P.M.) Nothing here.\nLindsay Pokora (2:22 P.M.) Markers? I just checked our inventory and we still have a box\nin the supply room. Do you need a special kind?\nKaitlyn Daley (2:23 P.M.) No, just regular black markers. Three boxes should be enough.\nI tried some markers from the box we have, but they seem to have dried up. A group of new\nemployees will be starting next week, and well need markers for the orientation and\ntraining sessions.\nCraig Kopalinski (2:24 P.M.) OK. Lindsay, in addition to those markers, could you please\norder a new chair for the second-floor conference room to replace the one that is broken?\nYou’ll need to look up the model number. Thanks.\n*","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"0-0-0\nLindsay Pokora (2:15 P.M.) Hello, Mr. Kopalinski. I need to place the monthly office *\nsupplies order. In addition to the regular items, can you let me know if anything extra is\nneeded?\nCraig Kopalinski (2:17 P.M.) Let me check with the other managers. Kaitlyn and Jeffrey,\ndo you have any requests for office supplies in your departments?\nKaitlyn Daley (2:18 P.M.) Yes, we need more whiteboard markers.\nCraig Kopalinski (2:19 P.M.) And how about accounting?\nJeffrey Carden (2:20 P.M.) Nothing here.\nLindsay Pokora (2:22 P.M.) Markers? I just checked our inventory and we still have a box\nin the supply room. Do you need a special kind?\nKaitlyn Daley (2:23 P.M.) No, just regular black markers. Three boxes should be enough.\nI tried some markers from the box we have, but they seem to have dried up. A group of new\nemployees will be starting next week, and well need markers for the orientation and\ntraining sessions.\nCraig Kopalinski (2:24 P.M.) OK. Lindsay, in addition to those markers, could you please\norder a new chair for the second-floor conference room to replace the one that is broken?\nYou’ll need to look up the model number. Thanks.\n*"}],"question":"What problem does Ms. Daley report?","bilingual":"Bà Daley báo cáo vấn đề gì?","options":["Some presentations are too long.","Expenses in the office have increased.","Some office supplies cannot be used.","The conference room is not big enough."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Some office supplies cannot be used.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"report","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ri''pɔ:t/","meaning":"bản báo cáo, bản tường thuật; biên bản"},{"word":"presentations","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌprɛzənˈteɪʃənz/","meaning":"Bài thuyết trình"},{"word":"expenses","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɛnsɪz/","meaning":"Chi phí"},{"word":"office","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɔfəs/","meaning":"buồng; văn phòng; đương nhiệm; hãng; thẩm quyền"}]},{"questionNum":"166","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following online chat discussion.","passageText":"0-0-0\nLindsay Pokora (2:15 P.M.) Hello, Mr. Kopalinski. I need to place the monthly office *\nsupplies order. In addition to the regular items, can you let me know if 