,"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"He has shopped with Ready Barn before.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"satisfied","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sætisfaid/","meaning":"cảm thấy hài lòng, cảm thấy vừa ý; thoả mãn"},{"word":"item","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈaɪ.t̬əm/","meaning":"món đồ"},{"word":"ready","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛdi/","meaning":"chuẩn bị; bộ; háo hức; sẵn sàng; nhanh; nhanh"}]},{"questionNum":"181","passageTitle":"Questions 181-185 refer to the following e-mail and boarding pass.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: Yong-Sun Che <ysche@buztech.com> From: Ginny Redman <gredman @silvervaleair.com>\nSubject: RE: Seat problem\nDate: February 12\nAttachment: § Voucher\nDear Mr. Che:\nThank you for contacting us regarding your recent flight. We apologize for the\ndiscomfort you experienced during your flight because of the nonfunctioning\nair-conditioning vent above your seat.\nWe value you as a customer and want to make sure your experience with Silvervale Air\nis positive, so we have attached Voucher 789798 in the amount of $200. This may be\napplied to a future domestic flight with us. The voucher expires after twelve months.\nThank you for choosing Silvervale Air.\nSincerely,\nGinny Redman\nSilvervale Air Customer Service\nPassenger: Mr. Yong-Sun Che\nTicket number: 0272125899649\nConfirmation code: CMOAAB\nFlight Departs\nArrives Seat\nSilvervale Air 29 Atlanta, GA(ATL) Los Angeles, CA(LAX) 36D\nMon.,May 6\n11:43 A.M.\nSummary of airfare charges\nBase fare $259.54\nTaxes and fees $33.76\nVoucher 789798 -$2 0 0. 0 0\nTotal $93.30\nMon., May 6\n1:35 P.M.\nAll passengers are entitled to travel with one complimentary carry-on and one checked bag.\n100","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"*E-mail*\nTo: Yong-Sun Che <ysche@buztech.com> From: Ginny Redman <gredman @silvervaleair.com>\nSubject: RE: Seat problem\nDate: February 12\nAttachment: § Voucher\nDear Mr. Che:\nThank you for contacting us regarding your recent flight. We apologize for the\ndiscomfort you experienced during your flight because of the nonfunctioning\nair-conditioning vent above your seat.\nWe value you as a customer and want to make sure your experience with Silvervale Air\nis positive, so we have attached Voucher 789798 in the amount of $200. This may be\napplied to a future domestic flight with us. The voucher expires after twelve months.\nThank you for choosing Silvervale Air.\nSincerely,\nGinny Redman\nSilvervale Air Customer Service\nPassenger: Mr. Yong-Sun Che\nTicket number: 0272125899649\nConfirmation code: CMOAAB\nFlight Departs\nArrives Seat\nSilvervale Air 29 Atlanta, GA(ATL) Los Angeles, CA(LAX) 36D\nMon.,May 6\n11:43 A.M.\nSummary of airfare charges\nBase fare $259.54\nTaxes and fees $33.76\nVoucher 789798 -$2 0 0. 0 0\nTotal $93.30\nMon., May 6\n1:35 P.M.\nAll passengers are entitled to travel with one complimentary carry-on and one checked bag.\n100"}],"question":"Why did Ms. Redman e-mail Mr. Che?","bilingual":"Tại sao bà Redman lại gửi email cho ông Che?","options":["To update him on the repair of some equipment","To announce changes to airfare pricing","To assign him a new seat","To offer him compensation"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To offer him compensation\".","vocabList":[{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"update","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ʌpˈdeɪt/","meaning":"nâng cấp"},{"word":"repair","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈper/","meaning":"sửa chữa, sửa đổi"},{"word":"equipment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ɪkˈwɪpmənt/","meaning":"quân nhu; các mặt hàng cần thiết; công cụ, dụng cụ hoặc những thứ khác"}]},{"questionNum":"182","passageTitle":"Questions 181-185 refer to the following e-mail and boarding pass.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: Yong-Sun Che <ysche@buztech.com> From: Ginny Redman <gredman @silvervaleair.com>\nSubject: RE: Seat problem\nDate: February 12\nAttachment: § Voucher\nDear Mr. Che:\nThank you for contacting us regarding your recent flight. We apologize for the\ndiscomfort you experienced during your flight because of the nonfunctioning\nair-conditioning vent above your seat.\nWe value you as a customer and want to make sure your experience with Silvervale Air\nis positive, so we have attached Voucher 789798 in the amount of $200. This may be\napplied to a future domestic flight with us. The voucher expires after twelve months.\nThank you for choosing Silvervale Air.\nSincerely,\nGinny Redman\nSilvervale Air Customer Service\nPassenger: Mr. Yong-Sun Che\nTicket number: 0272125899649\nConfirmation code: CMOAAB\nFlight Departs\nArrives Seat\nSilvervale Air 29 Atlanta, GA(ATL) Los Angeles, CA(LAX) 36D\nMon.,May 6\n11:43 A.M.\nSummary of airfare charges\nBase fare $259.54\nTaxes and fees $33.76\nVoucher 789798 -$2 0 0. 0 0\nTotal $93.30\nMon., May 6\n1:35 P.M.\nAll passengers are entitled to travel with one complimentary carry-on and one checked bag.\n100","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"*E-mail*\nTo: Yong-Sun Che <ysche@buztech.com> From: Ginny Redman <gredman @silvervaleair.com>\nSubject: RE: Seat problem\nDate: February 12\nAttachment: § Voucher\nDear Mr. Che:\nThank you for contacting us regarding your recent flight. We apologize for the\ndiscomfort you experienced during your flight because of the nonfunctioning\nair-conditioning vent above your seat.\nWe value you as a customer and want to make sure your expe