it,\ncereal, juice, coffee, and tea. Please be aware, however, that on May 2 breakfast will be served\nin the Fin Restaurant, located on the third floor, to accommodate a private event.\nRegards,\nMalcolm Anderson, Manager\nWesterly Hotel"}],"question":"What is a purpose of the note?","bilingual":"Mục đích của ghi chú là gì?","options":["To request feedback on a recent stay","To inform a guest of a location change","To invite a guest to a private event","To announce the opening of a new hotel 118"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To inform a guest of a location change\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"note","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/noʊt/","meaning":"không nhằm mục đích kiếm lợi nhuận; quan sát; để nhận xét về;"},{"word":"request","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈkwest/","meaning":"yêu cầu"},{"word":"feedback","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈfiːd.bæk/","meaning":"phản hồi, góp ý"}]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following note.","passageText":"I W f l)\nWesterly Hotel\n295 Prudence Ave.\nAtlanta, GA 30317\nDear Guest\nWelcome to Atlanta. We are pleased you have chosen the Westerly Hotel.\nA complimentary breakfast is served daily from 6:00 A.M. to 10:30 A.M. in our dining area\nlocated in the lobby. Enjoy an array of selections including eggs, oatmeal, pastries, fresh fruit,\ncereal, juice, coffee, and tea. Please be aware, however, that on May 2 breakfast will be served\nin the Fin Restaurant, located on the third floor, to accommodate a private event.\nRegards,\nMalcolm Anderson, Manager\nWesterly Hotel","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"I W f l)\nWesterly Hotel\n295 Prudence Ave.\nAtlanta, GA 30317\nDear Guest\nWelcome to Atlanta. We are pleased you have chosen the Westerly Hotel.\nA complimentary breakfast is served daily from 6:00 A.M. to 10:30 A.M. in our dining area\nlocated in the lobby. Enjoy an array of selections including eggs, oatmeal, pastries, fresh fruit,\ncereal, juice, coffee, and tea. Please be aware, however, that on May 2 breakfast will be served\nin the Fin Restaurant, located on the third floor, to accommodate a private event.\nRegards,\nMalcolm Anderson, Manager\nWesterly Hotel"}],"question":"What is stated about the breakfast?","bilingual":"Điều gì được nêu về bữa sáng?","options":["It is free of charge.","It is not available on weekends.","It will not be served on May 2.","It will soon feature more selections."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It is free of charge.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"breakfast","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbrɛkfəst/","meaning":"Bữa sáng"},{"word":"charge","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/tʃɑːrdʒ/","meaning":"chi phí, tiền công; tính giá, đòi trả"},{"word":"available","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈveɪ.lə.bəl/","meaning":"có sẵn để dùng"},{"word":"served","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/sərvd/","meaning":"đã phục vụ"}]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Things Are Happening with the Southeast Rail Line ------- Time to Get Involved!\nPlans are moving forward with the renovations to the Southeast Rail Line. The\nchanges will create a faster, more convenient, more reliable alternative to traveling\non the area’s congested roadways. Construction begins this September. Public\nmeetings to solicit comments regarding design options for the new stations are\nscheduled for June, July, and August. Learn more about the meetings by visiting www.southeastrailproject.com/communityaffairs.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Things Are Happening with the Southeast Rail Line ------- Time to Get Involved!\nPlans are moving forward with the renovations to the Southeast Rail Line. The\nchanges will create a faster, more convenient, more reliable alternative to traveling\non the area’s congested roadways. Construction begins this September. Public\nmeetings to solicit comments regarding design options for the new stations are\nscheduled for June, July, and August. Learn more about the meetings by visiting www.southeastrailproject.com/communityaffairs."}],"question":"When will construction start on the project?","bilingual":"Khi nào dự án sẽ bắt đầu xây dựng?","options":["In June","In July","In August","In September"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"In September\".","vocabList":[{"word":"construction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈstrəkʃən/","meaning":"xây dựng; kết cấu; ngành xây dựng tòa nhà"},{"word":"start","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/stɑrt/","meaning":"bắt đầu"},{"word":"project","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈprɒdʒɛkt/","meaning":"đề án, dự án; kế hoạch"},{"word":"plans","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/plænz/","meaning":"kế hoạch"}]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Things Are Happening with the Southeast Rail Line ------- Time to Get Involved!\nPlans are moving forward with the renovations to the Southeast Rail Line. The\nchanges will create a faster, more convenient, more reliable alternative to traveling\non the area’s congested roadways. Construction begins this September. Public\nmeetings to solicit comments regarding design options for the new stations are\nscheduled for June, July, and August. Learn more about the meetings by visiting www.southeastrailproject.com/communityaffairs.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Things Are Happening with the Southeast Rail Line ------- Time to Get Involved!\nPlans are moving forward with the renovations to the Southeast Rail Line. The\nchanges will create a faster, more convenient, more reliable alternative to traveling\non the area’s congested roadways. Construction begins this September. Public\nmeetings to solicit comments regarding design options for the new stations are\nscheduled for June, July, and August. Learn more about the meetings by visiting www.southeastrailproject.com/communityaffairs."}],"question":"What will be discussed at the public meetings?","bilingual":"Điều gì sẽ được thảo luận tại các cuộc họp công khai?","options":["The reduction of roadway traffic","The source of construction materials","The design of the train stations","The schedule of the express trains"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"The design of the train stations\".","vocabList":[{"word":"discussed","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/dɪˈskəst/","meaning":"đã thảo luận"},{"word":"meeting","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''mi:tiɳ/","meaning":"(chính trị) cuộc mít tinh, cuộc biểu tình"},{"word":"reduction","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ri´dʌkʃən/","meaning":"sự thu nhỏ, sự giảm bớt"},{"word":"traffic","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈtræf.ɪk/","meaning":"giao thông"}]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Questions 153-154 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"Lisa Dominguez (3:24 P.M.)\nHi, Travis. I''m at the market shopping for\ntomatoes, but none of them are ripe. Can\nyou check to see if we have any frozen\ntomato sauce on hand from last week?\nOtherwise, I guess I could get some\ncanned tomatoes.\nTravis Farley (3:27 P.M.)\nI''m afraid we are all out. Let me speak to\nthe chef.\nLisa Dominguez (3:28 P.M.)\nThat would be great.\nTravis Farley (3:32 P.M.)\nShe says that you can pick up red peppers\ninstead. We will need to make a small\nchange to the menu description, but the\nother ingredients can stay the same.\nLisa Dominguez (3:34 P.M.)\nOK. I''ve got it. Thank you!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Lisa Dominguez (3:24 P.M.)\nHi, Travis. I''m at the market shopping for\ntomatoes, but none of them are ripe. Can\nyou check to see if we have any frozen\ntomato sauce on hand from last week?\nOtherwise, I guess I could get some\ncanned tomatoes.\nTravis Farley (3:27 P.M.)\nI''m afraid we are all out. Let me speak to\nthe chef.\nLisa Dominguez (3:28 P.M.)\nThat would be great.\nTravis Farley (3:32 P.M.)\nShe says that you can pick up red peppers\ninstead. We will need to make a small\nchange to the menu description, but the\nother ingredients can stay the same.\nLisa Dominguez (3:34 P.M.)\nOK. I''ve got it. Thank you!"}],"question":"For what kind of business does Mr. Farley most likely work?","bilingual":"Ông Farley có khả năng làm việc cho loại hình kinh doanh nào nhất?","options":["A farm","A grocery store","A restaurant","A delivery service 120"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"A restaurant\".","vocabList":[{"word":"kind","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/kaɪnd/","meaning":"kiểu; loại; lớp học; nhóm sự vật được phân loại"},{"word":"business","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɪznɪs/","meaning":"công ty; doanh nghiệp; buôn bán; thương mại; vấn đề"},{"word":"work","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/wərk/","meaning":"nhân công; nhiệm vụ; nghề nghiệp; nghề nghiệp; ơn gọi; cố gắng"},{"word":"grocery","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈgroʊsəri/","meaning":"cửa hàng bán thực phẩm và đồ gia dụng khá