ity members,\nespecially former ship builders who viewed the\nsite as a treasured industrial landmark.\nWanting their labor to be remembered by\nfuture generations, many ship builders had\netched their names on a wall near the entrance.\n“In the peak of production, shipyard workers\nproduced a naval ship in just a year,” said lead\nengineer, Barney Enyart. “Then production\ngradually slowed, and the shipyard eventually\nclosed. When this project is complete, the new\ncomplex will be enjoyed throughout the year,\nserving as a place for employment\nopportunities and recreation while the legacy\nof the site’s past will endure.”"}],"question":"The word “serving” in paragraph 3, line 7, is closest in meaning to","bilingual":"Từ “phục vụ” trong đoạn 3, dòng 7, gần nghĩa nhất với","options":["attending","functioning","distributing","presenting"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"functioning\".","vocabList":[{"word":"paragraph","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈpɛrəˌgræf/","meaning":"đoạn văn; phần văn bản riêng biệt (thường bắt đầu bằng một"},{"word":"attending","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈtɛndɪŋ/","meaning":"tham dự"},{"word":"functioning","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈfəŋkʃənɪŋ/","meaning":"hoạt động"},{"word":"distributing","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/dɪˈstrɪbjutɪŋ/","meaning":"phân phối"}]},{"questionNum":"164","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following memo.","passageText":"To: Customer Service Team\nFrom: Scott Davis, Director of Customer Service\nDate: July 22\nToday kicks off Harkness Clothiers’ Customer Service Appreciation Week. I\nwant to take this opportunity to thank you for your dedication and\nprofessionalism this year. ------- [1] -------. Each one of you has delivered\nexceptional customer service. Management is proud of what you have\nachieved as a team. ------- [2] -------. We understand that last year’s merger with\nSporting Clothes, Inc., was confusing and difficult at times. Your service\nstayed steady throughout the process and you provided a seamless\ntransition for our clients. What a great accomplishment! ------- [3] -------. On Tuesday, starting at 8 A.M., everyone will be treated to a\nbreakfast served with coffee, pastries, and fruit. On Wednesday, we will\nhave a pot luck lunch in the afternoon. On Thursday, we will host a team\ndinner at Mo’s Bistro after work. On Friday, there will be contests after\nlunch where you can win prizes. ------- [4] -------. I am excited about this week\nand hope you enjoy it.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Customer Service Team\nFrom: Scott Davis, Director of Customer Service\nDate: July 22\nToday kicks off Harkness Clothiers’ Customer Service Appreciation Week. I\nwant to take this opportunity to thank you for your dedication and\nprofessionalism this year. ------- [1] -------. Each one of you has delivered\nexceptional customer service. Management is proud of what you have\nachieved as a team. ------- [2] -------. We understand that last year’s merger with\nSporting Clothes, Inc., was confusing and difficult at times. Your service\nstayed steady throughout the process and you provided a seamless\ntransition for our clients. What a great accomplishment! ------- [3] -------. On Tuesday, starting at 8 A.M., everyone will be treated to a\nbreakfast served with coffee, pastries, and fruit. On Wednesday, we will\nhave a pot luck lunch in the afternoon. On Thursday, we will host a team\ndinner at Mo’s Bistro after work. On Friday, there will be contests after\nlunch where you can win prizes. ------- [4] -------. I am excited about this week\nand hope you enjoy it."}],"question":"Why did Mr. Davis write the memo?","bilingual":"Tại sao ông Davis lại viết bản ghi nhớ?","options":["To ask employees to attend a training session","To request that employees work overtime","To provide details of a celebration","To announce the end of a project"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"To provide details of a celebration\".","vocabList":[{"word":"write","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/raɪt/","meaning":"viết, sáng tác"},{"word":"memo","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈmɛˌmoʊ/","meaning":"lời nhắc nhở; tài liệu nội bộ"},{"word":"employee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ɪmˈplɔɪi/","meaning":"công nhân; người làm việc cho một công ty hoặc một"},{"word":"attend","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtend/","meaning":"tham dự"}]},{"questionNum":"165","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following memo.","passageText":"To: Customer Service Team\nFrom: Scott Davis, Director of Customer Service\nDate: July 22\nToday kicks off Harkness Clothiers’ Customer Service Appreciation Week. I\nwant to take this opportunity to thank you for your dedication and\nprofessionalism this year. ------- [1] -------. Each one of you has delivered\nexceptional customer service. Management is proud of what you have\nachieved as a team. ------- [2] -------. We understand that last year’s merger with\nSporting Clothes, Inc., was confusing and difficult at times. Your service\nstayed steady throughout the process and you provided a seamless\ntransition for our clients. What a great accomplishment! ------- [3] -------. On Tuesday, starting at 8 A.M., everyone will be treated to a\nbreakfast served with coffee, pastries, and fruit. On Wednesday, we will\nhave a pot luck lunch in the afternoon. On Thursday, we will host a team\ndinner at Mo’s Bistro after work. On Friday, there will be contests after\nlunch where you can win prizes. ------- [4] -------. I am excited about this week\nand hope you enjoy it.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Customer Service Team\nFrom: Scott Davis, Director of Customer Service\nDate: July 22\nToday kicks off Harkness Clothiers’ Customer Service Appreciation Week. I\nwant to take this opportunity to thank you for your dedication and\nprofessionalism this year. ------- [1] -------. Each one of you has delivered\nexceptional customer service. Management is proud of what you have\nachieved as a team. ------- [2] -------. We understand that last year’s merger with\nSporting Clothes, Inc., was confusing and difficult at times. Your service\nstayed steady throughout the process and you provided a seamless\ntransition for our clients. What a great accomplishment! ------- [3] -------. On Tuesday, starting at 8 A.M., everyone will be treated to a\nbreakfast served with coffee, pastries, and fruit. On Wednesday, we will\nhave a pot luck lunch in the afternoon. On Thursday, we will host a team\ndinner at Mo’s Bistro after work. On Friday, there will be contests after\nlunch where you can win prizes. ------- [4] -------. I am excited about this week\nand hope you enjoy it."}],"question":"What is suggested about Harkness Clothiers?","bilingual":"Điều gì được đề xuất về Harkness Clothingiers?","options":["It has combined with another company.","It gives awards to staff every year.","It manufactures a line of waterproof clothes.","It has a very small customer service team. 124"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It has combined with another company.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"company","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌm.pə.ni/","meaning":"công ty, bạn bè, bằng hữu"},{"word":"award","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈwɔrd/","meaning":"phần thưởng; khoản trợ cấp; trọng tài"},{"word":"staff","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/stæf/","meaning":"nhân viên"},{"word":"manufacture","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới