uesday, starting at 8 A.M., everyone will be treated to a\nbreakfast served with coffee, pastries, and fruit. On Wednesday, we will\nhave a pot luck lunch in the afternoon. On Thursday, we will host a team\ndinner at Mo’s Bistro after work. On Friday, there will be contests after\nlunch where you can win prizes. ------- [4] -------. I am excited about this week\nand hope you enjoy it."}],"question":"When will an event take place in the morning?","bilingual":"Khi nào một sự kiện sẽ diễn ra vào buổi sáng?","options":["On Tuesday","On Wednesday","On Thursday","On Friday"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"On Tuesday\".","vocabList":[{"word":"event","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪˈvent/","meaning":"sự kiện, sự việc"},{"word":"place","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/pleɪs/","meaning":"vị trí; chức vụ; đứng; vai trò; chức năng"},{"word":"tuesday","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈtuzˌdeɪ/","meaning":"Thứ Ba"},{"word":"wednesday","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈwɛnzˌdeɪ/","meaning":"Thứ Tư"}]},{"questionNum":"167","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following memo.","passageText":"To: Customer Service Team\nFrom: Scott Davis, Director of Customer Service\nDate: July 22\nToday kicks off Harkness Clothiers’ Customer Service Appreciation Week. I\nwant to take this opportunity to thank you for your dedication and\nprofessionalism this year. ------- [1] -------. Each one of you has delivered\nexceptional customer service. Management is proud of what you have\nachieved as a team. ------- [2] -------. We understand that last year’s merger with\nSporting Clothes, Inc., was confusing and difficult at times. Your service\nstayed steady throughout the process and you provided a seamless\ntransition for our clients. What a great accomplishment! ------- [3] -------. On Tuesday, starting at 8 A.M., everyone will be treated to a\nbreakfast served with coffee, pastries, and fruit. On Wednesday, we will\nhave a pot luck lunch in the afternoon. On Thursday, we will host a team\ndinner at Mo’s Bistro after work. On Friday, there will be contests after\nlunch where you can win prizes. ------- [4] -------. I am excited about this week\nand hope you enjoy it.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Customer Service Team\nFrom: Scott Davis, Director of Customer Service\nDate: July 22\nToday kicks off Harkness Clothiers’ Customer Service Appreciation Week. I\nwant to take this opportunity to thank you for your dedication and\nprofessionalism this year. ------- [1] -------. Each one of you has delivered\nexceptional customer service. Management is proud of what you have\nachieved as a team. ------- [2] -------. We understand that last year’s merger with\nSporting Clothes, Inc., was confusing and difficult at times. Your service\nstayed steady throughout the process and you provided a seamless\ntransition for our clients. What a great accomplishment! ------- [3] -------. On Tuesday, starting at 8 A.M., everyone will be treated to a\nbreakfast served with coffee, pastries, and fruit. On Wednesday, we will\nhave a pot luck lunch in the afternoon. On Thursday, we will host a team\ndinner at Mo’s Bistro after work. On Friday, there will be contests after\nlunch where you can win prizes. ------- [4] -------. I am excited about this week\nand hope you enjoy it."}],"question":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3] and [4] does the following sentence best belong? “To show our appreciation, management is providing some opportunities to have fun this week.”","bilingual":"Câu sau đây thuộc về vị trí nào được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]? “Để thể hiện sự đánh giá cao của chúng tôi, ban quản lý đang cung cấp một số cơ hội để vui chơi trong tuần này.”","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"[3]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"position","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pəˈzɪʃən/","meaning":"vị trí, chỗ (của một vật gì)"},{"word":"appreciation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˌpriː.ʃiˈeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"sự đánh giá cao, sự cảm kích"},{"word":"management","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈmænɪʤmənt/","meaning":"người của nhóm người điều hành và quản lý một"},{"word":"customer","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌs.tə.mɚ/","meaning":"khách hàng"}]},{"questionNum":"168","passageTitle":"Questions 168-171 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Friends of the Chesterton Public Library\nBook Sale\nThe Chesterton Public Library will host its annual book sale this weekend on the library’s\nsecond floor. The hours are Saturday, November 16, 9:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M., and Sunday,\nNovember 17, 12:00 noon to 5:00 P.M. A special preview sale for the Friends of Chesterton\nPublic Library (FCPL), the library’s volunteer support group, will be held on Friday,\nNovember 15, from 4:00 P.M. to 8:00 P.M.\nThe sale will include books that the library no longer lends, as well as books donated by the\npublic. Proceeds will be used to develop a children’s reading room.\nWe welcome donations of books for all ages, in all genres, in both paper back and hard cover.\nPlease, note, however, that books that are torn or otherwise defaced will be rejected. Sorry,\nno magazines or journals, please. Donations for this event will be accepted through Friday,\nNovember 8, and can be dropped off at the front desk during the following times:\nMonday to Thursday: 9:00 A.M. to 11:00 A.M.\nWednesday: 1:00 P.M. to 8:00 P.M.\nFriday: 9:00 A.M. to 3:00 P.M.\nThank you for your support!","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Friends of the Chesterton Public Library\nBook Sale\nThe Chesterton Public Library will host its annual book sale this weekend on the library’s\nsecond floor. The hours are Saturday, November 16, 9:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M., and Sunday,\nNovember 17, 12:00 noon to 5:00 P.M. A special preview sale for the Friends of Chesterton\nPublic Library (FCPL), the library’s volunteer support group, will be held on Friday,\nNovember 15, from 4:00 P.M. to 8:00 P.M.\nThe sale will include books that the library no longer lends, as well as books donated by the\npublic. Proceeds will be used to develop a children’s reading room.\nWe welcome donations of books for all ages, in all genres, in both paper back and hard cover.\nPlease, note, however, that books that are torn or otherwise defaced will be rejected. Sorry,\nno magazines or journals, please. Donations for this event will be accepted through Friday,\nNovember 8, and can be dropped off at the front desk during the following times:\nMonday to Thursday: 9:00 A.M. to 11:00 A.M.\nWednesday: 1:00 P.M. to 8:00 P.M.\nFriday: 9:00 A.M. to 3:00 P.M.\nThank you for your support!"}],"question":"Who can attend the sale on Friday?","bilingual":"Ai có thể tham dự đợt giảm giá vào thứ Sáu?","options":["Paid staff","Volunteers","Young children","Financial donors"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Volunteers\".","vocabList":[{"word":"attend","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtend/","meaning":"tham dự"},{"word":"sale","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/seil/","meaning":"sự bán, việc bán"},{"word":"friday","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈfraɪˌdeɪ/","meaning":"Thứ sáu"},{"word":"staff","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/stæf/","meaning":"nhân viên"}]},{"questionNum":"169","passageTitle":"Questions 168-171 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Friends of the Chesterton Public Library\nBook Sale\nThe Chesterton Public Library will host its annual book