person for the third month in a row.\nDanielle Becker (4:13 P.M.) That''s great news, Kaz. By the way, if you can get all your\nreceipts to me as soon as you are back in the office, you will get your travel reimbursement\ncheck early the following week.\nKaz Fedorowitz (4:14 P.M.) Are you sure about that? Didn''t Michael Lim just land a big sale?\nLily Park (4:15 P.M.) Unfortunately, Michael''s customers backed out at the last minute.\nThey decided to lease computers and printers from another firm rather than purchase\nnew equipment.\nKaz Fedorowitz (4:17 P.M.) That''s too bad. And thanks for taking care of that, Danielle.\nDanielle Becker (4:18 P.M.) My pleasure!\nLily Park (4:19 P.M.) Have a wonderful weekend, everyone.\n126"}],"question":"At 4:18 P.M., what does Ms. Becker most likely mean when she writes, “My pleasure!”?","bilingual":"Vào lúc 4:18 chiều, rất có thể cô Becker có ý gì khi viết, “Tôi rất hân hạnh!”?","options":["She is happy to help in refunding some travel expenses.","She is pleased to have successfully obtained a new client.","She feels relieved that it is the end of the workweek.","She is glad to have suggested leasing equipment."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She is happy to help in refunding some travel expenses.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"mean","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/min/","meaning":"điểm giữa; ở giữa; cách xa hai thái cực như nhau;"},{"word":"write","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/raɪt/","meaning":"viết, sáng tác"},{"word":"pleasure","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈplɛʒər/","meaning":"hưởng thụ; vui chơi giải trí; sự giải trí; vui thích; vui sướng"},{"word":"help","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/hɛlp/","meaning":"giúp đỡ"}]},{"questionNum":"176","passageTitle":"Questions 176-180 refer to the following advertisement and e-mail.","passageText":"Get Business Cards Custom Made by You\nLoretti Printing Co. is proud to announce loretticardprint.com, our new online platform for\ncreating customized business cards. While our customers can still place orders in person, as\nthey’ve done for nearly a decade, we now have a system that makes ordering business cards\nespecially quick and easy. Choose from hundreds of easy-to-use templates, include your own\ntext and images, and create professional-quality business cards within minutes.\nWe offer four different paper options:\nType Description Minimum Order\nMatte-Mi Standard card stock, reduces glare 50 cards\nGlossy-G4 Shiny, enhances colors and details 100 cards\nTextured-T3 Unique grid-like pattern, interesting to the touch 100 cards\nMetallic-M2 Extra shiny, unique, captures one’s attention 200 cards\nContact us before placing an online order if you’d like us to send you a sample\nof each type of paper.\n\n*E-mail* n\nTo: hello@loretticardprint.com From: felix @thibaultautoworks.com\nDate: Tuesday, May 22\nSubject: Order 28 191 ------- Follow-up\nAttachment: l!Logo auto works\nThanks for pausing my order right away and explaining how to make the necessary\nchanges. I’m so glad I was able to get in touch before my business cards went off to\nprint. It would have been such a shame to have printed 50 cards I can’t use.\nAs I mentioned over the phone, I had accidentally uploaded an older version of my logo\nto the Web site. I''ve since replaced it with the current one in the same file size, and I’m\nhoping you can confirm that this change reflects the image I’ve included here. If so,\nplease go ahead and submit my order now.\nThank you.\nFelix Thibault\n128","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1 (advertisement)","text":"Get Business Cards Custom Made by You\nLoretti Printing Co. is proud to announce loretticardprint.com, our new online platform for\ncreating customized business cards. While our customers can still place orders in person, as\nthey’ve done for nearly a decade, we now have a system that makes ordering business cards\nespecially quick and easy. Choose from hundreds of easy-to-use templates, include your own\ntext and images, and create professional-quality business cards within minutes.\nWe offer four different paper options:\nType Description Minimum Order\nMatte-Mi Standard card stock, reduces glare 50 cards\nGlossy-G4 Shiny, enhances colors and details 100 cards\nTextured-T3 Unique grid-like pattern, interesting to the touch 100 cards\nMetallic-M2 Extra shiny, unique, captures one’s attention 200 cards\nContact us before placing an online order if you’d like us to send you a sample\nof each type of paper."},{"label":"Văn bản 2 (e-mail)","text":"*E-mail* n\nTo: hello@loretticardprint.com From: felix @thibaultautoworks.com\nDate: Tuesday, May 22\nSubject: Order 28 191 ------- Follow-up\nAttachment: l!Logo auto works\nThanks for pausing my order right away and explaining how to make the necessary\nchanges. I’m so glad I was able to get in touch before my business cards went off to\nprint. It would have been such a shame to have printed 50 cards I can’t use.\nAs I mentioned over the phone, I had accidentally uploaded an older version of my logo\nto the Web site. I''ve since replaced it with the current one in the same file size, and I’m\nhoping you can confirm that this change reflects the image I’ve included here. If so,\nplease go ahead and submit my order now.\nThank you.\nFelix Thibault\n128"}],"question":"What is implied about Loretti Printing Co.?","bilingual":"Điều gì được ngụ ý về Công ty In ấn Loretti?","options":["It has a physical retail location.","It is merging with a card company.","It is seeking experienced designers.","It has expanded its paper selection."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It has a physical retail location.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"retail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈriteɪl , rɪˈteɪl/","meaning":"sự bán lẻ, việc bán lẻ"},{"word":"location","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/loʊˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"địa điểm; chức vụ; tình huống; địa điểm; điểm"},{"word":"card","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kɑrd/","meaning":"yêu cầu nhận dạng (tức là trong một quán bar)"},{"word":"company","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌm.pə.ni/","meaning":"công ty, bạn bè, bằng hữu"}]},{"questionNum":"177","passageTitle":"Questions 176-180 refer to the following advertisement and e-mail.","passageText":"Get Business Cards Custom Made by You\nLoretti Printing Co. is proud to announce loretticardprint.com, our new online platform for\ncreating customized business cards. While our customers can still place orders in person, as\nthey’ve done for nearly a decade, we now have a system that makes ordering business cards\nespecially quick and easy. Choose from hundreds of easy-to-use templates, include your own\ntext and images, and create professional-quality business cards within minutes.\nWe offer four different paper options:\nType Description Minimum Order\nMatte-Mi Standard card stock, reduces glare 50 cards\nGlossy-G4 Shiny, enhances colors and details 100 cards\nTextured-T3 Unique grid-like pattern, interesting to the touch 100 cards\nMetallic-M2 Extra shiny, unique, captures one’s attention 200 cards\nContact us before placing an online order if you’d like us to send you a sample\nof each type of paper.\n\n*E-mail* n\nTo: hello@loretticardprint.com From: felix @thibaultautoworks.com\nDate: Tuesday, May 22\nSubject: Order 28 191 ------- Follow-up\nAttachment: l!Logo auto works\nThanks for pausing my order right away and explaining how to make the necessary\nchanges. I’m so glad I was able to get in touch before my business cards went off to\nprint. It would have been such a shame to have printed 50 cards I can’t use.\nAs I mentioned over the phone, I had accidentally uploaded an older 