ts cannot be accepted after April 1. Return of these products\ncannot be accepted after May 1.\n134\n\nANTIZIO International\n~~ Merchandise Return ------- Please review our return policy before submitting this form. Returns must be made within\n60 days of purchase and must be in original, unused condition.\nReturn date: May 12\nCustomer name: William Lin, WKL Contractors, Inc.\nOriginal invoice date: March 20\nItem name: Medoro brand-\"Elemen+a\" +ile\nColor: pray\nQuantity: 20 boxes 70\nPrice/box:^\nReason for return: Actual color does no+ ma+ch image\nca+alo^\nForm of return requested: [X] Refund Q Store credit"}],"question":"Why will Mr. Lin’s refund request most likely be rejected?","bilingual":"Tại sao yêu cầu hoàn tiền của ông Lin rất có thể sẽ bị từ chối?","options":["He bought an item that was custom designed.","He failed to include proof of purchase.","He returned a product after a deadline had expired.","He forgot to ask for a return authorization number."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"He returned a product after a deadline had expired.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"refund","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈrifʌnd/","meaning":"trả lại, sự trả lại"},{"word":"request","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈkwest/","meaning":"yêu cầu"},{"word":"item","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈaɪ.t̬əm/","meaning":"món đồ"},{"word":"custom","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌs.təm/","meaning":"phong tục, tục lệ"}]},{"questionNum":"196","passageTitle":"Questions 196-200 refer to the following e-mails and schedule.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: All Staff\nFrom: Ronald Garrison\nDate: April 20\nSubject: Update\nDear Colleagues,\nIt’s an exciting time here at Zikomo Solutions, and we have a lot to celebrate! Our\ncompany has shown tremendous growth over the past year. Just last month we exceeded\nour goals and conducted 25 customer service workshops for 18 different companies in\nthe greater Groton area.\nIn response to our growth, we have added three new workshop presenters with\nsignificant customer service experience in their respective industries. Lisa Okoro will\nfocus on the telemarketing industry. Caleb Patel will train those in fields related to\nmedicine. And Alan Gorospe will specialize mainly in customer service for the\ntechnology industry. They will begin giving workshops during the first or second week\nof May. Please join me in welcoming these professionals to the Zikomo family.\nRonald Garrison\nCEO, Zikomo Solutions\n''\nZikomo Solutions\nTentative training schedule\nWeek of May 2\nCourse Name Course Date Trainer Location\nLength\nTelephone Skills Half Day May 2 Lisa Okoro Zikomo, Groton\nCustomer Service in a Full Day May 3 Alan Gorospe Zikomo, Groton\nDigital World\nPatient Relations for Full Day May 4 To Be Fitzer Medical\nHospital Professionals Determined Group, West\nGroton\nTurn Tech Problems into Half Day May 5 Alan Gorospe Callipher\nMarketing Opportunities Technologies,\nFayetteville\n136\n\n\"E-mail*\n\nTo: Ronald Garrison <rgai Tison @zikomosolutions.net>\nFrom: Jana Snyder <jsnyder@snyder.com> Date: May 8\nSubject: Recent workshops\nDear Mr. Garrison,\nSeveral of my employees from Snyder Goods attended Zikomo training sessions on\nMay 2 and 3. I wanted to provide feedback and ask a question. I think the half-day\nsession could be extended to a full day, considering the interesting topic and skill of the\nexcellent presenter. Conversely, the full day, while interesting, would be better\ncondensed into a half day. Additionally, could you provide more parking options?\nSpaces for participants were full, and a number of our Snyder Goods employees had to\npark in an expensive paid lot.\nSincerely,\nJana Snyder\nSnyder Goods","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1 (e-mails)","text":"*E-mail*\nTo: All Staff\nFrom: Ronald Garrison\nDate: April 20\nSubject: Update\nDear Colleagues,\nIt’s an exciting time here at Zikomo Solutions, and we have a lot to celebrate! Our\ncompany has shown tremendous growth over the past year. Just last month we exceeded\nour goals and conducted 25 customer service workshops for 18 different companies in\nthe greater Groton area.\nIn response to our growth, we have added three new workshop presenters with\nsignificant customer service experience in their respective industries. Lisa Okoro will\nfocus on the telemarketing industry. Caleb Patel will train those in fields related to\nmedicine. And Alan Gorospe will specialize mainly in customer service for the\ntechnology industry. They will begin giving workshops during the first or second week\nof May. Please join me in welcoming these professionals to the Zikomo family.\nRonald Garrison\nCEO, Zikomo Solutions\n''\nZikomo Solutions\nTentative training schedule\nWeek of May 2\nCourse Name Course Date Trainer Location\nLength\nTelephone Skills Half Day May 2 Lisa Okoro Zikomo, Groton\nCustomer Service in a Full Day May 3 Alan Gorospe Zikomo, Groton\nDigital World\nPatient Relations for Full Day May 4 To Be Fitzer Medical\nHospital Professionals Determined Group, West\nGroton\nTurn Tech Problems into Half Day May 5 Alan Gorospe Callipher\nMarketing Opportunities Technologies,\nFayetteville\n136\n\n\"E-mail*"},{"label":"Văn bản 2 (schedule)","text":"To: Ronald Garrison <rgai Tison @zikomosolutions.net>\nFrom: Jana Snyder <jsnyder@snyder.com> Date: May 8\nSubject: Recent workshops\nDear Mr. Garrison,\nSeveral of my employees from Snyder Goods attended Zikomo training sessions on\nMay 2 and 3. I wanted to provide feedback and ask a question. I think the half-day\nsession could be extended to a full day, considering the interesting topic and skill of the\nexcellent presenter. Conversely, the full day, while interesting, would be better\ncondensed into a half day. Additionally, could you provide more parking options?\nSpaces for participants were full, and a number of our Snyder Goods employees had to\npark in an expensive paid lot.\nSincerely,\nJana Snyder\nSnyder Goods"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the first e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích của email đầu tiên là gì?","options":["To announce the hiring of new staff members","To invite employees to a celebration","To outline a plan for a company’s growth","To recognize high-performing employees"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"To announce the hiring of new staff members\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"staff","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/stæf/","meaning":"nhân viên"},{"word":"member","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈmɛmbər/","meaning":"người thuộc một tổ chức, nhóm; phần;"}]},{"questionNum":"197","passageTitle":"Questions 196-200 refer to the following e-mails and schedule.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: All Staff\nFrom: Ronald Garrison\nDate: April 20\nSubject: Update\nDear Colleagues,\nIt’s an exciting time here at Zikomo Solutions, and we have a lot to celebrate! Our\ncompany has shown tremendous growth over the past year. Just last month we exceeded\nour goals and conducted 25 customer service workshops for 18 different companies in\nthe greater Groton area.\nIn response to our growth, we have added three new workshop presenters with\nsignificant customer service experience in their respective industries. Lisa Okoro will\nfocus on the telemarketing industry. Caleb Patel will train those in fields related to\nmedicine. And Alan Gorospe will specialize mainly in customer service for the\ntechnology industry. They wil