an Gorospe Callipher\nMarketing Opportunities Technologies,\nFayetteville\n136\n\n\"E-mail*\n\nTo: Ronald Garrison <rgai Tison @zikomosolutions.net>\nFrom: Jana Snyder <jsnyder@snyder.com> Date: May 8\nSubject: Recent workshops\nDear Mr. Garrison,\nSeveral of my employees from Snyder Goods attended Zikomo training sessions on\nMay 2 and 3. I wanted to provide feedback and ask a question. I think the half-day\nsession could be extended to a full day, considering the interesting topic and skill of the\nexcellent presenter. Conversely, the full day, while interesting, would be better\ncondensed into a half day. Additionally, could you provide more parking options?\nSpaces for participants were full, and a number of our Snyder Goods employees had to\npark in an expensive paid lot.\nSincerely,\nJana Snyder\nSnyder Goods","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1 (e-mails)","text":"*E-mail*\nTo: All Staff\nFrom: Ronald Garrison\nDate: April 20\nSubject: Update\nDear Colleagues,\nIt’s an exciting time here at Zikomo Solutions, and we have a lot to celebrate! Our\ncompany has shown tremendous growth over the past year. Just last month we exceeded\nour goals and conducted 25 customer service workshops for 18 different companies in\nthe greater Groton area.\nIn response to our growth, we have added three new workshop presenters with\nsignificant customer service experience in their respective industries. Lisa Okoro will\nfocus on the telemarketing industry. Caleb Patel will train those in fields related to\nmedicine. And Alan Gorospe will specialize mainly in customer service for the\ntechnology industry. They will begin giving workshops during the first or second week\nof May. Please join me in welcoming these professionals to the Zikomo family.\nRonald Garrison\nCEO, Zikomo Solutions\n''\nZikomo Solutions\nTentative training schedule\nWeek of May 2\nCourse Name Course Date Trainer Location\nLength\nTelephone Skills Half Day May 2 Lisa Okoro Zikomo, Groton\nCustomer Service in a Full Day May 3 Alan Gorospe Zikomo, Groton\nDigital World\nPatient Relations for Full Day May 4 To Be Fitzer Medical\nHospital Professionals Determined Group, West\nGroton\nTurn Tech Problems into Half Day May 5 Alan Gorospe Callipher\nMarketing Opportunities Technologies,\nFayetteville\n136\n\n\"E-mail*"},{"label":"Văn bản 2 (schedule)","text":"To: Ronald Garrison <rgai Tison @zikomosolutions.net>\nFrom: Jana Snyder <jsnyder@snyder.com> Date: May 8\nSubject: Recent workshops\nDear Mr. Garrison,\nSeveral of my employees from Snyder Goods attended Zikomo training sessions on\nMay 2 and 3. I wanted to provide feedback and ask a question. I think the half-day\nsession could be extended to a full day, considering the interesting topic and skill of the\nexcellent presenter. Conversely, the full day, while interesting, would be better\ncondensed into a half day. Additionally, could you provide more parking options?\nSpaces for participants were full, and a number of our Snyder Goods employees had to\npark in an expensive paid lot.\nSincerely,\nJana Snyder\nSnyder Goods"}],"question":"What does the schedule indicate about the workshops?","bilingual":"Lịch trình cho biết gì về các buổi hội thảo?","options":["Several are held on the same day.","Some are held at Zikomo’s office.","They typically last a full day.","They are usually filled to capacity. Stop! This is the end of the test. If you back to Parts 5, 6, and"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Some are held at Zikomo’s office.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"schedule","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''skedʒu:l/","meaning":"kế hoạch làm việc, tiến độ thi công"},{"word":"indicate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈɪn.də.keɪt/","meaning":"chỉ ra, chứng tỏ, biểu thị"},{"word":"workshop","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈwɝːk.ʃɑːp/","meaning":"hội thảo"},{"word":"several","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sevrəl/","meaning":"vài, riêng, cá nhân; khác nhau"}]},{"questionNum":"199","passageTitle":"Questions 196-200 refer to the following e-mails and schedule.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: All Staff\nFrom: Ronald Garrison\nDate: April 20\nSubject: Update\nDear Colleagues,\nIt’s an exciting time here at Zikomo Solutions, and we have a lot to celebrate! Our\ncompany has shown tremendous growth over the past year. Just last month we exceeded\nour goals and conducted 25 customer service workshops for 18 different companies in\nthe greater Groton area.\nIn response to our growth, we have added three new workshop presenters with\nsignificant customer service experience in their respective industries. Lisa Okoro will\nfocus on the telemarketing industry. Caleb Patel will train those in fields related to\nmedicine. And Alan Gorospe will specialize mainly in customer service for the\ntechnology industry. They will begin giving workshops during the first or second week\nof May. Please join me in welcoming these professionals to the Zikomo family.\nRonald Garrison\nCEO, Zikomo Solutions\n''\nZikomo Solutions\nTentative training schedule\nWeek of May 2\nCourse Name Course Date Trainer Location\nLength\nTelephone Skills Half Day May 2 Lisa Okoro Zikomo, Groton\nCustomer Service in a Full Day May 3 Alan Gorospe Zikomo, Groton\nDigital World\nPatient Relations for Full Day May 4 To Be Fitzer Medical\nHospital Professionals Determined Group, West\nGroton\nTurn Tech Problems into Half Day May 5 Alan Gorospe Callipher\nMarketing Opportunities Technologies,\nFayetteville\n136\n\n\"E-mail*\n\nTo: Ronald Garrison <rgai Tison @zikomosolutions.net>\nFrom: Jana Snyder <jsnyder@snyder.com> Date: May 8\nSubject: Recent workshops\nDear Mr. Garrison,\nSeveral of my employees from Snyder Goods attended Zikomo training sessions on\nMay 2 and 3. I wanted to provide feedback and ask a question. I think the half-day\nsession could be extended to a full day, considering the interesting topic and skill of the\nexcellent presenter. Conversely, the full day, while interesting, would be better\ncondensed into a half day. Additionally, could you provide more parking options?\nSpaces for participants were full, and a number of our Snyder Goods employees had to\npark in an expensive paid lot.\nSincerely,\nJana Snyder\nSnyder Goods","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1 (e-mails)","text":"*E-mail*\nTo: All Staff\nFrom: Ronald Garrison\nDate: April 20\nSubject: Update\nDear Colleagues,\nIt’s an exciting time here at Zikomo Solutions, and we have a lot to celebrate! Our\ncompany has shown tremendous growth over the past year. Just last month we exceeded\nour goals and conducted 25 customer service workshops for 18 different companies in\nthe greater Groton area.\nIn response to our growth, we have added three new workshop presenters with\nsignificant customer service experience in their respective industries. Lisa Okoro will\nfocus on the telemarketing industry. Caleb Patel will train those in fields related to\nmedicine. And Alan Gorospe will specialize mainly in customer service for the\ntechnology industry. They will begin giving workshops during the first or second week\nof May. Please join me in welcoming these professionals to the Zikomo family.\nRonald Garrison\nCEO, Zikomo Solutions\n''\nZikomo Solutions\nTentative training schedule\nWeek of May 2\nCourse Name Course Date Trainer Location\nLength\nTelephone Skills Half Day May 2 Lisa Okoro Zikomo, Groton\nCustomer Service in a Full Day May 3 Alan Gorospe Zikomo, Groton\nDigital World\nPatient Relations for Full Day May 4 To Be Fitzer Medical\nHospital Professionals Determined Group, West\nGroton\nTurn Tech Problems into Half Day May 5 Alan Gorospe Callipher\nMarketing Opportunities Technologies,\nFayetteville\n136\n\n\"E-mail*"},{"label":"Văn bản 2 (schedule)","text":"To: Ronald Garrison <rgai Tison @zikomosolutions.net>\nFrom: Jana Snyder <jsnyder@snyder.com> Date: May 8\nSubject: Recent workshops\nDear Mr. Garrison,\nSeveral of my employees from Snyder Goods attended Zikomo training sessions on\nMay 2 and 3. I wanted to provide feedback and ask a question. I think the half-day\nsession could be extended to a full day, considering the interesting topic and skill of the\nexcellent presenter. Conversely, the full day, while interesting, would be better\ncondensed into a half day. Additionally, could you provide more parking options?\nSpaces for participants were full, and a number of our Snyder Goods employees had to\npark in an expensive paid lot.\nSincerely,\nJana Snyder\nSnyder Goods"}],"question":"Who is most qualified to lead the workshop on May 4?","bilingual":"Ai đủ tư cách nhất để dẫn dắt workshop vào ngày 4 tháng 5?","options":["Mr. Garrison","Ms. Okoro","Mr. Patel","Mr. Gorospe"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Mr. Patel\".","vocabList":[{"word":"qualified","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkwɒləˌfaɪd/","meaning":"đủ tư cách, khả năng, điều kiện"},{"word":"lead","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/lɛd/","meaning":"tiến hành; hướng dẫn; chỉ đạo; ảnh hưởng"},{"word":"workshop","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈwɝːk.ʃɑːp/","meaning":"hội thảo"},{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"}]},{"questionNum":"200","passageTitle":"Questions 196-200 refer to the following e-mails and schedule.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: All Staff\nFrom: Ronald Garrison\nDate: April 20\nSubject: Update\nDear Colleagues,\nIt’s an exciting time here at Zikomo Solutions, and we have a lot to celebrate! Our\ncompany has shown tremendous growth over the past year. Just last month we exceeded\nour goals and conducted 25 customer service workshops for 18 di