meaning":"hạn chế lượng thức ăn ăn vào; chỉ ăn nhất định"},{"word":"analysis","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈnæl.ə.sɪs/","meaning":"sự phân tích, bản phân tích"}]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"To: All Residents\nFrom: Dan Madsen\nDate: 20 September\nSubject: Georgetown Marathon\nTo all Thompson Towers residents:\nThe 25th annual Georgetown Marathon will be held next Saturday. This year, for the first\ntime, the race will turn off of River Street and proceed onto Elmont Avenue. So on\nSaturday, there will be nearly 5,000 registered contestants running along the stretch of road\nthat provides the only access to our Thompson Towers parking garage entrance.\nUnsurprisingly, Elmont Avenue will be closed to all vehicle traffic between 7:00 A.M. and\n10:45 A.M. This means that residents’ cars will not be able to enter or exit our parking\ngarage during this event. If you know that you will need to use your car during this\nperiod, we recommend that you make arrangements ahead of time for either leaving early\nor parking elsewhere.\nFor more information about the race, including maps, registration guidelines, and\nalternative parking locations, please go to www.georgetownmarathon.co.uk. Sincerely yours,\nDan Madsen\nProperty Manager, Thompson Towers","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: All Residents\nFrom: Dan Madsen\nDate: 20 September\nSubject: Georgetown Marathon\nTo all Thompson Towers residents:\nThe 25th annual Georgetown Marathon will be held next Saturday. This year, for the first\ntime, the race will turn off of River Street and proceed onto Elmont Avenue. So on\nSaturday, there will be nearly 5,000 registered contestants running along the stretch of road\nthat provides the only access to our Thompson Towers parking garage entrance.\nUnsurprisingly, Elmont Avenue will be closed to all vehicle traffic between 7:00 A.M. and\n10:45 A.M. This means that residents’ cars will not be able to enter or exit our parking\ngarage during this event. If you know that you will need to use your car during this\nperiod, we recommend that you make arrangements ahead of time for either leaving early\nor parking elsewhere.\nFor more information about the race, including maps, registration guidelines, and\nalternative parking locations, please go to www.georgetownmarathon.co.uk. Sincerely yours,\nDan Madsen\nProperty Manager, Thompson Towers"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích của email là gì?","options":["To encourage participation in a race","To warn of an upcoming road closure","To reschedule a tenant meeting","To announce a construction plan 148"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To warn of an upcoming road closure\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"encourage","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˈkɝː.ɪdʒ/","meaning":"động viên, cổ vũ"},{"word":"warn","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/wɔːrn/","meaning":"cảnh báo"}]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"To: All Residents\nFrom: Dan Madsen\nDate: 20 September\nSubject: Georgetown Marathon\nTo all Thompson Towers residents:\nThe 25th annual Georgetown Marathon will be held next Saturday. This year, for the first\ntime, the race will turn off of River Street and proceed onto Elmont Avenue. So on\nSaturday, there will be nearly 5,000 registered contestants running along the stretch of road\nthat provides the only access to our Thompson Towers parking garage entrance.\nUnsurprisingly, Elmont Avenue will be closed to all vehicle traffic between 7:00 A.M. and\n10:45 A.M. This means that residents’ cars will not be able to enter or exit our parking\ngarage during this event. If you know that you will need to use your car during this\nperiod, we recommend that you make arrangements ahead of time for either leaving early\nor parking elsewhere.\nFor more information about the race, including maps, registration guidelines, and\nalternative parking locations, please go to www.georgetownmarathon.co.uk. Sincerely yours,\nDan Madsen\nProperty Manager, Thompson Towers","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: All Residents\nFrom: Dan Madsen\nDate: 20 September\nSubject: Georgetown Marathon\nTo all Thompson Towers residents:\nThe 25th annual Georgetown Marathon will be held next Saturday. This year, for the first\ntime, the race will turn off of River Street and proceed onto Elmont Avenue. So on\nSaturday, there will be nearly 5,000 registered contestants running along the stretch of road\nthat provides the only access to our Thompson Towers parking garage entrance.\nUnsurprisingly, Elmont Avenue will be closed to all vehicle traffic between 7:00 A.M. and\n10:45 A.M. This means that residents’ cars will not be able to enter or exit our parking\ngarage during this event. If you know that you will need to use your car during this\nperiod, we recommend that you make arrangements ahead of time for either leaving early\nor parking elsewhere.\nFor more information about the race, including maps, registration guidelines, and\nalternative parking locations, please go to www.georgetownmarathon.co.uk. Sincerely yours,\nDan Madsen\nProperty Manager, Thompson Towers"}],"question":"What is indicated about the Georgetown Marathon?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về Georgetown Marathon?","options":["It has close to 5,000 participants.","It is being held for the first time.","It starts on Elmont Avenue.","It includes participants from Thompson Towers."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It has close to 5,000 participants.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"close","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kloʊz/","meaning":"gần đó"},{"word":"participant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pa:´tisipənt/","meaning":"người tham gia, người tham dự"},{"word":"start","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/stɑrt/","meaning":"bắt đầu"},{"word":"include","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˈkluːd/","meaning":"bao gồm, gồm có"}]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following page from a handbook.","passageText":"One reason that corrugated fiber board has become such a popular material\nfor shipping fresh vegetables and fruits is the ease of labeling the containers.\nInformation such as the brand, size, and grade of the produce can be printed\ndirectly on the box after it has been formed. Although this method, known as\n“post printing,” is the most economical way of labeling fiber board containers,\nit is limited to only one or two colors. Full-color graphics can be obtained by\nprinting the information on the box before it has been formed. This method,\nknown as “pre printing,” costs about 15 percent more, but many supermarket\nmanagers prefer it because customers are attracted to the colorful displays,\nwhich leads to increased sales.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"One reason that corrugated fiber board has become such a popular material\nfor shipping fresh vegetables and fruits is the ease of labeling the containers.\nInformation such as the brand, size, and grade of the produce can be printed\ndirectly on the box after it has been formed. Although this method, known as\n“post printing,” is the most economical way of labeling fiber board containers,\nit is limited to only one or two colors. Full-color graphics can be obtained by\nprinting the information on the box before it has been formed. This method,\nknown as “pre printing,” costs about 15 percent more, but many supermarket\nmanagers prefer it because customers are attracted to the colorful displays,\nwhich leads to increased sales."}],"question":"What is indicated about corrugated fiber board boxes?","bilingual":"Hộp bìa cứng sóng được chỉ định những gì?","options":["They are easy to label.","They hold more than other containers.","They keep vegetables fresh.","They are used less often than other types."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"They are easy to label.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"board","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/bɔːrd/","meaning":"tấm ván, bảng, mạn thuyền"},{"word":"they","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ðeɪ/","meaning":"họ"},{"word":"easy","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈizi/","meaning":"nhẹ nhàng; nhẹ; thoải mái; đơn giản"},{"word":"label","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''leɪbl/","meaning":"nhãn, nhãn hiệu"}]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following page from a handbook.","passageText":"One reason that corrugated fiber board has become such a popular material\nfor shipping fresh vegetables and fruits is the ease of labeling the containers.\nInformation such as the brand, size, and grade of the produce can be printed\ndirectly on the box after it has been formed. Although this method, known as\n“post printing,” is the most economical way of labeling fiber board containers,\nit is limited to only one or two colors. Full-color graphics can be obtained by\nprinting the information on the box before it has been formed. This method,\nknown as “pre printing,” costs about 15 percent more, but many supermarket\nmanagers prefer it because customers are attracted to the colorful displays,\nwhich leads to increased sales.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"One reason that corrugated fiber board has become such a popular material\nfor shipping fresh vegetables and fruits is the ease of labeling the containers.\nInformation such as the brand, size, and grade of the produce can be printed\ndirectly on the box after it has been formed. Although this method, known as\n“post printing,” is the most economical way of labeling fiber board containers,\nit is limited to only one or two colors. Full-color graphics can be obtained by\nprinting the information on the box before it has been formed. This method,\nknown as “pre printing,” costs about 15 percent more, but many supermarket\nmanagers prefer it because customers are attracted to the colorful displays,\nwhich leads to increased sales."}],"question":"Why do store managers generally prefer boxes with full-color graphics?","bilingual":"Tại sao người quản lý cửa hàng thường thích những chiếc hộp có hình ảnh đầy màu sắc?","options":["They can be cleaned and reused.","They come in a wide variety of sizes.","They are often requested by customers.","They increase customers’ purchases."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"They increase customers’ purchases.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"store","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/stɔr/","meaning":"cửa hàng; nơi bán hàng hóa; cung cấp"},{"word":"manager","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈmænɪʤər/","meaning":"người điều hành một công ty; giám đốc; quản trị viên;"},{"word":"prefer","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pri''fə:/","meaning":"thích hơn, ưa hơn"},{"word":"they","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ðeɪ/","meaning":"họ"}]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Questions 153-155 refer to the following job advertisement.","passageText":"ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT\nPosition Summary:\nNaidu Rai Electronics, one of the world’s leading manufacturers in the telecommunications\nindustry, is seeking a full-time administrative assistant in our Jaipur office.\nResponsibilities:\n1. Provide administrative support for members of the product design team, including travel\nand expense reports\n2. Schedule appointments with prospective clients and designers\n3. Maintain files, process documents, and com pile reports\nRequired Qualifications/Education:\nSenior school certificate mandatory; business school certification preferred\nSkills:\n1. Strong interpersonal skills\n2. Strong organizational and planning skills\n3. Software proficiency\nTo be considered, e-mail your resume and cover letter to s.mohta@naiduraielec.in; candidates\nselected for an interview will be required to take a basic software proficiency test.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT\nPosition Summary:\nNaidu Rai Electronics, one of the world’s leading manufacturers in the telecommunications\nindustry, is seeking a full-time administrative assistant in our Jaipur office.\nResponsibilities:\n1. Provide administrative support for members of the product design team, including travel\nand expense reports\n2. Schedule appointments with prospective clients and designers\n3. Maintain files, process documents, and com pile reports\nRequired Qualifications/Education:\nSenior school certificate mandatory; business school certification preferred\nSkills:\n1. Strong interpersonal skills\n2. Strong organizational and planning skills\n3. Software proficiency\nTo be considered, e-mail your resume and cover letter to s.mohta@naiduraielec.in; candidates\nselected for an interview will be required to take a basic software proficiency test."}],"question":"What is indicated about the job?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về công việc?","options":["It involves working with product designers.","It requires frequent travel.","It is a temporary position.","It has been available for several months."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It involves working with product designers.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"involve","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈvɑlv/","meaning":"gây ra mối quan tâm; tham gia; để chiếm lĩnh"},{"word":"product","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈprɑdəkt/","meaning":"kết quả sản xuất; hàng hóa; hàng hóa"},{"word":"require","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ri''kwaiə(r)/","meaning":"đòi hỏi, yêu cầu; quy định"},{"word":"frequent","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈfrikˌwɛnt/","meaning":"xảy ra thường xuyên; thường xuyên; chung; thường"}]},{"questionNum":"154","passageTitle":"Questions 153-155 refer to the following job advertisement.","passageText":"ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT\nPosition Summary:\nNaidu Rai Electronics, one of the world’s leading manufacturers in the telecommunications\nindustry, is seeking a full-time administrative assistant in our Jaipur office.\nResponsibilities:\n1. Provide administrative support for members of the product design team, including travel\nand expense reports\n2. Schedule appointments with prospective clients and designers\n3. Maintain files, process documents, and com pile reports\nRequired Qualifications/Education:\nSenior school certificate mandatory; business school certification preferred\nSkills:\n1. Strong interpersonal skills\n2. Strong organizational and planning skills\n3. Software proficiency\nTo be considered, e-mail your resume and cover letter to s.mohta@naiduraielec.in; candidates\nselected for an interview will be required to take a basic software proficiency test.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT\nPosition Summary:\nNaidu Rai Electronics, one of the world’s leading manufacturers in the telecommunications\n