rne Colton Hotel is pleased to announce that construction of the\nnew Yarra River wing is now completed. ------- [2] -------. This new section offers extended-stay\napartments, which are ideal for executives who are relocating or for people on company\ntravel for more than a week. We offer furnished one- and two-bedroom apartments with\na living room, work space, and full kitchen. ------- [3] -------.\nWe offer:\n•Different levels of pricing for housekeeping\n•A variety of low-cost Internet and phone plans\n•Conference facilities that can be booked for a minimal fee\n•Short-term gym memberships at several nearby fitness centers\n•Complimentary coffee served each morning in the lobby\nThe Melbourne Colton Hotel is close to transportation, tourist sites, and shopping.\nContact reservations@coltonhotels.com.au for more information or call 61 3 7010 9921. ------- [4]\nJ *"}],"question":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3] and [4] does the following sentence best belong? “In addition, optional services are available for extended-stay guests.”","bilingual":"Câu sau đây thuộc về vị trí nào trong số các vị trí được đánh dấu [1], [2], [3] và [4]? “Ngoài ra, còn có các dịch vụ tùy chọn dành cho khách lưu trú dài ngày.”","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"[3]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"position","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pəˈzɪʃən/","meaning":"vị trí, chỗ (của một vật gì)"},{"word":"addition","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈdɪʃən/","meaning":"bổ sung; phép toán"},{"word":"service","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sə:vis/","meaning":"sự phục vụ, sự hầu hạ"},{"word":"available","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈveɪ.lə.bəl/","meaning":"có sẵn để dùng"}]},{"questionNum":"162","passageTitle":"Questions 162-163 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"[2:11P.M.] Frank Stern: 4\nHi, Petra. A customer wants1,000 glossy color posters,\ndouble-sided. Any chance we can do this today? If not,\nthey might take the job elsewhere.\n[2:12 P.M.] Petra Kitzos:\nProbably not. We’re backed up with a big job for Noble\nArchitects. How about first thing tomorrow?\n[2:12 P.M.] Frank Stern:\nI’ll ask.\n[2:13 P.M.] Frank Stern:\nThey want to know if it can be done by 10 A.M.\n[2:13 P.M.] Petra Kitzos:\nSure.\n[2:14 P.M.] Frank Stern:\nThat’s a relief. Thanks.\n4\n4","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"[2:11P.M.] Frank Stern: 4\nHi, Petra. A customer wants1,000 glossy color posters,\ndouble-sided. Any chance we can do this today? If not,\nthey might take the job elsewhere.\n[2:12 P.M.] Petra Kitzos:\nProbably not. We’re backed up with a big job for Noble\nArchitects. How about first thing tomorrow?\n[2:12 P.M.] Frank Stern:\nI’ll ask.\n[2:13 P.M.] Frank Stern:\nThey want to know if it can be done by 10 A.M.\n[2:13 P.M.] Petra Kitzos:\nSure.\n[2:14 P.M.] Frank Stern:\nThat’s a relief. Thanks.\n4\n4"}],"question":"Where do Mr. Stern and Ms. Kitzos most likely work?","bilingual":"Ông Stern và bà Kitzos thường làm việc ở đâu?","options":["At a shipping store","At an architecture firm","At an accounting office","At a print shop"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"At a print shop\".","vocabList":[{"word":"work","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/wərk/","meaning":"nhân công; nhiệm vụ; nghề nghiệp; nghề nghiệp; ơn gọi; cố gắng"},{"word":"shipping","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈʃɪp.ɪŋ/","meaning":"đang chuyển hàng"},{"word":"store","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/stɔr/","meaning":"cửa hàng; nơi bán hàng hóa; cung cấp"},{"word":"firm","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/fərm