u>\nFrom: Fawzia Gunnani <fgurmani@greerscoflfee.com.au> Subject: Following up on your recent call\nDate: l 7 September\nAttachment: [§ Proposal\nDear Mr. Dimmick,\nThank you for your recent call. We are always pleased to hear from one of our many local\nstore managers. I think your idea to reinstate the Greer’s Coffee Club is excellent, and I\nam also pleased to know your customers have been asking about the club punch cards. I\nagree that this is a good time to bring back the program, as we are working on rebranding\nthe company. I have drawn up your proposal and will forward it to Ms. So-Ra Oh, vice\npresident of marketing, tomorrow. Before I do that, can you please look it over and let me\nknow if I have missed any details? Please send me your feedback by the end of the day.\nThank you,\nFawzia Gurmani\nRegional Director http://www.greerscoffee.com.au/rewards Qree P$, the place for coffee, conversation, and snacks, is now even better!\nWe have brought back the Greers Coffee Club, but with an update: it is now even\neasier to use! Simply download our new mobile app and register. Use the app to scan\nyour receipt every time you visit any Greer’s Coffee location, and you will earn points.\nEach time you accrue 100 points, you can redeem the points for discounts on coffee,\nfood, and other items.\nv\n158","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Brody Dimmick <bdiminick @greerscoftee.com.au>\nFrom: Fawzia Gunnani <fgurmani@greerscoflfee.com.au> Subject: Following up on your recent call\nDate: l 7 September\nAttachment: [§ Proposal\nDear Mr. Dimmick,\nThank you for your recent call. We are always pleased to hear from one of our many local\nstore managers. I think your idea to reinstate the Greer’s Coffee Club is excellent, and I\nam also pleased to know your customers have been asking about the club punch cards. I\nagree that this is a good time to bring back the program, as we are working on rebranding\nthe company. I have drawn up your proposal and will forward it to Ms. So-Ra Oh, vice\npresident of marketing, tomorrow. Before I do that, can you please look it over and let me\nknow if I have missed any details? Please send me your feedback by the end of the day.\nThank you,\nFawzia Gurmani\nRegional Director http://www.greerscoffee.com.au/rewards Qree P$, the place for coffee, conversation, and snacks, is now even better!\nWe have brought back the Greers Coffee Club, but with an update: it is now even\neasier to use! Simply download our new mobile app and register. Use the app to scan\nyour receipt every time you visit any Greer’s Coffee location, and you will earn points.\nEach time you accrue 100 points, you can redeem the points for discounts on coffee,\nfood, and other items.\nv\n158"}],"question":"On the Web page, the word “redeem” in paragraph 1, line 4, is closest in meaning to","bilingual":"","options":["trade in","pay off","set free","win over"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"trade in\".","vocabList":[{"word":"page","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/peɪʤ/","meaning":"mảnh giấy; tiếp viên; người hầu"},{"word":"paragraph","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈpɛrəˌgræf/","meaning":"đoạn văn; phần văn bản riêng biệt (thường bắt đầu bằng một"},{"word":"trade","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/treɪd/","meaning":"sự trao đổi (hàng hóa, vật phẩm)"},{"word":"over","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈoʊvər/","meaning":"trên"}]},{"questionNum":"181","passageTitle":"Questions 181-185 refer to the following job advertisement and e-mail.","passageText":"Job Posted: April 10\nSeeking: Highly Experienced Finance Director\nEmployer: Vimaxo Financial Services (VFS)\nDuties include:\n•Setting annual financial targets\n•Managing the duties of accounting staff\n® Overseeing investments and cash flow\n0 Developing sound financial strategies\nPrerequisites:\n® 5 years of experience as a finance director\n•A university degree in economics or similar field\n• Excellent communication skills\n•Outstanding analytical skills\nTo apply: Send application and supporting documents to our director of Human\nResources, Celeste Zomorodi, at zomorodi.c@vfs.com by May 1 5. We aim to hire the\nideal applicant by June 21 and have him/her begin work on July 1.\n\n*E-mail*\nFrom: Noritaka Hosokawa\nTo: Celeste Zomorodi\nDate: April 11\nSubject: Finance director\nDear Celeste,\nI wanted to ask you about the finance director job posting released by our department\njust yesterday. I have a friend named Michaela Shabiby who I think may be a good fit\nfor this position. May I encourage her to apply?\nMichaela graduated with a Master’s degree in Finance from the University of Grenada\nthree years ago and has worked since then as finance director at Southside Investment\nBank. She is an experienced trainer, and her analytical skills are unparalleled. Please let\nme know.\nThanks,\nNoritaka Hosokawa\n160","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1 (job advertisement)","text":"Job Posted: April 10\nSeeking: Highly Experienced Finance Director\nEmployer: Vimaxo Financial Services (VFS)\nDuties include:\n•Setting annual financial targets\n•Managing the duties of accounting staff\n® Overseeing investments and cash flow\n0 Developing sound financial strategies\nPrerequisites:\n® 5 years of experience as a finance director\n•A university degree in economics or similar field\n• Excellent communication skills\n•Outstanding analytical skills\nTo apply: Send application and supporting documents to our director of Human\nResources, Celeste Zomorodi, at zomorodi.c@vfs.com by May 1 5. We aim to hire the\nideal applicant by June 21 and have him/her begin work on July 1."},{"label":"Văn bản 2 (e-mail)","text":"*E-mail*\nFrom: Noritaka Hosokawa\nTo: Celeste Zomorodi\nDate: April 11\nSubject: Finance director\nDear Celeste,\nI wanted to ask you about the finance director job posting released by our department\njust yesterday. I have a friend named Michaela Shabiby who I think may be a good fit\nfor this position. May I encourage her to apply?\nMichaela graduated with a Master’s degree in Finance from the University of Grenada\nthree years ago and has worked since then as finance director at Southside Investment\nBank. She is an experienced trainer, and her analytical skills are unparalleled. Please let\nme know.\nThanks,\nNoritaka Hosokawa\n160"}],"question":"According to the job advertisement, what will be one responsibility of the successful candidate?","bilingual":"Theo quảng cáo tuyển dụng, trách nhiệm của ứng viên thành công là gì?","options":["Reviewing tax policies","Overseeing financial planning","Evaluating promotional campaigns","Meeting with fund-raising coordinators"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Overseeing financial planning\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertisement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/æd.vɝːˈtaɪz.mənt/","meaning":"bản tin quảng cáo"},{"word":"responsibility","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/rɪˌspɑːn.səˈbɪl.ə.t̬i/","meaning":"trách nhiệm; sự chịu trách nhiệm; bổn phận;"},{"word":"candidate","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkæn.dɪ.dət/","meaning":"/ˈkæn.dɪ.deɪt/"},{"word":"financial","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/faɪˈnæn.ʃəl/","meaning":"/fəˈnæn.ʃəl/"}]},{"questionNum":"182","passageTitle":"Questions 181-185 refer to the following job advertisement and e-mail.","passageText":"Job Posted: April 10\nSeeking: Highly Experienced Finance Director\nEmployer: Vimaxo Financial Services (VFS)\nDuties include:\n•Setting annual financial targets\n•Managing the duties of accounting staff\n® Overseeing investments and cash flow\n0 Developing sound financial strategies\nPrerequisites:\n® 5 years of experience as a finance director\n•A university degree in economics or similar field\n• Excellent communication skills\n•Outstanding analytical skills\nTo apply: Send application and supporting documents to our director of Human\nResources, Celeste Zomorodi, at zomorodi.c@vfs.com by May 1 5. We aim to hire the\nideal applicant by June 21 and have him/her begin work on July 1.\n\n*E-mail*\nFrom: Noritaka Hosokawa\nTo: Celeste Zomorodi\nDate: April 11\nSubject: Finance director\nDear Celeste,\nI wanted to ask you about the finance director job posting released by our department\njust yesterday. I have a friend named Michaela Shabiby who I think may be a good fit\nfor this position. May I encourage her to apply?\nMichaela graduated with a Master’s degree in Finance from the University of Grenada\nthree years ago and has worked since then as finance director at Southside Investment\nBank. She is an experienced trainer, and her analytical skills are unparalleled. Please let\nme know.\nThanks,\nNoritaka Hosokawa\n160","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1 (job advertisement)","text":"Job Posted: April 10\nSeeking: Highly Experienced Finance Director\nEmployer: Vimaxo Financial Services (VFS)\nDuties include:\n•Setting annual financial targets\n•Managing the duties of accounting staff\n® Overseeing investments and cash flow\n0 Developing sound financial strategies\nPrerequisites:\n® 5 years of experience as a finance director\n•A university degree in economics or similar field\n• Excellent communication skills\n•Outstanding analytical skills\nTo apply: Send application and supporting documents to our director of Human\nResources, Celeste Zomorodi, at zomorodi.c@vfs.com by May 1 5. We aim to hire the\nideal applicant by June 21 and have him/her begin work on July 1."},{"label":"Văn bản 2 (e-mail)","text":"*E-mail*\nFrom: Noritaka Hosokawa\nTo: Celeste Zomorodi\nDate: April 11\nSubject: Finance director\nDear Celeste,\nI wanted to ask you about the finance director job posting released by our department\njust yesterday. I have a friend named Michaela Shabiby who I think may be a good fit\nfor this position. May I encourage her to apply?\nMichaela graduated with a Master’s degree in Finance from the University of Grenada\nthree years ago and has worked since then as finance director at Southside Investment\nBank. She is an experienced trainer, and her analytical skills are unparalleled. Please let\nme know.\nThanks,\nNoritaka Hosokawa\n160"}],"question":"When is the job application deadline?","bilingual":"Hạn chót nộp đơn xin việc là khi nào?","options":["April 10","May 15","June 21","July 1"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"May 15\".","vocabList":[{"word":"application","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌæp.ləˈkeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"ứng dụng, sự áp dụng"},{"word":"deadline","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈded.laɪn/","meaning":"hạn cuối, hạn hoàn thành"},{"word":"highly","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈhaɪ.li/","meaning":"rất, lắm, tốt"},{"word":"experienced","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪkˈspɪə.ri.ənst/","meaning":"người từng trải, người có kinh nghiệm"}]},{"questionNum":"183","passageTitle":"Questions 181-185 refer to the following job advertisement and e-mail.","passageText":"Job Posted: April 10\nSeeking: Highly Experienced Finance Director\nEmployer: Vimaxo Financial Services (VFS)\nDuties include:\n•Setting annual financial targets\n•Managing the duties of accounting staff\n® Overseeing investments and cash flow\n0 Developing sound financial strategies\nPrerequisites:\n® 5 years of experience as a finance director\n•A university degree in economics or similar field\n• Excellent communication skills\n•Outstanding analytical skills\nTo apply: Send application and supporting documents to our director of Human\nResources, Celeste Zomo