ts\nDate: April 18\nMilos,\nQuick update before you book. I will need a few days to consider whether I should\ndepart for Sumneyfeld on May 8 or leave one day earlier. There is an early conference\nworkshop the evening of May 7 that I might attend. Actually, a publisher representative\nwith whom I would like to talk regarding my latest manuscript may be in attendance! I\nwill let you know shortly.\nThanks so much for your help, as always.\nThanda\n166\n\nSumneyfeld Quick Taxi\n555-0194\nDate: May 7\nFrom: Sumneyfeld Airport\nIWM\nTo: Peru Dreaming Cafe, 98 Treetop Avenue\nPickup: 11:55 A.M.\nDrop off: 12:04 P.M.\nDistance: 1.2 miles\nTotal: $8.00\nPayment type: X credit card\ncash\nName on Credit Card: Thanda Peterson\nCredit Card Number: xxxx xxxx xxxx 5523"}],"question":"What did Ms. Peterson most likely do in response to advice?","bilingual":"Cô Peterson rất có thể đã làm gì để đáp lại lời khuyên?","options":["She visited a restaurant.","She took advantage of a free shuttle service.","She met with a representative.","She changed airlines."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She visited a restaurant.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"response","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈspɑns/","meaning":"hồi đáp; trả lời; sự phản ứng lại"},{"word":"advice","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ədˈvaɪs/","meaning":"lời khuyên, lời chỉ bảo"},{"word":"restaurant","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛˌstrɑnt/","meaning":"Nhà hàng"},{"word":"advantage","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ədˈvæn.t̬ɪdʒ/","meaning":"lợi thế"}]},{"questionNum":"200","passageTitle":"Questions 196-200 refer to the following e-mails and receipt.","passageText":"To: Thanda Peterson <thandapeterson@thandapeterson.com> From: Milos Adamek <milosa@wistartravel.org> Subject: Travel arrangements\nDate: April 17\nHello Thanda,\nl hope you ar