    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following advertisement.","passageText":"Kendricks Appliances Sale\nMarch 5 and 6\n\"Hiis event is our way of saying thank you to our friends and neighbors for\nwelcoming our new business to the South Waterfront neighborhood one year\nago. Members of the community who live east of Broad Avenue and west of\nRiverside Avenue are invited to stop in and claim an additional discount on\nselected merchandise this weekend. Just remember to bring proof of residency.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Kendricks Appliances Sale\nMarch 5 and 6\n\"Hiis event is our way of saying thank you to our friends and neighbors for\nwelcoming our new business to the South Waterfront neighborhood one year\nago. Members of the community who live east of Broad Avenue and west of\nRiverside Avenue are invited to stop in and claim an additional discount on\nselected merchandise this weekend. Just remember to bring proof of residency."}],"question":"What is being advertised?","bilingual":"Điều gì đang được quảng cáo?","options":["The recent relocation of a business","The grand opening of a branch store","A special promotion for local residents","The introduction of new product brands"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"A special promotion for local residents\".","vocabList":[{"word":"advertised","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌædvərˈtaɪzd/","meaning":"được quảng cáo"},{"word":"recent","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/´ri:sənt/","meaning":"gần đây, xảy ra gần đây, mới đây"},{"word":"business","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɪznɪs/","meaning":"công ty; doanh nghiệp; buôn bán; thương mại; vấn đề"},{"word":"opening","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈoʊpənɪŋ/","meaning":"khai trương"}]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following advertisement.","passageText":"Kendricks Appliances Sale\nMarch 5 and 6\n\"Hiis event is our way of saying thank you to our friends and neighbors for\nwelcoming our new business to the South Waterfront neighborhood one year\nago. Members of the community who live east of Broad Avenue and west of\nRiverside Avenue are invited to stop in and claim an additional discount on\nselected merchandise this weekend. Just remember to bring proof of residency.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Kendricks Appliances Sale\nMarch 5 and 6\n\"Hiis event is our way of saying thank you to our friends and neighbors for\nwelcoming our new business to the South Waterfront neighborhood one year\nago. Members of the community who live east of Broad Avenue and west of\nRiverside Avenue are invited to stop in and claim an additional discount on\nselected merchandise this weekend. Just remember to bring proof of residency."}],"question":"What is indicated about Kendricks Appliances?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về Thiết bị Kendricks?","options":["It has been in business for one year.","It has a store on Broad Avenue.","Its delivery service is limited to South Waterfront.","Its hours are extended on the weekend."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It has been in business for one year.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"appliance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈplaɪ.əns/","meaning":"thiết bị, dụng cụ"},{"word":"business","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɪznɪs/","meaning":"công ty; doanh nghiệp; buôn bán; thương mại; vấn đề"},{"word":"store","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/stɔr/","meaning":"cửa hàng; nơi bán hàng hóa; cung cấp"},{"word":"delivery","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈlɪv.ɚ.i/","meaning":"sự phân phát, giao hàng"}]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following memo.","passageText":"To: All Eastland Regional Hospital staff\nFrom: Patrick Menzales\nDate: February 1\nSubject: Referrals\nEastland Regional Hospital is planning to hire more registered nurses,\nx-ray technicians, and cafeteria and housekeeping staff. We will be holding\na hiring and information event on Wednesday, February 27, from 2 P.M. to\n5 P.M. in the Winkler Auditorium. If you have friends or family interested\nin working here, this is a great opportunity for them to find out about\nopen positions. There is no fee for entry. It is not necessary to make an\nappointment.\nAs a valued employee, you will receive a bonus if you refer a candidate\nwho is hired and whose employment lasts at least three months. Ask the\ncandidate to include your name on the application in the space labeled\n“referred by.” The bonus will be added to your paycheck.\nPlease contact me if you have any questions.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: All Eastland Regional Hospital staff\nFrom: Patrick Menzales\nDate: February 1\nSubject: Referrals\nEastland Regional Hospital is planning to hire more registered nurses,\nx-ray technicians, and cafeteria and housekeeping staff. We will be holding\na hiring and information event on Wednesday, February 27, from 2 P.M. to\n5 P.M. in the Winkler Auditorium. If you have friends or family interested\nin working here, this is a great opportunity for them to find out about\nopen positions. There is no fee for entry. It is not necessary to make an\nappointment.\nAs a valued employee, you will receive a bonus if you refer a candidate\nwho is hired and whose employment lasts at least three months. Ask the\ncandidate to include your name on the application in the space labeled\n“referred by.” The bonus will be added to your paycheck.\nPlease contact me if you have any questions."}],"question":"What is indicated about the hiring and information event?","bilingual":"Thông tin gì về sự kiện tuyển dụng và thông tin?","options":["It will be held in the cafeteria.","An admission fee will be charged.","It will take place in the afternoon.","Attendees will be asked to register in advance. 178"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It will take place in the afternoon.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"event","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪˈvent/","meaning":"sự kiện, sự việc"},{"word":"cafeteria","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌkæf.əˈtɪr.i.ə/","meaning":"quán ăn tự phục vụ, phòng cà phê"},{"word":"admission","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ədˈmɪʃən/","meaning":"cổng vào; phép vào; sự xưng tội"}]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following memo.","passageText":"To: All Eastland Regional Hospital staff\nFrom: Patrick Menzales\nDate: February 1\nSubject: Referrals\nEastland Regional Hospital is planning to hire more registered nurses,\nx-ray technicians, and cafeteria and housekeeping staff. We will be holding\na hiring and information event on Wednesday, February 27, from 2 P.M. to\n5 P.M. in the Winkler Auditorium. If you have friends or family interested\nin working here, this is a great opportunity for them to find out about\nopen positions. There is no fee for entry. It is not necessary to make an\nappointment.\nAs a valued employee, you will receive a bonus if you refer a candidate\nwho is hired and whose employment lasts at least three months. Ask the\ncandidate to include your name on the application in the space labeled\n“referred by.” The bonus will be added to your paycheck.\nPlease contact me if you have any questions.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: All Eastland Regional Hospital staff\nFrom: Patrick Menzales\nDate: February 1\nSubject: Referrals\nEastland Regional Hospital is planning to hire more registered nurses,\nx-ray technicians, and cafeteria and housekeeping staff. We will be holding\na hiring and information event on Wednesday, February 27, from 2 P.M. to\n5 P.M. in the Winkler Auditorium. If you have friends or family interested\nin working here, this is a great opportunity for them to find out about\nopen positions. There is no fee for entry. It is not necessary to make an\nappointment.\nAs a valued employee, you will receive a bonus if you refer a candidate\nwho is hired and whose employment lasts at least three months. Ask the\ncandidate to include your name on the application in the space labeled\n“referred by.” The bonus will be added to your paycheck.\nPlease contact me if you have any questions."}],"question":"What does Mr. Menzales encourage employees to do?","bilingual":"Ông Menzales khuyến khích nhân viên làm gì?","options":["Volunteer to lead a project","Refer applicants for employment","Earn a bonus by working overtime","Apply for a better-paying position"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Refer applicants for employment\".","vocabList":[{"word":"encourage","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˈkɝː.ɪdʒ/","meaning":"động viên, cổ vũ"},{"word":"employee","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ɪmˈplɔɪi/","meaning":"công nhân; người làm việc cho một công ty hoặc một"},{"word":"volunteer","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌvɑlənˈtɪr/","meaning":"một người cung cấp dịch vụ của mình theo ý chí tự do của riêng mình hoặc"},{"word":"lead","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/lɛd/","meaning":"tiến hành; hướng dẫn; chỉ đạo; ảnh hưởng"}]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Meeting of the Chelmsbury Civic Association\nWhere: Alvar Madsen Community Center, 4141 Hoover Road\nWhen: Tuesday, June 14, 7:00 P.M.-8:30 PM.\nAgenda\n•Introduce new neighbors\n•Update on road construction\n•Election of vice president\n•Refreshments\nPlease note:\nWe are currently collecting dues for the year. The dues are $25.\nIf you have not yet paid your dues, please do so. You may pay at\nthe meeting, or you may send your payment to Bob Robsen at\n595 Shelton Drive.\nWe hope to see you at the meeting!\nSusan Wolfe, President, Chelmsbury Civic Association]\n784 Harmony Drive J","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Meeting of the Chelmsbury Civic Association\nWhere: Alvar Madsen Community Center, 4141 Hoover Road\nWhen: Tuesday, June 14, 7:00 P.M.-8:30 PM.\nAgenda\n•Introduce new neighbors\n•Update on road construction\n•Election of vice president\n•Refreshments\nPlease note:\nWe are currently collecting dues for the year. The dues are $25.\nIf you have not yet paid your dues, please do so. You may pay at\nthe meeting, or you may send your payment to Bob Robsen at\n595 Shelton Drive.\nWe hope to see you at the meeting!\nSusan Wolfe, President, Chelmsbury Civic Association]\n784 Harmony Drive J"}],"question":"What is stated about the upcoming meeting?","bilingual":"Có thông tin gì về cuộc họp sắp tới?","options":["It will be held on Harmony Drive.","It will include voting for an office.","It will be led by Mr. Robsen.","It will have a speaker from the local community center."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It will include voting for an office.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"upcoming","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈʌpˌkʌm.ɪŋ/","meaning":"sắp xảy ra"},{"word":"meeting","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''mi:tiɳ/","meaning":"(chính trị) cuộc mít tinh, cuộc biểu tình"},{"word":"harmony","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈhɑrməni/","meaning":"đoàn kết; hiệp định; thỏa thuận; sự cân bằng dễ chịu; sự đối xứng"},{"word":"drive","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/draɪv/","meaning":"cuộc đua; lái xe"}]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Meeting of the Chelmsbury Civic Association\nWhere: Alvar Madsen Community Center, 4141 Hoover Road\nWhen: Tuesday, June 14, 7:00 P.M.-8:30 PM.\nAgenda\n•Introduce new neighbors\n•Update on road construction\n•Election of vice president\n•Refreshments\nPlease note:\nWe are currently collecting dues for the year. The dues are $25.\nIf you have not yet paid your dues, please do so. You may pay at\nthe meeting, or you may send your payment to Bob Robsen at\n595 Shelton Drive.\nWe hope to see you at the meeting!\nSusan Wolfe, President, Chelmsbury Civic Association]\n784 Harmony Drive J","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Meeting of the Chelmsbury Civic Association\nWhere: Alvar Madsen Community Center, 4141 Hoover Road\nWhen: Tuesday, June 14, 7:00 P.M.-8:30 PM.\nAgenda\n•Introduce new neighbors\n•Update on road construction\n•Election of vice president\n•Refreshments\nPlease note:\nWe are currently collecting dues for the year. The dues are $25.\nIf you have not yet paid your dues, please do so. You may pay at\nthe meeting, or you may send your payment to Bob Robsen at\n595 Shelton Drive.\nWe hope to see you at the meeting!\nSusan Wolfe, President, Chelmsbury Civic Association]\n784 Harmony Drive J"}],"question":"What is true about Mr. Robsen?","bilingual":"Điều gì đúng về ông Robsen?","options":["He is the vice president of the association.","He forgot to pay his membership fee.","He provides refreshments at meetings.","He collects association members’ dues."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"He collects association members’ dues.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"president","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈprɛzɪdənt/","meaning":"cái đầu; lãnh đạo; chủ tịch; người đứng đầu"},{"word":"association","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˌsoʊʃiˈeɪʃən/","meaning":"tổ chức; xã hội; công đoàn; liên minh; sự thành lập"},{"word":"membership","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''membəʃip/","meaning":"tư cách hội viên, địa vị hội viên"},{"word":"provide","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/prəˈvaɪd/","meaning":"cung cấp; cấp ; để thiết lập; cung cấp"}]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Questions 153-154 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"r\nEric Ozawa (12:06 P.M.)\nHi Kara. I wanted to let you know that my train\nis going to be late.\nKara Murato (12:10 P.M.)\nOh, that''s too bad. Will you make it to the\n3:00 meeting?\nEric Ozawa (12:11P.M.)\nI''m not sure. The conduct or thinks it will be\nat least another hour before we leave.\nKara Murato (12:12 P.M.)\nShould we postpone the meeting?\nEric Ozawa (12:14 P.M.)\nI think you should get started. The plans for the\nnew hospital wing are on my desk. You know\neverything about the changes to the original\ndesign. You can call me if the client has any\nquestions that you are unable to answer.\nKara Murato (12:15 P.M.)\nSounds good. Let me know when you have an\nupdate on your arrival time.\nEric Ozawa (12:16 P.M.)\nSure. Thanks.\n° 8 HU\"","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"r\nEric Ozawa (12:06 P.M.)\nHi Kara. I wanted to let you know that my train\nis going to be late.\nKara Murato (12:10 P.M.)\nOh, that''s too bad. Will you make it to the\n3:00 meeting?\nEric Ozawa (12:11P.M.)\nI''m not sure. The conduct or thinks it will be\nat least another hour before we leave.\nKara Murato (12:12 P.M.)\nShould we postpone the meeting?\nEric Ozawa (12:14 P.M.)\nI think you should get started. The plans for the\nnew hospital wing are on my desk. You know\neverything about the changes to the original\ndesign. You can call me if the client has any\nquestions that you are unable to answer.\nKara Murato (12:15 P.M.)\nSounds good. Let me know when you have an\nupdate on your arrival time.\nEric Ozawa (12:16 P.M.)\nSure. Thanks.\n° 8 HU\""}],"question":"Why does Mr. Ozawa contact Ms. Murato?","bilingual":"Tại sao ông Ozawa liên hệ với cô Murato?","options":["To introduce her to a new client","To inform her of a delay","To ask her to book a train ticket","To thank her for changing a project’s deadline 180"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To inform her of a delay\".","vocabList":[{"word":"contact","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtækt/","meaning":"thiết lập giao tiếp; để tạo kết nối; ĐẾN"},{"word":"introduce","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪntrəˈdus/","meaning":"trình bày lần đầu tiên; bắt đầu; thành lập; ĐẾN"},{"word":"client","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈklaɪ.ənt/","meaning":"khách hàng (của luật sư, cửa hàng...)"},{"word":"inform","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈfɔrm/","meaning":"truyền đạt dữ liệu tới; nói ; để tóm tắt; để thông báo"}]},{"questionNum":"154","passageTitle":"Questions 153-154 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"r\nEric Ozawa (12:06 P.M.)\nHi Kara. I wanted to let you know that my train\nis going to be late.\nKara Murato (12:10 P.M.)\nOh, that''s too bad. Will you make it to the\n3:00 meeting?\nEric Ozawa (12:11P.M.)\nI''m not sure. The conduct or thinks it will be\nat least another hour before we leave.\nKara Murato (12:12 P.M.)\nShould we postpone the meeting?\nEric Ozawa (12:14 P.M.)\nI think you should get started. The plans for the\nnew hospital wing are on my desk. You know\neverything about the changes to the original\ndesign. You can call me if the client has any\nquestions that you are unable to answer.\nKara Murato (12:15 P.M.)\nSounds good. Let me know when you have an\nupdate on your arrival time.\nEric Ozawa (12:16 P.M.)\nSure. Thanks.\n° 8 HU\"","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"r\nEric Ozawa (12:06 P.M.)\nHi Kara. I wanted to let you know that my train\nis going to be late.\nKara Murato (12:10 P.M.)\nOh, that''s too bad. Will you make it to the\n3:00 meeting?\nEric Ozawa (12:11P.M.)\nI''m not sure. The conduct or thinks it will be\nat least another hour before we leave.\nKara Murato (12:12 P.M.)\nShould we postpone the meeting?\nEric Ozawa (12:14 P.M.)\nI think you should get started. The plans for the\nnew hospital wing are on my desk. You know\neverything about the changes to the original\ndesign. You can call me if the client has any\nquestions that you are unable to answer.\nKara Murato (12:15 P.M.)\nSounds good. Let me know when you have an\nupdate on your arrival time.\nEric Ozawa (12:16 P.M.)\nSure. Thanks.\n° 8 HU\""}],"question":"At 12:15 P.M., what does Ms. Murato most likely mean when she writes, “Sounds good”?","bilingual":"Vào lúc 12:15 trưa, rất có thể cô Murato có ý gì khi viết “Nghe hay đấy”?","options":["She will contact Mr. Ozawa if she has questions.","She will attend a meeting by phone.","She will drive Mr. Ozawa to the station.","She will reschedule a consultation."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"She will contact Mr. Ozawa if she has questions.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"mean","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/min/","meaning":"điểm giữa; ở giữa; cách xa hai thái cực như nhau;"},{"word":"write","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/raɪt/","meaning":"viết, sáng tác"},{"word":"sound","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/saʊnd/","meaning":"những rung động mà tai người có thể phát hiện được;"},{"word":"contact","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Ver