g Software\n186","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Hien Pham <hpham @ngoc.com>\nFrom: Theresa Griffin <tgriffin @thiongsoftware.com>\nSubject: Information\nDate: September 20\nDear Mr. Pham:\nWelcome to Throng Software. We are pleased that you are joining the company. On your\nfirst day of work, Monday, October 3, please report to building 14 at 8:45 A.M. You can\ncheck in at the front desk, where you will be given a temporary ID badge. I will meet you\nthere, show you to your office, and then take you on a tour of the building to introduce\nyou to your colleagues. You will then go to Information Technology (IT) to receive your\nlaptop, passwords, and security information. When you are finished, someone will guide\nyou to Human Resources in building 12 so you can fill out payroll and benefits forms.\nPlease join me and several colleagues at 11:30 A.M. We will take you to one of our favorite\nrestaurants near the office. The rest of the afternoon will be free for you to get settled into\nyour office and review the information you receive during the day. I will stop by your\noffice later in the day to make sure you know where all the office equipment is.\nI look forward to seeing you then.\nSincerely,\nTheresa Griffin\nHuman Resources, Throng Software\n186"}],"question":"What will Mr. Pham do in the afternoon?","bilingual":"Buổi chiều anh Phạm sẽ làm gì?","options":["Test some equipment","Visit Ms. Griffin’s office","Review some project proposals","Learn where equipment is located"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"Learn where equipment is located\".","vocabList":[{"word":"equipment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ɪkˈwɪpmənt/","meaning":"quân nhu; các mặt hàng cần thiết; công cụ, dụng cụ hoặc những thứ khác"},{"word":"visit","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈvɪzɪt/","meaning":"tạm trú ở đâu đó; ví dụ về việc dành thời gian"},{"word":"office","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɔfəs/","meaning":"buồng; văn phòng; đương nhiệm; hãng; thẩm quyền"},{"word":"review","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌrivˈju/","meaning":"sự khảo sát; nghiên cứu tổng quát; bài kiểm tra; điều tra"}]},{"questionNum":"176","passageTitle":"Questions 176-180 refer to the following review and letter.","passageText":"Calbo Cuts\nMy visit to Calbo Cuts as a first-time and I was happy with my standard\ncustomer was disappointing. When men’s cut. The stylist, though, cut\nI arrived, the sign on the door my hair without saying a word. I\nsaid “Walk-ins welcome,’'' but the understand that not everyone likes\nreceptionist bluntly told me that 1 to make small talk, but I found my\nwould need to wait about an hour stylists total silence to be rude.\ntor my haircut, even though only When she finished my haircut,\none other customer was in the shop she removed the hair cutting cape\nand three stylists were there. The without even offering to blow-dry\nquality of the work was fine; the my hair.\nhaircut was fairly priced at just $15, ------- Martin Silver, Bishopville\nCalbo Cuts * 678 Seventh Street • Lamar, South Carol in a • 29069\nMartin Silver\n51 Oak Street\nBishopville, South Carol in a 29010\nDear Mr. Silver,\nThank you for taking the time to leave us a review. We always try to provide the best\nservice available. If you feel that any of our staff were unaccommodating or\nunprofessional, then I would like to hear more details regarding your complaint. Feel\nfree to call me directly at 803-555-0110.\nAt Calbo Cuts, we are serious about earning your continued business. I would be\nhappy to schedule an appointment for you for a haircut and blow-dry with Marissa\nLopez, as I believe she can provide you with the haircut experience you are looking\nfor. In addition, on your next visit to Calbo Cuts, we would like to offer you a\ncomplimentary bottle of our all-natural shampoo, one of our best-selling products.\nWe hope you will come back to Calbo Cuts in the future whenever you need a trim.\nBest regards,\nJenna Makowski\nOwner, Calbo Cuts\n188","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Calbo Cuts\nMy visit to Calbo Cuts as a first-time and I was happy with my standard\ncustomer was disappointing. When men’s cut. The stylist, though, cut\nI arrived, the sign on the door my hair without saying a word. I\nsaid “Walk-ins welcome,’'' but the understand that not everyone likes\nreceptionist bluntly told me that 1 to make small talk, but I found my\nwould need to wait about an hour stylists total silence to be rude.\ntor my haircut, even though only When she finished my haircut,\none other customer was in the shop she removed the hair cutting cape\nand three stylists were there. The without even offering to blow-dry\nquality of the work was fine; the my hair.\nhaircut was fairly priced at just $15, ------- Martin Silver, Bishopville\nCalbo Cuts * 678 Seventh Street • Lamar, South Carol in a • 29069\nMartin Silver\n51 Oak Street\nBishopville, South Carol in a 29010\nDear Mr. Silver,\nThank you for taking the time to leave us a review. We always try to provide the best\nservice available. If you feel that any of our staff were unaccommodating or\nunprofessional, then I would like to hear more details regarding your complaint. Feel\nfree to call me directly at 803-555-0110.\nAt Calbo Cuts, we are serious about earning your continued business. I would be\nhappy to schedule an appointment for you for a haircut and blow-dry with Marissa\nLopez, as I believe she can provide you with the haircut experience you are looking\nfor. In addition, on your next visit to Calbo Cuts, we would like to offer you a\ncomplimentary bottle of our all-natural shampoo, one of our best-selling products.\nWe hope you will come back to Calbo Cuts in the future whenever you need a trim.\nBest regards,\nJenna Makowski\nOwner, Calbo Cuts\n188"}],"question":"According to the review, what is suggested about Mr. Silver?","bilingual":"","options":["He was late for an appointment.","He did not ask for a standard haircut.","He has been to Calbo Cuts only once.","He did not see a sign on the door."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"He has been to Calbo Cuts only once.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"review","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌrivˈju/","meaning":"sự khảo sát; nghiên cứu tổng quát; bài kiểm tra; điều tra"},{"word":"late","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/leɪt/","meaning":"sau thời gian thông thường hoặc dự kiến; chậm trễ; gần đây; xa"},{"word":"appointment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈpɔɪnt.mənt/","meaning":"sự bổ nhiệm, cuộc hẹn gặp"},{"word":"standard","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈstændərd/","meaning":"người mẫu; tiêu chí; định mức; trung bình; hàng hóa mà"}]},{"questionNum":"177","passageTitle":"Questions 176-180 refer to the following review and letter.","passageText":"Calbo Cuts\nMy visit to Calbo Cuts as a first-time and I was happy with my standard\ncustomer was disappointing. When men’s cut. The stylist, though, cut\nI arrived, the sign on the door my hair without saying a word. I\nsaid “Walk-ins welcome,’'' but the understand that not everyone likes\nreceptionist bluntly told me that 1 to make small talk, but I found my\nwould need to wait about an hour stylists total silence to be rude.\ntor my haircut, even though only When she finished my haircut,\none other customer was in the shop she removed the hair cutting cape\nand three stylists were there. The without even offering to blow-dry\nquality of the work was fine; the my hair.\nhaircut was fairly priced at just $15, ------- Martin Silver, Bishopville\nCalbo Cuts * 678 Seventh Street • Lamar, South Carol in a • 29069\nMartin Silver\n51 Oak Street\nBishopville