\nwork and inquire about a dinner reservation at Bombay Palace on 6 October.\nSincerely,\nDang Thi Lien\n¥ *"}],"question":"Why is Mr. Zezula interested in dining at Victoria Grill?","bilingual":"Tại sao ông Zezula lại thích dùng bữa tại Victoria Grill?","options":["It offers vegetarian options.","It offers private rooms.","It is open relatively late.","It has an attractive view."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It has an attractive view.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"grill","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɡrɪl/","meaning":"chả nướng; nướng, thiêu đốt"},{"word":"offer","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɔfər/","meaning":"gợi ý; đề xuất giá; mềm; giá thầu"},{"word":"vegetarian","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌvɛʤəˈtɛˌriən/","meaning":"người không ăn thịt; động vật ăn cỏ"},{"word":"option","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɔpʃən/","meaning":"sự lựa chọn; thay thế; khả năng; lựa chọn; cuộc bầu cử"}]},{"questionNum":"189","passageTitle":"Questions 186-190 refer to the following e-mails and Web page.","passageText":"From: Michal Zezula <m.zezula@gerlach-kozey.com.au> To: Dang Thi Lien <dtlien @hermiston.com.au>\nDate: Thursday, 21 September, l:44 P.M.\nSubject: Conference dinner\nDear Ms. Lien,\nI am looking forward to meeting you at the Business Leadership Conference in Sydney\nnext month. I am delighted that you will be part of our panel, and I am looking forward to\nhearing you discuss your paper on local government initiatives.\nAs the panel chair, I am organizing a dinner for all the speakers immediately following the\npanel. Since you are locally based, perhaps you have in sights about the places listed on the\nconference Web site? I am leaning towards Victoria Grill because it overlooks the harbor,\nbut I would like to hear your opinion. Any place that can accommo