y and in fact would require a taxi ride from\nthe conference site. In my opinion, Bombay Palace is likely the best for a group of our\nsize. It is located right next to my office building. If you like, I could stop by after\nwork and inquire about a dinner reservation at Bombay Palace on 6 October.\nSincerely,\nDang Thi Lien\n¥ *"}],"question":"What information on the conference Web site does Ms. Lien think is inaccurate?","bilingual":"Thông tin nào trên website hội nghị mà bà Liên cho là không chính xác?","options":["Bombay Palace’s ability to host large groups","Victoria Grill’s distance from the conference site","The price of food at the restaurants","The need to make dinner reservations"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Victoria Grill’s distance from the conference site\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"conference","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnfərəns/","meaning":"cuộc họp; hội thảo; quy ước"},{"word":"site","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/saɪt/","meaning":"địa điểm; vị trí; khu vực"},{"word":"think","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/θɪŋk/","meaning":"nghĩ"}]},{"questionNum":"191","passageTitle":"Questions 191=195 refer to the following e-mail, product information, and invoice.","passageText":"From: a martin @ net force events.com\nTo: mpresser@gerenukofficedesign.com Date: September 3\nSubject: Chairs (Item #10405)\nDear Mr. Presser,\nAs a result of our company''s expansion last spring, we moved into a larger facility and\nneeded new furniture. At that time we ordered 22 office chairs from Gerenuk Office Design\n(Item #10405-Blue). Within two months, many of the chairs were broken and unusable.\nWe were initially happy with the replacement chairs that you delivered free of charge, but\nsome of those have now broken as well.\nI am here by requesting that you replace all 22 with chairs from your new Executive line\n(Item #10612) at no extra charge ------- assuming that they are better quality. These are\ncomparable in price to the original model we purchased. If you are unable to do this, we\nwill be forced to look elsewhere for our furnishing needs.\nAlexandra Martin, Office Administrator\nNetforce Events\n(http://www.hansons-office.com/ergonomic-task-chair A\nHANSON S: YOUR ONE-STOP SHOP FOR OFFICE SUPPLIES\nHome Products I f Customer f About Us\nHelp^\nErgonomic Task Chair\nThe Ergonomic Task Chair is our best-selling swivel • Black, Item Code 429BL\nmodel. It is specially designed to promote good posture • Blue, Item Code 469BB\nand avoid discomfort, and therefore it is perfect for those •Green, Item Code 490GN\nlong workdays at the office. Best of all, it is built to last •Red, Item Code 459RD\nand comes with a lifetime warranty. The model is available\nin four attractive colors.\n$159 per unit\n194\n\nHANSON S: YOUR ONE-STOP SHOP FOR OFFICE SUPPLIES\nINVOICE\nClient: Netforce Events\nAddress: 342 Collat''d Boulevard, Hampton, ME\nDate: September 10\nItem Quantity Unit Price Total\nErgonomic Task Chair, 22 $159.00 $3,498.00\nItem 490GN\nSubtotal $3,498.00\nDiscount for first-time customers -$159.00\nTotal $3,339.00\nPlease contact customerhelp@hansons-office.com if you have any questions.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"From: a martin @ net force events.com\nTo: mpresser@gerenukofficedesign.com Date: September 3\nSubject: Chairs (Item #10405)\nDear Mr. Presser,\nAs a result of our company''s expansion last spring, we moved into a larger facility and\nneeded new furniture. At that time we ordered 22 office chairs from Gerenuk Office Design\n(Item #10405-Blue). Within two months, many of the chairs were broken and unusable.\nWe were initially happy with the replacement chairs that you delivered free of charge, but\nsome of those have now broken as well.\nI am here by requesting that you replace all 22 with chairs from your new Executive line\n(Item #10612) at no extra charge ------- assuming that they are better quality. These are\ncomparable in price to the original model we purchased. If you are unable to do this, we\nwill be forced to look elsewhere for our furnishing needs.\nAlexandra Martin, Office Administrator\nNetforce Events\n(http://www.hansons-office.com/ergonomic-task-chair A\nHANSON S: YOUR ONE-STOP SHOP FOR OFFICE SUPPLIES\nHome Products I f Customer f About Us\nHelp^\nErgonomic Task Chair\nThe Ergonomic Task Chair is our best-selling swivel • Black, Item Code 429BL\nmodel. It is specially designed to promote good posture • Blue, Item Code 469BB\nand avoid discomfort, and therefore it is perfect for those •Green, Item Code 490GN\nlong workdays at the office. Best of all, it is built to last •Red, Item Code 459RD\nand comes with a lifetime warranty. The model is available\nin four attractive colors.\n$159 per unit\n194\n\nHANSON S: YOUR ONE-STOP SHOP FOR OFFICE SUPPLIES\nINVOICE\nClient: Netforce Events\nAddress: 342 Collat''d Boulevard, Hampton, ME\nDate: September 10\nItem Quantity Unit Price Total\nErgonomic Task Chair, 22 $159.00 $3,498.00\nItem 490GN\nSubtotal $3,498.00\nDiscount for first-time customers -$159.00\nTotal $3,339.00\nPlease contact customerhelp@hansons-office.com if you have any questions."}],"question":"What is true about Netforce Events?","bilingual":"Điều gì đúng về Sự kiện Netforce?","options":["It recently moved into another building.","It manufactures furniture.","It has just opened a new store.","It was founded last spring."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It recently moved into another building.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"events","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ɪˈvɛnts/","meaning":"sự kiện"},{"word":"recently","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 30