9 per unit\n194\n\nHANSON S: YOUR ONE-STOP SHOP FOR OFFICE SUPPLIES\nINVOICE\nClient: Netforce Events\nAddress: 342 Collat''d Boulevard, Hampton, ME\nDate: September 10\nItem Quantity Unit Price Total\nErgonomic Task Chair, 22 $159.00 $3,498.00\nItem 490GN\nSubtotal $3,498.00\nDiscount for first-time customers -$159.00\nTotal $3,339.00\nPlease contact customerhelp@hansons-office.com if you have any questions."}],"question":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích của email là gì?","options":["To complain about available chair colors","To request that some chairs be repaired","To place an office stationery order","To ask that some furniture be replaced"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To ask that some furniture be replaced\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"complain","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/kəmˈpleɪn/","meaning":"kêu ca, phàn nàn, oán trách"},{"word":"available","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈveɪ.lə.bəl/","meaning":"có sẵn để dùng"}]},{"questionNum":"193","passageTitle":"Questions 191=195 refer to the following e-mail, product information, and invoice.","passageText":"From: a martin @ net force events.com\nTo: mpresser@gerenukofficedesign.com Date: September 3\nSubject: Chairs (Item #10405)\nDear Mr. Presser,\nAs a result of our company''s expansion last spring, we moved into a larger facility and\nneeded new furniture. At that time we ordered 22 office chairs from Gerenuk Office Design\n(Item #10405-Blue). Within two months, many of the chairs were broken and unusable.\nWe were initially happy with the replacement chairs that you delivered f