    '{"summary":"54 câu hỏi đọc hiểu Part 7 chuẩn ETS 2022 Test 7 gồm đầy đủ đoạn đơn (147-175), đoạn đôi (176-185) và đoạn ba (186-200).","rules":["Đọc lướt tiêu đề, người gửi/nhận để định vị thông tin nhanh.","Câu hỏi liên kết nhiều văn bản cần đối chiếu dữ kiện giữa các đoạn."],"example":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?"}'::jsonb,
    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"To: Way an Cahyo\nFrom: Adi Athletic Club\nDate: March 10\nSubject: Acknowledgment\nDear Mr. Cahyo,\nThis is to acknowledge receipt of your letter dated March 5.\nYour request has been processed. Your athletic club membership is scheduled to end on the\ndate indicated below. You are welcome to use our facilities and attend group classes until\nthen. Please be sure to clear out your locker of any personal belongings by this deadline.\nTermination effective: March 31\nThank you.\nJordi Sommers, Customer Service Representative","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Way an Cahyo\nFrom: Adi Athletic Club\nDate: March 10\nSubject: Acknowledgment\nDear Mr. Cahyo,\nThis is to acknowledge receipt of your letter dated March 5.\nYour request has been processed. Your athletic club membership is scheduled to end on the\ndate indicated below. You are welcome to use our facilities and attend group classes until\nthen. Please be sure to clear out your locker of any personal belongings by this deadline.\nTermination effective: March 31\nThank you.\nJordi Sommers, Customer Service Representative"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích của email là gì?","options":["To correct some information","To offer a membership discount","To promote a new group class","To confirm a cancellation"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To confirm a cancellation\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"correct","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kərˈɛkt/","meaning":"Phải; thích hợp; chính xác; chính xác"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"}]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"To: Way an Cahyo\nFrom: Adi Athletic Club\nDate: March 10\nSubject: Acknowledgment\nDear Mr. Cahyo,\nThis is to acknowledge receipt of your letter dated March 5.\nYour request has been processed. Your athletic club membership is scheduled to end on the\ndate indicated below. You are welcome to use our facilities and attend group classes until\nthen. Please be sure to clear out your locker of any personal belongings by this deadline.\nTermination effective: March 31\nThank you.\nJordi Sommers, Customer Service Representative","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Way an Cahyo\nFrom: Adi Athletic Club\nDate: March 10\nSubject: Acknowledgment\nDear Mr. Cahyo,\nThis is to acknowledge receipt of your letter dated March 5.\nYour request has been processed. Your athletic club membership is scheduled to end on the\ndate indicated below. You are welcome to use our facilities and attend group classes until\nthen. Please be sure to clear out your locker of any personal belongings by this deadline.\nTermination effective: March 31\nThank you.\nJordi Sommers, Customer Service Representative"}],"question":"What must Mr. Cahyo do by March 31?","bilingual":"Ông Cahyo phải làm gì trước ngày 31/3?","options":["Mail a check","Empty a locker","Write to an instructor","Call Mr. Sommers"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"Empty a locker\".","vocabList":[{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"check","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ʧɛk/","meaning":"bài kiểm tra; lệnh chuyển tiền; lệnh thanh toán; nhà hà