requirements for truck licenses, as well as fees for other types of vehicle licenses: www.motorvehiclelicense.net. It is quick and easy to renew online. ------- [3] -------. You can also renew by mail. If you\nchoose this option, please send a copy of this notice along with payment to your\nlocal Motor Vehicle License office. ------- [41 -------.\nSincerely,\n73etty TXM;\nBetty Tsai\nAdministrator, Motor Vehicle Licenses"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the letter?","bilingual":"Mục đích của bức thư là gì?","options":["To explain the reasons for a fee increase","To provide the status of a license","To schedule a meeting in Laketon","To update a user’s identification number"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"To provide the status of a license\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"letter","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈlɛtər/","meaning":"ký tự là một phần của bảng chữ cái; bằng văn bản"},{"word":"explain","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ɪkˈspleɪn/","meaning":"minh họa; làm sáng tỏ; để giải thích; để mô tả ; ĐẾN"},{"word":"reason","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈrizən/","meaning":"suy nghĩ ; để xem xét một cách hợp lý; tranh luận ; để yêu cầu"}]},{"questionNum":"162","passageTitle":"Questions 161-163 refer to the following letter.","passageText":"November 23\nMatteo Fernandez\n5196 Revol St.\nLaketon, CA 97999\nDear Mr. Fernandez,\nWe are writing to notify you that your license as described below will expire at the\nend of the year. ------- [1] -------.\nLicense Type: Motorcycle\nLicense Number: 297461\nExpiration: December 31\nState law requires all motor vehicle licenses to be renewed periodically. The fees\nare $20 for boat and snow mobile licenses, $30 for motorcycle licenses, $40 for car\nlicenses, and $50 for truck licenses. ------- 2] -------. Check our Web site regarding further\nrequirements for truck licenses, as well as fees for other types of vehicle licenses: www.motorvehiclelicense.net. It is quick and easy to renew online. ------- [3] -------. You can also renew by mail. If you\nchoose this option, please send a copy of this notice along with payment to your\nlocal Motor Vehicle License office. ------- [41 -------.\nSincerely,\n73etty TXM;\nBetty Tsai\nAdministrator, Motor Vehicle Licenses","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"November 23\nMatteo Fernandez\n5196 Revol St.\nLaketon, CA 97999\nDear Mr. Fernandez,\nWe are writing to notify you that your license as described below will expire at the\nend of the year. ------- [1] -------.\nLicense Type: Motorcycle\nLicense Number: 297461\nExpiration: December 31\nState law requires all motor vehicle licenses to be renewed periodically. The fees\nare $20 for boat and snow mobile licenses, $30 for motorcycle licenses, $40 for car\nlicenses, and $50 for truck licenses. ------- 2] -------. Check our Web site regarding further\nrequirements for truck licenses, as well as fees for other types of vehicle licenses: www.motorvehiclelicense.net. It is quick and easy to renew online. ------- [3] -------. You can also renew by mail. If you\nchoose this option, please send a copy of this notice along with payment to your\nlocal Motor Vehicle License office. ------- [41 -------.\nSincerely,\n73etty TXM;\nBetty Tsai\nAdministrator, Motor Vehicle Licenses"}],"question":"According to the letter, how much does Mr. Fernandez need to pay?","bilingual":"Theo thư, ông Fernandez cần phải trả bao nhiêu?","options":["$20","$30","$40","$50"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"$30\".","vocabList":[{"word":"letter","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈlɛtər/","meaning":"ký tự là một phần của bảng chữ cái; bằng văn bản"},{"word":"need","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/nid/","meaning":"yêu cầu; thiếu một mặt hàng không thể thiếu;"},{"word":"notify","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/nəʊ.tɪ.faɪ/","meaning":"báo, khai báo; thông báo"},{"word":"your","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/jʊr/","meaning":"của bạn"}]},{"questionNum":"163","passageTitle":"Questions 161-163 refer to the following letter.","passageText":"November 23\nMatteo Fernandez\n5196 Revol St.\nLaketon, CA 97999\nDear Mr. Fernandez,\nWe are writing to notify you that your license as described below will expire at the\nend of the year. ------- [1] -------.\nLicense Type: Motorcycle\nLicense Number: 297461\nExpiration: December 31\nState law requires all motor vehicle licenses to be renewed periodically. The fees\nare $20 for boat and snow mobile licenses, $30 for motorcycle licenses, $40 for car\nlicenses, and $50 for truck licenses. ------- 2] -------. Check our Web site regarding further\nrequirements for truck licenses, as well as fees for other types of vehicle licenses: www.motorvehiclelicense.net. It is quick and easy to renew online. ------- [3] -------. You can also renew by mail. If you\nchoose this option, please send a copy of this notice along with payment to your\nlocal Motor Vehicle License office. ------- [41 -------.\nSincerely,\n73etty TXM;\nBetty Tsai\nAdministrator, Motor Vehicle Licenses","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"November 23\nMatteo Fernandez\n5196 Revol St.\nLaketon, CA 97999\nDear Mr. Fernandez,\nWe are writing to notify you that your license as described below will expire at the\nend of the year. ------- [1] -------.\nLicense Type: Motorcycle\nLicense Number: 297461\nExpiration: December 31\nState law requires all motor vehicle licenses to be renewed periodically. The fees\nare $20 for boat and snow mobile licenses, $30 for motorcycle licenses, $40 for car\nlicenses, and $50 for truck licenses. ------- 2] -------. Check our Web site regarding further\nrequirements for truck licenses, as well as fees for other types of vehicle licenses: www.motorvehiclelicense.net. It is quick and easy to renew online. ------- [3] -------. You can also renew by mail. If you\nchoose this option, please send a copy of this notice along with payment to your\nlocal Motor Vehicle License office. ------- [41 -------.\nSincerely,\n73etty TXM;\nBetty Tsai\nAdministrator, Motor Vehicle Licenses"}],"question":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3] and [4] does the following sentence best belong? “To do so, please visit our Web site.”","bilingual":"Câu nào sau đây được đánh dấu ở vị trí nào [1], [2], [3] và [4]? SI “Để làm như vậy, vui lòng truy cập trang web của chúng tôi.”","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"[3]\".","vocabList":[{"word":"position","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/pəˈzɪʃən/","meaning":"vị trí, chỗ (của một vật gì)"},{"word":"visit","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈvɪzɪt/","meaning":"tạm trú ở đâu đó; ví dụ về việc dành thời gian"},{"word":"site","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/saɪt/","meaning":"địa điểm; vị trí; khu vực"},{"word":"notify","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/nəʊ.tɪ.faɪ/","meaning":"báo, khai báo; thông báo"}]},{"questionNum":"164","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following online chat discussion.","passageText":"David Tham [8:04 A.M.] Hello, Kelly and Jonathan. Have we confirmed &\nwho will be arriving from Hong Kong next week?\nKelly Cromwell [8:05 A.M.] The Hong Kong office is sending Sara Wang\nand Neha Agarwal. Others can call in if needed.\nDavid Tham [8:07 A.M.] Where will Sara and Neha be working when\nthey arrive?\nKelly Cromwell [8:09 A.M. l They''ll be set up in conference room B.\nOtherwise, they can use the empty desks located near Michael Klein in\nHuman Resources.\nJonathan Li [8:11 A.M. l Hold on. Actually, there are going to be three.\nLillian Zhang is coming, too.\nDavid Tham [8:12 A.M. l We will need another work space then. I''d like\nto keep them together. Maybe there''s a spare office in Accounting?\nKelly Cromwell [8:13 A.M. l Why is Ms. Zhang coming? I thought it was\njust the marketing team.\nJonathan Li [8:14 A.M. l The packaging designers have been working\nclosely with Marketing on this project.\nKelly Cromwell [8:17 A.M.] Got it. I''ll take care of it. I''ll send a final\nschedule to you before lunch. Jonathan, please update the list of call-in\nparticipants'' names and numbers and send it to all of us.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"David Tham [8:04 A.M.] Hello, Kelly and Jonathan. Have we confirmed &\nwho will be arriving from Hong Kong next week?\nKelly Cromwell [8:05 A.M.] The Hong Kong office is sending Sara Wang\nand Neha Agarwal. Others can call in if needed.\nDavid Tham [8:07 A.M.] Where will Sara and Neha be working when\nthey arrive?\nKelly Cromwell [8:09 A.M. l They''ll be set up in conference room B.\nOtherwise, they can use the empty desks located near Michael Klein in\nHuman Resources.\nJonathan Li [8:11 A.M. l Hold on. Actually, there are going to be three.\nLillian Zhang is coming, too.\nDavid Tham [8:12 A.M. l We will need another work space then. I''d like\nto keep them together. Maybe there''s a spare office in Accounting?\nKelly Cromwell [8:13 A.M. l Why is Ms. Zhang coming? I thought it was\njust the marketing team.\nJonathan Li [8:14 A.M. l The packaging designers have been working\nclosely with Marketing on this project.\nKelly Cromwell [8:17 A.M.] Got it. I''ll take care of it. I''ll send a final\nschedule to you before lunch. Jonathan, please update the list of call-in\nparticipants'' names and numbers and se