at has been the result of installing the signs in other cities?","bilingual":"Theo thông tin, kết quả của việc lắp đặt biển báo ở các thành phố khác là gì?","options":["Increased use of public transportation","Higher bus fares","Improved lighting at bus stops","More on-time bus arrivals"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Increased use of public transportation\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"sign","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/saɪn/","meaning":"đánh dấu; biểu tượng; chỉ định; gợi ý; dấu vết; để ý;"},{"word":"transportation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˌtræn.spɚˈteɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"sự vận chuyển"},{"word":"higher","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/haɪər/","meaning":"cao hơn"}]},{"questionNum":"171","passageTitle":"Questions 168-171 refer to the following information.","passageText":"Request for Proposal\nPurpose\nI ’he City of New Langston is seeking proposals for the manufacture and installation of electronic\nsignage at bus stops throughout the city. New Langston plans to deploy new electronic signs that\ndisplay real-time arrival information to bus riders.\nBackground\nCurrently, New Langston’s bus stops are marked by simple metal signs displaying only the\nlocation of the stop and the lines that stop at the location. Cities around the world have begun to\nincorporate real-time arrival information into bus stop signage. Electronic signs are proving to be\nvery popular with riders, and studies show that the introduction of such signage has contributed\nto increased ridership in numerous cities.\nProject Description\nThe successful bidder will provide New Langston with up to 350 electronic signs. The signs\nmust be powered by solar energy and have a battery backup allowing them to op