các biển báo mới?","options":["They must be powered by solar energy.","They must operate in the rain.","They must be reliable.","They must display information in color."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"They must display information in color.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"requirement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈkwaɪr.mənt/","meaning":"yêu cầu, cần thiết"},{"word":"sign","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/saɪn/","meaning":"đánh dấu; biểu tượng; chỉ định; gợi ý; dấu vết; để ý;"},{"word":"they","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ðeɪ/","meaning":"họ"},{"word":"powered","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/paʊərd/","meaning":"được hỗ trợ"}]},{"questionNum":"172","passageTitle":"Questions 172-175 refer to the following job announcement.","passageText":"Junior Project Manager\nTraskin Public Relations\nSeattle, WA\nTraskin Public Relations is a marketing and public relations firm focusing on the\nhospitality industry. We are based in Seattle and have been in business for more than\ntwenty years. To keep up with our recent rapid expansion, Traskin is now seeking a new\njunior project manager. ------- [1] -------. This is an opportunity to be trained in valuable strategic\nand creative processes. This training program served as the starting point for several of\nour current senior project managers. Traskin offers all employees competitive\ncompensation and benefits. ------- [2] -------.\nResponsibilities include coordinating with managers and clients, scheduling meetings and\npresentations, and managing budgets. ------- [3] -------. Additionally, the successful applicant\nwill create weekly e-mail updates for internal teammates and clients.\nQualifications include a minimum of two years’ management experience at a similar\nagency, knowledge of project management software, and excellent organizational skills.\n[4]-.\nUpload resume and cover letter to careers@traskinpr.com.\n216","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Junior Project Manager\nTraskin Public Relations\nSeattle, WA\nTraskin Public Relations is a marketing and public relations firm focusing on the\nhospitality industry. We are based in Seattle and have been in business for more than\ntwenty years. To keep up with our recent rapid expansion, Traskin is now seeking a new\njunior project manager. ------- [1] -------. This is an opportunity to be trained in valuable strategic\nand creative processes. This training program served as the starting point for several of\nour current senior project managers. Traskin offers all employees competitive\ncompensation and benefits. ------- [2] -------.\nResponsibilities include coordinating with managers and clients, scheduling meetings and\npresentations, and managing budgets. ------- [3] -------. Additionally, the successful applicant\nwill create weekly e-mail updates for internal teammates and clients.\nQualifications include a minimum of two years’ management experience at a similar\nagency, knowledge of project management software, and excellent organizational skills.\n[4]-.\nUpload resume and cover letter to careers@traskinpr.com.\n216"}],"question":"What is indicated about Traskin Public Relations?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về Quan hệ công chúng của Traskin?","options":["It is a new company.","It has international offices.","It focuses on Web site development.","It is growing in size."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"It is growing in size.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"relation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/riˈleɪʃən/","meaning":"tường thuật; hành động kể lại; thành viên gia đình; sự liên quan;"},{"word":"company","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌm.pə.ni/","meaning":"công ty, bạn bè, bằng hữu"},{"word":"intern