full day.\nWould you want to use the machine while I have it? If so, we can coordinate our\nschedules, and I can bring it to you after I finish. Then I can return the trencher to Zolio\nRentals the next morning. I will gladly cover the entire rental fee. It is my way of\nreturning the favour for your help with my lawn mower last autumn. Please let me know.\nRegards,\nRalph\n218","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Văn bản 1 (Web page)","text":"https://www.zoliorentals.ca A\nZolio Rentals Ltd. has a large inventory of heavy machines and construction tools\navailable for hourly or daily rental. No matter what your task is, we likely have what\nyou need to tackle it. We have more than 50 locations throughout Canada, with\nlimited delivery available in some locations. If you require assistance, please call us\nat 604-555-0129 or e-mail us at info@zoliorentals.ca.\nSearch:\nMachine for trench digging\nResults:\n45-cm trencher 60-cm trencher\n4-hour rental $166 $194\n24-hour rental $237 $275"},{"label":"Văn bản 2 (e-mail)","text":"To: Sharia Stanton <sharla @stantonacres.ca>\nFrom: Ralph Fitzpatrick <rfitzpatrick @fitzgreenways.ca>\nDate: 6 April\nSubject: Trencher machine\nHi Sharia,\nYou had mentioned the other day that you anticipate needing to dig an irrigation trench on\nyour property, just as I do. I wanted to let you know that I did some searching on the\nZolio Rentals Web site, and I have decided that tomorrow I am going to rent the smallest\ntrencher that is available. I will need the machine only for a couple of hours, but since the\nclosest rental location is 45 minutes away in Durham, and it will take time to load it onto\nmy truck both for the trip home and back to Durham again, I have decided to rent the\nmachine for a full day.\nWould you want to use the machine while I have it? If so, we can coordinate our\nschedules, and I can bring it to you after I finish. Then I can return the trencher to Zolio\nRentals the next morning. I will gladly cover the entire rental fee. It is my way of\nreturning the favour for your help with my lawn mower last autumn. Please let me know.\nRegards,\nRalph\n218"}],"question":"How much will Mr. Fitzpatrick most likely spend at Zolio Rentals?","bilingual":"Ông Fitzpatrick có nhiều khả năng sẽ chi bao nhiêu nhất tại Zolio Rentals?","options":["$166","$194","$237","$275"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"$237\".","vocabList":[{"word":"spend","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/spɛnd/","meaning":"chi tiêu ; giải ngân; bỏ ra (tiền bạc, nguồn lực,"},{"word":"rental","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛntəl/","meaning":"có sẵn để cho thuê hoặc cho thuê"},{"word":"large","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/lɑrʤ/","meaning":"lớn; lớn lao; rộng; rộng rãi; nổi tiếng"},{"word":"inventory","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈɪn.vən.tɔːr.i/","meaning":"sự kiểm kê, bản kiểm kê"}]},{"questionNum":"181","passageTitle":"Questions 181-185 refer to the following article and job posting.","passageText":"Welinaras Corporation to\nMove R&D Division\nPUNE (12 March) ------- Welinaras Corporation,\nthe health technology company headquartered\nin Pune, announced today that its Research\nand Development (R&D) Division will be\nbased in Mumbai effective 1 May. “Mumbai\nhas the business climate, facilities, and\ncreative talent we need to help push our\nproduction forward,” said Mr. Ram Jadhav,\nwho became the company''s third president\nlast month. Currently, the company has offices\nin two other Indian cities, namely New Delhi\nand Hyderabad.\nWelinaras Corporation is the manufacturer of\nhigh-quality technological equipment. Its\nproduct that is most in demand and, thus,\nprofitable, is called Vigilant. Invented by\nMr. Jadhav, and available across India, the\ndevice is intended for people with health\nproblems. A key feature is its ability to\nregularly gather and update data about the\npatient s condition, information that might be\ncrucial in emergencies.\nWelinaras Corporation\nJob title: Senior Research and Development Engineer\nListing date: 23 March\nApply by: 25 April\nResponsible for designing and testing wear able health-monitoring devices.\nEDUCATION AND SKILLS:\n•Graduate degree in biomedical engineering\n•Minimum of five years'' experience developing medical devices and\nconducting clinical trials\n© Minimum of three years'' experience in managing research teams\n•Excellent written and oral communication skills\n•Ability to work collaboratively in a global, multicultural environment\nCandidate must attend a preliminary training course on 25 May, prior to\nstarting work on 8 June.\n220","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Welinaras Corporation to\nMove R&D Division\nPUNE (12 March) ------- Welinaras Corporation,\nthe health technology company headquartered\nin Pune, announced today that its Research\nand Development (R&D) Division will be\nbased in Mumbai effective 1 May. “Mumbai\nhas the business climate, facilities, and\ncreative talent we need to help push our\nproduction forward,” said Mr. Ram Jadhav,\nwho became the company''s third president\nlast month. Currently, the company has offices\nin two other Indian cities, namely New Delhi\nand Hyderabad.\nWelinaras Corporation is the manufacturer of\nhigh-quality technological equipment. Its\nproduct that is most in demand and, thus,\nprofitable, is called Vigilant. Invented by\nMr. Jadhav, and available across India, the\ndevice is intended for people with health\nproblems. A key feature is its ability to\nregularly gather and update data about the\npatient s condition, information that might be\ncrucial in emergencies.\nWelinaras Corporation\nJob title: Senior Research and Development Engineer\nListing date: 23 March\nApply by: 25 April\nResponsible for designing and testing wear able health-monitoring devices.\nEDUCATION AND SKILLS:\n•Graduate degree in biomedical engineering\n•Minimum of five years'' experience developing medical devices and\nconducting clinical trials\n© Minimum of three years'' experience in managing research teams\n•Excellent written and oral communication skills\n•Ability to work collaboratively in a global, multicultural environment\nCandidate must attend a preliminary training course on 25 May, prior to\nstarting work on 8 June.\n220"}],"question":"What is stated about Mr. Jadhav?","bilingual":"Người ta nói gì về ông Jadhav?","options":["He created one of the company''s products.","He is the founder of Welinaras Corporation.","He used to be in charge of the R&D Division.","He has been company president for three years."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"He created one of the company''s products.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"company","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkʌm.pə.ni/","meaning":"công ty, bạn bè, bằng hữu"},{"word":"products","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈprɑdəkts/","meaning":"sản phẩm"},{"word":"founder","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈfaʊndər/","meaning":"đổ đầy nước và chìm xuống; ngã; thất bại; vấp ngã; ĐẾN"},{"word":"charge","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/tʃɑːrdʒ/","meaning":"chi phí, tiền công; tính giá, đòi trả"}]},{"questionNum":"182","passageTitle":"Questions 181-185 refer to the following article and job posting.","passageText":"Welinaras Corporation to\nMove R&D Division\nPUNE (12 March) ------- Welinaras Corporation,\nthe health technology company headquartered\nin Pune, announced today that its Research\nand Development (R&D) Division will be\nbased in Mumbai effective 1 May. “Mumbai\nhas the business climate, facilities, and\ncreative talent we need to help push our\nproduction forward,” said Mr. Ram Jadhav,\nwho became the company''s third