    '{"summary":"54 câu hỏi đọc hiểu Part 7 chuẩn ETS 2022 Test 8 gồm đầy đủ đoạn đơn (147-175), đoạn đôi (176-185) và đoạn ba (186-200).","rules":["Đọc lướt tiêu đề, người gửi/nhận để định vị thông tin nhanh.","Câu hỏi liên kết nhiều văn bản cần đối chiếu dữ kiện giữa các đoạn."],"example":"What does the information suggest about Smith County?"}'::jsonb,
    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following information.","passageText":"Smith County Transportation Department\nCurrent Postings\nBridge Inspector (BI9253) ------- Take your career to new heights as a bridge inspector\nin beautiful Smith County, known for its spectacular and varied landscape! The\ngeography of our county is large and hilly, necessitating the use of our many bridges\nand tunnels by residents and tourists alike. The position involves assessing the\ncondition of existing bridges, tunnels, culverts, and related road signs as well as\nproposing and overseeing repairs. We offer competitive salaries with excellent\nbenefits. For details on requirements and how to apply, please visit www.smithcounty.gov/jobs. The deadline is January 15.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Smith County Transportation Department\nCurrent Postings\nBridge Inspector (BI9253) ------- Take your career to new heights as a bridge inspector\nin beautiful Smith County, known for its spectacular and varied landscape! The\ngeography of our county is large and hilly, necessitating the use of our many bridges\nand tunnels by residents and tourists alike. The position involves assessing the\ncondition of existing bridges, tunnels, culverts, and related road signs as well as\nproposing and overseeing repairs. We offer competitive salaries with excellent\nbenefits. For details on requirements and how to apply, please visit www.smithcounty.gov/jobs. The deadline is January 15."}],"question":"What does the information suggest about Smith County?","bilingual":"Thông tin gợi ý gì về Quận Smith?","options":["Its population is growing rapidly.","Its tunnel system requires modernization.","It is an attractive place to live and visit.","It is currently building many new highways."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It is an attractive place to live and visit.\".","vocabList":[{"word"