ww.smithcounty.gov/jobs. The deadline is January 15."}],"question":"According to the information, what is one duty of the bridge inspector?","bilingual":"Theo thông tin, nhiệm vụ của thanh tra cầu đường là gì?","options":["Supervising maintenance work","Planning new bridges","Collecting bridge and tunnel tolls","Designing traffic signs"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Supervising maintenance work\".","vocabList":[{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"duty","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈduti/","meaning":"nghĩa vụ; trách nhiệm; phân công; thuế hải quan"},{"word":"inspector","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˌɪnˈspɛktər/","meaning":"người có nhiệm vụ giám sát, kiểm tra;"},{"word":"supervising","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈsupərˌvaɪzɪŋ/","meaning":"Giám sát"}]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Thank you for purchasing tickets for a tour of the historic Walton Steam ship. If you\nneed to cancel or change your appointment, please he aware of our cancellation\npolicy. Cancellations up to one clay before the scheduled tour will receive a refund of\n50% per ticket. Canceling on the same day or failing to appear at the time of your\nscheduled tour will result in no refund. All refunds will be credited to the card used\nto purchase the tickets.\nPlease note that tours are conducted both inside the ship and outside on deck. Tours\nare rarely canceled due to weather. Please wear appropriate clothing in case we\nexperience cold or wet weather.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Thank you for purchasing tickets for a tour of the historic Walton Steam ship. If you\nneed to cancel or change your appointment, please he aware of our cancellation\npolicy. Cancellations up to one clay before the scheduled tour will receive a refund of\n50% per ticket. Canceling on the same day or failing to appear at the time of your\nscheduled tour will result in no refund. All refunds will be credited to the card used\nto purchase the tickets.\nPlease note that tours are conducted both inside the ship and outside on deck. Tours\nare rarely canceled due to weather. Please wear appropriate clothing in case we\nexperience cold or wet weather."}],"question":"For whom is the notice most likely intended?","bilingual":"Thông báo có khả năng dành cho ai nhất?","options":["Current ticket holders","Steam ship crew members","Customer service representatives","Tour guides in training 238"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"Current ticket holders\".","vocabList":[{"word":"notice","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''nəƱtis/","meaning":"thông tri, yết thị, thông báo"},{"word":"current","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈkɝː.ənt/","meaning":"dòng, luồng; hiện tại, hiện thời"},{"word":"ticket","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈtɪkɪt/","meaning":"giấy chứng nhận; thẻ nhập cảnh; nhãn"},{"word":"steam","pos":"Verb (Động từ)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/stiːm/","meaning":"đánh hơi nóng, làm nóng bằng hơi nước"}]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Thank you for purchasing tickets for a tour of the historic Walton Steam ship. If you\nneed to cancel or change your appointment, please he aware of our cancellation\npolicy. Cancellations up to one clay before the scheduled tour will receive a refund of\n50% per ticket. Canceling on the same day or failing to appear at the time of your\nscheduled tour will result in no refund. All refunds will be credited to the card used\nto purchase the tickets.\nPlease note that tours are conducted both inside the ship and outside on deck. Tours\nare rarely canceled due to weather. Please wear appropriate clothing in case we\nexperience cold or wet weather.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Thank you for purchasing tickets for a tour of the historic Walton Steam ship. If you\nneed to cancel or change your appointment, please he aware of our cancellation\npolicy. Cancellations up to one clay before the scheduled tour will receive a refund of\n50% per ticket. Canceling on the same day or failing to appear at the time of your\nscheduled tour will result in no refund. All refunds will be credited to the card used\nto purchase the tickets.\nPlease note that tours are conducted both inside the ship and outside on deck. Tours\nare rarely canceled due to weather. Please wear appropriate clothing in case we\nexperience cold or wet weather."}],"question":"What does the notice recommend people do?","bilingual":"Thông báo khuyến nghị mọi người nên làm gì?","options":["Update their contact information","Print historical reference materials","Dress to spend time outdoors","Arrive early on the day of the tour"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Dress to spend time outdoors\".","vocabList":[{"word":"notice","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''nəƱtis/","meaning":"thông tri, yết thị, thông báo"},{"word":"recommend","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rekə''mend/","meaning":"giới thiệu, tiến cử (người, vật...)"},{"word":"update","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ʌpˈdeɪt/","meaning":"nâng cấp"},{"word":"contact","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtækt/","meaning":"thiết lập giao tiếp; để tạo kết nối; ĐẾN"}]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"Questions 151=152 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"E-Mail Message\nFrom: support @volunix.com O\nTo: Amrita Das <adas@myfastmail.com> Sent: September 6\nSubject: Incident 030924\nDear Valued Customer:\nO\nt\nThank you for contacting Volunix Ltd., the online store for medical supplies. We\napologize for the technical difficulty you are experiencing with your online purchase.\nYour support ticket was submitted on Wednesday, September 6, at 10:12 p.m. You can\ntrack the status of your incident by using the “case status” feature. You can also use this\nfeature to add information to the ticket at any time.\nThe Volunix team responds to support issues as quickly as possible. During regular\nbusiness hours (8 a.m. to 6 p.m., Monday through Friday), you can expect a response\nwithin one hour. Tickets submitted after business hours and on weekends will be\nresponded to before noon of the following business day.\nThank you,\nThe Volunix Web Team\n* 5 la","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"E-Mail Message\nFrom: support @volunix.com O\nTo: Amrita Das <adas@myfastmail.com> Sent: September 6\nSubject: Incident 030924\nDear Valued Customer:\nO\nt\nThank you for contacting Volunix Ltd., the online store for medical supplies. We\napologize for the technical difficulty you are experiencing with your online purchase.\nYour support ticket was submitted on Wednesday, September 6, at 10:12 p.m. You can\ntrack the status of your incident by using the “case status” feature. You can also use this\nfeature to add information to the ticket at any time.\nThe Volunix team responds to support issues as quickly as possible. During regular\nbusiness hours (8 a.m. to 6 p.m., Monday through Friday), you can expect a response\nwithin one hour. Tickets submitted after business hours and on weekends will be\nresponded to before noon of the following business day.\nThank you,\nThe Volunix Web Team\n* 5 la"}],"question":"What problem is Ms. Das most likely experiencing?","bilingual":"Cô Das có khả năng gặp phải vấn đề gì nhất?","options":["Her firm’s 