ation\nHello Ms. Lim,\nI am George Siskos, Recruiting Manager at Crehcorp Ltd. We are currently looking to hire\nan accounting clerk, and Joe Argento recommended you. From what Joe told me, your\nbackground makes you a good fit for the role (posting attached). If you are interested in\nlearning more about Crehcorp and the position, I will be happy to provide further\ninformation. Let me know when you are available to talk, and I will give you a call.\nI look forward to hearing back from you!\nGeorge Siskos","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Mary Lim <mlim4 l 2@ mailhouz.com>\nFrom: George Siskos <gsiskos@crehcorp.com> Date: September 24\nSubject: Referral from Joe Argento\nAttachment: l|Information\nHello Ms. Lim,\nI am George Siskos, Recruiting Manager at Crehcorp Ltd. We are currently looking to hire\nan accounting clerk, and Joe Argento recommended you. From what Joe told me, your\nbackground makes you a good fit for the role (posting attached). If you are interested in\nlearning more about Crehcorp and the position, I will be happy to provide further\ninformation. Let me know when you are available to talk, and I will give you a call.\nI look forward to hearing back from you!\nGeorge Siskos"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?","bilingual":"Mục đích của email là gì?","options":["To advertise for Crehcorp","To request a reference","To recruit an employee","To announce a promotion"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"To recruit an employee\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"mail","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/meɪl/","meaning":"dịch vụ bưu chính; thư và các vật phẩm khác được gửi qua"},{"word":"advertise","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈæd.vɚ.taɪz/","meaning":"quảng cáo, thông báo"},{"