condhand.ca> From: Edward Hasegawa <e.hasegawa@abodemail.com> Subject: Furniture pickup\nDate: 10 August\nMy name is Edward Hasegawa. On Tuesday, 8 August, I bought a desk from your store. I\nplanned to borrow my coworker’s truck to pick up the desk, but today I learned that his\ntruck will be in the repair shop for the next two weeks. I’d like to ask whether the hold\ntime can be extended because of these unforeseen circumstances. I have been a long-time\ncustomer of your store and have purchased sofas, shelving, a kitchen table, and other\nitems.\nSincerely,\nEdward"}],"question":"What is suggested about Beth’s Secondhand Furniture?","bilingual":"Nội thất cũ của Beth được gợi ý gì?","options":["It is under new management.","It does not accept returns.","It is a nonprofit business.","It is opening another location."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"It does not accept returns.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"furniture","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˈfɝː.nɪ.tʃɚ/","meaning":"đồ đạc"},{"word":"management","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈmænɪʤmənt/","meaning":"người của nhóm người điều hành và quản lý một"},{"word":"accept","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əkˈsept/","meaning":"chấp nhận, chấp thuận"},{"word":"returns","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtərnz/","meaning":"trả về"}]},{"questionNum":"188","passageTitle":"Questions 186-190 refer to the following sign, receipt, and e-mail.","passageText":"BETH S SECONDHAND FURNITURE\nHold Rules\n1. Purchased merchandise can be held for 7 days.\n2. Merchandise unclaimed after 7 days will be returned to inventory\nand resold.\n3. We are not responsible for damage to items that are a waiting\ncollection.\n4. We will provide delivery services for large furniture on request.\nLarge furniture is considered 25 kg or heavier.\n5. All sales are final.\nRECEIPT\nBETH