    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following advertisement.","passageText":"Wayne Rental Available\nA sparkling two-bedroom, one-bath apartment is available in the village of Wayne,\nfifteen miles from the center of Bowling Green. Situated in a mid-rise building that is\nten years old, the apartment is convenient to shops and cafes and within walking\ndistance of the train station. The oven and dishwasher have just been replaced, and a\nfresh tile countertop has been installed in the kitchen. A new was her and dryer set is\nnext to the pantry. The monthly rent is $950, including utilities. Sign a one-year\nlease and you can move in as early as August 1. Call (419) 555-0145 to arrange a\ntour.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Wayne Rental Available\nA sparkling two-bedroom, one-bath apartment is available in the village of Wayne,\nfifteen miles from the center of Bowling Green. Situated in a mid-rise building that is\nten years old, the apartment is convenient to shops and cafes and within walking\ndistance of the train station. The oven and dishwasher have just been replaced, and a\nfresh tile countertop has been installed in the kitchen. A new was her and dryer set is\nnext to the pantry. The monthly rent is $950, including utilities. Sign a one-year\nlease and you can move in as early as August 1. Call (419) 555-0145 to arrange a\ntour."}],"question":"What is suggested about the apartment building?","bilingual":"Điều gì được đề xuất về tòa nhà chung cư?","options":["It is under new management.","It has a large parking area.","It is close to public transportation.","It was constructed one year ago."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"It is close to public transportation.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"apartment","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əˈpɑrtmənt/","meaning":"phẳng"},{"word":"building","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɪldɪŋ/","meaning":"căn nhà; nhà ở; kết cấu; cơ sở"},{"word":"management","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈmænɪʤmənt/","meaning":"người của nhóm người điều hành và quản lý một"},{"word":"large","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/lɑrʤ/","meaning":"lớn; lớn lao; rộng; rộng rãi; nổi tiếng"}]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following advertisement.","passageText":"Wayne Rental Available\nA sparkling two-bedroom, one-bath apartment is available in the village of Wayne,\nfifteen miles from the center of Bowling Green. Situated in a mid-rise building that is\nten years old, the apartment is convenient to shops and cafes and within walking\ndistance of the train station. The oven and dishwasher have just been replaced, and a\nfresh tile countertop has been installed in the kitchen. A new was her and dryer set is\nnext to the pantry. The monthly rent is $950, including utilities. Sign a one-year\nlease and you can move in as early as August 1. Call (419) 555-0145 to arrange a\ntour.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Wayne Rental Available\nA sparkling two-bedroom, one-bath apartment is available in the village of Wayne,\nfifteen miles from the center of Bowling Green. Situated in a mid-rise building that is\nten years old, the apartment is convenient to shops and cafes and within walking\ndistance of the train station. The oven and dishwasher have just been replaced, and a\nfresh tile countertop has been installed in the kitchen. A new was her and dryer set is\nnext to the pantry. The monthly rent is $950, including utilities. Sign a one-year\nlease and you can move in as early as August 1. Call (419) 555-0145 to arrange a\ntour."}],"question":"What is NOT mentioned as a new appliance?","bilingual":"Điều gì KHÔNG được đề cập như một thiết bị mới?","options":["A refrigerator","A clothes dryer","An oven","A dishwasher"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"A refrigerator\".","vocabList":[{"word":"appliance","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈplaɪ.əns/","meaning":"thiết bị, dụng cụ"},{"word":"refrigerator","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/rɪˈfrɪdʒ.ər.eɪ.tər/","meaning":"tủ lạnh"},{"word":"oven","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈʌvn/","meaning":"lò nướng"},{"word":"rental","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈrɛntəl/","meaning":"có sẵn để cho thuê hoặc cho thuê"}]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"We appreciate your purchase from Drapes-A-Lot!\nFor issues regarding payment, exchanges, and returns, please contact your nearest\nDrapes-A-Lot retailer. For help with damaged or missing parts, instructions for\ndo-it-yourself installation, or questions about your product, call Drapes-A-Lot\ncustomer support at (713) 555-0101. Representatives are available to answer\nquestions Monday through Friday, 9:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M. Before calling, please have\nthe following information ready: your name and phone number, the purchase order\nnumber, and where you made your purchase.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"We appreciate your purchase from Drapes-A-Lot!\nFor issues regarding payment, exchanges, and returns, please contact your nearest\nDrapes-A-Lot retailer. For help with damaged or missing parts, instructions for\ndo-it-yourself installation, or questions about your product, call Drapes-A-Lot\ncustomer support at (713) 555-0101. Representatives are available to answer\nquestions Monday through Friday, 9:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M. Before calling, please have\nthe following information ready: your name and phone number, the purchase order\nnumber, and where you made your purchase."}],"question":"What does the notice suggest about Drapes-A-Lot?","bilingual":"Thông báo gợi ý gì về Drapes-A-Lot?","options":["It does not offer installation service.","It does not accept returns.","It provides online customer support.","It recently opened retail stores. 268"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"It does not offer installation service.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"notice","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''nəƱtis/","meaning":"thông tri, yết thị, thông báo"},{"word":"suggest","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/səˈdʒest/","meaning":"đề xuất"},{"word":"offer","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɔfər/","meaning":"gợi ý; đề xuất giá; mềm; giá thầu"},{"word":"installation","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.stəˈleɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"sự cài đặt"}]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"We appreciate your purchase from Drapes-A-Lot!\nFor issues regarding payment, exchanges, and returns, please contact your nearest\nDrapes-A-Lot retailer. For help with damaged or missing parts, instructions for\ndo-it-yourself installation, or questions about your product, call Drapes-A-Lot\ncustomer support at (713) 555-0101. Representatives are available to answer\nquestions Monday through Friday, 9:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M. Before calling, please have\nthe following information ready: your name and phone number, the purchase order\nnumber, and where you made your purchase.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"We appreciate your purchase from Drapes-A-Lot!\nFor issues regarding payment, exchanges, and returns, please contact your nearest\nDrapes-A-Lot retailer. For help with damaged or missing parts, instructions for\ndo-it-yourself installation, or questions about your product, call Drapes-A-Lot\ncustomer support at (713) 555-0101. Representatives are available to answer\nquestions Monday through Friday, 9:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M. Before calling, please have\nthe following information ready: your name and phone number, the purchase order\nnumber, and where you made your purchase."}],"question":"According to the notice, what information is necessary when contacting customer support?","bilingual":"Theo thông báo, khi liên hệ hỗ trợ khách hàng cần những thông tin gì?","options":["The serial number of the product","The store location where the product was bought","The credit card number used to make the purchase","The e-mail address of the customer"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"The store location where the product was bought\".","vocabList":[{"word":"notice","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''nəƱtis/","meaning":"thông tri, yết thị, thông báo"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"necessary","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈnɛsəˌsɛri/","meaning":"một cái gì đó là cần thiết hoặc bắt buộc; yếu tố cần thiết của"},{"word":"contacting","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtæktɪŋ/","meaning":"Liên hệ"}]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"Questions 151-152 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"Keith Odom (10:15 A.M.) We''re almost finished trimming the bushes and trees\naround the lobby entrance. We''ll trim everything in the back garden after lunch.\nWhile we''re in the front, though, we’re going to weed the flower beds.\nRebecca Truesdell (10:18 A.M.) 1 thought they were cleaned up earlier this week.\nKeith Odom (10:20 A.M.) Remember it rained. We couldn''t get to the weeding on\nWednesday.\nRebecca Truesdell (10:25 A.M.) That’s right. Yes, please finish out front first. We\nhave two large parties scheduled for tomorrow, so we want the hotel entrance and\ngrounds to look good.\nKeith Odom (10:27 A.M.) Okay. This should not take more than an hour or so.\nRebecca Truesdell (10:28 A.M.) Let me know when you''re finished in the back\ngarden. We’re expecting the delivery of some new patio furniture later this afternoon,\nand that will be set up as soon as it arrives.\n•i HU i •","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Keith Odom (10:15 A.M.) We''re almost finished trimming the bushes and trees\naround the lobby entrance. We''ll trim everything in the back garden after lunch.\nWhile we''re in the front, though, we’re going to weed the flower beds.\nRebecca Truesdell (10:18 A.M.) 1 thought they were cleaned up earlier this week.\nKeith Odom (10:20 A.M.) Remember it rained. We couldn''t get to the weeding on\nWednesday.\nRebecca Truesdell (10:25 A.M.) That’s right. Yes, please finish out front first. We\nhave two large parties scheduled for tomorrow, so we want the hotel entrance and\ngrounds to look good.\nKeith Odom (10:27 A.M.) Okay. This should not take more than an hour or so.\nRebecca Truesdell (10:28 A.M.) Let me know when you''re finished in the back\ngarden. We’re expecting the delivery of some new patio furniture later this afternoon,\nand that will be set up as soon as it arrives.\n•i HU i •"}],"question":"Who most likely is Mr. Odom?","bilingual":"Ai có nhiều khả năng là ông Odom nhất?","options":["A hotel manager","An event planner","A building inspector","A groundskeeper"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"A groundskeeper\".","vocabList":[{"word":"manager","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈmænɪʤər/","meaning":"người điều hành một công ty; giám đốc; quản trị viên;"},{"word":"event","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪˈvent/","meaning":"sự kiện, sự việc"},{"word":"building","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈbɪldɪŋ/","meaning":"