    54,
    NULL,
    NULL,
    '[]'::jsonb,
    '{"summary":"54 câu hỏi đọc hiểu Part 7 chuẩn ETS 2022 Test 10 gồm đầy đủ đoạn đơn (147-175), đoạn đôi (176-185) và đoạn ba (186-200).","rules":["Đọc lướt tiêu đề, người gửi/nhận để định vị thông tin nhanh.","Câu hỏi liên kết nhiều văn bản cần đối chiếu dữ kiện giữa các đoạn."],"example":"What will Mr. Bodine most likely work on next?"}'::jsonb,
    '[{"questionNum":"147","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"Brycen Bodine [1:07 P.M.]\nHi, Avichai. I finished the upholstery on the sofa\nand chairs for Ms. Levin. They look great! It''s such\na nice fabric. Which order should I work on next?\nAvichai Rosen [1:14 P.M.]\nGlad to hear it. I promised the Chens their dining\nchairs by Saturday. By the way, the Metropolitan\nDesign Show on June 14 has been postponed to\nJuly 7.\nBrycen Bodine [1:19 P.M.]\nOh, then I can''t make it.\nAvichai Rosen [1:22 P.M.]\nThat''s too bad. I''ll need at least two employees to\ncome help. We''ll be showing our office desks and\nbookshelves.\nBrycen Bodine [1:24 P.M.]\nI''ll ask Rita and Tom if they are available on that\nday. Unfortunately, I have a family commitment\nout of town that day. I''ll get started on the Chens''\norder now.\nAvichai Rosen [1:25 P.M.]\nSounds good. Thank you!\n•0 HH I •","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Brycen Bodine [1:07 P.M.]\nHi, Avichai. I finished the upholstery on the sofa\nand chairs for Ms. Levin. They look great! It''s such\na nice fabric. Which order should I work on next?\nAvichai Rosen [1:14 P.M.]\nGlad to hear it. I promised the Chens their dining\nchairs by Saturday. By the way, the Metropolitan\nDesign Show on June 14 has been postponed to\nJuly 7.\nBrycen Bodine [1:19 P.M.]\nOh, then I can''t make it.\nAvichai Rosen [1:22 P.M.]\nThat''s too bad. I''ll need at least two employees to\ncome help. We''ll be showing our office desks and\nbookshelves.\nBrycen Bodine [1:24 P.M.]\nI''ll ask Rita and Tom if they are available on that\nday. Unfortunately, I have a family commitment\nout of town that day. I''ll get started on the Chens''\norder now.\nAvichai Rosen [1:25 P.M.]\nSounds good. Thank you!\n•0 HH I •"}],"question":"What will Mr. Bodine most likely work on next?","bilingual":"Rất có thể ông Bodine sẽ làm gì tiếp theo?","options":["A sofa","An office desk","A bookshelf","A set of chairs"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"A set of chairs\".","vocabList":[{"word":"work","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/wərk/","meaning":"nhân công; nhiệm vụ; nghề nghiệp; nghề nghiệp; ơn gọi; cố gắng"},{"word":"office","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɔfəs/","meaning":"buồng; văn phòng; đương nhiệm; hãng; thẩm quyền"},{"word":"desk","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/dɛsk/","meaning":"bàn văn phòng"},{"word":"chair","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/tʃer/","meaning":"ghế ngồi"}]},{"questionNum":"148","passageTitle":"Questions 147-148 refer to the following text-message chain.","passageText":"Brycen Bodine [1:07 P.M.]\nHi, Avichai. I finished the upholstery on the sofa\nand chairs for Ms. Levin. They look great! It''s such\na nice fabric. Which order should I work on next?\nAvichai Rosen [1:14 P.M.]\nGlad to hear it. I promised the Chens their dining\nchairs by Saturday. By the way, the Metropolitan\nDesign Show on June 14 has been postponed to\nJuly 7.\nBrycen Bodine [1:19 P.M.]\nOh, then I can''t make it.\nAvichai Rosen [1:22 P.M.]\nThat''s too bad. I''ll need at least two employees to\ncome help. We''ll be showing our office desks and\nbookshelves.\nBrycen Bodine [1:24 P.M.]\nI''ll ask Rita and Tom if they are available on that\nday. Unfortunately, I have a family commitment\nout of town that day. I''ll get started on the Chens''\norder now.\nAvichai Rosen [1:25 P.M.]\nSounds good. Thank you!\n•0 HH I •","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Brycen Bodine [1:07 P.M.]\nHi, Avichai. I finished the upholstery on the sofa\nand chairs for Ms. Levin. They look great! It''s such\na nice fabric. Which order should I work on next?\nAvichai Rosen [1:14 P.M.]\nGlad to hear it. I promised the Chens their dining\nchairs by Saturday. By the way, the Metropolitan\nDesign Show on June 14 has been postponed to\nJuly 7.\nBrycen Bodine [1:19 P.M.]\nOh, then I can''t make it.\nAvichai Rosen [1:22 P.M.]\nThat''s too bad. I''ll need at least two employees to\ncome help. We''ll be showing our office desks and\nbookshelves.\nBrycen Bodine [1:24 P.M.]\nI''ll ask Rita and Tom if they are available on that\nday. Unfortunately, I have a family commitment\nout of town that day. I''ll get started on the Chens''\norder now.\nAvichai Rosen [1:25 P.M.]\nSounds good. Thank you!\n•0 HH I •"}],"question":"At 1:19 P.M., what does Mr. Bodine mean when he writes, “I can’t make it”?","bilingual":"Vào lúc 1:19 chiều, ông Bodine có ý gì khi viết “Tôi không thể làm được”?","options":["He will not be seeing Rita or Tom.","He will not be able to attend an event.","He will not be able to meet a deadline.","He does not know how to build a piece of furniture."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"He will not be able to attend an event.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"mean","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/min/","meaning":"điểm giữa; ở giữa; cách xa hai thái cực như nhau;"},{"word":"write","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/raɪt/","meaning":"viết, sáng tác"},{"word":"able","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈeɪbəl/","meaning":"có thẩm quyền; tài năng; thích hợp"},{"word":"attend","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈtend/","meaning":"tham dự"}]},{"questionNum":"149","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Thank you for downloading the Spumoni mobile phone app!\nAt your current basic membership level, your ability to save\nrecipes is limited to five per day. If you would like the freedom to\nsave unlimited recipes daily, automatically generate shopping\nlists, create weekly meal plans, and track nutritional data, you\ncan become a premium member for just $2.99 a month.\nMany users find this small fee to be money well spent, as the\npremium features save them time and enable them to make\nhealthier meal choices. Visit our “PM Community” Web page to\nview real testimonials from our premium members.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Thank you for downloading the Spumoni mobile phone app!\nAt your current basic membership level, your ability to save\nrecipes is limited to five per day. If you would like the freedom to\nsave unlimited recipes daily, automatically generate shopping\nlists, create weekly meal plans, and track nutritional data, you\ncan become a premium member for just $2.99 a month.\nMany users find this small fee to be money well spent, as the\npremium features save them time and enable them to make\nhealthier meal choices. Visit our “PM Community” Web page to\nview real testimonials from our premium members."}],"question":"What does the notice encourage users to do?","bilingual":"Thông báo khuyến khích người dùng làm gì","options":["Share their own recipes","Submit their own testimonials","Upgrade their membership status","Download a recent software update 298"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"Upgrade their membership status\".","vocabList":[{"word":"notice","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''nəƱtis/","meaning":"thông tri, yết thị, thông báo"},{"word":"encourage","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ɪnˈkɝː.ɪdʒ/","meaning":"động viên, cổ vũ"},{"word":"users","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈjuzərz/","meaning":"người dùng"},{"word":"share","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ʃɛr/","meaning":"phần; phần; hạn ngạch; phân bổ; phát hành cổ phiếu"}]},{"questionNum":"150","passageTitle":"Questions 149-150 refer to the following notice.","passageText":"Thank you for downloading the Spumoni mobile phone app!\nAt your current basic membership level, your ability to save\nrecipes is limited to five per day. If you would like the freedom to\nsave unlimited recipes daily, automatically generate shopping\nlists, create weekly meal plans, and track nutritional data, you\ncan become a premium member for just $2.99 a month.\nMany users find this small fee to be money well spent, as the\npremium features save them time and enable them to make\nhealthier meal choices. Visit our “PM Community” Web page to\nview real testimonials from our premium members.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Thank you for downloading the Spumoni mobile phone app!\nAt your current basic membership level, your ability to save\nrecipes is limited to five per day. If you would like the freedom to\nsave unlimited recipes daily, automatically generate shopping\nlists, create weekly meal plans, and track nutritional data, you\ncan become a premium member for just $2.99 a month.\nMany users find this small fee to be money well spent, as the\npremium features save them time and enable them to make\nhealthier meal choices. Visit our “PM Community” Web page to\nview real testimonials from our premium members."}],"question":"According to the notice, why should users go to a Web page?","bilingual":"Theo thông báo, tại sao người dùng nên vào một trang Web?","options":["To take a virtual tour","To see a sample meal plan","To compare ingredients from similar recipes","To find out about people’s experiences"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"To find out about people’s experiences\".","vocabList":[{"word":"notice","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''nəƱtis/","meaning":"thông tri, yết thị, thông báo"},{"word":"users","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈjuzərz/","meaning":"người dùng"},{"word":"page","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/peɪʤ/","meaning":"mảnh giấy; tiếp viên; người hầu"},{"word":"virtual","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˈvərʧuəl/","meaning":"tưởng tượng; giả định; máy tính mô phỏng"}]},{"questionNum":"151","passageTitle":"Questions 151=152 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: Marta Prigarina <mprigarina @ymw.co.za>\nFrom: Barry Winters <bwinters @ kerwinecs.co.za>\nDate: 23 October\nSubject: Office cleaning\nDear Ms. Prigarina,\nWe are glad you have chosen Kerwine Cleaning Services for your office cleaning needs.\nOur janitors will arrive at your facility with the commercial-grade equipment, tools, and\nproducts needed to complete all cleaning tasks quickly and effectively. You have already\nconfirmed a starting date of 30 October. However, you have not yet confirmed whether\nyou will use our services weekly or biweekly. As soon as you let us know, we will draw\nup a contract for you. Please note that we are currently running a special promotion. If\nyou sign up for six months of service by 31 October, your first two cleanings are free.\nBest,\nBarry Winters\nKerwine Cleaning Services","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"*E-mail*\nTo: Marta Prigarina <mprigarina @ymw.co.za>\nFrom: Barry Winters <bwinters @ kerwinecs.co.za>\nDate: 23 October\nSubject: Office cleaning\nDear Ms. Prigarina,\nWe are glad you have chosen Kerwine Cleaning Services for your office cleaning needs.\nOur janitors will arrive at your facility with the commercial-grade equipment, tools, and\nproducts needed to complete all cleaning tasks quickly and effectively. You have already\nconfirmed a starting date of 30 October. However, you have not yet confirmed whether\nyou will use our services weekly or biweekly. As soon as you let us know, we will draw\nup a contract for you. Please note that we are currently running a special promotion. If\nyou sign up for six months of service by 31 October, your first two cleanings are free.\nBest,\nBarry Winters\nKerwine Cleaning Services"}],"question":"What does Mr. Winters ask Ms. Prigarina to confirm?","bilingual":"Ông Winters yêu cầu cô Prigarina xác nhận điều gì?","options":["How often to clean her office","When he should arrive at her facility","Where her office is located","What products she prefers"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"How often to clean her office\".","vocabList":[{"word":"confirm","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kənˈfərm/","meaning":"phê duyệt; để xác minh; để xác định"},{"word":"often","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈɔfən/","meaning":"thường xuyên"},{"word":"office","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈɔfəs/","meaning":"buồng; văn phòng; đương nhiệm; hãng; thẩm quyền"},{"word":"arrive","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/əraɪv/","meaning":"đến đích; quay trở lại ; quay trở lại; ĐẾN"}]},{"questionNum":"152","passageTitle":"Questions 151=152 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"*E-mail*\nTo: Marta Prigarina <mprigarina @ymw.co.za>\nFrom: Barry Winters <bwinters @ kerwinecs.co.za>\nDate: 23 October\nSubject: Office cleaning\nDear Ms. Prigarina,\nWe are glad you have chosen Kerwine Cleaning Services for your office cleaning needs.\nOur janitors will arrive at your facility with the commercial-grade equipment, tools, and\nproducts needed to complete all cleaning tasks quickly and effectively. You have already\nconfirmed a starting date of 30 October. However, you have not yet confirmed whether\nyou will use our services weekly or biweekly. As soon as you let us know, we will draw\nup a contract for you. Please note that we are currently running a special promotion. If\nyou sign up for six months of service by 31 October, your first two cleanings are free.\nBest,\nBarry Winters\nKerwine Cleaning Services","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"*E-mail*\nTo: Marta Prigarina <mprigarina @ymw.co.za>\nFrom: Barry Winters <bwinters @ kerwinecs.co.za>\nDate: 23 October\nSubject: Office cleaning\nDear Ms. Prigarina,\nWe are glad you have chosen Kerwine Cleaning Services for your office cleaning needs.\nOur janitors will arrive at your facility with the commercial-grade equipment, tools, and\nproducts needed to complete all cleaning tasks quickly and effectively. You have already\nconfirmed a starting date of 30 October. However, you have not yet confirmed whether\nyou will use our services weekly or biweekly. As soon as you let us know, we will draw\nup a contract for you. Please note that we are currently running a special promotion. If\nyou sign up for six months of service by 31 October, your first two cleanings are free.\nBest,\nBarry Winters\nKerwine Cleaning Services"}],"question":"How can Ms. Prigarina receive two free cleanings?","bilingual":"Làm thế nào cô Prigarina có thể nhận được hai lần dọn dẹp miễn phí?","options":["By pre paying for services","By signing a contract for six months","By changing her starting date","By using a discount code"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"By signing a contract for six months\".","vocabList":[{"word":"receive","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ri''si:v/","meaning":"nhận, lĩnh, thu"},{"word":"service","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/''sə:vis/","meaning":"sự phục vụ, sự hầu hạ"},{"word":"contract","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈkɑnˌtrækt/","meaning":"tạo ra một thỏa thuận chính thức; ràng buộc về mặt pháp lý; để có được"},{"word":"date","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/deɪt/","meaning":"ngày, tháng, năm theo dương lịch;"}]},{"questionNum":"153","passageTitle":"Questions 153-154 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"To: Angela Jenkins\nFrom: Marcus Keller\nDate: Friday, 2 November\nSubject: Postpone call\nAngela,\nUnfortunately, I have to cancel our planned afternoon phone call at the last minute ------- I\nhope you get this e-mail in time. Could we please reschedule? This was my mistake, as I\nsome how double-booked our appointment time. In fact, I am on my way out the door right\nnow to keep the other appointment ------- a meeting with a high-priority client. I apologize.\nWould teleconferencing on Monday at noon work for you? Also, prior to our meeting,\ncould you look further into any grant opportunities that might be available for the current\nproject? Meanwhile, I will ask Leona to calculate more accurate budgets for some future\ninitiatives that will need funding. That will allow us to be more productive when we meet\nnext week.\nBest,\nMarcus Keller\nO''Connor Small Business Foundation","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Angela Jenkins\nFrom: Marcus Keller\nDate: Friday, 2 November\nSubject: Postpone call\nAngela,\nUnfortunately, I have to cancel our planned afternoon phone call at the last minute ------- I\nhope you get this e-mail in time. Could we please reschedule? This was my mistake, as I\nsome how double-booked our appointment time. In fact, I am on my way out the door right\nnow to keep the other appointment ------- a meeting with a high-priority client. I apologize.\nWould teleconferencing on Monday at noon work for you? Also, prior to our meeting,\ncould you look further into any grant opportunities that might be available for the current\nproject? Meanwhile, I will ask Leona to calculate more accurate budgets for some future\ninitiatives that will need funding. That will allow us to be more productive when we meet\nnext week.\nBest,\nMarcus Keller\nO''Connor Small Business Foundation"}],"question":"Why does Mr. Keller say he cannot meet as planned?","bilingual":"Tại sao ông Keller nói rằng ông ấy không thể gặp mặt như đã định?","options":["He anticipates a late return from a trip.","He has no new information to report.","He decided to take the afternoon off.","He discovered a scheduling conflict. 300"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"He discovered a scheduling conflict. 300\".","vocabList":[{"word":"anticipate","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ænˈtɪs.ə.peɪt/","meaning":"phỏng đoán, dự đoán"},{"word":"late","pos":"Trạng từ (Adverb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/leɪt/","meaning":"sau thời gian thông thường hoặc dự kiến; chậm trễ; gần đây; xa"},{"word":"return","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtərn/","meaning":"đối ứng; được thực hiện để đáp lại một hành động trước đó;"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"}]},{"questionNum":"154","passageTitle":"Questions 153-154 refer to the following e-mail.","passageText":"To: Angela Jenkins\nFrom: Marcus Keller\nDate: Friday, 2 November\nSubject: Postpone call\nAngela,\nUnfortunately, I have to cancel our planned afternoon phone call at the last minute ------- I\nhope you get this e-mail in time. Could we please reschedule? This was my mistake, as I\nsome how double-booked our appointment time. In fact, I am on my way out the door right\nnow to keep the other appointment ------- a meeting with a high-priority client. I apologize.\nWould teleconferencing on Monday at noon work for you? Also, prior to our meeting,\ncould you look further into any grant opportunities that might be available for the current\nproject? Meanwhile, I will ask Leona to calculate more accurate budgets for some future\ninitiatives that will need funding. That will allow us to be more productive when we meet\nnext week.\nBest,\nMarcus Keller\nO''Connor Small Business Foundation","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"To: Angela Jenkins\nFrom: Marcus Keller\nDate: Friday, 2 November\nSubject: Postpone call\nAngela,\nUnfortunately, I have to cancel our planned afternoon phone call at the last minute ------- I\nhope you get this e-mail in time. Could we please reschedule? This was my mistake, as I\nsome how double-booked our appointment time. In fact, I am on my way out the door right\nnow to keep the other appointment ------- a meeting with a high-priority client. I apologize.\nWould teleconferencing on Monday at noon work for you? Also, prior to our meeting,\ncould you look further into any grant opportunities that might be available for the current\nproject? Meanwhile, I will ask Leona to calculate more accurate budgets for some future\ninitiatives that will need funding. That will allow us to be more productive when we meet\nnext week.\nBest,\nMarcus Keller\nO''Connor Small Business Foundation"}],"question":"What will most likely be done before the meeting?","bilingual":"Điều gì có nhiều khả năng sẽ được thực hiện trước cuộc họp?","options":["More financial information will be gathered.","The meeting location will be changed.","Another person will be invited to attend.","A marketing plan will be modified."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"More financial information will be gathered.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"meeting","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''mi:tiɳ/","meaning":"(chính trị) cuộc mít tinh, cuộc biểu tình"},{"word":"financial","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/faɪˈnæn.ʃəl/","meaning":"/fəˈnæn.ʃəl/"},{"word":"information","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/ˌɪn.fɚˈmeɪ.ʃən/","meaning":"thông tin"},{"word":"location","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/loʊˈkeɪʃən/","meaning":"địa điểm; chức vụ; tình huống; địa điểm; điểm"}]},{"questionNum":"155","passageTitle":"Questions 155-157 refer to the following comment card.","passageText":"Gracio Store Comment Card\nGracio Store is seeking to make your visit with us a better experience. Tell us\nabout your visit to our store today so we can improve the way we serve you.\nAnd each week, one comment card will be drawn from those submitted to\nearn the customer a $50 store coupon!\nCustomer name: Huy Nguyen\nE-mail contact: hnquyen@briqhtmail.co.nz Date: 4 May\nReason for your visit today: Shopping for a gift\nComment:I was shopping for a friend''s birthday. Ms, Davie, a sales\nassociate in Accessories, greeted me and asked me questions to narrow\ndown my gift search. She even offered to hold some of my bags so that\nI could shop more easily. She directed me to a colourful display of silk\nscarves and told me about the various places they were produced. The\none Ichose ended up in my planned price range too.","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"Gracio Store Comment Card\nGracio Store is seeking to make your visit with us a better experience. Tell us\nabout your visit to our store today so we can improve the way we serve you.\nAnd each week, one comment card will be drawn from those submitted to\nearn the customer a $50 store coupon!\nCustomer name: Huy Nguyen\nE-mail contact: hnquyen@briqhtmail.co.nz Date: 4 May\nReason for your visit today: Shopping for a gift\nComment:I was shopping for a friend''s birthday. Ms, Davie, a sales\nassociate in Accessories, greeted me and asked me questions to narrow\ndown my gift search. She even offered to hold some of my bags so that\nI could shop more easily. She directed me to a colourful display of silk\nscarves and told me about the various places they were produced. The\none Ichose ended up in my planned price range too."}],"question":"What is indicated about Gracio Store?","bilingual":"Những gì được chỉ định về Cửa hàng Gracio?","options":["It has recently opened.","It is training new sales associates.","It wants to improve its customer service.","It has organized a competit