in 30 days of purchase\ndate. Any new merchandise may be returned within 14 days of\npurchase date. The original box and packaging materials must be\nincluded. If you need to return the item by post, the store will issue\nand e-mail a postage-paid shipping label for you to print at home\nand attach to your parcel. The cost of your item will be refunded\nonce it has been received.\nCustomer Service contact information is as follows:\nPhone: 1-800-555-0176\nE-mail: cs@electronicsplusexpress.com"}],"question":"What is indicated about all returns?","bilingual":"Điều gì được chỉ ra về tất cả lợi nhuận?","options":["They are only received at store locations.","They cannot be processed on weekends.","They require an authorization code.","They are not accepted after 14 days."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (C) \"They require an authorization code.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"returns","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtərnz/","meaning":"trả về"},{"word":"they","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ðeɪ/","meaning":"họ"},{"word":"store","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/stɔr/","meaning":"cửa hàng; nơi bán hàng hóa; cung cấp"},{"word":"locations","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/loʊˈkeɪʃənz/","meaning":"địa điểm"}]},{"questionNum":"163","passageTitle":"Questions 161-163 refer to the following information from a Web page.","passageText":"^ ^ l https://www.electronicsplusexpress.com/returns Electronics Plus Express Return Policy\nAll returns require prior authorization. Please call during business\nhours (Monday-Friday 9:00 A.M. to 7:00 P.M. and weekends\n10:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M.) or e-mail Customer Service with your\nreturn request to receive a return authorization code.\nDefective merchandise may be returned within 30 days of purchase\ndate. Any new merchandise may be returned within 14 days of\npurchase date. The original box and packaging materials must be\nincluded. If you need to return the item by post, the store will issue\nand e-mail a postage-paid shipping label for you to print at home\nand attach to your parcel. The cost of your item will be refunded\nonce it has been received.\nCustomer Service contact information is as follows:\nPhone: 1-800-555-0176\nE-mail: cs@electronicsplusexpress.com","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"^ ^ l https://www.electronicsplusexpress.com/returns Electronics Plus Express Return Policy\nAll returns require prior authorization. Please call during business\nhours (Monday-Friday 9:00 A.M. to 7:00 P.M. and weekends\n10:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M.) or e-mail Customer Service with your\nreturn request to receive a return authorization code.\nDefective merchandise may be returned within 30 days of purchase\ndate. Any new merchandise may be returned within 14 days of\npurchase date. The original box and packaging materials must be\nincluded. If you need to return the item by post, the store will issue\nand e-mail a postage-paid shipping label for you to print at home\nand attach to your parcel. The cost of your item will be refunded\nonce it has been received.\nCustomer Service contact information is as follows:\nPhone: 1-800-555-0176\nE-mail: cs@electronicsplusexpress.com"}],"question":"What is mentioned about return shipping fees?","bilingual":"Điều gì được đề cập về phí vận chuyển hoàn trả?","options":["They are calculated based on the weight of the package.","They are listed on the company’s Web site.","They will be refunded to the customer within 30 days.","They are paid for by the company."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (D) \"They are paid for by the company.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"return","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/rɪˈtərn/","meaning":"đối ứng; được thực hiện để đáp lại một hành động trước đó;"},{"word":"shipping","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ˈʃɪp.ɪŋ/","meaning":"đang chuyển hàng"},{"word":"they","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/ðeɪ/","meaning":"họ"},{"word":"based","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/beɪst/","meaning":"dựa trên"}]},{"questionNum":"164","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following online chat discussion.","passageText":"0-0-0\nKelli Wethers [2:15 P.M.] Hi, Mr. East on. I want to remind you about the dinner meeting with 4\nyour client, Mr. Kasai, at the Magnolia Grill this evening. Mr. Kasai will be coming directly\nfrom the airport. Anna Kwon from our marketing department will be joining both of you.\nAdam East on [2:31 P.M.] Thanks, Ms. Wethers. It occurs to me, if he is coming straight from\nthe airport, what will he do with his luggage?\nKelli Wethers [2:33 P.M.] Don’t worry. Kyle Friedman is picking Mr. Kasai up at the airport\nand dropping the bags off at the hotel. I’m adding Kyle to this message now in case you two\nneed to communicate.\nAdam East on [2:34 P.M.] Sounds great. I can drive Mr. Kasai back to his hotel following our\nmeeting. It would be a nice gesture for such a key client.\nKyle Friedman [2:36 P.M.] Heading to the airport soon, Ms. Wethers. Just text me later if I\nneed to know anything more.\nKelli Wethers [2:40 P.M.] Good idea, Mr. East on. A taxi for after the dinner will not be\nnecessary then.\n4 4","passageTextVi":"","passages":[{"label":"Bài đọc","text":"0-0-0\nKelli Wethers [2:15 P.M.] Hi, Mr. East on. I want to remind you about the dinner meeting with 4\nyour client, Mr. Kasai, at the Magnolia Grill this evening. Mr. Kasai will be coming directly\nfrom the airport. Anna Kwon from our marketing department will be joining both of you.\nAdam East on [2:31 P.M.] Thanks, Ms. Wethers. It occurs to me, if he is coming straight from\nthe airport, what will he do with his luggage?\nKelli Wethers [2:33 P.M.] Don’t worry. Kyle Friedman is picking Mr. Kasai up at the airport\nand dropping the bags off at the hotel. I’m adding Kyle to this message now in case you two\nneed to communicate.\nAdam East on [2:34 P.M.] Sounds great. I can drive Mr. Kasai back to his hotel following our\nmeeting. It would be a nice gesture for such a key client.\nKyle Friedman [2:36 P.M.] Heading to the airport soon, Ms. Wethers. Just text me later if I\nneed to know anything more.\nKelli Wethers [2:40 P.M.] Good idea, Mr. East on. A taxi for after the dinner will not be\nnecessary then.\n4 4"}],"question":"What is the purpose of the online chat discussion?","bilingual":"Mục đích của cuộc thảo luận trò chuyện trực tuyến là gì?","options":["To review arrangements for a client visit","To choose a location for a company celebration","To give invitations to a dinner event","To arrange a taxi for some traveling colleagues"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (A) \"To review arrangements for a client visit\".","vocabList":[{"word":"purpose","pos":"Danh từ / Động từ (Noun / Verb)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/''pɜ:pəs/","meaning":"mục đích, ý định"},{"word":"discussion","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/dɪˈskʌʃ.ən/","meaning":"cuộc tranh luận, thảo luận"},{"word":"review","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 4: 400 - 495 đ","ipa":"/ˌrivˈju/","meaning":"sự khảo sát; nghiên cứu tổng quát; bài kiểm tra; điều tra"},{"word":"arrangement","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/əˈreɪndʒ.mənt/","meaning":"sự sắp đặt"}]},{"questionNum":"165","passageTitle":"Questions 164-167 refer to the following online chat discussion.","passageText":"0-0-0\nKelli Wethers [2:15 P.M.] Hi, Mr. East on. I want to remind you about the dinner meeting with 4\nyour client, Mr. Kasai, at the Magnolia Grill this evening. Mr. Kasai will be coming directly\nfrom the airport. Anna Kwon from our marketing department will be joining both 