r Mr. Greenly,\nI recently moved to Hagerstown, and I am interested in learning about the native\nvegetation in the area. I have a lot of experience growing trees and plants in my former\nhometown, but the varieties that grow here are completely different. A neighbor mentioned\nthat there would be a session related to gardening, but do any of the workshops address\nmy specific interest in learning about the native flora and fauna?\nSincerely,\nAntonio Perkins"}],"question":"What is most likely true about Mr. Card well?","bilingual":"Điều gì có thể đúng nhất về ông Cardwell?","options":["He is a professional weather forecaster.","He is a member of the MCRWI organization.","He is a university professor.","He is in charge of organizing the Quick Fix workshop series."],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Căn cứ vào nội dung bài đọc, đáp án chính xác là (B) \"He is a member of the MCRWI organization.\".","vocabList":[{"word":"card","pos":"Động từ (Verb)","level":"Level 2: 200 - 300 đ","ipa":"/kɑrd/","meaning":"yêu cầu nhận dạng (tức là trong một quán bar)"},{"word":"professional","pos":"Tính từ (Adjective)","level":"Level 1: Dưới 200 đi","ipa":"/prə''feʃənl/","meaning":"(thuộc) nghề, (thuộc) nghề nghiệp; có tay nghề"},{"word":"weather","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈwɛðər/","meaning":"thời tiết"},{"word":"forecaster","pos":"Danh từ (Noun)","level":"Level 3: 300 - 400 đ","ipa":"/ˈfɔrˌkæstər/","meaning":"người báo trước những sự kiện trong tương lai; nam dự báo thời tiết"}]},{"questionNum":"188","passageTitle":"Questions 186-190 refer to the following flyer, brochure, and e-mail.","passageText":"Quick Fix Workshops\nJoin Hagerstown residents at the community center on January 15 for our Quick Fix\nworkshop series. There is sure to be at least one topic that will interest you. For\nexample, you might learn how to economize financially without inhibiting your\nlifestyle or to discover ways of reducing your impact on the environment by living\nsmar